ade Leather Bag"}}, [34]={npc="Turroc", tgt="Turroc"}, [35]={npc="Cook Torka", tgt="Cook Torka"}, [36]={hint="Speak with Cook Torka in Razor Hill to learn to become a cook.", tag="Optional"}, [37]={npc="Cook Torka", tgt="Cook Torka", tag="Optional"}, [38]={text="Tiragarde Keep → the wrecks → Kolkar Crag and Echo Isles"}, [39]={hint="Kill 10 Kul Tiras Sailors, 8 Kul Tiras Marines and Lieutenant Benedict and return to Gar'Thok in Razor Hill."}, [40]={hint="Furl Scornbrow in the Razor Hill watchtower wants 8 Canvas Scraps."}, [41]={hint="Collect the Raider's Battleaxe, Raider's Bow, and Raider's Shield from the Tiragarde Keep outskirts, then return them to Turroc in Razor Hill."}, [42]={npc="Aged Envelope", npcObj=true, desc="Loot Lieutenant Benedict's key. Open the upstairs chest for the Aged Envelope."}, [43]={npc="Ukor's Lost Pack", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="If you loot the pack on the way, start the quest and head south to Ukor."}, [44]={text="Return to Razor Hill from Tiragarde Keep. Hearth if ready."}, [45]={hint="Take Admiral Proudmoore's Orders to Gar'Thok in Razor Hill."}, [46]={npc="Gar'Thok", tgt="Gar'Thok"}, [47]={npc="Gar'Thok", tgt="Gar'Thok"}, [48]={npc="Turroc", tgt="Turroc", desc="Also find Razor Hill Barbarian Soldier (53.06, 42.48) in the same quest."}, [49]={npc="Furl Scornbrow", tgt="Furl Scornbrow", star={"Handmade Leather Bag"}}, [50]={npc="Gar'Thok", tgt="Gar'Thok"}, [51]={npc="Gar'Thok", tgt="Gar'Thok", tag="Optional"}, [52]={hint="Bring 4 Intact Makrura Eyes and 8 vials of Crawler Mucus to Master Vornal in Sen'jin Village."}, [53]={hint="Gar'Thok of Razor Hill wants you to retrieve 3 Gnomish Tools from the wreckage off the coast."}, [54]={hint="Return the pack to Ukor in southern Durotar.", tag="Optional"}, [55]={npc="Ukor", tgt="Ukor", tag="Optional"}, [56]={npc="Master Vornal", tgt="Master Vornal"}, [57]={hint="Lar Prowltusk outside of Sen'jin Village wants you to destroy the 3 sets of Attack Plans held within Kolkar Crag."}, [58]={