ond target is a Surf Crawler."}, [164]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Surf Crawler. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Thotar at Razor Hill.", desc="Forever prereq: Taming the Beast. The second target is a Surf Crawler."}, [165]={npc="Thotar", tgt="Thotar", desc="Forever prereq: Taming the Beast. The second target is a Surf Crawler."}, [166]={npc="Thotar", tgt="Thotar", desc="Forever prereq: Taming the Beast, and the third camera is Armored Scorpid."}, [167]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame an Armored Scorpid. Practice your skills, then return to Thotar at Razor Hill.", desc="Forever prereq: Taming the Beast, and the third camera is Armored Scorpid."}, [168]={npc="Thotar", tgt="Thotar", desc="Forever prereq: Taming the Beast, and the third camera is Armored Scorpid."}, [169]={npc="Thotar", tgt="Thotar", desc="After taming, train pet skills in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor."}, [170]={hint="Speak with Ormak Grimshot in Orgrimmar.", desc="After taming, train pet skills in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor."}, [171]={npc="Ormak Grimshot", tgt="Ormak Grimshot", desc="After taming, train pet skills in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor."}, [172]={npc="Ophek", tgt="Ophek", tag="Optional", desc="Channeling optional, and the quest itself allows for Horde Warlocks."}, [173]={hint="Speak with Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.", tag="Optional", desc="Channeling optional, and the quest itself allows for Horde Warlocks."}, [174]={npc="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tgt="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tag="Optional", desc="Channeling optional, and the quest itself allows for Horde Warlocks."}, [175]={npc="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tgt="Gan'rul Bloodeye", desc="Orgrimmar Take the stone slab from the cave Skull Rock on the east side outside the city."}, [176]={hint="Retrieve the Tablet of Verga for Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.", desc="Orgrimmar Take the stone slab from the cave Skull Rock on the east side outside the city."}, [177]={npc="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tgt="Gan'rul Bloodeye", desc="Orgrimmar Take the s