). You can set your hearth with Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind (51.99, 29.89)."}}},
    ["01-3"] = {name="Camp Narache", tips={{k="交通", text="From another start zone, go to Bloodhoof Village, then south up Red Cloud Mesa to Camp Narache."}, {k="取捨", text="Brambleblade Ravine Do Rite of Strength, Chief Sharptusk Thornmantle (Break Sharptusk!), Battleboar (The Battleboars) on the same trip, and then pick up Attack on Camp Narache if there is a map."}, {k="提醒", text="If it is less than level 6, add Battleboar or Bristleback Quilboar along the outside of Brambleblade Ravine, and then go to Bloodhoof Village.", s={{"If it is less than level 6, add Battleboar or Bristleback Quilboar along the outside of Brambleblade Ravine, and then go to Bloodhoof Village"}}}}, danger={[1]="The quilboars in Brambleblade Ravine are concentrated in the narrow slope. Clear the slope before hitting Chief Sharptusk Thornmantle, and return to Hongyun Mesa when retreating."}, grind={[1]={mob="Plainstrider", note="Dense/normal mobs/mostly neutral, attack monsters one by one/Camp Narache next to the southeast well, The Hunt Begins when you hit it"}, [2]={mob="Mountain Cougar", note="Dense/normal mobs/mostly neutral, open monsters one by one/Red Cloud Mesa south slope, make up for the skin required by The Hunt Continues"}, [3]={mob="Bristleback Battleboar", note="Concentrate/normal mobs/mix with Bristleback Quilboar, clear the outside first/Brambleblade Ravine, go with Battleboar and Rite of Strength"}}, supply={[1]={npc="Bronk Steelrage"}, [2]={npc="Moodan Sungrain"}, [3]={npc="Kawnie Softbreeze"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Camp Narache Gift Voucher", npcObj=true, tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Only accept if you hold Camp Narache Gift Voucher. Right-click your race's starting voucher. There's no pickup on the map."}, [2]={hint="Bring the Camp Narache Gift Voucher to Vorn Skyseer.", tag="Optional", desc="Only accept if you hold Camp Narache Gift Voucher."}, [3]={npc="Vorn Skyseer", tgt="Vorn Skyseer", tag="Optional", desc="Only accept if you hold Camp Narache Gift Voucher."}, [4]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind"}, [5]={npc="Chief Hawkwind", tgt="Chief Hawkwind"}, [6]={hint="Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 7 Plainstrider Feathers and 7 pieces of Plainstrider Meat."}, [7]={hint="Chief Hawkwind wants you to search for his mother near the water well to the southeast of Camp Narache."}, [8]={npc="Greatmother Hawkwind", tgt="Greatmother Hawkwind"}, [9]={npc="Greatmother Hawkwind", tgt="Greatmother Hawkwind"}, [10]={hint="Take a Water Pitcher from the water well.", desc="Look for Water Pitcher in the well next to Grandma Yingfeng."}, [11]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind"}, [12]={npc="Chief Hawkwind", tgt="Chief Hawkwind"}, [13]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind"}, [14]={npc="Chief Hawkwind", tgt="Chief Hawkwind"}, [15]={npc="Brave Windfeather", tgt="Brave Windfeather"}, [16]={hint="Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 10 Mountain Cougar Pelts."}, [17]={hint="Travel to Seer Graytongue who lives in the hills directly south of Camp Narache."}, [18]={npc="Seer Graytongue", tgt="Seer Graytongue"}, [19]={npc="Seer Graytongue", tgt="Seer Graytongue"}, [20]={npc="Seer Graytongue", tgt="Seer Graytongue", tag="Optional", desc="Take the smoldering incense to the southeast altar within 10 minutes.", star={"Scorched Leather Pouch"}}, [21]={hint="Carry the Smoldering Incense to the shrine of An'she and Mu'sha in the southeastern hills before the incense burns to ash in ten minutes!", tag="Optional", desc="Take the smoldering incense to the southeast altar within 10 minutes."}, [22]={npc="Ritual Fire", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Take the smoldering incense to the southeast altar within 10 minutes.", star={"Scorched Leather Pouch"}}, [23]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind"}, [24]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind"}, [25]={hint="Kill Bristlebacks in Brambleblade Ravine and bring 12 Bristleback Belts to Chief Hawkwind in Camp Narache."}, [26]={hint="Bring the head of Chief Sharptusk Thornmantle to Brave Windfeather in Red Cloud Mesa."}, [27]={hint="Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to kill Battleboars and bring back 8 Battleboar Snouts and 8 Battleboar Flanks."}, [28]={npc="Dirt-stained Map", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Bristleback Quilboar drops Dirt-stained Map, pick it up and click it."}, [29]={npc="Chief Hawkwind", tgt="Chief Hawkwind"}, [30]={npc="Brave Windfeather", tgt="Brave Windfeather"}, [31]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind"}, [32]={hint="Bring the Bristleback Attack Plans to Chief Hawkwind in Camp Narache.", tag="Optional"}, [33]={npc="Chief Hawkwind", tgt="Chief Hawkwind", tag="Optional"}, [34]={npc="Chief Hawkwind", tgt="Chief Hawkwind"}, [35]={npc="Chief Hawkwind", tgt="Chief Hawkwind", tag="Optional"}, [36]={npc="Antur Fallow", tgt="Antur Fallow", tag="Optional", desc="Pick up from the west side of the camp via Antur."}, [37]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind", desc="After completing prerequisite The Hunt Begins, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [38]={hint="Read the Simple Note and speak to Harutt Thunderhorn in Camp Narache.", desc="After completing prerequisite The Hunt Begins, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [39]={npc="Harutt Thunderhorn", tgt="Harutt Thunderhorn", desc="After completing prerequisite The Hunt Begins, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [40]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind", desc="After completing prerequisite The Hunt Begins, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [41]={hint="Read the Rune-Inscribed Note and speak to Meela Dawnstrider in Camp Narache.", desc="After completing prerequisite The Hunt Begins, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [42]={npc="Meela Dawnstrider", tgt="Meela Dawnstrider", desc="After completing prerequisite The Hunt Begins, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [43]={npc="Seer Ravenfeather", tgt="Seer Ravenfeather"}, [44]={hint="Bring 2 applications of Ritual Salve to Seer Ravenfeather in Camp Narache."}, [45]={npc="Seer Ravenfeather", tgt="Seer Ravenfeather"}, [46]={npc="Seer Ravenfeather", tgt="Seer Ravenfeather", desc="Only after drinking the spirit contract can you see the small earth spirit body."}, [47]={hint="Find Kodo Rock and drink the Earth Sapta.", desc="Only after drinking the spirit contract can you see the small earth spirit body."}, [48]={npc="Minor Manifestation of Earth", tgt="Minor Manifestation of Earth", desc="Only after drinking the spirit contract can you see the small earth spirit body."}, [49]={npc="Minor Manifestation of Earth", tgt="Minor Manifestation of Earth", desc="Obtain the world totem after completion."}, [50]={hint="Bring the Rough Quartz to Seer Ravenfeather in Camp Narache.", desc="Obtain the world totem after completion."}, [51]={npc="Seer Ravenfeather", tgt="Seer Ravenfeather", desc="Obtain the world totem after completion."}, [52]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind"}, [53]={hint="Read the Etched Note and speak to Lanka Farshot in Red Cloud Mesa."}, [54]={npc="Lanka Farshot", tgt="Lanka Farshot"}, [55]={npc="Grull Hawkwind", tgt="Grull Hawkwind"}, [56]={hint="Read the Verdant Note and speak to Gart Mistrunner in Camp Narache."}, [57]={npc="Gart Mistrunner", tgt="Gart Mistrunner"}, [58]={text="Leave Red Cloud Mesa and follow the road north to Bloodhoof Village."}}},
    ["01-4"] = {name="Mulgore: Bloodhoof Village", short="Bloodhoof Village", tips={{k="取捨", text="Do Rite of Vision →Rite of Vision→Rite of Vision, Rite of Wisdom and Journey into Thunder Bluff. The final section is just right for flying."}, {k="取捨", text="Complete the water well quest first before taking the next one [Tauren only]. If you have reached level 12, skip the Well of Wildmane branch [Tauren only].", s={{"Complete the water well quest first before taking the next one [Tauren only]. If you have reached level 12, skip the Well of Wildmane branch [Tauren only].", {race={"Tauren"}}}}}, {k="取捨", text="When it comes to Thunder Bluff, it can be connected to Ragefire Chasm preamplifier. If you plan to buy this book, connect Testing an Enemy's Strength (Testing an Enemy's Strength) Testing an Enemy's Strength and Searching for the Lost Satchel with Rahauro."}, {k="提醒", text="Need XP for level 12? Grind harpies in northern Mulgore, Red Rocks or the Venture Co. Mine. See the class quests below for level 10 unlocks.", s={{"Need XP for level 12?"}, {"Grind harpies in northern Mulgore, Red Rocks or the Venture Co"}, {"Mine"}, {"See the class quests below for level 10 unlocks"}}}}, danger={[1]="Fitzprok Mines will bring patrols and miners into battle. Clear the outside first, get the clipboard and exit the cave."}, grind={[1]={mob="Prairie Stalker", note="Scattered/normal mobs/grass can be pulled one by one, pay attention to wandering monsters/North side of Bloodhoof Village, and collect Mazzranache materials smoothly"}, [2]={mob="Venture Co. Supervisor", note="Concentrated/normal mobs/mixed with workers and patrols, first pull along the outside of Mines/Fitzprok Mines, and follow the Mines quest"}, [3]={note="Dense/normal mobs/mixed with spellcasting harpies, pull the outside of the camp first/Mulgore Northwest harpy camp, gain experience when approaching level 12"}}, supply={[1]={npc="Innkeeper Kauth"}, [2]={npc="Harant Ironbrace"}, [3]={npc="Innkeeper Kauth"}, [4]={npc="Kennah Hawkseye"}, [5]={npc="Tal"}}, steps={[1]={hint="Deliver the Supply Bundle to Kaga Wildhoof near Bloodhoof Village.", tag="Optional"}, [2]={npc="Kaga Wildhoof", tgt="Kaga Wildhoof", tag="Optional"}, [3]={npc="Kaga Wildhoof", tgt="Kaga Wildhoof", tag="Optional"}, [4]={hint="Sit near Kaga's Basic Campfire and wait until you receive the Boosted Rest buff.", tag="Optional"}, [5]={npc="Kaga Wildhoof", tgt="Kaga Wildhoof", tag="Optional"}, [6]={npc="Kaga Wildhoof", tgt="Kaga Wildhoof", tag="Optional"}, [7]={npc="Kaga Wildhoof", tgt="Kaga Wildhoof", tag="Optional", desc="Learn Skinning before accepting. Turn in once you meet the skill requirement."}, [8]={hint="Take the Totem of Hawkwind to Baine Bloodhoof in Bloodhoof Village. Follow the road out of Camp Narache."}, [9]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [10]={hint="Bring the Bundle of Furs to Innkeeper Kauth in Bloodhoof Village.", tag="Optional"}, [11]={npc="Innkeeper Kauth", tgt="Innkeeper Kauth", tag="Optional"}, [12]={text="Set your hearth with Innkeeper Kauth in Bloodhoof Village (45.93, 64.16)."}, [13]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [14]={hint="Speak with Zarlman Two-Moons in Bloodhoof Village."}, [15]={npc="Zarlman Two-Moons", tgt="Zarlman Two-Moons"}, [16]={npc="Zarlman Two-Moons", tgt="Zarlman Two-Moons"}, [17]={npc="Harken Windtotem", tgt="Harken Windtotem"}, [18]={npc="Maur Raincaller", tgt="Maur Raincaller"}, [19]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [20]={npc="Brave Wildrunner", tgt="Brave Wildrunner"}, [21]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [22]={npc="Krang Stonehoof", tgt="Krang Stonehoof", tag="Optional"}, [23]={hint="Defeat 3 other players in duels or Novice Warriors for Tang Stonehoof.", tag="Optional"}, [24]={npc="Krang Stonehoof", tgt="Krang Stonehoof", tag="Optional"}, [25]={npc="Ahab Wheathoof", tgt="Ahab Wheathoof", tag="Optional"}, [26]={hint="Speak with Pyall Silentstride in Bloodhoof Village to learn to become a cook.", tag="Optional"}, [27]={npc="Pyall Silentstride", tgt="Pyall Silentstride", tag="Optional"}, [28]={hint="Speak with Yonn Deepcut in Bloodhoof Village to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.", tag="Optional"}, [29]={npc="Yonn Deepcut", tgt="Yonn Deepcut", tag="Optional"}, [30]={text="East of Bloodhoof Village → caravan and centaurs"}, [31]={hint="Collect 2 Well Stones and 2 Ambercorn and bring them back to Zarlman Two-Moons in Bloodhoof Village."}, [32]={hint="Bring 8 Trophy Swoop Quills to Harken Windtotem in Bloodhoof Village."}, [33]={hint="Bring a Prairie Wolf Heart, Flatland Cougar Femur, Plainstrider Scale and Swoop Gizzard to Maur Raincaller at Bloodhoof Village."}, [34]={hint="Bring 6 Prairie Wolf Paws and 4 Plainstrider Talons to Mull Thunderhorn in Bloodhoof."}, [35]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [36]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [37]={hint="Use the Winterhoof Cleansing Totem at the Winterhoof Water Well, then return to Mull Thunderhorn."}, [38]={hint="Find Longwalker Malah Longwind east of Bloodhoof Village, near the edge of Mulgore."}, [39]={npc="Malah Longwind", tgt="Malah Longwind"}, [40]={npc="Malah Longwind", tgt="Malah Longwind"}, [41]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker"}, [42]={hint="Morin Cloudstalker wants you to examine the contents of a supply crate at the Ravaged Caravan."}, [43]={npc="Sealed Supply Crate", npcObj=true}, [44]={npc="Sealed Supply Crate", npcObj=true}, [45]={hint="Return the Venture Co. Documents to Morin Cloudstalker near Bloodhoof Village."}, [46]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker"}, [47]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker"}, [48]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker"}, [49]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [50]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [51]={hint="Bring Longwalker Malah's Report to Brave Wildrunner in Bloodhoof Village."}, [52]={npc="Brave Wildrunner", tgt="Brave Wildrunner"}, [53]={npc="Brave Wildrunner", tgt="Brave Wildrunner"}, [54]={hint="Bring Longwalker Malah's Report to Baine Bloodhoof."}, [55]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [56]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [57]={npc="Zarlman Two-Moons", tgt="Zarlman Two-Moons"}, [58]={npc="Harken Windtotem", tgt="Harken Windtotem"}, [59]={npc="Zarlman Two-Moons", tgt="Zarlman Two-Moons"}, [60]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [61]={npc="Ruul Eagletalon", tgt="Ruul Eagletalon"}, [62]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane", tag="Optional"}, [63]={text="West: Palemane and the dig site. Follow the vision to the seer"}, [64]={hint="Kill 10 Palemane Tanners, 8 Palemane Skinners, and 5 Palemane Poachers, then return to Baine Bloodhoof in Bloodhoof Village."}, [65]={hint="Collect 5 Prospector's Picks."}, [66]={hint="Consume the Water of the Seers in front of the tribal fire in Bloodhoof Village and follow the vision once it appears.", desc="Drink the Water of the Seers at the campfire. Follow the vision northwest."}, [67]={npc="Perith Stormhoof", tgt="Perith Stormhoof", tag="Optional", desc="Escort now and turn in on your first visit to Thunder Bluff."}, [68]={hint="Help Perith Stormhoof escape Palemane Rock, and report his safety to Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional"}, [69]={npc="Seer Wiserunner", tgt="Seer Wiserunner"}, [70]={npc="Seer Wiserunner", tgt="Seer Wiserunner"}, [71]={hint="Bring 6 Stalker Claws and 6 Cougar Claws to Mull Thunderhorn."}, [72]={text="Hearth to Bloodhoof Village and turn in the western quests together."}, [73]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [74]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [75]={npc="Maur Raincaller", tgt="Maur Raincaller"}, [76]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [77]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [78]={hint="Ahab Wheathoof at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore wants you to feed his prized puppy, Kyle the Frenzied.", tag="Optional", desc="Have one Tender Strider Meat. Wait for Kyle to come close before feeding him."}, [79]={npc="Ahab Wheathoof", tgt="Ahab Wheathoof", tag="Optional"}, [80]={text="Northern wells, red stones and the mine in the northeast"}, [81]={hint="Use the Thunderhorn Cleansing Totem at the Thunderhorn Water Well, then return to Mull."}, [82]={hint="Travel to Red Rocks east of Thunder Bluff and speak with the Ancestral Spirit."}, [83]={npc="Lorekeeper Raintotem", tgt="Lorekeeper Raintotem"}, [84]={hint="Lorekeeper Raintotem wants you to kill 8 Bristleback Interlopers at Red Rocks."}, [85]={hint="Bring 8 Windfury Talons to Ruul Eagletalon in Bloodhoof Village."}, [86]={npc="Ancestral Spirit", tgt="Ancestral Spirit"}, [87]={npc="Lorekeeper Raintotem", tgt="Lorekeeper Raintotem"}, [88]={npc="Ancestral Spirit", tgt="Ancestral Spirit"}, [89]={hint="Kill 6 Galak Centaurs, 4 Galak Outrunners, and bring the head of Herak the Pillager to Baine Bloodhoof."}, [90]={hint="Kill 14 Venture Co. Workers and 6 Venture Co. Supervisors for Morin Cloudstalker at Bloodhoof Village."}, [91]={hint="Kill Supervisor Fizsprocket and return his clipboard to Morin Cloudstalker at Bloodhoof Village."}, [92]={npc="Mulgore Expansion Plans", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Starting with Mulgore Expansion Plans dropped by Supervisor Fizsprocket."}, [93]={hint="Collect the rest of Supervisor Fizsprocket's pages inside The Venture Co. Mine and bring them to Morin Cloudstalker near Bloodhoof Village.", tag="Optional", desc="The three notes are all in The Venture Co. Mine. Collect them all before leaving."}, [94]={hint="Defeat Chakuyak and bring back her pelt.", tag="Optional"}, [95]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker"}, [96]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker"}, [97]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker", tag="Optional"}, [98]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker", tag="Optional", desc="If you are less than level 12, return to the mining area to make up for it."}, [99]={hint="Bring the Clearcutter Key to Morin Cloudstalker outside Bloodhoof Village.", tag="Optional", desc="If you are less than level 12, return to the mining area to make up for it."}, [100]={npc="Morin Cloudstalker", tgt="Morin Cloudstalker", tag="Optional", desc="If you are less than level 12, return to the mining area to make up for it."}, [101]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [102]={npc="Ruul Eagletalon", tgt="Ruul Eagletalon"}, [103]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane", tag="Optional"}, [104]={npc="Baine Bloodhoof", tgt="Baine Bloodhoof"}, [105]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn"}, [106]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn", tag="Optional"}, [107]={hint="Bring 8 Prairie Alpha Teeth to Mull Thunderhorn in Bloodhoof Village.", tag="Optional"}, [108]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn", tag="Optional"}, [109]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn", tag="Optional"}, [110]={hint="Use the Wildmane Cleansing Totem at the Wildmane Water Well, then return to Mull Thunderhorn.", tag="Optional"}, [111]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn", tag="Optional"}, [112]={npc="Mull Thunderhorn", tgt="Mull Thunderhorn", tag="Optional"}, [113]={npc="Skorn Whitecloud", tgt="Skorn Whitecloud", tag="Optional"}, [114]={hint="Bring 4 Flatland Prowler Claws to Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional"}, [115]={text="Unlock Thunder Bluff and continue to the Crossroads"}, [116]={text="Follow Mulgore's main road to Thunder Bluff. Take the lift and learn Tal's flight path (47.00, 49.83)."}, [117]={hint="Speak with Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff."}, [118]={hint="Seek audience with High Chieftain Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff."}, [119]={npc="Cairne Bloodhoof", tgt="Cairne Bloodhoof"}, [120]={npc="Cairne Bloodhoof", tgt="Cairne Bloodhoof"}, [121]={npc="Cairne Bloodhoof", tgt="Cairne Bloodhoof", tag="Optional"}, [122]={hint="Bring Thunderhorn's Report to Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional"}, [123]={npc="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem", tgt="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem", tag="Optional"}, [124]={npc="Melor Stonehoof", tgt="Melor Stonehoof", tag="Optional"}, [125]={npc="Eylah Sunhorn", tgt="Eylah Sunhorn", tag="Optional", desc="Buy all four materials on the bluff. Use the incense on Hunter Rise."}, [126]={hint="Purchase a Bundle of Herbs from Nida the herbalist, a Bundle of Cedar Twigs from Nata the enchanting supplier, and Sinew Thread from Mahu the leatherworking supplier and Ceremonial Flint and Tinder from Naal the cooking supplier.", tag="Optional", desc="Buy all four materials on the bluff. Use the incense on Hunter Rise."}, [127]={npc="Eylah Sunhorn", tgt="Eylah Sunhorn", tag="Optional", desc="Buy all four materials on the bluff. Use the incense on Hunter Rise."}, [128]={npc="Veren Tallstrider", tgt="Veren Tallstrider", tag="Optional", desc="Learn skinning and pay 12 pieces of light skin."}, [129]={hint="Bring 12 pieces of Light Leather to Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional", desc="Learn skinning and pay 12 pieces of light skin. Turn in at Thunder Bluff. Skin low-level beasts for Light Leather or buy it."}, [130]={npc="Veren Tallstrider", tgt="Veren Tallstrider", tag="Optional", desc="Learn skinning and pay 12 pieces of light skin."}, [131]={npc="Veren Tallstrider", tgt="Veren Tallstrider", tag="Optional", desc="Meet the Leatherworking requirement. Bring 4 Light Leather and 4 Coarse Thread."}, [132]={hint="Bring 4 Light Leather and 4 Coarse Thread to Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional", desc="Meet the Leatherworking requirement. Bring 4 Light Leather and 4 Coarse Thread. Turn in at Thunder Bluff. Skin or buy Light Leather. Buy Coarse Thread from a vendor."}, [133]={npc="Veren Tallstrider", tgt="Veren Tallstrider", tag="Optional", desc="Meet the Leatherworking requirement. Bring 4 Light Leather and 4 Coarse Thread."}, [134]={text="At level 12, leave Mulgore by the east gate. Learn Omusa Thunderhorn's flight path in Camp Taurajo (44.45, 59.15)."}, [135]={npc="Kirge Sternhorn", tgt="Kirge Sternhorn", tag="Optional", desc="Picked up via Taolazu, destination is The Crossroads."}, [136]={hint="Speak with Thork at the Crossroads in the Barrens.", tag="Optional", desc="Picked up via Taolazu, destination is The Crossroads."}, [137]={npc="Thork", tgt="Thork", tag="Optional", desc="Picked up via Taolazu, destination is The Crossroads."}, [138]={npc="Narm Skychaser", tgt="Narm Skychaser", desc="Start in Bloodhoof Village. Continue Call of Fire-Call of Fire from Kranal or at the Crossroads."}, [139]={hint="Find Kranal Fiss in the Barrens.", desc="Start in Bloodhoof Village. Continue Call of Fire-Call of Fire from Kranal or at the Crossroads."}, [140]={npc="Kranal Fiss", tgt="Kranal Fiss", desc="Start in Bloodhoof Village. Continue Call of Fire-Call of Fire from Kranal or at the Crossroads."}, [141]={npc="Kary Thunderhorn", tgt="Kary Thunderhorn", tag="Optional", desc="Choose one of the three guides, directly contact Yawen to answer Taming the Beast."}, [142]={hint="Speak with Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village.", tag="Optional", desc="Choose one of the three guides, directly contact Yawen to answer Taming the Beast."}, [143]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane", tag="Optional", desc="Choose one of the three guides, directly contact Yawen to answer Taming the Beast."}, [144]={npc="Sian'dur", tgt="Sian'dur", tag="Optional", desc="Choose one of the three guides, directly contact Yawen to answer Taming the Beast."}, [145]={hint="Speak with Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village.", tag="Optional", desc="Choose one of the three guides, directly contact Yawen to answer Taming the Beast."}, [146]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane", tag="Optional", desc="Choose one of the three guides, directly contact Yawen to answer Taming the Beast."}, [147]={npc="Thotar", tgt="Thotar", tag="Optional", desc="Choose one of the three guides, directly contact Yawen to answer Taming the Beast."}, [148]={hint="Speak with Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village.", tag="Optional", desc="Choose one of the three guides, directly contact Yawen to answer Taming the Beast."}, [149]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane", tag="Optional", desc="Choose one of the three guides, directly contact Yawen to answer Taming the Beast."}, [150]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [151]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame an Adult Plainstrider. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village."}, [152]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [153]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [154]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Prairie Stalker. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village."}, [155]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [156]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [157]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Swoop. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village."}, [158]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [159]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane", desc="After all three tames, train pet skills on Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff."}, [160]={hint="Speak with Holt Thunderhorn on Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff.", desc="After all three tames, train pet skills on Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff."}, [161]={npc="Holt Thunderhorn", tgt="Holt Thunderhorn", desc="After all three tames, train pet skills on Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff."}, [162]={npc="Gennia Runetotem", tgt="Gennia Runetotem", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [163]={hint="Speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [164]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up M