ndrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze", desc="Talk to Great Bear Spirit to the northwest, then return to Nighthaven."}, [177]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze"}, [178]={hint="Return to Thunder Bluff and speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise."}, [179]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem"}, [180]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem"}, [181]={hint="Use the Cenarion Lunardust on the Moonkin Stone between Mulgore and the Barrens to bring forth Lunaclaw. From there, you must face Lunaclaw and earn the strength of body and heart it possesses."}, [182]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem"}, [183]={text="Follow the road north to the Crossroads. Learn Devrak's flight path (51.50, 30.34) and set your hearth with Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind (51.99, 29.89)."}}},
    ["01-5"] = {name="Deathknell", tips={{k="交通", text="From another start zone, leave the zeppelin tower south of Brill and follow the road west to Deathknell."}, {k="提醒", text="Start at Rude Awakening inside the tomb [Undead only]. After arriving at Deathknell, pick up The Mindless Ones at Shadow Priest Sarvis (30.84, 66.20). If Xavius ​​doesn't show a quest, follow the road to Brill.", s={{"Start at Rude Awakening inside the tomb [Undead only]", {race={"Scourge"}}}, {"After arriving at Deathknell, pick up The Mindless Ones at Shadow Priest Sarvis (30.84, 66.20)"}, {"If Xavius ​​doesn't show a quest, follow the road to Brill"}}}, {k="提醒", text="I haven't reached level 3 yet to fight a few more Rattlecage Skeleton, and I won't pick up Marla's Last Wish until I reach level 3. Go to Brill when you reach level 6 or finish this section.", s={{"I haven't reached level 3 yet to fight a few more Rattlecage Skeleton, and I won't pick up Marla's Last Wish until I reach level 3"}, {"Go to Brill when you reach level 6 or finish this section"}}}}, danger={[1]="The narrow passage of Night Web's Hollow can easily pull in two groups of spiders at the front and rear at the same time. The entrance must be cleared first before entering."}, grind={[1]={mob="Wretched Zombie", note="Dense/normal mobs/mostly neutral, pull one at a time/Deathknell North side, level 1-2 are brainless zombies"}, [2]={mob="Night Web Spider", note="Dense/normal mobs/Yidora in the cave, clear them step by step from the entrance to the inside/Night Web's Hollow, follow the cave quest"}, [3]={mob="Scarlet Initiate", note="Densely packed/normal mobs/mixed with believers, attack the outside of the camp/the bloody camp on the east side first, and clear it together with the armband quest"}}, supply={[1]={npc="Blacksmith Rand"}, [2]={npc="Joshua Kien"}, [3]={npc="Joshua Kien"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Undertaker Mordo", tgt="Undertaker Mordo"}, [2]={hint="Speak with Shadow Priest Sarvis."}, [3]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [4]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [5]={hint="Shadow Priest Sarvis wants you to kill 8 Mindless Zombies and 8 Wretched Zombies."}, [6]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [7]={npc="Novice Elreth", tgt="Novice Elreth"}, [8]={hint="Novice Elreth requires 6 Scavenger Paws and 6 Duskbat Wings."}, [9]={npc="Novice Elreth", tgt="Novice Elreth"}, [10]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [11]={npc="Deathguard Saltain", tgt="Deathguard Saltain"}, [12]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [13]={npc="Novice Elreth", tgt="Novice Elreth"}, [14]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand"}, [15]={hint="Kill 12 Rattlecage Skeletons, and then return to Shadow Priest Sarvis in Deathknell when you are done."}, [16]={hint="Search Deathknell and the vicinity for 6 pieces of Scavenged Goods, and return them to Deathguard Saltain."}, [17]={hint="Executor Arren wants you to kill 10 Young Night Web Spiders and 8 Night Web Spiders."}, [18]={hint="Bring Samuel Fipps' Remains to Marla's Grave, then return to Novice Elreth."}, [19]={hint="Free 6 Webbed Victims in Night's Web Hollow for Aramis Hammerhand in Deathknell."}, [20]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [21]={npc="Deathguard Saltain", tgt="Deathguard Saltain"}, [22]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [23]={npc="Novice Elreth", tgt="Novice Elreth"}, [24]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand"}, [25]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [26]={hint="Bring Executor Arren 12 Scarlet Armbands from Scarlet Converts and Scarlet Initiates."}, [27]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [28]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [29]={hint="Kill Meven Korgal, the messenger, at the Crusader camp, then return any information you find to Executor Arren."}, [30]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [31]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [32]={npc=