ll and speak to David Trias in Deathknell.", desc="After completing the prerequisite The Mindless Ones, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [47]={npc="David Trias", tgt="David Trias", desc="After completing the prerequisite The Mindless Ones, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [48]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [49]={hint="Read the Tainted Scroll and speak to Maximillion in Deathknell."}, [50]={npc="Maximillion", tgt="Maximillion"}, [51]={npc="Venya Marthand", tgt="Venya Marthand", desc="Deathknell route, the quest itself allows for Horde Warlocks."}, [52]={hint="Bring Venya Marthand 3 Rattlecage Skulls.", desc="Deathknell route, the quest itself allows for Horde Warlocks."}, [53]={npc="Venya Marthand", tgt="Venya Marthand", desc="Deathknell route, the quest itself allows for Horde Warlocks."}, [54]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones to unlock the scroll."}, [55]={hint="Read the Hallowed Scroll and speak to Dark Cleric Duesten in the church in Deathknell.", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones to unlock the scroll."}, [56]={npc="Dark Cleric Duesten", tgt="Dark Cleric Duesten", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones to unlock the scroll."}, [57]={npc="Dark Cleric Duesten", tgt="Dark Cleric Duesten"}, [58]={hint="Speak to Dark Cleric Beryl in Tirisfal Glades."}, [59]={npc="Dark Cleric Beryl", tgt="Dark Cleric Beryl"}, [60]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis", desc="First hand The Mindless Ones Brainless Zombies."}, [61]={hint="Read the Glyphic Scroll and speak to Isabella in the church in Deathknell.", desc="First hand The Mindless Ones Brainless Zombies."}, [62]={npc="Isabella", tgt="Isabella", desc="First hand The Mindless Ones Brainless Zombies."}, [63]={text="Take the east road out of Deathknell to Brill."}}},
    ["01-6"] = {name="Tirisfal Glades: Brill", tips={{k="提醒", text="If Vital Intelligence is not answered, start directly from Brill hotel and the first batch of available quests.", s={{"If Vital Intelligence is not answered, start directly from Brill hotel and the first batch of available quests"}}}, {k="取捨", text="Blood, Spider and Tombweed can be taken together in the southeast; Murlocs and Agamand on the north shore can be taken together in one trip. Start with inbreeding, then move to The Crossroads at level 12."}, {k="取捨", text="The The Chill of Death next to the hotel requires Coarse Thread, so buy it from the supplier en route. Hides for the Forsaken If you still lack the North Shore Murloc Skin, wait until you go to the North Shore to complete it."}, {k="取捨", text="Bandarion Keep [Orcs/Trolls/Undead only] can be obtained after the two local quests of the Argent Dawn. Some parts of the fortress can be picked up later [Undead only]. Rush to The Crossroads to leave after the Argent Dawn's two local quests.", s={{"Bandarion Keep [Orcs/Trolls/Undead only] can be obtained after the two local quests of the Argent Dawn", {race={"Orc", "Troll", "Scourge"}}}, {"Some parts of the fortress can be picked up later [Undead only]", {race={"Scourge"}}}, {"Rush to The Crossroads to leave after the Argent Dawn's two local quests"}}}, {k="提醒", text="If you have not reached level 12, give priority to At War With The Scarlet Crusade, The Family Crypt or Argent Dawn The Argent Emissary/The Cult of the Damned/Remnants of War, depending on where you are.", s={{"If you have not reached level 12, give priority to At War With The Scarlet Crusade, The Family Crypt or Argent Dawn The Argent Emissary/The Cult of the Damned/Remnants of War, depending on where you are"}}}}, danger={[1]="There are blood zombies and Wandering Spirit mixed in the southeast cemetery, and they are easily attacked from both front and rear. Clear along the edge of the cemetery to leave an escape route."}, grind={