g="Optional", desc="Channeling optional, and the quest itself allows for Horde Warlocks."}, [188]={npc="Carendin Halgar", tgt="Carendin Halgar", desc="Find Egarin's Grimoire in the ruined tower south of Brill."}, [189]={hint="Recover Egalin's Grimoire and bring it to Carendin Halgar in the Temple of the Damned.", desc="Find Egarin's Grimoire in the ruined tower south of Brill."}, [190]={npc="Carendin Halgar", tgt="Carendin Halgar", desc="Find Egarin's Grimoire in the ruined tower south of Brill."}, [191]={npc="Carendin Halgar", tgt="Carendin Halgar", desc="Use the rune in the summoning circle in the magic area to defeat Summoned Voidwalker."}, [192]={hint="Using the Runes of Summoning, summon and subdue a voidwalker, then return the Runes of Summoning to Carendin Halgar in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity.", desc="Use the rune in the summoning circle in the magic area to defeat Summoned Voidwalker."}, [193]={npc="Carendin Halgar", tgt="Carendin Halgar", desc="Use the rune in the summoning circle in the magic area to defeat Summoned Voidwalker."}, [194]={npc="Dark Cleric Beryl", tgt="Dark Cleric Beryl", desc="You must first learn Lesser Healing (Level 2) and Power Word: Fortitude from your trainer."}, [195]={hint="Find Deathguard Kel and heal his wounds using Lesser Heal (Rank 2). Afterwards, grant him Power Word: Fortitude and then return to Dark Cleric Beryl in Brill.", desc="You must first learn Lesser Healing (Level 2) and Power Word: Fortitude from your trainer."}, [196]={npc="Dark Cleric Beryl", tgt="Dark Cleric Beryl", desc="You must first learn Lesser Healing (Level 2) and Power Word: Fortitude from your trainer."}, [197]={npc="Aelthalyste", tgt="Aelthalyste"}, [198]={hint="Complete the quest objectives."}, [199]={npc="Aelthalyste", tgt="Aelthalyste"}, [200]={npc="Cain Firesong", tgt="Cain Firesong"}, [201]={hint="Speak with Anastasia Hartwell."}, [202]={npc="Anastasia Hartwell", tgt="Anastasia Hartwell"}, [203]={npc="Anastasia Hartwell", tgt="Anastasia Hartwell"}, [204]={hint="Bring Balnir Snapdragons to Anastasia Hartwell in the Mage Quarter of the Undercity."}, [205]={npc="Anastasia Hartwell", tgt="Anastasia Hartwell"}, [206]={text="Board the Orgrimmar zeppelin at Zapetta's west platform southeast of Brill (60.74, 58.87). Get off at the south platform of the east tower outside Orgrimmar (50.82, 13.54)."}, [207]={text="Enter Orgrimmar and learn Doras's flight path (45.12, 63.89). Fly to the Crossroads if unlocked. Otherwise run south to Razor Hill, cross west into the Barrens and continue to the Crossroads. Learn Devrak's flight path (51.50, 30.34) and set your hearth with Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind (51.99, 29.89)."}}},
    ["01-7"] = {tips={{k="交通", text="From another start zone, board the Skycutter at Skywatcher Plateau's south dock in Mulgore (34.30, 25.80). Get off at Valanaar's west dock (57.90, 80.90) and follow the road north."}, {k="提醒", text="From Valanaar, follow the road north to Thendal Grove. Other Horde races can do the shared side quests. Race restrictions and missing prerequisites are filtered. At levels 1-3, kill young vuldren and cirrusflies before the gathering and village quests. If you finish below 12, do side quests in Bloodhoof Village.", s={{"From Valanaar, follow the road north to Thendal Grove"}, {"Other Horde races can do the shared side quests"}, {"Race restrictions and missing prerequisites are filtered"}, {"At levels 1-3, kill young vuldren and cirrusflies before the gathering and village quests"}, {"If you finish below 12, do side quests in Bloodhoof Village"}}}, {k="取捨", text="The main line of the island takes Tandel, Shen'dar Village, Valanaar and Shrine of Akir in sequence. If you haven't reached level 12 yet, first do the Orchard or Shadowgale Forest side quest, and then take the zeppelin."}, {k="取捨", text="The village apprentice and bandit quests can be taken together. also connect Hippogryph Harassment [only Skyborne] at the same time. The Problem With Prideclaws to Simple Leather Satchel. Meddlesome Mages Optional Idol of Shifting Tides [Druids only]. Complete Call of Fire to obtain Totem of Charged Flames [Shaman only].", s={{"The village apprentice and bandit quests can be taken together. also connect Hippogryph Harassment [only Skyborne] at the same time"}, {"The Problem With Prideclaws to Simple Leather Satchel"}, {"Meddlesome Mages Optional Idol of Shifting Tides [Druids only]"}, {"Complete Call of Fire to obtain Totem of Charged Flames [Shaman only]"}}}, {k="提醒", text="The two island lead-ins, What Comes Next and The Earthen Ring, show level 13 but can be picked up from level 7 after the main chain.", s={{"The two island lead-ins, What Comes Next and The Earthen Ring, show level 13 but can be picked up from level 7 after the main chain"}}}}, danger={[1]="Thendal Grove The jump route from the observation tower requires walking on the air. Put the racial skills on the shortcut list first, and use them immediately after jumping off.", [2]="Shadowgale Forest Al'Aketh Stormchaser in the camp should be mixed among the foot soldiers. Don't go through the center of the camp and pull them one by one along the outer circle."}, grind={[1]={mob="Juvenile Vuldren", note="Dense/normal mobs/open monsters one by one, pay attention to nearby swarms/Thendal Grove, level 1-2 can be upgraded near the starting point first"}, [2]={mob="Highlands Bandit", note="Dense/normal mobs/robbers will gather in groups, clear the edge of the camp first/Shen'dar Highlands, and go with The Criminal Element and Pilfered Windstones"}, [3]={mob="Al'Aketh Stormchaser", note="Dense/normal mobs/mixed with foot soldiers, first pull/Shadowgale Forest from the outside of the camp, followed by Unwanted and Unworthy, gain experience when approaching level 12"}}, supply={[1]={npc="Fevrath Skyhammer"}, [2]={npc="Uualia Suncrest"}, [3]={npc="Uualia Suncrest"}, [4]={npc="Zephras Citizen"}, [5]={npc="Aedi Thriceforged"}, [6]={npc="Zephras Citizen"}, [7]={npc="Belandiel Farflight"}, [8]={npc="Donaal Downbreeze"}, [9]={npc="Taliaa Brightsky"}, [10]={npc="Donaal Downbreeze"}, [11]={npc="Antelariaa Cloudgaze"}, [12]={npc="Tal"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Dalia the Collector", tgt="Ailee Farheart"}, [2]={hint="Speak with Rorian the Dayseeker in Thendal Grove."}, [3]={npc="Ailee Farheart", tgt="Rorian the Dayseeker"}, [4]={npc="Ailee Farheart", tgt="Rorian the Dayseeker"}, [5]={npc="Falorne Fallwind", tgt="Elatrell Featherlight"}, [6]={npc="Myriaal Mistwake", tgt="Myriaal Mistwake"}, [7]={npc="Halaan Hawk-Eye", tgt="Halaan Hawk-Eye"}, [8]={hint="Slay 8 Vuldren Juveniles in Thendal Grove."}, [9]={hint="Slay 8 Pesky Cirrusflies in Thendal Grove."}, [10]={hint="Jump from the top of the watchtower in Thendal Grove and use your Walk on Air ability to slow your fall.", desc="Jump from the watchtower and activate the Skyborne racial before landing."}, [11]={hint="Speak with Halaan Hawk-Eye and borrow his gift to view the anchor pylon in the distance."}, [12]={npc="Ailee Farheart", tgt="Rorian the Dayseeker"}, [13]={npc="Falorne Fallwind", tgt="Elatrell Featherlight"}, [14]={npc="Ailee Farheart", tgt="Rorian the Dayseeker"}, [15]={npc="Halaan Hawk-Eye", tgt="Halaan Hawk-Eye"}, [16]={npc="Falorne Fallwind", tgt="Elatrell Featherlight"}, [17]={npc="Destin Thriceforged", tgt="Dalia the Collector"}, [18]={npc="Ailee Farheart", tgt="Rorian the Dayseeker"}, [19]={npc="Ventaari Brightwish", tgt="Ventaari Brightwish"}, [20]={hint="Destroy the Cirrusfly Queen in Thendal Grove."}, [21]={hint="Collect 15 Windstone Clusters from Raw Windstones in Thendal Grove."}, [22]={hint="Use your Skysight racial ability at the Elemental Convergence in Thendal Grove.", desc="Use the Skyborne racial next to the elemental convergence."}, [23]={npc="Falorne Fallwind", tgt="Elatrell Featherlight"}, [24]={npc="Destin Thriceforged", tgt="Dalia the Collector"}, [25]={npc="Ventaari Brightwish", tgt="Ventaari Brightwish"}, [26]={hint="Speak to Yala Windwatcher in Thendal Grove."}, [27]={npc="Yala Windwatcher", tgt="Yala Windwatcher"}, [28]={npc="Yala Windwatcher", tgt="Yala Windwatcher"}, [29]={hint="Slay 6 Roiling Winds and 7 Al'Aketh Converts in Thendal Grove."}, [30]={npc="Yala Windwatcher", tgt="Yala Windwatcher"}, [31]={npc="Yala Windwatcher", tgt="Yala Windwatcher"}, [32]={hint="Bring word of the Al'Aketh to Rorian the Dayseeker in Thendal Grove."}, [33]={npc="Ailee Farheart", tgt="Rorian the Dayseeker"}, [34]={npc="Ailee Farheart", tgt="Rorian the Dayseeker"}, [35]={hint="Speak with Aetheen of the Gales in Thendal Grove."}, [36]={npc="Elatrell Featherlight", tgt="Aetheen of the Gales"}, [37]={npc="Valreaa Valewind", tgt="Valreaa Valewind"}, [38]={npc="Elatrel