ar Highlands."}, [68]={hint="Collect 3 Small Eggs and 8 Strider Meat from creatures found throughout the Shen'dar Highlands."}, [69]={hint="Slay 6 High Order Apprentices in Shen'dar Highlands."}, [70]={hint="Slay 8 Hippogryph Youths, 6 Hippogryph Protectors and a Hippogryph Matriarch in the Shen'dar Highlands."}, [71]={hint="Kill 10 Highlands Bandits and their leader, \"Badwind\" Bennic in the Shen'dar Highlands."}, [72]={hint="Collect 10 Pilfered Windstones from the Highlands Bandits in the Shen'dar Highlands."}, [73]={hint="Collect 8 Hippogryph Down feathers in the Shen'dar Highlands."}, [74]={npc="Indari Sunseam", tgt="Indari Sunseam", star={"Simple Leather Satchel"}}, [75]={npc="Teeri Wellwind", tgt="Zerril Softbreeze"}, [76]={npc="Illaya Amberwind", tgt="Illaya Amberwind", star={"Idol of Shifting Tides", {"DRUID"}}}, [77]={npc="Teeri Wellwind", tgt="Teeri Wellwind"}, [78]={npc="Constable Aonda", tgt="Constable Aonda"}, [79]={npc="Teeri Wellwind", tgt="Teeri Wellwind"}, [80]={npc="Taleen Shimmerthread", tgt="Taleen Shimmerthread"}, [81]={npc="Bounty Available: Vulgara the Insatiable!", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Elite, one can jump with great difficulty."}, [82]={hint="Kill Vulgara the Insatiable in the Shen'dar Highlands and bring her head to Danarii Bellowveil.", tag="Optional", desc="Elite, one can jump with great difficulty."}, [83]={npc="Danarii Bellowveil", tgt="Danarii Bellowveil", tag="Optional", desc="Elite, one can jump with great difficulty."}, [84]={npc="Raan Wildwind", tgt="Raan Wildwind", tag="Optional", desc="Do it when you want to understand the function of the camp."}, [85]={hint="Sit near Raan's Basic Campfire and wait until you receive the Boosted Rest buff.", tag="Optional", desc="Do it when you want to understand the function of the camp."}, [86]={npc="Raan Wildwind", tgt="Raan Wildwind", tag="Optional", desc="Do it when you want to understand the function of the camp."}, [87]={text="Falaath Village and the western watchtower"}, [88]