yhoppers in Valanaar until you've eliminated 8 Enchanted Skyhoppers."}, [170]={npc="Yorana Windyreed", tgt="Yorana Windyreed"}, [171]={hint="Bring Yorna's Report to Valennia Stormfist in Valanaar."}, [172]={npc="Valennia Stormfist", tgt="Valennia Stormfist"}, [173]={npc="Valennia Stormfist", tgt="Valennia Stormfist"}, [174]={npc="Ayessa Dawnsinger", tgt="Ayessa Dawnsinger"}, [175]={npc="Valennia Stormfist", tgt="Valennia Stormfist"}, [176]={hint="Speak with Talaanis Shadowsong in Valanaar."}, [177]={npc="Peacekeeper Elite", tgt="Talaanis Shadowsong"}, [178]={npc="Peacekeeper Elite", tgt="Talaanis Shadowsong"}, [179]={hint="Find the cultist turncoat at the house just inside the highlands northwest of Valanaar."}, [180]={npc="Dead Cultist", tgt="Dead Cultist"}, [181]={npc="Dead Cultist", tgt="Dead Cultist"}, [182]={hint="Deliver the glowing crystal to Talanaanis Shadowsong in Valanaar."}, [183]={npc="Peacekeeper Elite", tgt="Talaanis Shadowsong"}, [184]={npc="Talaanis Shadowsong", tgt="Talaanis Shadowsong"}, [185]={hint="Speak with Talaanis Shadowsong and observe the conversation."}, [186]={npc="Talaanis Shadowsong", tgt="Talaanis Shadowsong"}, [187]={npc="Peacekeeper Elite", tgt="Talaanis Shadowsong"}, [188]={hint="Speak with Valennia Stormfist in Valanaar and follow her instructions."}, [189]={npc="Valennia Stormfist", tgt="Valennia Stormfist"}, [190]={text="Optional XP in Shadowgale Forest. At level, go straight to the Shrine of Akir"}, [191]={npc="Lotheluum Starbreeze", tgt="Lotheluum Starbreeze", tag="Optional"}, [192]={hint="Find and speak with Elegael Thornpaw in the northeastern part of Shadowgale Forest.", tag="Optional"}, [193]={npc="Elegael Thornpaw", tgt="Elegael Thornpaw", tag="Optional"}, [194]={npc="Elegael Thornpaw", tgt="Elegael Thornpaw", tag="Optional"}, [195]={npc="Elegael Thornpaw", tgt="Elegael Thornpaw", tag="Optional"}, [196]={npc="Elegael Thornpaw", tgt="Elegael Thornpaw", tag="Optional"}, [197]={hint="Collect 8 Lady's Tear Moss.", tag="Optional"}, [198]={hint="Collect 20 feathers from the Shadowgale Shrieklings in Shadowgale Forest.", tag="Optional"}, [199]={hint="Collect 10 Bloodied Heirlooms from Al'Aketh Footsoldiers and Al'Aketh Stormchasers in the Shadowgale Forest.", tag="Optional"}, [200]={npc="Elegael Thornpaw", tgt="Elegael Thornpaw", tag="Optional"}, [201]={npc="Elegael Thornpaw", tgt="Elegael Thornpaw", tag="Optional"}, [202]={npc="Elegael Thornpaw", tgt="Elegael Thornpaw", tag="Optional"}, [203]={hint="Gather 10 Wind Hollow Essences from Wind Hollows in the Shadowgale Forest.", tag="Optional"}, [204]={npc="Endaria Mistgaze", tgt="Endaria Mistgaze", tag="Optional"}, [205]={npc="Elegael Thornpaw", tgt="Elegael Thornpaw", tag="Optional"}, [206]={hint="Kill Commander Haalien and bring his head to Elegael Thornpaw in the Shadowgale Forest.", tag="Optional"}, [207]={npc="Elegael Thornpaw", tgt="Elegael Thornpaw", tag="Optional"}, [208]={npc="Elegael Thornpaw", tgt="Elegael Thornpaw", tag="Optional"}, [209]={hint="Enter the Nightfang Den and heal 7 druids and find Jorel Windsinger in Shadowgale Forest.", tag="Optional"}, [210]={npc="Elegael Thornpaw", tgt="Elegael Thornpaw", tag="Optional"}, [211]={npc="Ripped Missive", npcObj=true, tag="Optional"}, [212]={hint="Bring the Ripped Missive to Elegael Thornpaw in the Shadowgale Forest.", tag="Optional"}, [213]={npc="Elegael Thornpaw", tgt="Elegael Thornpaw", tag="Optional"}, [214]={npc="Elegael Thornpaw", tgt="Elegael Thornpaw", tag="Optional"}, [215]={hint="Give the missive to Lotheluum in Valanaar and tell him what has transpired.", tag="Optional"}, [216]={npc="Lotheluum Starbreeze", tgt="Lotheluum Starbreeze", tag="Optional"}, [217]={npc="Strange Hermit", tgt="Strange Hermit", tag="Optional"}, [218]={hint="Speak with the Strange Hermit in the Shadowgale Forest and learn more about him.", tag="Optional"}, [219]={npc="Strange Hermit", tgt="Strange Hermit", tag="Optional"}, [220]={npc="Strange Hermit", tgt="Strange Hermit", tag="Optional"}, [221]={hint="Gather 8 Shadowgale Acorns in Shadowgale Forest.", tag="Optional"}, [222]={npc="Strange Hermit", tgt="Strange Hermit", tag="Optional"}, [223]={npc="Strange Hermit", tgt="Strange Hermit", tag="Optional"}, [224]={hint="Destroy 10 Wind Hollows in Shadowgale Forest.", tag="Optional"}, [225]={npc="Strange Hermit", tgt="Strange Hermit", tag="Optional"}, [226]={text="Shrine of Akir and the outlying islands"}, [227]={npc="Valennia Stormfist", tgt="Valennia Stormfist"}, [228]={hint="Speak with Valennia Stormfist in the Gustberry Lowlands."}, [229]={npc="Valennia Stormfist", tgt="Valennia Stormfist"}, [230]={npc="Valennia Stormfist", tgt="Valennia Stormfist"}, [231]={hint="Slay 7 Al'Aketh Guardians, 7 Al'Aketh Spiritcallers, and 7 Al'Aketh Blademasters, then report to Hyusaa Quickbreeze at the Shrine of Akir."}, [232]={npc="Hyusaa Quickbreeze", tgt="Hyusaa Quickbreeze"}, [233]={npc="Hyusaa Quickbreeze", tgt="Hyusaa Quickbreeze"}, [234]={hint="Speak with Valennia Stormfist inside the inner sanctum at the Shrine of Akir."}, [235]={npc="Valennia Stormfist", tgt="Valennia Stormfist"}, [236]={npc="Valennia Stormfist", tgt="Valennia Stormfist"}, [237]={hint="Take the portal to the Rohashi Spires overhead and join Elaadrin Evengale and Ayessa Dawnsinger in their confrontation with the High Priestess Lorthuna.", desc="Portal to the spires for the event. Turn in afterward in Valanaar."}, [238]={npc="Ayessa Dawnsinger", tgt="Ayessa Dawnsinger"}, [239]={npc="Ayessa Dawnsinger", tgt="Ayessa Dawnsinger"}, [240]={hint="Speak with Talaanis Shadowsong in Valanaar."}, [241]={npc="Talaanis Shadowsong", tgt="Talaanis Shadowsong"}, [242]={npc="Peacekeeper Elite", tgt="Talaanis Shadowsong"}, [243]={hint="Speak with Ayessa Dawnsinger when you are prepared to leave Zephras Isle."}, [244]={npc="Ayessa Dawnsinger", tgt="Ayessa Dawnsinger"}, [245]={npc="Ayessa Dawnsinger", tgt="Ayessa Dawnsinger"}, [246]={text="Board the skycutter at Valanaar's west dock (57.90, 80.90), by the Skyborne dockmaster. Get off at Skywatcher Plateau's south dock in Mulgore (34.30, 25.80). Valanaar's east dock (65.90, 83.50) serves Dalaran."}, [247]={hint="Take the skycutter ship from Zephras Isle to Mulgore and speak with Alaana Stormwalker when you arrive."}, [248]={npc="Alaana Stormwalker", tgt="Alaana Stormwalker", desc="The same quest can also be found at Alaana Stormwalker (33.42, 22.59)."}, [249]={npc="Alaana Stormwalker", tgt="Alaana Stormwalker", tag="Optional", desc="Then pay at Orgrimmar."}, [250]={npc="Ailee Farheart", tgt="Rorian the Dayseeker", desc="After completing the prerequisite Harmony in Balance, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [251]={hint="Read the Crumpled Note you've been given, then seek out Blademaster Ren inside the Thendal Village watchtower.", desc="After completing the prerequisite Harmony in Balance, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [252]={npc="Blademaster Ren", tgt="Blademaster Ren", desc="After completing the prerequisite Harmony in Balance, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [253]={npc="Ailee Farheart", tgt="Rorian the Dayseeker", desc="After completing the prerequisite Harmony in Balance, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [254]={hint="Read the Simple Note then speak with Akeri Duskblade within the watchtower in Thendal Grove.", desc="After completing the prerequisite Harmony in Balance, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [255]={npc="Akeri Duskblade", tgt="Akeri Duskblade", desc="After completing the prerequisite Harmony in Balance, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [256]={npc="Ailee Farheart", tgt="Rorian the Dayseeker", desc="After completing the prerequisite Harmony in Balance, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [257]={hint="Examine the Humming Recall Crystal then speak with Windshaper Boro in Thendal Grove.", desc="After completing the prerequisite Harmony in Balance, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [258]={npc="Tai'ree Farsight", tgt="Windshaper Boro", desc="After completing the prerequisite Harmony in Balance, you will be guided by a professional trainer."}, [259]={npc="Seena Skybreaker", tgt="Seena Skybreaker", desc="Zephras Isle Professional weapons side quest, accompanying the main line on the island.", star={"Stormforged Protector", {"WARRIOR"}}}, [260]={hint="Reclaim the Skybreaker Bulwark from Zaal Stormshield at the Shrine of Akir.", desc="Zephras Isle Professional weapons side quest, accompanying the main line on the island."}, [261]={npc="Seena Skybreaker", tgt="Seena Skybreaker", desc="Zephras Isle Professional weapons side quest, accompanying the main line on the island.", star={"Stormforged Protector", {"WARRIOR"}}}, [262]={npc="Tai'ree Farsight", tgt="Windshaper Boro"}, [263]={hint="Bring a Signet of Akir to Windshaper Boro."}, [264]={npc="Tai'ree Farsight", tgt="Windshaper Boro"}, [265]={npc="Tai'ree Farsight", tgt="Windshaper Boro", desc="Drink the elixir to see the earth spirit. Alt pickup: 42.76, 23.66."}, [266]={hint="Find the Rise of Spirits and drink the Earth Sapta.", desc="Only after drinking the spirit contract can you see the small earth spirit body."}, [267]={npc="Minor Manifestation of Earth", tgt="Minor Manifestation of Earth", desc="Only after drinking the spirit contract can you see the small earth spirit body."}, [268]={npc="Minor Manifestation of Earth", tgt="Minor Manifestation of Earth", desc="Obtain the world totem after completion."}, [269]={hint="Bring the Rough Quartz to Windshaper Boros in Thendal Grove.", desc="Obtain the world totem after completion."}, [270]={npc="Tai'ree Farsight", tgt="Windshaper Boro", desc="Obtain the world totem after completion."}, [271]={npc="Sessaria Skystride", tgt="Sessaria Skystride", desc="The same quest can also be found in Aarnor Galestrike (43.45, 44.87)."}, [272]={hint="Bring the Torch of Dormant Flame to Olariaan Swiftburn at the Shrine of Flames in the Gustberry Lowlands."}, [273]={npc="Olariaan Swiftburn", tgt="Olariaan Swiftburn"}, [274]={npc="Olariaan Swiftburn", tgt="Olariaan Swiftburn"}, [275]={hint="Slay Skypriest Faladiel in the Gustberry Lowlands and collect Faladiel's Heart."}, [276]={npc="Olariaan Swiftburn", tgt="Olariaan Swiftburn"}, [277]={npc="Olariaan Swiftburn", tgt="Olariaan Swiftburn"}, [278]={hint="Find the home of Kuramaa in the Shen'dar Highlands, and defeat the spirit in combat. Bring Kuramaa's Mask to Olariaan Swiftburn in the Gustberry Lowlands when you are victorious."}, [279]={npc="Olariaan Swiftburn", tgt="Olariaan Swiftburn"}, [280]={npc="Olariaan Swiftburn", tgt="Olariaan Swiftburn", desc="Clear the route before the fire transfer step; obtain the flame totem after completion.", star={"Totem of Charged Flames", {"SHAMAN"}}}, [281]={hint="Wait for Olariaan to begin the ritual at the Brazier of Offering and follow his instructions.", tag="Target: Sacrifice brazier/Brazier of Eternal Flame", desc="Clear the route before the fire transfer step; obtain the flame totem after completion."}, [282]={npc="Sessaria Skystride", tgt="Sessaria Skystride", desc="Clear the route before the fire transfer step; obtain the flame totem after completion.", star={"Totem of Charged Flames", {"SHAMAN"}}}, [283]={npc="Ailee Farheart", tgt="Rorian the Dayseeker"}, [284]={hint="Read the Scribbled Note and then speak with Tai'ree Farsight in Thendal Grove."}, [285]={npc="Dorii Brightwhisper", tgt="Tai'ree Farsight"}, [286]={npc="Elayaa Easewind", tgt="Elayaa Easewind", desc="If you have arrived at Valanaar, directly check whether Quelana provides Taming the Beast."}, [287]={hint="Report to Quel'ana Quickgale in Valanaar.", desc="If you have arrived at Valanaar, directly check whether Quelana provides Taming the Beast."}, [288]={npc="Quel'ana Quickgale", tgt="Quel'ana Quickgale", desc="If you have arrived at Valanaar, directly check whether Quelana provides Taming the Beast."}, [289]={npc="Quel'ana Quickgale", tgt="Quel'ana Quickgale"}, [290]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Windsong Crawler found near bodies of water."}, [291]={npc="Quel'ana Quickgale", tgt="Quel'ana Quickgale"}, [292]={npc="Quel'ana Quickgale", tgt="Quel'ana Quickgale"}, [293]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame an Ornery Galestrider in the Gustberry Lowlands."}, [294]={npc="Quel'ana Quickgale", tgt="Quel'ana Quickgale"}, [295]={npc="Quel'ana Quickgale", tgt="Quel'ana Quickgale"}, [296]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Vuldren Alpha in the Gustberry Lowlands. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Quel'ana Quickgale in Valanaar."}, [297]={npc="Quel'ana Quickgale", tgt="Quel'ana Quickgale"}, [298]={npc="Quel'ana Quickgale", tgt="Quel'ana Quickgale"}, [299]={hint="Speak to Quel'dora Quickgale in Valanaar."}, [300]={npc="Quel'dora Quickgale", tgt="Quel'dora Quickgale"}, [301]={npc="Ailee Farheart", tgt="Rorian the Dayseeker"}, [302]={hint="Read the Folded Parchment then speak with Xyton Silverwind in Thendal Grove."}, [303]={npc="Windshaper Boro", tgt="Xyton Silverwind"}, [304]={npc="Lotheluum Starbreeze", tgt="Lotheluum Starbreeze"}, [305]={hint="Speak with Urs'endris near the falls northeast of Valanaar."}, [306]={npc="Urs'endris", tgt="Urs'endris"}, [307]={npc="Urs'endris", tgt="Urs'endris", desc="Ur'endra patrols Shen'dar Highlands."}, [308]={hint="Find and kill Ur'endra in the Shen'dar Highlands.", desc="Ur'endra patrols Shen'dar Highlands."}, [309]={npc="Urs'endris", tgt="Urs'endris", desc="Ur'endra patrols Shen'dar Highlands."}, [310]={npc="Alaana Stormwalker", tgt="Muln Earthfury", tag="Optional", desc="Pick up on arrival in Mulgore. Alt pickup: Alaana Stormwalker (33.38, 22.51)."}, [311]={hint="Speak with Turak Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional", desc="The Skybreaker can receive guidance when it arrives at Mulgore."}, [312]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem", tag="Optional", desc="The Skybreaker can receive guidance when it arrives at Mulgore."}, [313]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem", desc="Learn the teleport in Thunder Bluff, then use it to turn in at Moonglade."}, [314]={hint="Use the spell \"Teleport: Moonglade\" to travel to Moonglade. When you arrive, speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.", desc="Learn the teleport in Thunder Bluff, then use it to turn in at Moonglade."}, [315]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze", desc="Learn the teleport in Thunder Bluff, then use it to turn in at Moonglade."}, [316]={text="Run south from Skywatcher Plateau, take the lift to Thunder Bluff and learn Tal's flight path (47.00, 49.83). Fly to the Crossroads if unlocked. Otherwise leave Mulgore via the east pass, learn Camp Taurajo from Omusa Thunderhorn (44.45, 59.15), then follow the road north. In the Crossroads, learn Devrak's flight path (51.50, 30.34) and set your hearth with Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind (51.99, 29.89)."}}},
    ["02-8"] = {name="The Barrens: Crossroads", tips={{k="交通", text="Step 4: Drive The Crossroads and tie the hearthstone; drive Bragok for the first Ratchet; leave the station and wait for the Tirisfal Glades line on the Fresa side."}, {k="取捨", text="Do The Forgotten Pools → The Stagnant Oasis → Altered Beings, and only Mura Runetotem bound for Silver Pine after paying. TUGs queued Altered Beings to another The Barrens. This route was cleared early, so that Mura Runetotem could be transferred directly to the next stop."}, {k="取捨", text="Escort the swamp, mine and Stolen Booty on the north side. Leave The Barrens Ratchet and Camp Taurajo together. The first time you go to Ratchet, you will only clear the offshore pirates."}, {k="取捨", text="Thunder Bluff Apothecary Zamah, Hamuul Runetotem, Until Death Do Us Part to see if it goes your way; if you are already level 16 and there is no wailing team, directly transfer to Silver Pine."}, {k="提醒", text="Ragefire Chasm is optional at 14-16. Below 16, do Echeyakee and Harpy Lieutenants early at Ratchet and Camp Taurajo or grind turtles at Stagnant Oasis (about 55, 42). Turn in completed quests before leaving.", s={{"Ragefire Chasm is optional at 14-16"}, {"Below 16, do Echeyakee and Harpy Lieutenants early at Ratchet and Camp Taurajo or grind turtles at Stagnant Oasis (about 55, 42)"}, {"Turn in completed quests before leaving"}}}}, danger={[1]="Ratchet South's South Seas Artillery and pirates will join together from the upper and lower floors. First clear the foot of the mountain and then go uphill to get the parts."}, grind={[1]={mob="Fleeting Plainstrider", note="The Crossroads The open plain in the southeast, with medium density and normal mobs. There are centaurs patrolling nearby and picking up lone chocobos en route. It is suitable for level 12-13 to replenish starting experience."}, [2]={mob="Oasis Snapjaw", note="The Stagnant Oasis The density on the shore is high and there are normal mobs; pull out and pay attention to Kokar nearby. The mutated jaw turtle shell can be replenished."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Devrak"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind"}, [3]={npc="Jahan Hawkwing"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind"}, [5]={npc="Uthrok"}, [6]={npc="Hula'mahi"}, [7]={npc="Bragok"}, [8]={npc="Grazlix"}}, steps={[1]={hint="Travel to Orgrimmar and speak with Thrall in the Valley of Wisdom.", tag="Optional", desc="Do it after you received it; if it is still at Orgrimmar, first find Wisdom Valley Thrall."}, [2]={npc="Thrall", tgt="Thrall", tag="Optional"}, [3]={npc="Thrall", tgt="Thrall", tag="Optional", desc="Pay Welcome to Azeroth first."}, [4]={text="At the Crossroads, learn Devrak's flight path (51.50, 30.34) and set your hearth with Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind (51.99, 29.89). Keep it for the return from Silverpine, Ratchet and Camp Taurajo."}, [5]={hint="Report To Thork at The Crossroads in The Barrens.", tag="Optional"}, [6]={npc="Thork", tgt="Thork", tag="Optional"}, [7]={hint="Speak with Sergra Darkthorn at the Crossroads.", tag="Optional", desc="Only do this if there is pre-delivery."}, [8]={npc="Sergra Darkthorn", tgt="Sergra Darkthorn", tag="Optional"}, [9]={hint="Speak with Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads.", tag="Optional", desc="Only do this if there is pre-delivery."}, [10]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem", tag="Optional"}, [11]={hint="Bring the Wolf Heart Sample to Apothecary Helbrim in the Barrens.", tag="Optional", desc="Only do this if there is pre-delivery."}, [12]={npc="Apothecary Helbrim", tgt="Apothecary Helbrim", tag="Optional"}, [13]={npc="Sergra Darkthorn", tgt="Sergra Darkthorn"}, [14]={npc="Gazrog", tgt="Gazrog"}, [15]={npc="Thork", tgt="Thork"}, [16]={npc="Thork", tgt="Thork"}, [17]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem"}, [18]={npc="Apothecary Helbrim", tgt="Apothecary Helbrim"}, [19]={npc="Darsok Swiftdagger", tgt="Darsok Swiftdagger"}, [20]={npc="Apothecary Helbrim", tgt="Apothecary Helbrim"}, [21]={hint="Collect 7 Plainstrider Beaks and return them to Sergra Darkthorn in the Crossroads."}, [22]={hint="Bring 12 Raptor Heads to Gazrog at the Crossroads."}, [23]={hint="Of the Razormane tribe, kill 8 Water Seekers, 8 Thornweavers and 3 Hunters, and then return to Thork in the Crossroads."}, [24]={npc="Chen's Empty Keg", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Clear mobs by the barrel outside the northeast quilboar camp first."}, [25]={npc="Sergra Darkthorn", tgt="Sergra Darkthorn"}, [26]={npc="Thork", tgt="Thork"}, [27]={npc="Sergra Darkthorn", tgt="Sergra Darkthorn"}, [28]={npc="Thork", tgt="Thork"}, [29]={text="Eastern quilboar. Turn in supplies and the first hunts on the way back"}, [30]={hint="Slay Zhevra Runners to collect 4 Zhevra Hooves for Sergra Darkthorn in the Crossroads."}, [31]={hint="Kill 8 Razormane Geomancers, 8 Razormane Defenders, and Kreenig Snarlsnout."}, [32]={hint="Find and return Crossroads' Supply Crates to Thork in the Barrens."}, [33]={npc="Sergra Darkthorn", tgt="Sergra Darkthorn"}, [34]={npc="Thork", tgt="Thork"}, [35]={npc="Thork", tgt="Thork"}, [36]={npc="Sergra Darkthorn", tgt="Sergra Darkthorn"}, [37]={npc="Gazrog", tgt="Gazrog"}, [38]={npc="Gazrog", tgt="Gazrog", desc="Save this for the raptor nests on your second Barrens visit."}, [39]={text="Forgotten Pools: start the centaur chain, then loop around the harpy camp"}, [40]={npc="Regthar Deathgate", tgt="Regthar Deathgate"}, [41]={npc="Regthar Deathgate", tgt="Regthar Deathgate"}, [42]={hint="Report back to Tonga Runetotem with your findings."}, [43]={hint="Bring 4 Fungal Spores to Apothecary Helbrim at the Crossroads."}, [44]={hint="Bring 15 Centaur Bracers to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.", desc="Kill Kolkar Wranglers at the oasis. Other nearby Kolkar can drop bracers too."}, [45]={hint="Bring Barak's Head to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.", desc="Pull it away from the wrangler. Group up if you're underleveled."}, [46]={hint="Collect 8 Witchwing talons."}, [47]={hint="Collect 7 Prowler Claws from Savannah Prowlers for Sergra Darkthorn in the Crossroads."}, [48]={npc="Regthar Deathgate", tgt="Regthar Deathgate"}, [49]={npc="Regthar Deathgate", tgt="Regthar Deathgate"}, [50]={npc="Regthar Deathgate", tgt="Regthar Deathgate", desc="Save for Ratchet and Camp Taurajo. Summon Verog at the Stagnant Oasis camp."}, [51]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem"}, [52]={npc="Apothecary Helbrim", tgt="Apothecary Helbrim"}, [53]={npc="Darsok Swiftdagger", tgt="Darsok Swiftdagger"}, [54]={npc="Sergra Darkthorn", tgt="Sergra Darkthorn"}, [55]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem"}, [56]={npc="Darsok Swiftdagger", tgt="Darsok Swiftdagger"}, [57]={npc="Sergra Darkthorn", tgt="Sergra Darkthorn"}, [58]={text="Ratchet: pick up the dock and pirate quests on the first visit"}, [59]={text="Follow the east road to Ratchet. Learn Bragok's flight path (63.08, 37.16)."}, [60]={hint="Bring the Secure Crate to Wharfmaster Dizzywig in Ratchet."}, [61]={npc="Wharfmaster Dizzywig", tgt="Wharfmaster Dizzywig"}, [62]={npc="Gazlowe", tgt="Gazlowe"}, [63]={npc="Wrenix the Wretched", tgt="Wrenix the Wretched"}, [64]={npc="Sputtervalve", tgt="Sputtervalve"}, [65]={npc="WANTED", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="The Pirate Captain is further south, and his level is negligible."}, [66]={hint="Find someone who knows about Chen's Empty Keg.", tag="Optional", desc="Only do this if you have a found wine barrel."}, [67]={npc="Brewmaster Drohn", tgt="Brewmaster Drohn", tag="Optional"}, [68]={npc="Brewmaster Drohn", tgt="Brewmaster Drohn", tag="Optional", desc="Save for Ratchet and Camp Taurajo. Loot lion fangs, bird kidneys and lizard horns."}, [69]={hint="Kill 12 Southsea Brigands and 6 Southsea Cannoneers for Gazlowe in Ratchet."}, [70]={hint="Collect 5 Handfuls of Complicated Parts from the upper pirate camp south of Ratchet, then return to Wrenix the Wretched in Ratchet."}, [71]={hint="Bring the head of Baron Longshore to Gazlowe in Ratchet.", tag="Optional"}, [72]={npc="Gazlowe", tgt="Gazlowe"}, [73]={npc="Wrenix the Wretched", tgt="Wrenix the Wretched"}, [74]={npc="Gazlowe", tgt="Gazlowe", tag="Optional"}, [75]={npc="Gazlowe", tgt="Gazlowe"}, [76]={hint="Bring Gazlowe's Ledger to Wharfmaster Dizzywig."}, [77]={npc="Wharfmaster Dizzywig", tgt="Wharfmaster Dizzywig"}, [78]={npc="Wharfmaster Dizzywig", tgt="Wharfmaster Dizzywig"}, [79]={hint="Return Gazlowe's Ledger to Gazlowe in Ratchet."}, [80]={npc="Gazlowe", tgt="Gazlowe"}, [81]={npc="Gazlowe", tgt="Gazlowe", desc="The second trip back to The Barrens was the same trip as the Northwatch Hold artillery."}, [82]={text="Take the southwest road to the Stagnant Oasis. Clear it and run back to the Crossroads to turn in. Save your hearth for the return from Silverpine."}, [83]={text="Stagnant Oasis and Altered Snapjaws. Unlock the Silverpine lead-in"}, [84]={hint="Return to Tonga at The Crossroads, after investigating the Stagnant Oasis."}, [85]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem"}, [86]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem"}, [87]={hint="Bring 8 Altered Snapjaw Shells to Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads.", tag="Target: Oasis Snapjaw / Oasis Snapjaw Hatchling", desc="Kill turtles at Lushwater Oasis southwest of the Crossroads or at Stagnant Oasis."}, [88]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem"}, [89]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem", desc="Leave Silverpine Forest The Sepulcher first and hand in Silverpine Forest The Sepulcher."}, [90]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem", tag="Optional", desc="Pick up for Wailing Caverns. The chain starts in Thunder Bluff."}, [91]={text="Below 16? Finish extra hunts before crossing"}, [92]={npc="Apothecary Helbrim", tgt="Apothecary Helbrim", tag="Optional", desc="Only pick up if you want to go to Thunder Bluff at this moment, time 45 minutes."}, [93]={text="For the optional Thunder Bluff detour, fly from the Crossroads if unlocked. Otherwise enter Mulgore via Camp Taurajo, take the lift and learn Tal's flight path (47.00, 49.83). Quest Apothecary Zamah starts a timer on pickup. Take it only if you can make it."}, [94]={hint="Bring the Rendered Spores to Apothecary Zamah in Thunder Bluff, before the time limit is up.", tag="Optional"}, [95]={hint="Speak with Hamuul Runetotem.", tag="Optional"}, [96]={npc="Apothecary Zamah", tgt="Apothecary Zamah", tag="Optional"}, [97]={npc="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem", tgt="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem", tag="Optional"}, [98]={npc="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem", tgt="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem", tag="Optional", desc="Complete Hamuul Runetotem first; then return to Kalimdor #10 and then wail."}, [99]={hint="Speak with Nara Wildmane.", tag="Optional", desc="Complete Hamuul Runetotem first; then return to Kalimdor #10 and then wail."}, [100]={npc="Nara Wildmane", tgt="Nara Wildmane", tag="Optional", desc="Complete Hamuul Runetotem first; then return to Kalimdor #10 and then wail."}, [101]={npc="Nara Wildmane", tgt="Nara Wildmane", tag="Optional", desc="Nara Wildmane has been completed and Wailing Caverns will be formed before answering.", star={"Crescent Staff", {"MAGE", "PRIEST", "WARLOCK", "DRUID", "SHAMAN"}}}, [102]={npc="Apothecary Zamah", tgt="Apothecary Zamah", tag="Optional", desc="Only if there is a Wailing Caverns team."}, [103]={npc="Clarice Foster", tgt="Clarice Foster", tag="Optional", desc="Pick up from Clarice on Spirit Rise. Turn in at the Sepulcher later."}, [104]={text="Fly to Orgrimmar if unlocked. For your first visit, start at the Crossroads, cross the Southfury River and follow the Durotar road north. From Thunder Bluff, fly to the Crossroads first. Unlock Orgrimmar with Doras (45.12, 63.89)."}, [105]={npc="Zor Lonetree", tgt="Zor Lonetree", tag="Optional", desc="Pick up in Orgrimmar's Valley of Wisdom. See Seereth on the Sun Rock Retreat leg."}, [106]={npc="Tarshaw Jaggedscar", tgt="Tarshaw Jaggedscar", desc="Take the Razor Hill lead to Far Watch Post. Skip if you did Brill's Ulag the Cleaver."}, [107]={hint="Speak with Uzzek at Far Watch Post.", desc="Start at any listed Warrior trainer. Skip this branch if you did Brill's Ulag the Cleaver."}, [108]={npc="Uzzek", tgt="Uzzek", desc="Start at any listed Warrior trainer. Skip this branch if you did Brill's Ulag the Cleaver."}, [109]={npc="Uzzek", tgt="Uzzek", desc="Defensive posture quest, choose one with Brill Ulag the Cleaver."}, [110]={hint="Bring 5 Singed Scales to Uzzek at Far Watch Post in the Barrens.", desc="Defensive posture quest, choose one with Brill Ulag the Cleaver."}, [111]={npc="Uzzek", tgt="Uzzek", desc="Defensive posture quest, choose one with Brill Ulag the Cleaver."}, [112]={npc="Uzzek", tgt="Uzzek", tag="Optional", desc="Continue the weapon quest on your first pass through the Crossroads."}, [113]={hint="Speak with Thun'grim Firegaze in the Barrens.", tag="Optional", desc="Continue the weapon quest on your first pass through the Crossroads."}, [114]={npc="Thun'grim Firegaze", tgt="Thun'grim Firegaze", tag="Optional", desc="Continue the weapon quest on your first pass through the Crossroads."}, [115]={npc="Thun'grim Firegaze", tgt="Thun'grim Firegaze", tag="Optional", desc="The box is in the quilboar camp, clear the guards first."}, [116]={hint="Bring the Forged Steel Bars to Thun'grim Firegaze in the Barrens.", tag="Optional", desc="The box is in the quilboar camp, clear the guards first."}, [117]={npc="Thun'grim Firegaze", tgt="Thun'grim Firegaze", tag="Optional", desc="The box is in the quilboar camp, clear the guards first."}, [118]={npc="Kranal Fiss", tgt="Kranal Fiss", desc="Climb up from the foot of the mountain along the trail."}, [119]={hint="Bring the Torch of the Dormant Flame to Telf Joolam in Durotar.", desc="Climb up from the foot of the mountain along the trail."}, [120]={npc="Telf Joolam", tgt="Telf Joolam", desc="Climb up from the foot of the mountain along the trail."}, [121]={npc="Telf Joolam", tgt="Telf Joolam", desc="Get tar from Barrens quilboar and the reagent pouch from Durotar's Burning Blade."}, [122]={hint="Bring 1 Fire Tar and 1 Reagent Pouch to Telf Joolam in Durotar.", desc="Get tar from Barrens quilboar and the reagent pouch from Durotar's Burning Blade."}, [123]={npc="Telf Joolam", tgt="Telf Joolam", desc="Get tar from Barrens quilboar and the reagent pouch from Durotar's Burning Blade."}, [124]={npc="Telf Joolam", tgt="Telf Joolam", desc="Fight the fire elemental only after drinking the spiritual contract next to the temple."}, [125]={hint="Defeat the Minor Manifestation of Fire, and place the Glowing Ember in the brazier atop the Shrine of Eternal Flame.", tag="Target: Minor Manifestation of Fire /Manifestation of Flames", desc="Fight the fire elemental only after drinking the spiritual contract next to the temple."}, [126]={npc="Brazier of the Dormant Flame", npcObj=true, desc="Fight the fire elemental only after drinking the spiritual contract next to the temple."}, [127]={npc="Brazier of the Dormant Flame", npcObj=true, desc="Obtain the Fire Totem upon completion.", star={"Totem of Charged Flames", {"SHAMAN"}}}, [128]={hint="Bring the Torch of Eternal Flame to Kranal Fiss in the Barrens.", desc="Obtain the Fire Totem upon completion."}, [129]={npc="Kranal Fiss", tgt="Kranal Fiss", desc="Obtain the Fire Totem upon completion.", star={"Totem of Charged Flames", {"SHAMAN"}}}, [130]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem", desc="Alternate pickup: Hanna Lighthoof in northern Mulgore (33.42, 22.13)."}, [131]={hint="Travel to Moonglade and speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.", desc="Hanna Lighthoof in northern Mulgore also offers this quest."}, [132]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze", desc="Hanna Lighthoof in northern Mulgore also offers this quest."}, [133]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze"}, [134]={hint="Use the Empty Dreadmist Peak Sampler to draw a sample of water from a pool at the top of the peak."}, [135]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem"}, [136]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem", desc="Buy or trade for Earthroot. Loot 5 Kodo Horns from Barrens kodos."}, [137]={hint="Bring 5 Earthroot and 5 Kodo Horns to Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads so he may make a curative salve.", desc="Buy or trade for Earthroot. Loot 5 Kodo Horns from Barrens kodos."}, [138]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem", desc="Buy or trade for Earthroot. Loot 5 Kodo Horns from Barrens kodos."}, [139]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem", desc="Treat 10 Sickly Gazelles north of the Crossroads. Teleport to Dendrite to turn in."}, [140]={hint="Use the Curative Animal Salve on 10 Sickly Gazelles that are located throughout the northern part of the Barrens; doing so should cure them. Sickly Gazelles have been reported north of the east-west road that runs through the Crossroads.", desc="Treat 10 Sickly Gazelles north of the Crossroads. Teleport to Dendrite to turn in."}, [141]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze", desc="Treat 10 Sickly Gazelles north of the Crossroads. Teleport to Dendrite to turn in."}, [142]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze"}, [143]={hint="Return to Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise, Thunder Bluff."}, [144]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem"}, [145]={text="Leave Orgrimmar and board the Tirisfal Glades zeppelin at Frezza's platform (50.82, 13.54). Keep your hearth at the Crossroads."}}},
    ["05-d2"] = {name="Hall of Thanes", entrance="Ironforge 27.63, 47.83", pickup="After transferring from The Barrens to Eastern Kingdoms, only special-trip achievement teams can go south from Undercity via Silverpine, Hillsbrad, and Arathi to Wetlands, via Dun Algaz to Dun Morogh and then enter Ironforge. Tribe front access point not found.", pickupS={{"After transferring from The Barrens to Eastern Kingdoms, only special-trip achievement teams can go south from Undercity via Silverpine, Hillsbrad, and Arathi to Wetlands, via Dun Algaz to Dun Morogh and then enter Ironforge"}, {"Tribe front access point not found"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Entrance → Fadlin at Anvilmar's Rest → Magmatus by the Dark Iron summoner → the patrolling Reaver → Durgan in the royal vault."}, {k="說明", text="The native Eternal versions of Underground Map, Old Ironforge Incursion, The Restless Dead, An Ancient Grudge, Important Heirlooms, and The Treaty of Understanding are all labeled Alliance; Horde has no verifiable access route.", s={{"The native Eternal versions of Underground Map, Old Ironforge Incursion, The Restless Dead, An Ancient Grudge, Important Heirlooms, and The Treaty of Understanding are all labeled Alliance"}, {"Horde has no verifiable access route"}}}, {k="說明", text="Enter the dungeon to fight bosses such as Fadelin Anvilmar, Magmatus, Plunder, Durgan Deathstroke Hammer, etc. This trip is mainly about drops or achievements.", s={{"Enter the dungeon to fight bosses such as Fadelin Anvilmar, Magmatus, Plunder, Durgan Deathstroke Hammer, etc"}, {"This trip is mainly about drops or achievements"}}}, {k="說明", text="Tribal submission not found.", s={{"Tribal submission not found"}}}, {k="取捨", text="Leveling optional. If you want to achieve inheritance achievements, you must first make a team appointment before going there. Alliance capital guards and PvP rules will make it more difficult to enter."}, {k="說明", text="In the city, enter the old Ironforge passage through the side door of the throne room; go through to the end to reach the dungeon door. Blizzard confirmed that the Horde can enter, but they need to enter the alliance territory.", s={{"In the city, enter the old Ironforge passage through the side door of the throne room; go through to the end to reach the dungeon door"}, {"Blizzard confirmed that the Horde can enter, but they need to enter the alliance territory"}}}}, steps={[1]={text="Hall of Thanes entrance"}}},
    ["05-d1"] = {name="Ragefire Chasm", entrance="Orgrimmar 52.60, 49.00", pickup="After The Barrens The Crossroads opens the flight path, fly Thunder Bluff to find Rahauro to pick up Searching for the Lost Satchel/Testing an Enemy's Strength, fly Orgrimmar to find Thrall and do Hidden Enemies/Hidden Enemies first, then go to the dark alley area to pick up Slaying the Beast; if this round has already started Undercity flying point can lead The Power to Destroy... to Varimathras first when the zeppelin crosses the sea.", pickupS={{"After The Barrens The Crossroads opens the flight path, fly Thunder Bluff to find Rahauro to pick up Searching for the Lost Satchel/Testing an Enemy's Strength, fly Orgrimmar to find Thrall and do Hidden Enemies/Hidden Enemies first, then go to the dark alley area to pick up Slaying the Beast; if this round has already started Undercity flying point can lead The Power to Destroy... to Varimathras first when the zeppelin crosses the sea"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Clear troggs at the entrance → take the first hall's right ramp to Oggleflint and Maur → cross the lava bridge for Taragaman → clear Burning Blade cultists → Bazzalan up the right ramp, then Jergosh at the end."}, {k="取捨", text="Make sure Hidden Enemies is unlocked before entering. Only fight Fury Flame once, and the dark alley area will be close to Slaying the Beast; the deliveries of Thunder Bluff and Undercity can be assigned to the cross-city main line."}, {k="說明", text="The official door is at the bottom of the shadow rift at Orgrimmar; first enter the shadow rift in the city, and then follow the passage to the blue door.", s={{"The official door is at the bottom of the shadow rift at Orgrimmar; first enter the shadow rift in the city, and then follow the passage to the blue door"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Rahauro", tgt="Rahauro"}, [2]={npc="Rahauro", tgt="Rahauro"}, [3]={npc="Varimathras", tgt="Varimathras", tag="Optional", desc="Ask a party member to share The Power to Destroy.... Skip it if you can't pick it up easily."}, [4]={npc="Thrall", tgt="Thrall"}, [5]={hint="Bring a Lieutenant's Insignia to Thrall in Orgrimmar."}, [6]={npc="Thrall", tgt="Thrall"}, [7]={npc="Thrall", tgt="Thrall", preText="Hidden Enemies"}, [8]={hint="Take the Lieutenant's Insignia to Neeru Fireblade and speak to him. Gauge if he believes you are a member of the Burning Blade and then return to Thrall in Orgrimmar."}, [9]={npc="Thrall", tgt="Thrall"}, [10]={npc="Thrall", tgt="Thrall", preText="Hidden Enemies"}, [11]={npc="Neeru Fireblade", tgt="Neeru Fireblade"}, [12]={text="Ragefire Chasm entrance"}, [13]={hint="Search Orgrimmar for Ragefire Chasm, then kill 8 Ragefire Troggs and 8 Ragefire Shaman before returning to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff.", desc="Location: Follow the slope to the first trogg hall. Kill the shamans and troggs."}, [14]={hint="Search Ragefire Chasm for Maur Grimtotem's corpse and search it for any items of interest.", desc="Location: Take the right ramp in the first trogg hall. Find the body behind Oggleflint."}, [15]={npc="Maur Grimtotem", tgt="Maur Grimtotem", tag="Unverified"}, [16]={npc="Maur Grimtotem", tgt="Maur Grimtotem", tag="Unverified", preText="Searching for the Lost Satchel"}, [17]={hint="Enter Ragefire Chasm and slay Taragaman the Hungerer, then bring his heart back to Neeru Fireblade in Orgrimmar.", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: Taragaman the Hungerer at 41.00, 57.70. Location: Return to the main path. Taragaman is on the platform at the lava crossroads."}, [18]={hint="Bring the books Spells of Shadow and Incantations from the Nether to Varimathras in Undercity.", tag="Optional", desc="Location: Cross the lava bridge and clear the Burning Blade cultists toward the last bosses."}, [19]={hint="Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker before returning to Thrall in Orgrimmar.", desc="Map 1: Bazzalan (41.50, 86.20), Jergosh the Invoker (33.00, 84.50). Location: Take the right ramp for Bazzalan, then return to the main path for Jergosh."}, [20]={npc="Neeru Fireblade", tgt="Neeru Fireblade"}, [21]={npc="Thrall", tgt="Thrall"}, [22]={npc="Thrall", tgt="Thrall", preText="Hidden Enemies"}, [23]={hint="Speak to Neeru Fireblade in Orgrimmar."}, [24]={npc="Neeru Fireblade", tgt="Neeru Fireblade"}, [25]={npc="Neeru Fireblade", tgt="Neeru Fireblade", preText="Hidden Enemies"}, [26]={hint="Speak to Thrall in Orgrimmar and tell him what you've learned."}, [27]={npc="Thrall", tgt="Thrall"}, [28]={hint="Take the Grimtotem Satchel to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff."}, [29]={npc="Rahauro", tgt="Rahauro"}, [30]={npc="Rahauro", tgt="Rahauro"}, [31]={npc="Varimathras", tgt="Varimathras", tag="Optional"}}},
    ["02-9"] = {name="Silverpine Forest", tips={{k="交通", text="First visit The Sepulcher Walk on the ground first; fly after turning on the point. On the return trip, use the The Crossroads hearthstone first, and only take the Orgrimmar zeppelin when it's cooled down."}, {k="取捨", text="Do | Unlock Ambermill Investigations and eternal version Watching the Roads first, scan Ambermill in the same trip; return Ambermill Investigations and then kill the The Weaver mage."}, {k="取捨", text="Do | Pyrewood Village Do 99 and A Recipe For Death together; hand in 99 and then pick up Arugal's Folly and Stop the Spread at once, and clear the Greymane Wall together."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional|return to The Barrens when you reach level 20. Prioritize skipping the Escort Escorting Erland, Ambush Pyrewood Ambush and Shadowfang Keep branches that have not yet entered the scene. If you have already received delivery of Undercity such as A Recipe For Death and Rot Hide Origins, turn it in when flying back from The Sepulcher."}, {k="取捨", text="Don't turn it in yet | Journey to Hillsbrad Foothills will be left to Hillsbrad Foothills Tarren Mill after receiving it at level 19. The route returns to The Barrens first, instead of taking another trip to Tarren Mill."}, {k="提醒", text="If it is lower than level 20, first clear the remaining single-player quests and normal mobs in Greymane Wall (approximately 43, 81) or Ambermill (approximately 63, 65). play Shadowfang Keep when you have a team; the minimum level of The Book of Ur is 16, and the minimum level of Arugal Must Die and Deathstalkers in Shadowfang is 18.", s={{"If it is lower than level 20, first clear the remaining single-player quests and normal mobs in Greymane Wall (approximately 43, 81) or Ambermill (approximately 63, 65). play Shadowfang Keep when you have a team; the minimum level of The Book of Ur is 16, and the minimum level of Arugal Must Die and Deathstalkers in Shadowfang is 18"}}}}, danger={[1]="Silverpine Forest is patrolled by the elite level 24-25 Sons of Arugal. If you see an elite, avoid it and don't run into the forest.", [2]="Pyrewood Village The path to Greymane Wall also encounters the Sons of Arugal. After completing the ambush, leave, don't chase monsters along the wall."}, grind={[1]={mob="Dalaran Conjuror", note="Ambermill The peripheral density is medium, and there are ordinary remote monsters; clear the roadside first, and use the terrain to pull it away from the door of the house to reduce the risk of attracting monsters."}, [2]={mob="Dalaran Wizard", note="Ambermill The density in the outer circle is medium, and there are ordinary long-range monsters; there are guards nearby, so fight them one by one. Close to the original Dalaran quest."}, [3]={mob="Sickly Refugee", note="The density in front of the Greymane Wall is high, and there are normal mobs; the area near the wall is crowded, so pull them one by one from the roadside, which is suitable for reaching level 20 before leaving the station."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Karos Razok"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Bates"}, [3]={npc="Sebastian Meloche"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Bates"}, [5]={npc="Edwin Harly"}, [6]={npc="Patrice Dwyer"}, [7]={npc="Innkeeper Renee"}, [8]={npc="Innkeeper Renee"}, [9]={npc="Michael Garrett"}, [10]={npc="Thomas Mordan"}, [11]={npc="Ezekiel Graves"}}, steps={[1]={text="At the Durotar zeppelin tower, confirm the Tirisfal Glades route with Frezza (50.82, 13.54). Get off south of Brill and follow the road to Undercity. Keep your hearth at the Crossroads."}, [2]={text="Learn Undercity's flight path from Michael Garrett (63.25, 48.56). Fly to the Sepulcher if unlocked. Otherwise leave the city and take Tirisfal's southwest road into Silverpine Forest."}, [3]={text="Pick up at the Sepulcher → northern farms"}, [4]={text="Learn the Sepulcher flight path from Karos Razok (45.62, 42.60). Keep your current hearth."}, [5]={hint="Speak with Mura Runetotem in the Sepulcher."}, [6]={npc="Mura Runetotem", tgt="Mura Runetotem"}, [7]={hint="Take Apothecary Johaan's findings to Apothecary Renferrel in Silverpine Forest.", tag="Optional"}, [8]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel", tag="Optional"}, [9]={hint="Place Clarice's Pendant on Yuriv's Tomb in Silverpine.", tag="Optional"}, [10]={npc="Yuriv's Tombstone", npcObj=true, tag="Optional"}, [11]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [12]={npc="High Executor Hadrec", tgt="High Executor Hadrec"}, [13]={npc="High Executor Hadrec", tgt="High Executor Hadrec"}, [14]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel"}, [15]={npc="Shadow Priest Allister", tgt="Shadow Priest Allister"}, [16]={hint="Dalar Dawnweaver at the Sepulcher wants you to kill 5 Moonrage Whitescalps."}, [17]={hint="Kill rot hide gnolls at the Dead Fields."}, [18]={hint="Find the Deathstalkers Quinn and Rane Yorick."}, [19]={npc="Rane Yorick", tgt="Rane Yorick"}, [20]={npc="Rane Yorick", tgt="Rane Yorick"}, [21]={hint="Gather 6 discolored worg hearts and bring them to Apothecary Renferrel at the Sepulcher."}, [22]={npc="Deathstalker Erland", tgt="Deathstalker Erland", tag="Optional"}, [23]={hint="Escort Erland through the wolves, to Rane Yorick.", tag="Optional"}, [24]={npc="Rane Yorick", tgt="Rane Yorick", tag="Optional"}, [25]={npc="Rane Yorick", tgt="Rane Yorick", tag="Requires quest Escorting Erland, Optional"}, [26]={hint="Collect 6 Grizzled Bear Hearts and 6 samples of Skittering Blood and deliver them to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity."}, [27]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [28]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [29]={npc="High Executor Hadrec", tgt="High Executor Hadrec"}, [30]={npc="High Executor Hadrec", tgt="High Executor Hadrec"}, [31]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel"}, [32]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel"}, [33]={hint="Bring the Deathstalker Report to High Executor Hadrec at the Sepulcher.", tag="Requires quest Escorting Erland, Optional"}, [34]={npc="High Executor Hadrec", tgt="High Executor Hadrec", tag="Requires quest Escorting Erland, Optional"}, [35]={npc="High Executor Hadrec", tgt="High Executor Hadrec", tag="Requires quest The Deathstalkers' Report, Optional"}, [36]={hint="Speak with Apothecary Renferrel at the Sepulcher.", tag="Requires quest The Deathstalkers' Report, Optional"}, [37]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel", tag="Requires quest The Deathstalkers' Report, Optional"}, [38]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel", tag="Requires quest Speak with Renferrel, Optional"}, [39]={text="Northern farms → lakeside crossing → crates on the south road"}, [40]={hint="Retrieve the Remedy of Arugal for Dalar Dawnweaver at the Sepulcher."}, [41]={hint="Bring Quinn's potion to Quinn Yorick at the Ivar Patch, north of the Sepulcher."}, [42]={npc="Quinn Yorick", tgt="Quinn Yorick"}, [43]={npc="Quinn Yorick", tgt="Quinn Yorick"}, [44]={hint="Gather 3 murloc eyes and bring them to Apothecary Renferrel at the Sepulcher."}, [45]={hint="Go to the Decrepit Ferry."}, [46]={npc="Corpse Laden Boat", npcObj=true}, [47]={npc="Corpse Laden Boat", npcObj=true}, [48]={hint="Retrieve the contents of one of the Dalaran wizards' crates. You will find Pyrewood Village to the south."}, [49]={npc="Dalaran Crate", npcObj=true}, [50]={npc="Dalaran Crate", npcObj=true}, [51]={hint="Bring the strange pendant to Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher."}, [52]={npc="Shadow Priest Allister", tgt="Shadow Priest Allister"}, [53]={npc="Shadow Priest Allister", tgt="Shadow Priest Allister"}, [54]={hint="Take the rune-inscribed pendant to Dalar Dawnweaver at the Sepulcher."}, [55]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [56]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [57]={hint="Speak with Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher."}, [58]={npc="Shadow Priest Allister", tgt="Shadow Priest Allister"}, [59]={npc="Shadow Priest Allister", tgt="Shadow Priest Allister"}, [60]={npc="Shadow Priest Allister", tgt="Shadow Priest Allister"}, [61]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [62]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [63]={npc="High Executor Hadrec", tgt="High Executor Hadrec"}, [64]={npc="High Executor Hadrec", tgt="High Executor Hadrec"}, [65]={npc="High Executor Hadrec", tgt="High Executor Hadrec"}, [66]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel"}, [67]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel"}, [68]={npc="Shadow Priest Allister", tgt="Shadow Priest Allister"}, [69]={text="Worgen cave and Ambermill → Fenris ferry → Brill and Undercity"}, [70]={hint="Bring 6 Glutton Shackles and 3 Darksoul Shackles to Dalar Dawnweaver at the Sepulcher."}, [71]={hint="Obtain 8 Dalaran Pendants for Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher."}, [72]={hint="Slay 8 Dalaran Wizards and 8 Dalaran Watchers for Shadow Priest Allister in the Sepulcher."}, [73]={hint="Locate Beren's Peril, then kill 6 Ravenclaw Drudgers and 6 Ravenclaw Guardians, then return to Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher."}, [74]={hint="Bring 8 bottles of rot hide ichor to Apothecary Renferrel at the Sepulcher."}, [75]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [76]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [77]={npc="Shadow Priest Allister", tgt="Shadow Priest Allister"}, [78]={npc="Shadow Priest Allister", tgt="Shadow Priest Allister"}, [79]={npc="Shadow Priest Allister", tgt="Shadow Priest Allister"}, [80]={npc="Shadow Priest Allister", tgt="Shadow Priest Allister"}, [81]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel"}, [82]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel"}, [83]={hint="Kill Grimson the Pale and bring his head to Dalar Dawnweaver at the Sepulcher."}, [84]={hint="Kill the Dalaran archmage, then retrieve his staff for Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher."}, [85]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [86]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [87]={npc="Shadow Priest Allister", tgt="Shadow Priest Allister"}, [88]={hint="Bring Quinn's potion to Quinn Yorick at the Ivar Patch, north of the Sepulcher."}, [89]={npc="Quinn Yorick", tgt="Quinn Yorick"}, [90]={npc="Rane Yorick", tgt="Rane Yorick"}, [91]={hint="Kill Ivar the Foul, and bring Ivar's Head to Rane Yorick at the Ivar Patch."}, [92]={npc="Rane Yorick", tgt="Rane Yorick"}, [93]={hint="Bring Deliah's Ring to Magistrate Sevren in Brill."}, [94]={npc="Magistrate Sevren", tgt="Magistrate Sevren"}, [95]={npc="Magistrate Sevren", tgt="Magistrate Sevren"}, [96]={text="After Brill, run to Undercity for the city turn-ins. Learn the flight path from Michael Garrett (63.25, 48.56) if needed."}, [97]={hint="Bring Deliah's Ring to Raleigh."}, [98]={npc="Raleigh Andrean", tgt="Raleigh Andrean"}, [99]={npc="Raleigh Andrean", tgt="Raleigh Andrean"}, [100]={hint="Bring the Sample Ichor to Bethor Iceshard in the Undercity."}, [101]={npc="Bethor Iceshard", tgt="Bethor Iceshard"}, [102]={npc="Bethor Iceshard", tgt="Bethor Iceshard"}, [103]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell"}, [104]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell"}, [105]={hint="Bring the Wolf Heart Samples to Apothecary Zinge in the Undercity.", tag="Optional"}, [106]={npc="Apothecary Zinge", tgt="Apothecary Zinge", tag="Optional"}, [107]={npc="Keeper Bel'dugur", tgt="Keeper Bel'dugur", tag="Only for a Shadowfang Keep run, Optional"}, [108]={text="Return to the Sepulcher → Pyrewood Village → Greymane Wall"}, [109]={text="Fly from Undercity to the Sepulcher, then take the west road south to Pyrewood Village."}, [110]={hint="Bring Bethor's Scroll to Apothecary Renferrel at the Silverpine Sepulcher."}, [111]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel"}, [112]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel"}, [113]={hint="Report to High Executor Hadrec at the Sepulcher."}, [114]={npc="High Executor Hadrec", tgt="High Executor Hadrec"}, [115]={npc="High Executor Hadrec", tgt="High Executor Hadrec"}, [116]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver", tag="Lv 18+. Accept only for Shadowfang Keep., Optional"}, [117]={npc="High Executor Hadrec", tgt="High Executor Hadrec", tag="Lv 18+. Accept only for Shadowfang Keep., Optional"}, [118]={hint="Bring 6 Pyrewood Shackles to Dalar Dawnweaver at the Sepulcher."}, [119]={hint="Retrieve Apothecary Berard's journal from Pyrewood Village and take it to Apothecary Renferrel at the Sepulcher."}, [120]={npc="Deathstalker Faerleia", tgt="Deathstalker Faerleia", tag="Group, Optional"}, [121]={hint="Help Deathstalker Faerleia kill the Pyrewood Council.", tag="Group, Optional"}, [122]={npc="Deathstalker Faerleia", tgt="Deathstalker Faerleia", tag="Group, Optional"}, [123]={hint="Find the Deathstalker Adamant and Deathstalker Vincent.", tag="Dungeon, Optional", desc="In Shadowfang Keep, find both Deathstalkers. Vincent is at 56.50, 58.50 on floor 1."}, [124]={npc="Deathstalker Vincent", tgt="Deathstalker Vincent", tag="Dungeon, Optional, Unverified", desc="Turn in to Vincent inside Shadowfang Keep. Entrance: 44.80, 67.80."}, [125]={hint="Bring the Book of Ur to Keeper Bel'dugur at the Apothecarium in the Undercity.", tag="Dungeon, Optional", desc="The pin marks the Shadowfang Keep entrance. Interior coordinates are unknown."}, [126]={hint="Kill Arugal and bring his head to Dalar Dawnweaver at the Sepulcher.", tag="Dungeon, Optional", desc="The pin marks the Shadowfang Keep entrance. Interior coordinates are unknown."}, [127]={hint="Kill Valdred Moray."}, [128]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [129]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel"}, [130]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel"}, [131]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver", tag="Dungeon, Optional"}, [132]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [133]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [134]={hint="Bring 6 Worgen Bits to Dalar Dawnweaver in The Sepulcher."}, [135]={hint="Slay 5 Sickly Refugees and 5 Haggard Refugees for Dalar Dawnweaver in The Sepulcher."}, [136]={text="Fenris Isle and shore → Sepulcher turn-ins → Undercity"}, [137]={hint="Bring Thule's Head to High Executor Hadrec at the Sepulcher."}, [138]={hint="Bring 6 samples of Lake Creeper Moss, 6 samples of Lake Skulker Moss and a Hardened Tumor to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity."}, [139]={npc="A Talking Head", npcObj=true, tag="Drop starts it, Optional"}, [140]={hint="Bring Alaric's Head to his grave.", tag="Drop starts it, Optional"}, [141]={npc="Shallow Grave", npcObj=true, tag="Drop starts it, Optional"}, [142]={npc="Shallow Grave", npcObj=true, tag="Optional"}, [143]={hint="Take Alaric to the hidden alcove.", tag="Optional"}, [144]={npc="Dusty Shelf", npcObj=true, tag="Optional"}, [145]={npc="Dusty Shelf", npcObj=true, tag="Optional"}, [146]={npc="High Executor Hadrec", tgt="High Executor Hadrec"}, [147]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [148]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [149]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel", tag="Lv 19+. Save for Tarren Mill."}, [150]={text="Fly to Undercity if you have turn-ins there. Otherwise hearth straight from the Sepulcher at the next step."}, [151]={npc="Raleigh Andrean", tgt="Raleigh Andrean"}, [152]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell"}, [153]={npc="Keeper Bel'dugur", tgt="Keeper Bel'dugur", tag="Dungeon, Optional"}, [154]={hint="Take the Woven Wand to Bethor Iceshard in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity.", tag="Optional"}, [155]={npc="Bethor Iceshard", tgt="Bethor Iceshard", tag="Optional"}, [156]={npc="Danitha Morr", tgt="Danitha Morr", desc="At level 18, return from the Sepulcher to Tirisfal. Visit the fort after the farms."}, [157]={hint="Travel to The Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest and speak with Trevan Rol about the missing Earthen Ring travelers.", desc="At level 18, return from the Sepulcher to Tirisfal. Visit the fort after the farms."}, [158]={npc="Trevan Rol", tgt="Trevan Rol", desc="At level 18, return from the Sepulcher to Tirisfal. Visit the fort after the farms."}, [159]={npc="Trevan Rol", tgt="Trevan Rol"}, [160]={hint="Speak with Deathguard Baldren about the mysterious Earthen Ring travelers who recently passed through The Sepulcher."}, [161]={npc="Deathguard Baldren", tgt="Deathguard Baldren"}, [162]={npc="Deathguard Baldren", tgt="Deathguard Baldren", desc="Can be done together with the Fenris Isle quest of Silverpine Forest The Sepulcher."}, [163]={hint="Investigate Fenris Isle to the east and learn the fate of the Earthen Ring traveling party.", desc="Can be done together with the Fenris Isle quest of Silverpine Forest The Sepulcher."}, [164]={npc="Charred Remains", npcObj=true, desc="Can be done together with the Fenris Isle quest of Silverpine Forest The Sepulcher."}, [165]={npc="Charred Remains", npcObj=true}, [166]={hint="Investigate Fenris Keep to the north and attempt to locate the missing member of the Earthen Ring party."}, [167]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger"}, [168]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger"}, [169]={hint="Retrieve the Fenris Isle Key from the Rot Hide Gnolls and use it to free Lumina Windsinger."}, [170]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger"}, [171]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger"}, [172]={hint="Accompany Lumina Windsinger and help her escape Fenris Keep."}, [173]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger"}, [174]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger", desc="After completion, you will not receive the next stage A Moon-Kissed Blade until level 20."}, [175]={hint="Speak with Lumina Windsinger in the Sepulcher.", desc="After completion, you will not receive the next stage A Moon-Kissed Blade until level 20."}, [176]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger", desc="After completion, you will not receive the next stage A Moon-Kissed Blade until level 20."}, [177]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger", tag="Optional", desc="Turn in The Debt. At 20, see Lumina and keep Trevan's notes. Return with all 3 materials."}, [178]={npc="Mennet Carkad", tgt="Mennet Carkad", tag="Optional", desc="Same as Yinsong North-South Route; need to return to Undercity."}, [179]={hint="Kill Fenwick Thatros and bring his head back to Mennet Carkad in the Rogues' Quarter of the Undercity.", tag="Optional", desc="Same as Yinsong North-South Route; need to return to Undercity."}, [180]={npc="Mennet Carkad", tgt="Mennet Carkad", tag="Optional", desc="Same as Yinsong North-South Route; need to return to Undercity."}, [181]={npc="Mennet Carkad", tgt="Mennet Carkad", tag="Optional", desc="Use stealth to avoid Dalaran Mage before entering the room."}, [182]={hint="Find the Dalaran Status Report and return it to Mennet Carkad in the Rogues' Quarter of the Undercity.", tag="Optional", desc="Use stealth to avoid Dalaran Mage before entering the room."}, [183]={npc="Mennet Carkad", tgt="Mennet Carkad", tag="Optional", desc="Use stealth to avoid Dalaran Mage before entering the room."}, [184]={npc="Mennet Carkad", tgt="Mennet Carkad", desc="Undead start in Undercity. Continue lockpicking around Ratchet and Camp Taurajo."}, [185]={hint="Journey to Orgrimmar and speak with Shenthul at the Cleft of Shadow.", desc="Undead start in Undercity. Continue lockpicking around Ratchet and Camp Taurajo."}, [186]={npc="Shenthul", tgt="Shenthul", desc="Undead start in Undercity. Continue lockpicking around Ratchet and Camp Taurajo."}, [187]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem"}, [188]={hint="Speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade."}, [189]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze"}, [190]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze", desc="First two pins are pendant spawns. Once looted, swim straight to Remulos's shrine."}, [191]={hint="Find a Shrine Bauble in Lake Elune'ara, and take it to the Shrine of Remulos in northwestern Moonglade. Once there, use the Shrine Bauble.", desc="First two pins are pendant spawns. Once looted, swim straight to Remulos's shrine."}, [192]={npc="Tajarri", tgt="Tajarri", desc="First two pins are pendant spawns. Once looted, swim straight to Remulos's shrine."}, [193]={npc="Tajarri", tgt="Tajarri"}, [194]={hint="Find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility and the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance. Speak with the residents of Moonglade to learn clues as to where these items may be located."}, [195]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze"}, [196]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze"}, [197]={hint="Return to Thunder Bluff and show Turak Runetotem the Pendant of the Sea Lion."}, [198]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem"}, [199]={npc="Cain Firesong", tgt="Cain Firesong", tag="Optional", desc="Take the Brill lead-in if passing. In Undercity, pick up Investigate the Alchemist Shop directly."}, [200]={hint="Speak with Anastasia Hartwell.", tag="Optional", desc="Take the Brill lead-in if passing. In Undercity, pick up Investigate the Alchemist Shop directly."}, [201]={npc="Anastasia Hartwell", tgt="Anastasia Hartwell", tag="Optional", desc="Take the Brill lead-in if passing. In Undercity, pick up Investigate the Alchemist Shop directly."}, [202]={npc="Anastasia Hartwell", tgt="Anastasia Hartwell", desc="Reveal it with the scroll. Fight until it stops, use the coffer, then loot it."}, [203]={hint="Obtain a Cantation of Manifestation and a Chest of Containment Coffers from behind Anastasia Hartwell. Bring 3 Filled Containment Coffers, the Chest of Containment Coffers and the Cantation of Manifestation to Anastasia in the Undercity.", desc="Reveal it with the scroll. Fight until it stops, use the coffer, then loot it."}, [204]={npc="Anastasia Hartwell", tgt="Anastasia Hartwell", desc="Reveal it with the scroll. Fight until it stops, use the coffer, then loot it."}, [205]={npc="Anastasia Hartwell", tgt="Anastasia Hartwell"}, [206]={hint="Bring 10 Linen Cloth and 6 Dalaran Mana Gems to Josef Gregorian."}, [207]={npc="Josef Gregorian", tgt="Josef Gregorian"}, [208]={npc="Josef Gregorian", tgt="Josef Gregorian", star={"Lesser Spellfire Robes", {"MAGE"}}}, [209]={hint="Complete the quest objectives."}, [210]={npc="Josef Gregorian", tgt="Josef Gregorian", star={"Lesser Spellfire Robes", {"MAGE"}}}, [211]={text="Hearth to the Crossroads. If your hearth is unavailable, board the Orgrimmar zeppelin at Zapetta's west platform south of Brill (60.74, 58.87), then fly to the Crossroads."}}},
    ["05-d3"] = {name="Ruins of Lordaeron", entrance="Undercity 72.41, 11.37", pickup="First confirm the progress of Rear Guard Patrol with Linnaeus at Tirisfal Glades Brill. Linnaeus also has version Rear Guard Patrol [orcs, undead only]. before Silverpine Forest, get off the zeppelin from Brill and visit Linnaeus and Christopher; The Sepulcher first get A Frightened Request from Tabitha, and complete A Recipe For Death→A Recipe For Death→A Recipe For Death; Undercity find Grave and Mobin in the alchemy room. These six types of quests will be handed in during the dungeon stage.", pickupS={{"First confirm the progress of Rear Guard Patrol with Linnaeus at Tirisfal Glades Brill"}, {"Linnaeus also has version Rear Guard Patrol [orcs, undead only]. before Silverpine Forest, get off the zeppelin from Brill and visit Linnaeus and Christopher"}, {"The Sepulcher first get A Frightened Request from Tabitha, and complete A Recipe For Death→A Recipe For Death→A Recipe For Death"}, {"Undercity find Grave and Mobin in the alchemy room"}, {"These six types of quests will be handed in during the dungeon stage"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Entrance → Witherfang in King's Alley → clear undead → kill the Baron and loot the crest → Rath'mael in the cemetery and Edward to the west. The Forsaken in the market and Victor by the southwest chimney are optional."}, {k="取捨", text="Tribes at levels 16-20 can prioritize one game. For characters who have not cleared the Silver Pine recipe line, first make Silverpine Forest The Sepulcher and then assemble the set, so that the withered teeth will be included in the calculation."}, {k="說明", text="The entrance is above Undercity, in the royal city Ruins on the surface of Tirisfal. Use the Undercity map coordinates and go up the stone steps on the left after entering the Royal City; do not go to the underground elevator.", s={{"The entrance is above Undercity, in the royal city Ruins on the surface of Tirisfal"}, {"Use the Undercity map coordinates and go up the stone steps on the left after entering the Royal City; do not go to the underground elevator"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Deathguard Linnea", tgt="Deathguard Linnea", desc="Tirisfal Glades Brill Skip if completed."}, [2]={hint="Kill 8 Bleeding Horrors and 8 Wandering Spirits, then report back to Linnea at her camp.", desc="Tirisfal Glades Brill Skip if completed."}, [3]={npc="Deathguard Linnea", tgt="Deathguard Linnea", desc="Tirisfal Glades Brill Skip if completed."}, [4]={npc="Deathguard Linnea", tgt="Deathguard Linnea", preText="Rear Guard Patrol"}, [5]={hint="Bring Riptear's Heart to Deathguard Linnea."}, [6]={npc="Deathguard Linnea", tgt="Deathguard Linnea"}, [7]={npc="Deathguard Kristof", tgt="Deathguard Kristof", desc="Quest Rear Guard Patrol has race restrictions. Check whether Kristof offers it to you.", preText="Rear Guard Patrol"}, [8]={npc="Tabitha Heartweaver", tgt="Tabitha Heartweaver"}, [9]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel", desc="If you've started this at the Sepulcher, continue from your current progress."}, [10]={hint="Collect 6 Grizzled Bear Hearts and 6 samples of Skittering Blood and deliver them to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity.", desc="If you've started this at the Sepulcher, continue from your current progress."}, [11]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell", desc="If you've started this at the Sepulcher, continue from your current progress."}, [12]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell", desc="Bernard's diary is in the Pyrewood Village hotel.", preText="A Recipe For Death"}, [13]={hint="Retrieve Apothecary Berard's journal from Pyrewood Village and take it to Apothecary Renferrel at the Sepulcher.", desc="Bernard's diary is in the Pyrewood Village hotel."}, [14]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel", desc="Bernard's diary is in the Pyrewood Village hotel."}, [15]={npc="Apothecary Renferrel", tgt="Apothecary Renferrel", preText="A Recipe For Death"}, [16]={hint="Bring 6 samples of Lake Creeper Moss, 6 samples of Lake Skulker Moss and a Hardened Tumor to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity."}, [17]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell"}, [18]={npc="Theodore Griffs", tgt="Theodore Griffs", preText="A Recipe For Death"}, [19]={npc="Morbin Lightbane", tgt="Morbin Lightbane"}, [20]={text="Ruins of Lordaeron entrance"}, [21]={hint="Collect the Highly Toxic Strain from Witherfang in Ruins of Lordaeron for Theodore Griffs in Undercity.", desc="The DungeonsForever dungeon map is available at Witherfang (1st map 70.20, 37.30). Location: Pass the nerubians and look for Witherfang patrolling King's Alley."}, [22]={hint="Collect 25 Intact Limbs within The Ruins of Lordaeron for Morbin Lightbane in the Undercity.", desc="Location: Loot undead along the main route through King's Alley, the overlook and cemetery."}, [23]={npc="Abominable Head", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Loot and use the Baron's head. Horde can pick this up at 15 after the Nov 6 hotfix. DungeonsForever map 1: The Baron drops the starter (58.80, 69.80)."}, [24]={npc="Crest of Lordaeron", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Look for seals in the spider courtyard, towers and locked rooms."}, [25]={hint="Investigate the disappearance of Edward Heartweaver in the Ruins of Lordaeron.", desc="Location: Find Edward by the ghouls on the west side of Rath'mael's cemetery. Order: Do step 25 before getting close to the body."}, [26]={hint="Kill Rath'mael in the Ruins of Lordaeron for Deathguard Kristof in Brill.", desc="The DungeonsForever dungeon map is available in Rath'mael (1st map 43.90, 60.70). Location: Clear space around Rath'mael in the Lordaeron cemetery before pulling."}, [27]={npc="Theodore Griffs", tgt="Theodore Griffs"}, [28]={npc="Morbin Lightbane", tgt="Morbin Lightbane"}, [29]={hint="Bring the Crest of Lordaeron to Oran Snakewrithe in Undercity.", desc="Look for seals in the spider courtyard, towers and locked rooms."}, [30]={npc="Oran Snakewrithe", tgt="Oran Snakewrithe"}, [31]={hint="Deliver the Abominable Head to Master Apothecary Faranell within the Undercity.", desc="Loot and use the Baron's head. Horde can pick this up at 15 after the Nov 6 hotfix."}, [32]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell"}, [33]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell", preText="Unending Torment"}, [34]={hint="Bring the Head of the Baron to the body of Othmar in the Undercity."}, [35]={npc="Unfinished Abomination", tgt="Unfinished Abomination"}, [36]={npc="Unfinished Abomination", tgt="Unfinished Abomination", preText="Unending Torment"}, [37]={hint="Report your findings to Master Apothecary Faranell in Undercity."}, [38]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell"}, [39]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell", desc="Find the first reagent in Trade, the herb by the trainer and poison in Rogues' Quarter.", preText="Unending Torment"}, [40]={hint="Collect a Toxic Skullcap from Tawny Grisette in the Trade Quarter, Blisterweed near the Herbalism Trainer, and Essence of Agony from the poison vendor in the Rogues' Quarter for Master Apothecary Faranell in Undercity.", desc="Find the first reagent in Trade, the herb by the trainer and poison in Rogues' Quarter."}, [41]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell", desc="Find the first reagent in Trade, the herb by the trainer and poison in Rogues' Quarter."}, [42]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell", desc="Inject the fizzing serum into Osma's upper device.", preText="Unending Torment"}, [43]={hint="Inject the Hissing Serum into the system above Othmar's body for Master Apothecary Faranell.", desc="Inject the fizzing serum into Osma's upper device."}, [44]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell", desc="Inject the fizzing serum into Osma's upper device."}, [45]={npc="Deathguard Kristof", tgt="Deathguard Kristof"}, [46]={npc="Tabitha Heartweaver", tgt="Tabitha Heartweaver"}}},
    ["02-10"] = {name="The Barrens: Ratchet & Camp Taurajo", short="Barrens: Ratchet +", tips={{k="交通", text="After clearing the north side, use the hearthstone to return to The Crossroads. First, hand in the camp quest and then fly to Ratchet. First arrived at Camp Taurajo to make up for flying points."}, {k="取捨", text="Do overlapping targets of Tribes at War, Her Name Is Olgra, Consumed by Hatred. Consumed by Hatred requires 60 fangs. If you don't have enough, keep them in your backpack. skip the single brushing when the level reaches the standard."}, {k="取捨", text="Letter to Jin'Zil and Ziz Fizziks bound for Stone Claw Mountain will be handed in at the next stop. Deepmoss Spider Eggs will be handed in after collecting eggs first and then returning to Ratchet next time. The Ashenvale Hunt Leave Ashenvale with the optional The Warsong Reports option."}, {k="取捨", text="Level 20 Elite WANTED: Bruuz, Centaur Incident Counterattack!, Border Wrongly Blamed, Justly Corrected can be done in a team; Northwatch Hold Escort can easily attract monsters en route, so also skip it."}, {k="取捨", text="Miner's Fortune has a low drop rate, so if you can't get it out, go to the back of the route; the four rare ones are only triggered when you encounter and pick up items."}, {k="提醒", text="Below 23, grind lizards and stalkers at Field to Clear (47.11, 77.38) or head south for Gann's Reclamation. Wailing Caverns (47.70, 35.00) is best at 18-23. Pick up Leaders of the Fang and Serpentbloom at the Crossroads, Trouble at the Docks and Smart Drinks at Ratchet, and Deviate Hides and Deviate Eradication on the ledge outside.", s={{"Below 23, grind lizards and stalkers at Field to Clear (47.11, 77.38) or head south for Gann's Reclamation"}, {"Wailing Caverns (47.70, 35.00) is best at 18-23"}, {"Pick up Leaders of the Fang and Serpentbloom at the Crossroads, Trouble at the Docks and Smart Drinks at Ratchet, and Deviate Hides and Deviate Eradication on the ledge outside"}}}}, danger={[1]="Field to Clear's elite raiders patrol among normal mobs. Only fight the outer ring of lizards to avoid running through the battle group.", [2]="The border leading to Dustwallow Marsh has hordes of Alliance soldiers. No team can skip Wrongly Blamed, Justly Corrected."}, grind={[1]={mob="Stormhide", note="Field to Clear has high density and is an normal mob; patrol the grassland, pay attention to Outraged Pillager elites, and avoid the center of the battle group."}, [2]={mob="Hecklefang Stalker", note="The same grassland as Stormhide, with high density and normal mobs; when other players clear the same area, they can fill in another type of monster along the outer circle without changing camps."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Devrak"}, [2]={npc="Bragok"}, [3]={npc="Innkeeper Wiley"}, [4]={npc="Grazlix"}, [5]={npc="Innkeeper Wiley"}, [6]={npc="Jazzik"}, [7]={npc="Omusa Thunderhorn"}, [8]={npc="Innkeeper Byula"}, [9]={npc="Sanuye Runetotem"}}, steps={[1]={text="Pick up quests if you're already back at the Crossroads. Joining from the Eastern Kingdoms? Hearth there, or take the Orgrimmar zeppelin south of Brill and fly to the Crossroads. Save your hearth for the end of the northern loop."}, [2]={npc="Mankrik", tgt="Mankrik"}, [3]={npc="Mankrik", tgt="Mankrik"}, [4]={npc="Korran", tgt="Korran"}, [5]={npc="Thork", tgt="Thork"}, [6]={hint="Bring Echeyakee's Hide to Sergra Darkthorn at the Crossroads."}, [7]={npc="Sergra Darkthorn", tgt="Sergra Darkthorn", desc="The Barrens The Crossroads If already submitted, skip it."}, [8]={npc="Sergra Darkthorn", tgt="Sergra Darkthorn"}, [9]={hint="Collect 6 Harpy Lieutenant Rings from Witchwing Slayers and return them to Darsok Swiftdagger at the Crossroads.", desc="The Barrens The Crossroads Don't do it until it's finished."}, [10]={npc="Darsok Swiftdagger", tgt="Darsok Swiftdagger", desc="The Barrens The Crossroads If already submitted, skip it."}, [11]={npc="Darsok Swiftdagger", tgt="Darsok Swiftdagger"}, [12]={text="Fly from the Crossroads to Ratchet if both flight paths are open. Otherwise take the east road and learn Ratchet from Bragok (63.08, 37.16). Keep quest Samophlange if you picked it up at the Crossroads."}, [13]={npc="Mebok Mizzyrix", tgt="Mebok Mizzyrix"}, [14]={npc="Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun", tgt="Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun"}, [15]={npc="Mebok Mizzyrix", tgt="Mebok Mizzyrix"}, [16]={npc="Sputtervalve", tgt="Sputtervalve"}, [17]={npc="Wharfmaster Dizzywig", tgt="Wharfmaster Dizzywig", tag="Optional", desc="To the north, go to the mine and pick it up again."}, [18]={npc="WANTED", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Level 20 elite, only pick it up if you plan to form a team."}, [19]={npc="Crane Operator Bigglefuzz", tgt="Crane Operator Bigglefuzz", tag="Optional", desc="Only the reservation group Wailing Caverns will be accepted."}, [20]={text="Take Ratchet's north exit to the Sludge Fen and clear the northern flats. If you missed Samophlange, pick it up from Sputtervalve first."}, [21]={hint="Access the control console at the Venture Company research site."}, [22]={npc="Control Console", npcObj=true}, [23]={npc="Control Console", npcObj=true}, [24]={hint="Close off the Fuel Control Valve, the Regulator Valve and the Main Control Valve then use the control console again."}, [25]={npc="Control Console", npcObj=true}, [26]={npc="Control Console", npcObj=true}, [27]={hint="Get the Console Key from Tinkerer Sniggles to use on the control console."}, [28]={npc="Control Console", npcObj=true}, [29]={npc="Control Console", npcObj=true}, [30]={hint="Retrieve the Cats Eye Emerald from one of the Venture Co. Overseers or Enforcers for Wharfmaster Dizzywig at Ratchet.", tag="Optional", desc="Cat's Eye Jade is rare. Kill on the way and move on if it doesn't drop soon."}, [31]={npc="Wizzlecrank's Shredder", tgt="Wizzlecrank's Shredder", desc="Defeat Foreman to get Ignition and give it to Wizkrank."}, [32]={hint="Get the Ignition Key and bring it to Wizzlecrank.", desc="Defeat Foreman to get Ignition and give it to Wizkrank."}, [33]={npc="Wizzlecrank's Shredder", tgt="Wizzlecrank's Shredder", desc="Defeat Foreman to get Ignition and give it to Wizkrank."}, [34]={npc="Wizzlecrank's Shredder", tgt="Wizzlecrank's Shredder", desc="Heal up and clear nearby mobs before accepting. The escort starts immediately."}, [35]={hint="Protect Wizzlecrank and the stolen goblin shredder on the way to Sputtervalve in Ratchet.", desc="Escort out of the mud swamp, wait for the dialogue to run out and jump to complete."}, [36]={hint="Report to Kadrak at the watch tower in northern Barrens."}, [37]={npc="Kadrak", tgt="Kadrak"}, [38]={npc="Kadrak", tgt="Kadrak", tag="Optional", desc="Save for Splintertree. Open the Bundle of Reports and trade with all three scouts."}, [39]={npc="Vrang Wildgore", tgt="Vrang Wildgore"}, [40]={npc="Vrang Wildgore", tgt="Vrang Wildgore"}, [41]={hint="Collect 6 Savannah Lion Hides from the Savannah Matriarchs and Savannah Patriarchs in the Barrens."}, [42]={hint="Collect 8 Trapped Game from traps found in Sprung Traps in the Barrens."}, [43]={npc="Vrang Wildgore", tgt="Vrang Wildgore"}, [44]={npc="Vrang Wildgore", tgt="Vrang Wildgore"}, [45]={npc="Vrang Wildgore", tgt="Vrang Wildgore"}, [46]={hint="Bring the Bundle of Hides to the hermit on the ridge overlooking the Dry Hills in the Barrens."}, [47]={npc="Terry Longdrink", tgt="Walton"}, [48]={npc="Terry Longdrink", tgt="Walton"}, [49]={hint="Travel to the wrecked caravan and learn more about why the Kul Tirans are here."}, [50]={npc="Terry Longdrink", tgt="Walton"}, [51]={npc="Terry Longdrink", tgt="Walton", tag="Optional", desc="Pull isolated sailors off the escort. Wait for the event to end with Terry's death."}, [52]={hint="Help Walton survive the encounter with Terry Longdrink and the Kul Tiras marines.", tag="Optional", desc="Pull isolated sailors off the escort. Wait for the event to end with Terry's death."}, [53]={npc="Terry Longdrink", tgt="Walton", tag="Optional", desc="Pull isolated sailors off the escort. Wait for the event to end with Terry's death."}, [54]={hint="Slay Serena Bloodfeather and return her head to Darsok Swiftdagger at the Crossroads."}, [55]={text="Hearth to the Crossroads after clearing the north, or take the main road south. Turn in to Serena and pick up Jin'Zil's Letter, then fly to Ratchet."}, [56]={npc="Darsok Swiftdagger", tgt="Darsok Swiftdagger"}, [57]={npc="Darsok Swiftdagger", tgt="Darsok Swiftdagger", desc="Save for the Sun Rock Retreat leg. Find Jin'Zil in the entrance cave."}, [58]={text="After the Crossroads turn-ins, fly to Ratchet for the control console and northern quests."}, [59]={hint="Return the Samophlange to Sputtervalve in Ratchet."}, [60]={npc="Sputtervalve", tgt="Sputtervalve"}, [61]={npc="Sputtervalve", tgt="Sputtervalve"}, [62]={npc="Wharfmaster Dizzywig", tgt="Wharfmaster Dizzywig", tag="Optional"}, [63]={hint="Bring Bruuz's Dorsal Fin to Gazlowe in Ratchet.", tag="Optional", desc="Group up or pull to guards. Deal enough damage to get loot credit."}, [64]={npc="Gazlowe", tgt="Gazlowe", tag="Optional"}, [65]={text="Southeast coast and quilboar pickups at Camp Taurajo"}, [66]={hint="Retrieve the Shipment of Boots and Telescopic Lens for Gazlowe in Ratchet.", desc="Traveling with Northwatch Hold, first open a chest in each camp of South Seas."}, [67]={hint="Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun of Ratchet wants you to collect 10 Theramore Medals and slay Captain Fairmount, Cannoneer Whessan and Cannoneer Smythe."}, [68]={npc="Gilthares Firebough", tgt="Gilthares Firebough", tag="Optional", desc="Escort only when ready; finish dealing with the cannons and badges in the tower first."}, [69]={hint="Safely escort Gilthares Firebough back to Captain Brightsun in Ratchet.", tag="Optional", desc="Escort Gilthares from Northwatch Hold to Ratchet. Stay until you get credit."}, [70]={npc="Gazlowe", tgt="Gazlowe"}, [71]={npc="Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun", tgt="Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun"}, [72]={npc="Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun", tgt="Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun", tag="Optional"}, [73]={text="Head southwest from Ratchet through the Stagnant Oasis and the raptor nests, then continue to Camp Taurajo."}, [74]={hint="Bring Verog's Head to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.", desc="Group up to clear faster. When you see the yell, head to the tent at 53.06, 41.74."}, [75]={hint="Kill Sunscale raptors and collect their feathers. Use the feathers on the 3 Scytheclaw nests. Return to Sergra Darkthorn in the Crossroads."}, [76]={hint="Gather 5 Intact Raptor Horns from Sunscale Scytheclaws, and bring them to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet."}, [77]={hint="Bring the Stolen Silver to Gazrog in the Crossroads."}, [78]={hint="Find Mankrik's wife and then return to him in the Crossroads."}, [79]={text="At Camp Taurajo, learn Omusa Thunderhorn's flight path (44.45, 59.15) if needed. Keep your Crossroads hearth through Sun Rock Retreat."}, [80]={npc="Mangletooth", tgt="Mangletooth"}, [81]={npc="Tatternack Steelforge", tgt="Tatternack Steelforge", tag="Optional", desc="Only pick it up if you want to go to the south to hunt wild boars."}, [82]={npc="Grunt Logmar", tgt="Grunt Logmar", tag="Optional", desc="Eternal version of the team line; if you are short of manpower, skip it."}, [83]={text="Fly to the Crossroads for The Angry Scytheclaws, Lost in Battle and other turn-ins. After getting Jorn's lead-in, head southwest for centaurs or fly back to Camp Taurajo."}, [84]={npc="Sergra Darkthorn", tgt="Sergra Darkthorn"}, [85]={npc="Gazrog", tgt="Gazrog"}, [86]={npc="Mankrik", tgt="Mankrik"}, [87]={npc="Mankrik", tgt="Mankrik", desc="Please hand in Lost in Battle before receive it."}, [88]={npc="Sergra Darkthorn", tgt="Sergra Darkthorn"}, [89]={npc="Regthar Deathgate", tgt="Regthar Deathgate"}, [90]={npc="Regthar Deathgate", tgt="Regthar Deathgate"}, [91]={hint="Bring Hezrul's Head to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads."}, [92]={npc="Regthar Deathgate", tgt="Regthar Deathgate"}, [93]={npc="Regthar Deathgate", tgt="Regthar Deathgate", tag="Optional", desc="Form a team and then pick it up, the Centaur reinforcements will attack in waves."}, [94]={hint="Bring a Piece of Krom'zar's Banner to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.", tag="Optional", desc="Protect your own side and kill the warlord Cromza, and pick up the flag fragment ×1."}, [95]={npc="Regthar Deathgate", tgt="Regthar Deathgate", tag="Optional"}, [96]={hint="Speak with Jorn Skyseer at Camp Taurajo."}, [97]={npc="Jorn Skyseer", tgt="Jorn Skyseer"}, [98]={npc="Jorn Skyseer", tgt="Jorn Skyseer"}, [99]={text="South of Camp Taurajo: quilboar and thunder lizards"}, [100]={hint="Kill 6 Bristleback Water Seekers, 12 Bristleback Thornweavers and 12 Bristleback Geomancers and return to Mangletooth at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens."}, [101]={hint="Bring 60 Bristleback Quilboar Tusks to Mankrik at the Crossroads."}, [102]={hint="Slay quilboars and collect 4 of Olgra's Adornments for Mankrik's memorial."}, [103]={hint="Bring 12 Silithid Eggs and the Digging Claw to Korran at the Crossroads."}, [104]={hint="Slay Alliance soldiers encroaching into the Barrens at the border to Dustwallow Marsh, then return to Grunt Logmar at Camp Taurajo.", tag="Optional", desc="Separate and clear the soldiers first, and finally fight the angry Plunder."}, [105]={npc="Hoof of Lakota'mani", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Only do it when you encounter the rare Lakota'mani, kill it and pick up the hoof."}, [106]={hint="Bring the Hoof of Lakota'mani to Jorn at Camp Taurajo.", tag="Optional", desc="Only do it when you encounter the rare Lakota'mani, kill it and pick up the hoof."}, [107]={npc="Jorn Skyseer", tgt="Jorn Skyseer", tag="Optional", desc="Only do it when you encounter the rare Lakota'mani, kill it and pick up the hoof."}, [108]={npc="Owatanka's Tailspike", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Only do it when you encounter the rare Owatanka, kill it and pick up the tail thorn."}, [109]={hint="Bring Owatanka's Tailspike to Jorn at Camp Taurajo.", tag="Optional", desc="Only do it when you encounter the rare Owatanka, kill it and pick up the tail thorn."}, [110]={npc="Jorn Skyseer", tgt="Jorn Skyseer", tag="Optional", desc="Only do it when you encounter the rare Owatanka, kill it and pick up the tail thorn."}, [111]={npc="Harvester's Head", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Only do this after encountering a rare reaper, killing him and picking up his head."}, [112]={hint="Bring the Harvester's Head to Jorn Skyseer.", tag="Optional", desc="Only do this after encountering a rare reaper, killing him and picking up his head."}, [113]={npc="Jorn Skyseer", tgt="Jorn Skyseer", tag="Optional", desc="Only do this after encountering a rare reaper, killing him and picking up his head."}, [114]={npc="Washte Pawne's Feather", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Only do it when you encounter the rare Washte Pawne, kill it and pick up a feather."}, [115]={hint="Bring Washte Pawne's Feather to Jorn Skyseer at Camp Taurajo.", tag="Optional", desc="Only do it when you encounter the rare Washte Pawne, kill it and pick up a feather."}, [116]={npc="Jorn Skyseer", tgt="Jorn Skyseer", tag="Optional", desc="Only do it when you encounter the rare Washte Pawne, kill it and pick up a feather."}, [117]={npc="Mangletooth", tgt="Mangletooth"}, [118]={npc="Mangletooth", tgt="Mangletooth", desc="Turn in a Blood Shard if you have one. Otherwise kill outside camp for another."}, [119]={hint="Bring a Blood Shard to Mangletooth in Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.", desc="Turn in a Blood Shard if you have one. Otherwise kill outside camp for another."}, [120]={npc="Mangletooth", tgt="Mangletooth", desc="Turn in a Blood Shard if you have one. Otherwise kill outside camp for another."}, [121]={npc="Mangletooth", tgt="Mangletooth", tag="Optional", desc="Fight three bosses to the south to pick it up."}, [122]={npc="Grunt Logmar", tgt="Grunt Logmar", tag="Optional"}, [123]={text="Add the far south if you need XP, then finish your turn-ins"}, [124]={hint="Bring a Razormane Backstabber, a Charred Razormane Wand and a Razormane War Shield to Tatternack Steelforge at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.", tag="Optional"}, [125]={hint="Kill Nak, Kuz, and Lok Orcbane and bring their skulls to Mangletooth at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.", tag="Optional", desc="The three named monsters are in different settlements, please clear them by coordinates."}, [126]={npc="Gann Stonespire", tgt="Gann Stonespire", tag="Optional", desc="Below 23 and already south? Kill both dwarf types and loot the foreman's journal."}, [127]={hint="Gann Stonespire wants you to kill 15 Bael'dun Excavators and 5 Bael'dun Foremen.", tag="Optional", desc="Below 23 and already south? Kill both dwarf types and loot the foreman's journal."}, [128]={npc="Gann Stonespire", tgt="Gann Stonespire", tag="Optional", desc="Below 23 and already south? Kill both dwarf types and loot the foreman's journal."}, [129]={npc="Sulhasa", tgt="Sulhasa", desc="Sulhasa is on the tree bordering Dustwallow Marsh."}, [130]={hint="Sulhasa in southern Barrens wants you to clear out 7 Stormhide lizards and 7 Hecklefang Stalkers in the area so she can leave the tree safely."}, [131]={npc="Sulhasa", tgt="Sulhasa"}, [132]={npc="Mangletooth", tgt="Mangletooth", tag="Optional"}, [133]={npc="Mangletooth", tgt="Mangletooth", tag="Optional", desc="Turn in when you return to the Crossroads."}, [134]={npc="Tatternack Steelforge", tgt="Tatternack Steelforge", tag="Optional"}, [135]={text="Finish Jorn's chain and the two lead-ins for later stops"}, [136]={text="North of Camp Taurajo, look for Swiftmane and Ishamuhale west of Ratchet. Once you loot a Fresh Zhevra Carcass, use it to summon Ishamuhale."}, [137]={hint="Bring Ishamuhale's Fang to Jorn at Camp Taurajo.", desc="Zebra carcasses decomposed after 30 minutes."}, [138]={npc="Mebok Mizzyrix", tgt="Mebok Mizzyrix"}, [139]={hint="Bring 5 Savannah Lion Tusks, 5 Plainstrider Kidneys, and 1 Thunder Lizard Horn to Brewmaster Drohn in Ratchet.", tag="Optional", desc="Loot lion fangs, bird kidneys and lizard horns en route. Skip if short."}, [140]={npc="Brewmaster Drohn", tgt="Brewmaster Drohn", tag="Optional"}, [141]={npc="Mebok Mizzyrix", tgt="Mebok Mizzyrix", tag="Optional", desc="Pay Raptor Horns first; only accept it when you plan to place Wailing Caverns."}, [142]={text="Fly from Ratchet to Camp Taurajo and see Jorn. At level 23, skip the Ashenvale hunting lead-in if desired and head west from the Crossroads to Stonetalon."}, [143]={npc="Jorn Skyseer", tgt="Jorn Skyseer"}, [144]={npc="Jorn Skyseer", tgt="Jorn Skyseer", desc="Leave Ashenvale Splintertree Post Ashenvale for broken wood sentry post."}, [145]={npc="Jorn Skyseer", tgt="Jorn Skyseer", desc="Go with Thunder Lizard outside the camp, and prepare three bottles first."}, [146]={hint="Bring 3 Thunder Lizard Blood to Jorn Skyseer at Camp Taurajo.", desc="Go with Thunder Lizard outside the camp, and prepare three bottles first."}, [147]={npc="Jorn Skyseer", tgt="Jorn Skyseer", desc="Go with Thunder Lizard outside the camp, and prepare three bottles first."}, [148]={npc="Jorn Skyseer", tgt="Jorn Skyseer"}, [149]={hint="Find and slay a Thunderhawk, return its wings to Jorn Skyseer at Camp Taurajo."}, [150]={npc="Jorn Skyseer", tgt="Jorn Skyseer"}, [151]={text="Fly back to the Crossroads for remaining turn-ins, then head west past Honor's Stand (35.26, 27.88) to Stonetalon."}, [152]={npc="Mankrik", tgt="Mankrik"}, [153]={npc="Mankrik", tgt="Mankrik"}, [154]={npc="Korran", tgt="Korran"}, [155]={hint="Bring Lok's Skull to Thork at the Crossroads in the Barrens.", tag="Optional"}, [156]={npc="Thork", tgt="Thork", tag="Optional"}, [157]={npc="Sorek", tgt="Sorek", tag="Optional", desc="Other pickups: Torm Ragetotem in Thunder Bluff or Baltus Fowler in Undercity."}, [158]={hint="Speak with Ruga Ragetotem.", tag="Optional", desc="Can be picked up from trainer Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff or Undercity."}, [159]={npc="Ruga Ragetotem", tgt="Ruga Ragetotem", tag="Optional", desc="Can be picked up from trainer Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff or Undercity."}, [160]={npc="Ruga Ragetotem", tgt="Ruga Ragetotem", tag="Optional", desc="Same trip as Camp Taurajo peripheral quest."}, [161]={hint="Bring 5 twitching antennae to Ruga Ragetotem at Camp Taurajo", tag="Optional", desc="Same trip as Camp Taurajo peripheral quest."}, [162]={npc="Ruga Ragetotem", tgt="Ruga Ragetotem", tag="Optional", desc="Same trip as Camp Taurajo peripheral quest."}, [163]={npc="Ruga Ragetotem", tgt="Ruga Ragetotem", tag="Optional"}, [164]={hint="Speak with Thun'grim Firegaze in the Barrens.", tag="Optional"}, [165]={npc="Thun'grim Firegaze", tgt="Thun'grim Firegaze", tag="Optional"}, [166]={npc="Thun'grim Firegaze", tgt="Thun'grim Firegaze", tag="Optional", desc="Get Iron Bars from goblins, Azurite from farmers and Phlogiston in Razorfen Kraul."}, [167]={npc="Shenthul", tgt="Shenthul", desc="Use the Razor Hill lead-in (To Orgrimmar!) or pick up directly from Shenthul."}, [168]={hint="Speak with Zando'zan at the Cleft of Shadow.", desc="Use the Razor Hill lead-in (To Orgrimmar!) or pick up directly from Shenthul."}, [169]={npc="Zando'zan", tgt="Zando'zan", desc="Use the Razor Hill lead-in (To Orgrimmar!) or pick up directly from Shenthul."}, [170]={npc="Zando'zan", tgt="Zando'zan"}, [171]={hint="Travel to Ratchet and speak with Wrenix the Wretched."}, [172]={npc="Wrenix the Wretched", tgt="Wrenix the Wretched"}, [173]={npc="Wrenix the Wretched", tgt="Wrenix the Wretched", desc="Use E.C.A.C. on the parrot first. Practice Lockpicking on shipboard chests."}, [174]={hint="Bring the Southsea Treasure back to Wrenix the Wretched in Ratchet. Do not forget to get an E.C.A.C. and Thieves' Tools from Wrenix's Gizmotronic Apparatus. You will need both of these items to complete your mission.", desc="Use E.C.A.C. on the parrot first. Practice Lockpicking on shipboard chests."}, [175]={npc="Wrenix the Wretched", tgt="Wrenix the Wretched", desc="Use E.C.A.C. on the parrot first. Practice Lockpicking on shipboard chests."}, [176]={npc="Shenthul", tgt="Shenthul", desc="Wait for Shenthul to demonstrate and select him before saluting."}, [177]={hint="Perform the Shattered Salute on Shenthul.", desc="Wait for Shenthul to demonstrate and select him before saluting."}, [178]={npc="Shenthul", tgt="Shenthul", desc="Wait for Shenthul to demonstrate and select him before saluting."}, [179]={npc="Shenthul", tgt="Shenthul", desc="Fire two flares, approach, then /salute. The wrong order makes him attack."}, [180]={hint="Travel to the Venture Co. Tower, north of the Sludge Fen and contact the Shattered Hand's covert operative, Taskmaster Fizzule.", desc="Fire two flares, approach, then /salute. The wrong order makes him attack."}, [181]={npc="Taskmaster Fizzule", tgt="Taskmaster Fizzule", desc="Fire two flares, approach, then /salute. The wrong order makes him attack."}, [182]={npc="Taskmaster Fizzule", tgt="Taskmaster Fizzule", desc="Pickpocket the key and pick the lock. After the poison, take Hinott's Assistance."}, [183]={hint="Steal Silixiz's Tower Key from Foreman Silixiz, then kill two Mutated Venture Co. Drones, two Venture Co. Patrollers, and two Venture Co. Lookouts.", desc="Pickpocket the key and pick the lock. After the poison, take Hinott's Assistance."}, [184]={npc="Shenthul", tgt="Shenthul", desc="Pickpocket the key and pick the lock. After the poison, take Hinott's Assistance."}, [185]={npc="Shenthul", tgt="Shenthul", desc="Hand in at Tarren Mill."}, [186]={npc="Searn Firewarder", tgt="Searn Firewarder", desc="Use any listed Call of Water lead-in or go straight to Islen Waterseer."}, [187]={hint="Find Islen Waterseer in the Barrens.", desc="Use any listed Call of Water lead-in or go straight to Islen Waterseer."}, [188]={npc="Islen Waterseer", tgt="Islen Waterseer", desc="Use any listed Call of Water lead-in or go straight to Islen Waterseer."}, [189]={npc="Islen Waterseer", tgt="Islen Waterseer"}, [190]={hint="Find Brine in Southern Barrens."}, [191]={npc="Brine", tgt="Brine"}, [192]={npc="Brine", tgt="Brine"}, [193]={hint="Fill the Empty Brown Waterskin at the watering hole below Brine's hut and return it to her in the Barrens."}, [194]={npc="Brine", tgt="Brine"}, [195]={npc="Brine", tgt="Brine", desc="Get water at Tarren Mill. Turn it in back in the Barrens after Freewind Post."}, [196]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem"}, [197]={hint="Speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade."}, [198]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze"}, [199]={text="Tauren"}, [200]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze"}, [201]={hint="Seek out the Great Cat Spirit in southern part Moonglade and learn what it has to share with you about the nature of the cat."}, [202]={npc="Great Cat Spirit", tgt="Great Cat Spirit"}, [203]={npc="Great Cat Spirit", tgt="Great Cat Spirit"}, [204]={hint="Recover the Relic of the Fang, Relic of the Claw, and Relic of the Silent Shadow from the Stormrage Barrow Den, and return them to the Great Cat Spirit."}, [205]={npc="Great Cat Spirit", tgt="Great Cat Spirit"}, [206]={npc="Great Cat Spirit", tgt="Great Cat Spirit"}, [207]={hint="Speak to Dendrite."}, [208]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze"}, [209]={text="Windshaper Skyborne"}, [210]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze"}, [211]={hint="Seek out the Avatar of Saeyleenan in the southern part Moonglade and learn what it has to share with you about the nature of the windborne cat."}, [212]={npc="Avatar of Saeyleenan", tgt="Avatar of Saeyleenan"}, [213]={npc="Avatar of Saeyleenan", tgt="Avatar of Saeyleenan"}, [214]={hint="Recover the Relic of the Fang, Relic of the Claw, and Relic of the Silent Shadow from the Stormrage Barrow Den, and return them to the Avatar of Saeyleenan."}, [215]={npc="Avatar of Saeyleenan", tgt="Avatar of Saeyleenan"}, [216]={npc="Avatar of Saeyleenan", tgt="Avatar of Saeyleenan"}, [217]={hint="Speak to Dendrite."}, [218]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze"}, [219]={text="Finish both racial routes here"}, [220]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze", desc="Submit the picture Rarc to learn the cheetah form and the starting skills of this form."}, [221]={hint="Return to Thunder Bluff and speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise.", desc="Submit the picture Rarc to learn the cheetah form and the starting skills of this form."}, [222]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem", desc="Submit the picture Rarc to learn the cheetah form and the starting skills of this form."}, [223]={npc="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tgt="Gan'rul Bloodeye", desc="After connecting, select Succubus or Incubus at Cazul."}, [224]={hint="Speak with Cazul in the Cleft of Shadow.", desc="After connecting, select Succubus or Incubus at Cazul."}, [225]={npc="Cazul", tgt="Cazul", desc="After connecting, select Succubus or Incubus at Cazul."}, [226]={text="Western route: Succubus"}, [227]={npc="Cazul", tgt="Cazul"}, [228]={hint="Speak with Zankaja in Orgrimmar."}, [229]={npc="Zankaja", tgt="Zankaja"}, [230]={npc="Zankaja", tgt="Zankaja"}, [231]={hint="Speak with Gazrog at the Crossroads."}, [232]={npc="Gazrog", tgt="Gazrog"}, [233]={npc="Gazrog", tgt="Gazrog"}, [234]={hint="Speak with Ken'zigla at the Malaka'jin."}, [235]={npc="Ken'zigla", tgt="Ken'zigla"}, [236]={npc="Ken'zigla", tgt="Ken'zigla"}, [237]={hint="Bring Ken'zigla's Draught to Grunt Logmar at Camp Taurajo."}, [238]={npc="Grunt Logmar", tgt="Grunt Logmar"}, [239]={npc="Grunt Logmar", tgt="Grunt Logmar"}, [240]={hint="Bring Ken'zigla's Draught to Dogran in the Barrens."}, [241]={npc="Grunt Dogran", tgt="Grunt Dogran"}, [242]={npc="Grunt Dogran", tgt="Grunt Dogran"}, [243]={hint="Bring the Dirt-caked Pendant to Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar."}, [244]={npc="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tgt="Gan'rul Bloodeye"}, [245]={npc="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tgt="Gan'rul Bloodeye", desc="Use Dogran's Pendant at the summoning circle in Orgrimmar. Defeat the succubus."}, [246]={hint="Using Dogran's Pendant, summon and subdue a succubus, then return Dogran's Pendant to Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.", desc="Use Dogran's Pendant at the summoning circle in Orgrimmar. Defeat the succubus."}, [247]={npc="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tgt="Gan'rul Bloodeye", desc="Use Dogran's Pendant at the summoning circle in Orgrimmar. Defeat the succubus."}, [248]={text="Western route: Incubus"}, [249]={npc="Cazul", tgt="Cazul", tag="Optional"}, [250]={hint="Speak with Magar in Orgrimmar.", tag="Optional"}, [251]={npc="Magar", tgt="Magar", tag="Optional"}, [252]={npc="Magar", tgt="Magar", tag="Optional", desc="Kill Shadethicket Stone Movers near Fallen Sky Lake for a Shriveled Scarf."}, [253]={hint="Investigate Fallen Sky Lake in Ashenvale and report your findings to Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.", tag="Optional", desc="Kill Shadethicket Stone Movers near Fallen Sky Lake for a Shriveled Scarf."}, [254]={npc="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tgt="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tag="Optional", desc="Kill Shadethicket Stone Movers near Fallen Sky Lake for a Shriveled Scarf."}, [255]={npc="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tgt="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tag="Optional", desc="Use the scarf to summon the Dream Demon at Orgrimmar. After defeating it, go to Ganluer."}, [256]={hint="Using the Withered Scarf, summon and subdue an incubus, then return the Withered Scarf to Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.", tag="Optional", desc="Use the scarf to summon the Dream Demon at Orgrimmar. After defeating it, go to Ganluer."}, [257]={npc="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tgt="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tag="Optional", desc="Use the scarf to summon the Dream Demon at Orgrimmar. After defeating it, go to Ganluer."}, [258]={text="Eastern route: shared start"}, [259]={npc="Carendin Halgar", tgt="Carendin Halgar", tag="Optional", desc="For the eastern route, see Godrick in Undercity. Pick up once you're level 20."}, [260]={hint="Speak with Godrick Farsan in the Temple of the Damned.", tag="Optional", desc="For the eastern route, see Godrick in Undercity. Pick up once you're level 20."}, [261]={npc="Godrick Farsan", tgt="Godrick Farsan", tag="Optional", desc="For the eastern route, see Godrick in Undercity. Pick up once you're level 20."}, [262]={text="Eastern route: Succubus"}, [263]={npc="Godrick Farsan", tgt="Godrick Farsan", tag="Optional", desc="Loot Dalin's heart in south Silverpine and Comar's near Menethil Harbor."}, [264]={hint="Bring the hearts of Dalin Forgewright and Comar Villard to Carendin Halgar in the Temple of the Damned.", tag="Optional", desc="Loot Dalin's heart in south Silverpine and Comar's near Menethil Harbor."}, [265]={npc="Carendin Halgar", tgt="Carendin Halgar", tag="Optional", desc="Loot Dalin's heart in south Silverpine and Comar's near Menethil Harbor."}, [266]={npc="Carendin Halgar", tgt="Carendin Halgar", tag="Optional", desc="Use the heart to summon the circle at Undercity and defeat the succubus."}, [267]={hint="Using the Pure Hearts, summon and subdue a succubus, then return the Pure Hearts to Carendin Halgar in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity.", tag="Optional", desc="Use the heart to summon the circle at Undercity and defeat the succubus."}, [268]={npc="Carendin Halgar", tgt="Carendin Halgar", tag="Optional", desc="Use the heart to summon the circle at Undercity and defeat the succubus."}, [269]={text="Eastern route: Incubus"}, [270]={npc="Godrick Farsan", tgt="Godrick Farsan", tag="Optional", desc="Kill Avelina in Silverpine and Isaac Pearson in the Barrens. Loot both hearts."}, [271]={hint="Bring the hearts of Avelina Lilly and Isaac Pearson to Carendin Halgar in the Temple of the Damned.", tag="Optional", desc="Kill Avelina in Silverpine and Isaac Pearson in the Barrens. Loot both hearts."}, [272]={npc="Carendin Halgar", tgt="Carendin Halgar", tag="Optional", desc="Kill Avelina in Silverpine and Isaac Pearson in the Barrens. Loot both hearts."}, [273]={npc="Carendin Halgar", tgt="Carendin Halgar", tag="Optional", desc="Summon the magic circle at Undercity and use the heart to defeat the Dream Demon."}, [274]={hint="Using the Lovers' Hearts, summon and subdue an incubus, then return the Lovers' Hearts to Carendin Halgar in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity.", tag="Optional", desc="Summon the magic circle at Undercity and use the heart to defeat the Dream Demon."}, [275]={npc="Carendin Halgar", tgt="Carendin Halgar", tag="Optional", desc="Summon the magic circle at Undercity and use the heart to defeat the Dream Demon."}, [276]={text="Optional class gear"}, [277]={npc="Doan Karhan", tgt="Doan Karhan", tag="Optional", desc="Loot 3 small fragments from BFD acolytes and 1 large fragment from SFK Darksouls.", star={"Orb of Soran'ruk", {"WARLOCK"}}}, [278]={hint="Find 3 Soran'ruk Fragments and 1 Large Soran'ruk Fragment and return them to Doan Karhan in the Barrens.", tag="Optional", desc="Loot 3 small fragments from BFD acolytes and 1 large fragment from SFK Darksouls. Pins mark BFD and SFK entrances. Interior mob positions are unconfirmed."}, [279]={npc="Doan Karhan", tgt="Doan Karhan", tag="Optional", desc="Loot 3 small fragments from BFD acolytes and 1 large fragment from SFK Darksouls.", star={"Orb of Soran'ruk", {"WARLOCK"}}}}},
    ["05-d5"] = {name="The Deadmines", entrance="Westfall 38.20, 77.50", pickup="When going to Silverpine Forest, first find Denissa at Tirisfal Glades Bandarion Keep to pick up Diplomatic Incident, and complete Silver Pine and Fenris Isle preset [Undead only] [Paladin only] en route. At level 20, go to Lumina at The Sepulcher to get A Moon-Kissed Blade and go to Cui Fan to get the notes [Undead only] [Paladin only]. Take a boat from The Barrens Ratchet to Booty Bay, go north along Stranglethorn Vale to Duskwood, and then west to Moonbrook.", pickupS={{"When going to Silverpine Forest, first find Denissa at Tirisfal Glades Bandarion Keep to pick up Diplomatic Incident, and complete Silver Pine and Fenris Isle preset [Undead only] [Paladin only] en route", {race={"Scourge"}, class={"PALADIN"}}}, {"At level 20, go to Lumina at The Sepulcher to get A Moon-Kissed Blade and go to Cui Fan to get the notes [Undead only] [Paladin only]", {race={"Scourge"}, class={"PALADIN"}}}, {"Take a boat from The Barrens Ratchet to Booty Bay, go north along Stranglethorn Vale to Duskwood, and then west to Moonbrook"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Mine tunnel → Rhahk'Zor → Sneed and the lumber → Gilnid's forge → blast the door to the docks → Mr. Smite → Captain Greenskin → Edwin VanCleef. Cookie is on the lower deck. Leave after Sneed if you only need the lumber."}, {k="取捨", text="For pure leveling, skip this trip. Do A Moon-Kissed Blade to get to the Sneed room and collect all the wood [Undead only] [Paladin only]. If the team wants to get the final boss equipment, they can continue the fight to the end.", s={{"For pure leveling, skip this trip"}, {"Do A Moon-Kissed Blade to get to the Sneed room and collect all the wood [Undead only] [Paladin only]", {race={"Scourge"}, class={"PALADIN"}}}, {"If the team wants to get the final boss equipment, they can continue the fight to the end"}}}, {k="說明", text="The entrance to the mine at Moonbrook is about 42.40, 70.40. Go downstairs in the advanced building and then follow the tunnel to the official gate at 38.20, 77.50. Defias quests received by the Alliance are not included in the Horde.", s={{"The entrance to the mine at Moonbrook is about 42.40, 70.40"}, {"Go downstairs in the advanced building and then follow the tunnel to the official gate at 38.20, 77.50"}, {"Defias quests received by the Alliance are not included in the Horde"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Danitha Morr", tgt="Danitha Morr"}, [2]={hint="Travel to The Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest and speak with Trevan Rol about the missing Earthen Ring travelers."}, [3]={npc="Trevan Rol", tgt="Trevan Rol"}, [4]={npc="Trevan Rol", tgt="Trevan Rol", preText="Diplomatic Incident"}, [5]={hint="Speak with Deathguard Baldren about the mysterious Earthen Ring travelers who recently passed through The Sepulcher."}, [6]={npc="Deathguard Baldren", tgt="Deathguard Baldren"}, [7]={npc="Deathguard Baldren", tgt="Deathguard Baldren", preText="A Curious Pair"}, [8]={hint="Investigate Fenris Isle to the east and learn the fate of the Earthen Ring traveling party."}, [9]={npc="Charred Remains", npcObj=true}, [10]={npc="Charred Remains", npcObj=true, preText="A Grim Fate"}, [11]={hint="Investigate Fenris Keep to the north and attempt to locate the missing member of the Earthen Ring party."}, [12]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger"}, [13]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger", preText="Into Fenris Keep"}, [14]={hint="Retrieve the Fenris Isle Key from the Rot Hide Gnolls and use it to free Lumina Windsinger."}, [15]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger"}, [16]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger", desc="Follow the Silverpine Forest The Sepulcher occupation column to handle the Windshaper.", preText="Lumina Windsinger"}, [17]={hint="Accompany Lumina Windsinger and help her escape Fenris Keep.", desc="Follow the Silverpine Forest The Sepulcher occupation column to handle the Windshaper."}, [18]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger", desc="Follow the Silverpine Forest The Sepulcher occupation column to handle the Windshaper."}, [19]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger", preText="The Windshaper's Wrath"}, [20]={hint="Speak with Lumina Windsinger in the Sepulcher."}, [21]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger"}, [22]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger", desc="After answering, talk to Trevan Rol to get Weapon Note ×1, and then keep the quest.", preText="The Debt"}, [23]={text="The Deadmines entrance"}, [24]={hint="Speak with Trevan Rol in the Sepulcher and bring him the materials he requires.", desc="The drop rate only counts Whitestone Oak Lumber dropped by Goblin Woodcarver. Location: Pass Rhahk'Zor. Kill the carpenters by Sneed in the lumber room."}, [25]={npc="Trevan Rol", tgt="Trevan Rol", desc="Bring the notes, Whitestone Oak, Enchanted Silver Bar and Purified Kor Gem."}}},
    ["05-d4"] = {name="Wailing Caverns", entrance="The Barrens 46.00, 36.30", pickup="Find Tuga in The Barrens The Crossroads to complete The Forgotten Pools→The Stagnant Oasis→Altered Beings, then go to Thunder Bluff to find Hamuir, Nala and Zama; Ratchet first hand over Raptor Horns and then pick up Smart Drinks and Trouble at the Docks. Finally, go to the stone platform above the cave entrance to find Nalpak and Ebru.", pickupS={{"Find Tuga in The Barrens The Crossroads to complete The Forgotten Pools→The Stagnant Oasis→Altered Beings, then go to Thunder Bluff to find Hamuir, Nala and Zama"}, {"Ratchet first hand over Raptor Horns and then pick up Smart Drinks and Trouble at the Docks"}, {"Finally, go to the stone platform above the cave entrance to find Nalpak and Ebru"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Anacondra in the entrance shallows → Cobrahn west of the river → Pythas, Skum, Serpentis and Verdan to the east → return to the entrance after all four Fanglords, escort the Disciple and kill Mutanus. Gather Serpentbloom, Deviate Hides and Wailing Essence while clearing deviates in both wings."}, {k="取捨", text="If you don't hand in Raptor Horns, you won't be able to see Smart Drinks; if you don't have one, you don't have to make the whole team wait at the door. The The Barrens The Crossroads oasis chain has been completed first, and continues from Hamuul Runetotem according to the existing progress."}, {k="說明", text="The entrance to the outer cave is about 47.70, 35.00; enter the stone cave from the lush oasis and pass through the passage. The door is deeper. Nalpak and Ebru are connected to the small hole above the outer hole and then go down.", s={{"The entrance to the outer cave is about 47.70, 35.00; enter the stone cave from the lush oasis and pass through the passage"}, {"The door is deeper"}, {"Nalpak and Ebru are connected to the small hole above the outer hole and then go down"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem"}, [2]={hint="Report back to Tonga Runetotem with your findings."}, [3]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem"}, [4]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem", preText="The Forgotten Pools"}, [5]={hint="Return to Tonga at The Crossroads, after investigating the Stagnant Oasis."}, [6]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem"}, [7]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem", preText="The Stagnant Oasis"}, [8]={hint="Bring 8 Altered Snapjaw Shells to Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads.", tag="Target: Oasis Snapjaw / Oasis Snapjaw Hatchling"}, [9]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem"}, [10]={npc="Tonga Runetotem", tgt="Tonga Runetotem", preText="Altered Beings"}, [11]={hint="Speak with Hamuul Runetotem."}, [12]={npc="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem", tgt="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem"}, [13]={npc="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem", tgt="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem", preText="Hamuul Runetotem"}, [14]={hint="Speak with Nara Wildmane."}, [15]={npc="Nara Wildmane", tgt="Nara Wildmane"}, [16]={npc="Nara Wildmane", tgt="Nara Wildmane", preText="Nara Wildmane"}, [17]={npc="Apothecary Zamah", tgt="Apothecary Zamah"}, [18]={npc="Mebok Mizzyrix", tgt="Mebok Mizzyrix"}, [19]={hint="Gather 5 Intact Raptor Horns from Sunscale Scytheclaws, and bring them to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet."}, [20]={npc="Mebok Mizzyrix", tgt="Mebok Mizzyrix"}, [21]={npc="Mebok Mizzyrix", tgt="Mebok Mizzyrix", preText="Raptor Horns"}, [22]={npc="Crane Operator Bigglefuzz", tgt="Crane Operator Bigglefuzz"}, [23]={npc="Nalpak", tgt="Nalpak"}, [24]={npc="Ebru", tgt="Ebru"}, [25]={hint="Crane Operator Bigglefuzz in Ratchet wants you to retrieve the bottle of 99-Year-Old Port from Mad Magglish who is hiding in the Wailing Caverns."}, [26]={text="Wailing Caverns entrance"}, [27]={hint="Apothecary Zamah in Thunder Bluff wants you to collect 10 Serpentbloom.", desc="The pins mark Serpentbloom outside the instance portal. Location: Follow the shallow stream and gather Serpentbloom along both banks."}, [28]={hint="Nalpak in the Wailing Caverns wants 20 Deviate Hides.", desc="The coordinates are the mutant killer spawn point in the cave outside the dungeon door. Location: Kill deviates at the shallow fork and in both wings. Loot hides as you go."}, [29]={hint="Ebru in the Wailing Caverns wants you to kill 7 Deviate Ravagers, 7 Deviate Vipers, 7 Deviate Shamblers and 7 Deviate Dreadfangs.", desc="Location: Clear the shallow fork, then finish all four mobs in the west and east wings."}, [30]={hint="Bring 6 portions of Wailing Essence to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet.", desc="Pins mark Devouring Ectoplasms outside. Oozes inside count too. Drop rate is for Devouring Ectoplasms outside the portal. Location: Find oozes along the stream if you're short on Wailing Essence."}, [31]={hint="Bring the Gems of Cobrahn, Anacondra, Pythas and Serpentis to Nara Wildmane in Thunder Bluff.", desc="Map 1: Anacondra 30.5,43.2; Cobrahn 15.6,58.5; Pythas 85.6,28.4; Serpentis 61.6,53.8. Location: Find Anacondra in the shallows, Cobrahn west and the other two bosses east."}, [32]={npc="Glowing Shard", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Return to the Disciple after the four Druids. Escort him and kill Mutanus for the shard. DungeonsForever map 1: Mutanus the Devourer drops the shard (34.40, 13.60)."}, [33]={npc="Nalpak", tgt="Nalpak"}, [34]={npc="Ebru", tgt="Ebru"}, [35]={npc="Crane Operator Bigglefuzz", tgt="Crane Operator Bigglefuzz"}, [36]={npc="Mebok Mizzyrix", tgt="Mebok Mizzyrix"}, [37]={hint="Travel to Ratchet to find someone that can tell you more about the glowing shard."}, [38]={npc="Falla Sagewind", tgt="Falla Sagewind"}, [39]={npc="Falla Sagewind", tgt="Falla Sagewind", preText="The Glowing Shard"}, [40]={hint="Bring the Nightmare Shard to Hamuul Runetotem on Elder Rise."}, [41]={npc="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem", tgt="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem"}, [42]={npc="Nara Wildmane", tgt="Nara Wildmane"}, [43]={npc="Apothecary Zamah", tgt="Apothecary Zamah"}}},
    ["02-11"] = {name="Stonetalon Mountains", tips={{k="交通", text="Sun Rock Retreat is opened for the first time and the hearth stone is tied; leave the hearth stone to the south mountain pass and return to Sun Rock Retreat, and continue the flight to Ratchet."}, {k="取捨", text="Do. Mirkfallon Lake picks up Gaea Seed, Stonetalon Peak clears Cenarius' Legacy. After returning the seeds, do the four items The Charred Vale in the same trip. Thousand Needles Freewind Post Passing by The Great Lift, please pay Calling in the Reserves again."}, {k="取捨", text="Drop by later. Ordanus Call Ordanus at Ashenvale Splintertree Post; Further Instructions~Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle can only be continued if you return to Windshear Crag in the future, one less round trip to Ratchet."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional. For Besseleth and Earthen Arise, fight elites; for Jin'Zil's Forest Magic, farm a variety of beasts and submit the materials at the south end. Only when you have enough materials can you submit them."}, {k="提醒", text="Before reaching level 25, add Bloodfury Harpy or fire element outside The Charred Vale (approximately 32, 64), and kill only the lone monster first.", s={{"Before reaching level 25, add Bloodfury Harpy or fire element outside The Charred Vale (approximately 32, 64), and kill only the lone monster first"}}}}, danger={[1]="There is an elite spider Besseleth in Spider Web Mountain. Clear the surrounding little spiders first, there are no teams to jump over.", [2]="Boulderslide Ravine The road in the cave is narrow. Before opening the barrel to summon Goggeroc, clear the retreat from the cave entrance to the barrel."}, grind={[1]={mob="Bloodfury Harpy", note="The Charred Vale The east entrance has a medium density and contains normal mobs; pick out single monsters on the outside first, and pay attention to patrols. gain experience at level 23."}, [2]={mob="Bloodfury Windcaller", note="The Charred Vale The east side has a high density and contains ordinary spell-casting monsters; use the mountain wall to pull out the camp to avoid attracting the nest group together. The Charred Vale quests can be performed at the same time."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Tharm"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Jayka"}, [3]={npc="Borand"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Jayka"}, [5]={npc="Grawnal"}, [6]={npc="Jeeda"}}, steps={[1]={text="Take the northwest road from the Crossroads toward Stonetalon. Stop for Seereth Stonebreak in the Barrens (35.26, 27.88)."}, [2]={hint="Speak with Seereth Stonebreak in the Stonetalon Mountains.", tag="If The Barrens The Crossroads is connected, Optional"}, [3]={npc="Seereth Stonebreak", tgt="Seereth Stonebreak", tag="If The Barrens The Crossroads is connected, Optional"}, [4]={npc="Seereth Stonebreak", tgt="Seereth Stonebreak"}, [5]={text="Go through southern Stonetalon to Malaka'jin, then uphill past the spiders to Windshear Crag."}, [6]={hint="Deliver Darsok's letter to Jin'Zil within his cave in Malaka'Jin, in Stonetalon.", tag="If The Barrens Ratchet and Camp Taurajo are connected"}, [7]={npc="Witch Doctor Jin'Zil", tgt="Witch Doctor Jin'Zil", tag="If The Barrens Ratchet and Camp Taurajo are connected"}, [8]={npc="Xen'Zilla", tgt="Xen'Zilla"}, [9]={npc="Witch Doctor Jin'Zil", tgt="Witch Doctor Jin'Zil", tag="Optional"}, [10]={npc="Wanted Poster: Besseleth", npcObj=true, tag="Optional"}, [11]={hint="Speak with Ziz Fizziks in Windshear Crag.", tag="If The Barrens Ratchet and Camp Taurajo are connected"}, [12]={npc="Ziz Fizziks", tgt="Ziz Fizziks", tag="If The Barrens Ratchet and Camp Taurajo are connected"}, [13]={npc="Ziz Fizziks", tgt="Ziz Fizziks"}, [14]={hint="Xen'zilla at Malaka'Jin needs you to kill 10 Deepmoss Creepers and 7 Deepmoss Venomspitters."}, [15]={hint="Bring 15 Deepmoss Eggs to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet.", tag="If The Barrens Ratchet and Camp Taurajo are connected"}, [16]={hint="Kill 15 Venture Co. Loggers, then return to Seereth Stonebreak on the border of Stonetalon and the Barrens."}, [17]={hint="Get the Super Reaper 6000 Blueprints for Ziz Fizziks in the Stonetalon Mountains.", desc="The drop rate is Venture Co. Operator listed in QuestieDB."}, [18]={npc="Ziz Fizziks", tgt="Ziz Fizziks"}, [19]={npc="Ziz Fizziks", tgt="Ziz Fizziks"}, [20]={hint="Kill Besseleth and bring Besseleth's Fang to Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat.", tag="Optional", desc="Besseleth is an elite, if you can't beat it, skip it first."}, [21]={text="Follow the road up to Sun Rock Retreat. Learn the flight path from Tharm (45.12, 59.84) and set your hearth with Innkeeper Jayka (47.47, 62.13). Save it until the southern pass turn-ins are done."}, [22]={npc="Maggran Earthbinder", tgt="Maggran Earthbinder", tag="Optional"}, [23]={npc="Tammra Windfield", tgt="Tammra Windfield"}, [24]={npc="Braelyn Firehand", tgt="Braelyn Firehand"}, [25]={npc="Maggran Earthbinder", tgt="Maggran Earthbinder"}, [26]={npc="Tsunaman", tgt="Tsunaman"}, [27]={npc="Maggran Earthbinder", tgt="Maggran Earthbinder"}, [28]={npc="Maggran Earthbinder", tgt="Maggran Earthbinder"}, [29]={npc="Mor'rogal", tgt="Mor'rogal", tag="Optional"}, [30]={text="Loop north around Mirkfallon Lake and Stonetalon Peak. Come back down the same way and turn in the seeds at Sun Rock Retreat before heading west."}, [31]={hint="Tammra Windfield at Sun Rock Retreat wants you to gather 10 Gaea Seeds."}, [32]={hint="Kill 4 Sons of Cenarius, 4 Daughters of Cenarius and 4 Cenarion Botanists for Braelyn Firehand near Sun Rock Retreat."}, [33]={hint="Witch Doctor Jin'Zil at Malaka'jin wants 5 portions of Stonetalon Sap, 5 Twilight Whiskers, 30 Courser Eyes and a Fey Dragon Scale.", tag="Optional", desc="Loot the eyes on the Cenarius' Legacy run. Don't farm the rest separately."}, [34]={npc="Tammra Windfield", tgt="Tammra Windfield"}, [35]={npc="Tammra Windfield", tgt="Tammra Windfield"}, [36]={npc="Braelyn Firehand", tgt="Braelyn Firehand"}, [37]={npc="Braelyn Firehand", tgt="Braelyn Firehand", tag="Optional"}, [38]={text="Head west to the Charred Vale. Clear harpies, collect sunscale stones, kill fire elementals and check the mounds on one loop."}, [39]={hint="Maggran Earthbinder in Sun Rock Retreat wants you to slay 7 Bloodfury Harpies, 7 Bloodfury Ambushers, 7 Bloodfury Slayers and 7 Bloodfury Roguefeathers."}, [40]={hint="Bring 15 Glittering Sunstones to Mor'rogal."}, [41]={hint="Bring 10 Incendrites to Tsunaman at Sun Rock Retreat."}, [42]={hint="Plant 10 Gaea Seeds in Gaea Dirt Mounds, and then return the remaining Enchanted Gaea Seeds to Tammra at Sun Rock Retreat.", desc="Use quest seed for Gaea Dirt Mound with bump."}, [43]={text="Return east to Sun Rock Retreat for turn-ins. Save your hearth for the Malaka'jin and mountain pass return."}, [44]={npc="Maggran Earthbinder", tgt="Maggran Earthbinder"}, [45]={npc="Mor'rogal", tgt="Mor'rogal"}, [46]={npc="Tsunaman", tgt="Tsunaman"}, [47]={npc="Tammra Windfield", tgt="Tammra Windfield"}, [48]={npc="Maggran Earthbinder", tgt="Maggran Earthbinder", tag="Elite, Optional"}, [49]={hint="Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat wishes you to slay Bloodfury Ripper and bring her remains as proof of your deed.", tag="Elite, Optional", desc="Bloodfury Ripper is a level 26 elite and can only be done with teammates."}, [50]={npc="Maggran Earthbinder", tgt="Maggran Earthbinder", tag="Elite, Optional"}, [51]={text="After the Charred Vale turn-ins, take the southeast road. Do the optional Boulderslide Ravine quests or go straight to Malaka'jin and the Barrens pass. Save your hearth for after the pass turn-ins."}, [52]={hint="Explore deep into the cave at Boulderslide Ravine and bring back 10 Resonite Crystals for Mor'rogal at Sun Rock Retreat to investigate.", tag="Optional"}, [53]={npc="Mor'rogal", tgt="Mor'rogal", tag="Optional"}, [54]={npc="Mor'rogal", tgt="Mor'rogal", tag="Optional"}, [55]={hint="Open the Resonite cask with the Enchanted Resonite Crystal, and then slay Goggeroc. Return to Mor'rogal with the news and Enchanted Resonite Crystal.", tag="Optional", desc="This step will summon level 20 elites, skip it if you want to do it alone."}, [56]={npc="Mor'rogal", tgt="Mor'rogal", tag="Optional"}, [57]={npc="Xen'Zilla", tgt="Xen'Zilla"}, [58]={npc="Witch Doctor Jin'Zil", tgt="Witch Doctor Jin'Zil", tag="Optional"}, [59]={npc="Seereth Stonebreak", tgt="Seereth Stonebreak"}, [60]={npc="Seereth Stonebreak", tgt="Seereth Stonebreak", tag="Skip the return trip if you have enough XP, Optional"}, [61]={hint="Kill the shredders XT:4 and XT:9, then return to Seereth Stonebreak at the border of the Stonetalon Mountains and the Barrens.", tag="Skip the return trip if you have enough XP, Optional, Target: XT:4/XT:9"}, [62]={npc="Seereth Stonebreak", tgt="Seereth Stonebreak", tag="Skip the return trip if you have enough XP, Optional"}, [63]={npc="Seereth Stonebreak", tgt="Seereth Stonebreak", tag="Thunder Bluff prereq, Optional"}, [64]={text="After turning in to Seereth at the pass, hearth to Sun Rock Retreat. Fly from Tharm to Ratchet for the egg and letter. If your hearth is down, run to the Crossroads and fly from there."}, [65]={npc="Mebok Mizzyrix", tgt="Mebok Mizzyrix", tag="If The Barrens Ratchet and Camp Taurajo are connected"}, [66]={hint="Deliver the Sealed Envelope to Sputtervalve in the Barrens."}, [67]={npc="Sputtervalve", tgt="Sputtervalve"}, [68]={npc="Sputtervalve", tgt="Sputtervalve", tag="Later, on the way, Optional"}, [69]={text="If doing the optional Innocent Blood lead-in and holding The Elder Crone, fly from Ratchet to Thunder Bluff. Skip the detour and fly to Orgrimmar if you won't unlock Thunder Bluff along the way."}, [70]={hint="Speak with Magatha in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Thunder Bluff prereq, Optional"}, [71]={npc="Magatha Grimtotem", tgt="Magatha Grimtotem", tag="Thunder Bluff prereq, Optional"}, [72]={npc="Magatha Grimtotem", tgt="Magatha Grimtotem", tag="Thunder Bluff prereq, Optional"}, [73]={hint="Speak with Apothecary Zamah in the Pools of Vision in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Thunder Bluff prereq, Optional"}, [74]={npc="Apothecary Zamah", tgt="Apothecary Zamah", tag="Thunder Bluff prereq, Optional"}, [75]={npc="Apothecary Zamah", tgt="Apothecary Zamah", tag="Thunder Bluff prereq, Optional"}, [76]={npc="Veenix", tgt="Veenix", tag="Optional", desc="Prepare here, then do The Horn of Xelthos in Silverpine for an optional dungeon entrance."}, [77]={hint="Find The Horn of Xelthos inside of Shadowfang Keep. Then, return it to C's dead drop near Pyrewood Village.", tag="Optional", desc="Prepare here, then do The Horn of Xelthos in Silverpine for an optional dungeon entrance."}, [78]={npc="Veenix", tgt="Veenix", tag="Optional", desc="Prepare here, then do The Horn of Xelthos in Silverpine for an optional dungeon entrance."}, [79]={npc="Ur'kyo", tgt="Ur'kyo"}, [80]={hint="Complete the quest objectives."}, [81]={npc="Ur'kyo", tgt="Ur'kyo"}, [82]={text="After the optional Thunder Bluff quests, fly to Orgrimmar. Board the Tirisfal zeppelin at Frezza's platform (50.82, 13.54). Get off south of Brill, head to Undercity, then continue to Tarren Mill."}}},
    ["02-12"] = {name="Hillsbrad Foothills", tips={{k="交通", text="For the first visit, first walk from The Sepulcher to Tarren Mill; open Zarise and tie the hearthstone to Shane. From the station, walk from Undercity to Brill South Tower and take line Orgrimmar."}, {k="取捨", text="Do | Elixir of Suffering and Elixir of Pain are collected on the same trip in the west, paired with Battle of Hillsbrad. After turning in Battle of Hillsbrad, Souvenirs of Death appears, and then when killing humans, collect the skulls en route."}, {k="取捨", text="Do |Scout Support, Elixir of Agony Complete the two quests around Masoji en route; if you take Blood of Innocents, go to the outside of Durnholde. The skull was filled up only after Forever"}, {k="取捨", text="Optional|If there is no target in Dangerous! and turn back for this purpose, go directly to the next stop. Dun Garok Battle of Hillsbrad There are many monsters, so stay alone until the level is higher; there is a high-level Mountain Cougar on the ridge on the west side of Valuable Vantages. Skip the entire side quest when you are on your way."}, {k="取捨", text="En route afterwards|If Stonetalon Mountains Sun Rock Retreat has already received Journey to Tarren Mill, take advantage of Durnholde's itinerary to complete Blood of Innocents and bring Return to Thunder Bluff to Thousand Needles Freewind Post when passing through Thunder Bluff."}, {k="取捨", text="Then stop by | Elixir of Agony → Elixir of Agony. After completing Hillsbrad Foothills Tarren Mill, pick up Elixir of Agony at Undercity, and then return to the coast of Hillsbrad to do it."}, {k="取捨", text="Later | If you want to rescue the two prisoners Durnholde Keep now, do The Rescue (The Rescue, The Rescue) of Krusk; do WANTED: Syndicate Personnel (WANTED: Syndicate Personnel, WANTED: Syndicate Personnel) in the same place together. Alterac Mountains contains the complete steps of the two quests. Infiltration (Infiltration, Infiltration) is only continued at level 29 after completing The Rescue."}, {k="提醒", text="When you reach level 27, transfer to Thousand Needles Freewind Post short visit, and then enter Ashenvale. When it is still below level 27, first fight the farmers at Hillsbrad Fields (about 33, 42) on the west side, or clear the ordinary syndicate members outside Durnholde Keep (about 77, 43); if you have a team, challenge Dun Garok again.", s={{"When you reach level 27, transfer to Thousand Needles Freewind Post short visit, and then enter Ashenvale"}, {"When it is still below level 27, first fight the farmers at Hillsbrad Fields (about 33, 42) on the west side, or clear the ordinary syndicate members outside Durnholde Keep (about 77, 43); if you have a team, challenge Dun Garok again"}}}}, danger={[1]="Dun Garok Musketeers, priests, and rangers will support each other at the top of the stairs. The team first clears the outer circle, then goes indoors to find the captain.", [2]="To put the Xifeng potion bottle, go above the snow monster cave. If you encounter high-level Mountain Cougar, go around it along the slope and avoid going directly up the steep slope."}, grind={[1]={mob="Hillsbrad Farmer", note="Hillsbrad Fields The density on the east side is medium, and there are normal mobs; avoid the group of monsters at the farmhouse door, and collect human skulls at the same time."}, [2]={mob="Hillsbrad Footman", note="Farm The density in the middle section is medium, and there are normal mobs; look for patrol infantry along the edge of the field, and avoid the house where the congressman and the farmer are standing at the same time."}, [3]={mob="Elder Gray Bear", note="Durnholde Keep The wild woodland on the north side has a low density and contains normal mobs; to avoid the crowds in the castle, it is suitable to pick up a few monsters en route back along the main line on the east side."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Zarise"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Shay"}, [3]={npc="Innkeeper Shay"}, [4]={npc="Kayren Soothallow"}, [5]={npc="Gordon Wendham"}, [6]={npc="Thomas Mordan"}, [7]={npc="Ezekiel Graves"}}, steps={[1]={text="Start from Undercity if you arrived from Sun Rock Retreat. Fly to Tarren Mill if unlocked. Otherwise fly to the Sepulcher, follow the south road east into Hillsbrad, then take the north fork. Walk from Undercity if needed. If still in Kalimdor, board the zeppelin outside Orgrimmar first."}, [2]={text="On arrival, learn Zarise's flight path (60.14, 18.62) and set your hearth with Innkeeper Shay (62.78, 19.03)."}, [3]={hint="Deliver Apothecary Renferrel's findings to Apothecary Lydon in the town of Tarren Mill in the Hillsbrad Foothills."}, [4]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon"}, [5]={hint="Bring Zamah's Note to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill.", tag="Optional"}, [6]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon", tag="Optional"}, [7]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon", tag="Requires quest Journey to Tarren Mill, Optional"}, [8]={text="Pick up at Tarren Mill → bears, spiders, lions and farms to the west"}, [9]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon"}, [10]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon"}, [11]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia"}, [12]={npc="Dangerous!", npcObj=true, tag="Optional"}, [13]={hint="Apothecary Lydon of Tarren Mill wants 10 Gray Bear Tongues and some Creeper Ichor."}, [14]={hint="Bring 10 vials of Mountain Lion Blood to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill."}, [15]={hint="Kill 6 Hillsbrad Farmhands, 6 Hillsbrad Farmers, Farmer Ray and Farmer Getz and report back to Darthalia in Tarren Mill."}, [16]={text="After the first western loop, hearth to Tarren Mill or take the main road back."}, [17]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia"}, [18]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia"}, [19]={npc="Deathguard Samsa", tgt="Deathguard Samsa"}, [20]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon"}, [21]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon"}, [22]={hint="Give Umpi the Elixir of Suffering."}, [23]={npc="Umpi", tgt="Umpi"}, [24]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon"}, [25]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon"}, [26]={text="Second farm loop → Durnholde and Mudsnout Blossoms → western smithy"}, [27]={hint="Feed the Elixir of Pain to Stanley."}, [28]={npc="Stanley", tgt="Stanley"}, [29]={hint="Kill 15 Hillsbrad Peasants and report back to Darthalia in Tarren Mill."}, [30]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia"}, [31]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia"}, [32]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia"}, [33]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon"}, [34]={hint="Bring 5 Vials of Innocent Blood to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill.", tag="Optional"}, [35]={hint="High Executor Darthalia wants you to deliver updated orders to Deathstalker Masoj, south of Tarren Mill, outside of Dun Garok."}, [36]={npc="Deathstalker Masoj", tgt="Deathstalker Masoj"}, [37]={npc="Deathstalker Masoj", tgt="Deathstalker Masoj", tag="Finish quest Scout Support, Optional"}, [38]={hint="Bring 6 Mudsnout Blossoms to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill."}, [39]={hint="Kill Blacksmith Verringtan and 4 Hillsbrad Apprentice Blacksmiths."}, [40]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia"}, [41]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia"}, [42]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon", tag="Optional"}, [43]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon", tag="Need to complete Blood of Innocents first; Thousand Needles Freewind Post, Optional"}, [44]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon"}, [45]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon"}, [46]={text="Town hall → mine → turn in at Tarren Mill"}, [47]={hint="Kill Magistrate Burnside and 5 Hillsbrad Councilmen. Destroy the Hillsbrad Proclamation. Steal the Hillsbrad Town Registry. Report back to Darthalia in Tarren Mill afterwards."}, [48]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia"}, [49]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia"}, [50]={hint="Kill Foreman Bonds and 10 Hillsbrad Miners and report back to Darthalia in Tarren Mill."}, [51]={hint="High Executor Darthalia of Tarren Mill is offering a bounty on Clerk Horrace Whitesteed, Citizen Wilkes, Miner Hackett and Farmer Kalaba.", tag="Optional"}, [52]={hint="Deathguard Samsa of Tarren Mill wants 30 Hillsbrad Human Skulls."}, [53]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia"}, [54]={npc="Deathguard Samsa", tgt="Deathguard Samsa"}, [55]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia", tag="Optional"}, [56]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia", tag="Group, Optional"}, [57]={hint="Travel to Dun Garok and kill 8 Mountaineers, 4 Riflemen, 2 Priests and Captain Ironhill and report back to Darthalia in Tarren Mill.", tag="Group, Optional"}, [58]={hint="Deathstalker Masoj needs you to place the three Apothecary Vials on peaks around Hillsbrad Foothills and return to him.", tag="High-level mobs. Wowhead player-reported coords., Optional"}, [59]={npc="Deathstalker Masoj", tgt="Deathstalker Masoj", tag="Optional"}, [60]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia", tag="Group, Optional"}, [61]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia", tag="Requires quest Battle of Hillsbrad, Optional"}, [62]={text="Fly from Tarren Mill to Undercity for the elixir and commendation turn-ins. Keep your Tarren Mill hearth."}, [63]={hint="Take the Mudsnout Composite to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity."}, [64]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell"}, [65]={hint="Take Darthalia's Sealed Commendation to Varimathras in the Undercity.", tag="Optional"}, [66]={npc="Varimathras", tgt="Varimathras", tag="Optional"}, [67]={hint="Travel to Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills and deliver the Sample of Zanzil's Mixture to Serge Hinott."}, [68]={npc="Serge Hinott", tgt="Serge Hinott"}, [69]={npc="Serge Hinott", tgt="Serge Hinott", desc="Continue to clear Zanjir's Touch."}, [70]={hint="Wait for Serge Hinott to complete the cure.", desc="Continue to clear Zanjir's Touch."}, [71]={npc="Serge Hinott", tgt="Serge Hinott", desc="Continue to clear Zanjir's Touch."}, [72]={npc="Elegant Letter", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Your trainer starts Elegant Letter. Use Detect Traps on the boxes in the passage."}, [73]={hint="Take the Seal of Ravenholdt to Fahrad at Ravenholdt Manor, hidden away in the hills of Hillsbrad.", tag="Optional", desc="Your trainer starts Elegant Letter. Use Detect Traps on the boxes in the passage."}, [74]={npc="Fahrad", tgt="Fahrad", tag="Optional", desc="Your trainer starts Elegant Letter. Use Detect Traps on the boxes in the passage."}, [75]={npc="Ravenholdt Guard", tgt="Ravenholdt Guard", tag="Optional", desc="Repeat the reputation quest and must do it if you are not upgrading."}, [76]={hint="Loot from: Syndicate Assassin, Syndicate Conjuror, Syndicate Footpad", tag="Optional", desc="Repeat the reputation quest and must do it if you are not upgrading."}, [77]={npc="Ravenholdt Guard", tgt="Ravenholdt Guard", tag="Optional", desc="Repeat the reputation quest and must do it if you are not upgrading."}, [78]={npc="Myrokos Silentform", tgt="Myrokos Silentform", tag="Optional", desc="Can be taken together with the Durnholde quest."}, [79]={hint="Find Lord Tomas inside Durnholde Keep, in Hillsbrad Foothills, and kill him. Then, return to Myrokos Silentform.", tag="Optional", desc="Can be taken together with the Durnholde quest."}, [80]={npc="Myrokos Silentform", tgt="Myrokos Silentform", tag="Optional", desc="Can be taken together with the Durnholde quest."}, [81]={npc="Dead Drop", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Recommended level 23. Use Veenix's explosives to open the courtyard gate solo."}, [82]={hint="Find The Horn of Xelthos inside of Shadowfang Keep. Then, return it to C's dead drop near Pyrewood Village. You must complete the job alone.", tag="Optional", desc="Recommended level 23. Use Veenix's explosives to open the courtyard gate solo."}, [83]={npc="Dead Drop", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Recommended level 23. Use Veenix's explosives to open the courtyard gate solo."}, [84]={hint="Log", tag="Optional", desc="You will be prompted by email later; confirm receipt and then reply to Dead Drop."}, [85]={npc="Dead Drop", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="You will be prompted by email later; confirm receipt and then reply to Dead Drop."}, [86]={npc="Dead Drop", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Level 25+. Learn Vanish and Distract first. Return to Silverpine with the invite."}, [87]={hint="Find The Eye of Bhossca inside of the Scarlet Monastery. Then, return it to C's dead drop near Pyrewood Village. You must complete the job alone.", tag="Optional", desc="Level 25+. Learn Vanish and Distract first. Return to Silverpine with the invite."}, [88]={npc="Dead Drop", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Level 25+. Learn Vanish and Distract first. Return to Silverpine with the invite."}, [89]={hint="Log", tag="Optional", desc="Return only after you receive the follow-up letter."}, [90]={npc="Dead Drop", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Return only after you receive the follow-up letter."}, [91]={hint="Fill the Empty Red Waterskin at the well in Tarren Mill and return to Brine in the Barrens.", desc="Keep full water bladder to Thousand Needles Freewind Post."}, [92]={npc="Aelthalyste", tgt="Aelthalyste"}, [93]={hint="Complete the quest objectives."}, [94]={npc="Aelthalyste", tgt="Aelthalyste"}, [95]={npc="Anastasia Hartwell", tgt="Anastasia Hartwell", tag="Optional"}, [96]={hint="Speak with Deino.", tag="Optional"}, [97]={npc="Deino", tgt="Deino", tag="Optional"}, [98]={text="Board the Orgrimmar zeppelin south of Brill at Zapetta's west platform (60.74, 58.87) for Freewind Post. At level 29 with Freewind Post finished, go straight from Orgrimmar to Splintertree Post."}}},
    ["05-d7"] = {name="Excavation Site: Wetlands", entrance="Wetland 47.79, 56.16", pickup="Stonetalon Mountains Sun Rock Retreat If you are 24 or older, fly Orgrimmar from Stone Claw Mountain. Find Borstan in the dark alley area to pick up Changing Tastes. After Tarren Mill leaves the station, go to Arashi Hammerfall to find Zaruk and then pick up Dragonmaw Rumors, then pass Thandol Span and Dun Modr, then take the mountain road along Thelgen Rock to find Deathstalker Agent; pick up Open the Maw before entering.", pickupS={{"Stonetalon Mountains Sun Rock Retreat If you are 24 or older, fly Orgrimmar from Stone Claw Mountain"}, {"Find Borstan in the dark alley area to pick up Changing Tastes"}, {"After Tarren Mill leaves the station, go to Arashi Hammerfall to find Zaruk and then pick up Dragonmaw Rumors, then pass Thandol Span and Dun Modr, then take the mountain road along Thelgen Rock to find Deathstalker Agent; pick up Open the Maw before entering"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="From the east entrance, head west through the marsh to Saltspine → take the brushy trail for Thicket Raptors and Shadetooth → clear Dragonmaw in the southwest camp → activate the panel at the dig site and loot the relic from the Relic Guardian."}, {k="取捨", text="After filling it once, collect meat, dragon throat urgent items and tail king holy items at the same time. The last section needs to be returned to Kalimdor and paid together with the next trip Orgrimmar / Thunder Bluff."}, {k="說明", text="The formal blue door is on the high slope southeast of Whelgar's Excavation Site. The collection stone, Deathstalker Agent and the copy door are different.", s={{"The formal blue door is on the high slope southeast of Whelgar's Excavation Site"}, {"The collection stone, Deathstalker Agent and the copy door are different"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Borstan", tgt="Borstan"}, [2]={npc="Zaruk", tgt="Zaruk"}, [3]={hint="Travel to the Wetlands and meet the Deathstalker Agent in the hills above the Dragonmaw camp."}, [4]={npc="Deathstalker Agent", tgt="Deathstalker Agent"}, [5]={npc="Deathstalker Agent", tgt="Deathstalker Agent", preText="Dragonmaw Rumors"}, [6]={text="Excavation Site: Wetlands entrance"}, [7]={hint="Enter the Excavation Sites in the Wetlands and bring back Thicket Raptor Meat.", desc="Location: Past Saltspine's lake, take the brushy trail before Shadetooth and kill raptors."}, [8]={hint="Slay the Dragonmaw forces within the Excavation Site and return to the Deathstalker Agent outside with anything you recover.", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: Dragonmaw troops (28.20, 67.20). Location: Pass Shadetooth and clear Dragonmaw troops at the excavation camp."}, [9]={npc="Titan Relic", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Loot the Titan Relic from the Relic Guardian and right-click it to start the quest. DungeonsForever map 1: Relic Guardian drops the starter (46.60, 74.10)."}, [10]={npc="Deathstalker Agent", tgt="Deathstalker Agent"}, [11]={npc="Borstan", tgt="Borstan"}, [12]={hint="Take the Titan Relic to the Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff and look for someone who can tell you more about it.", desc="Loot the Titan Relic from the Relic Guardian and right-click it to start the quest."}, [13]={npc="Bashana Runetotem", tgt="Bashana Runetotem"}, [14]={npc="Bashana Runetotem", tgt="Bashana Runetotem", desc="After Elder Knowledge, check whether Bashana gives you the relic again.", preText="Elder Knowledge"}, [15]={hint="Bring the Titan Relic to Muln Earthfury at the Skywatcher Plateau in northwest Mulgore.", desc="After Elder Knowledge, check whether Bashana gives you the relic again."}, [16]={npc="Alaana Stormwalker", tgt="Muln Earthfury", desc="After Elder Knowledge, check whether Bashana gives you the relic again."}}},
    ["05-d6"] = {name="Shadowfang Keep", entrance="Silverpine Forest 44.70, 67.80", pickup="Before Silverpine Forest, when passing by Undercity, pick up The Book of Ur in the chain gold area. Go to The Sepulcher to find Hadrick and Dalal to pick up Deathstalkers in Shadowfang and Arugal Must Die. Can be connected to The Orb of Soran'ruk [Warlock only] on the east side of The Barrens Camp Taurajo. Do Diplomatic Incident to A Moon-Kissed Blade of chapter Deadmines first, and keep A Moon-Kissed Blade [Undead only] [Paladin only]. en route to Hillsbrad, after returning to Eastern Kingdoms, first fly to Silverpine Forest The Sepulcher, and then go south.", pickupS={{"Before Silverpine Forest, when passing by Undercity, pick up The Book of Ur in the chain gold area"}, {"Go to The Sepulcher to find Hadrick and Dalal to pick up Deathstalkers in Shadowfang and Arugal Must Die", {class={"WARLOCK"}}}, {"Can be connected to The Orb of Soran'ruk [Warlock only] on the east side of The Barrens Camp Taurajo", {race={"Scourge"}, class={"PALADIN"}}}, {"Do Diplomatic Incident to A Moon-Kissed Blade of chapter Deadmines first, and keep A Moon-Kissed Blade [Undead only] [Paladin only]. en route to Hillsbrad, after returning to Eastern Kingdoms, first fly to Silverpine Forest The Sepulcher, and then go south"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Kill Rethilgore and free Adamant → find Vincent on the right side of the courtyard → banquet hall and ramparts → Fenrus's room for the book → clear the tower to Wolf Master Nandos → kill Arugal upstairs and check his table."}, {k="取捨", text="The Book of Ur and Arugal Must Die must be returned outside; Deathstalkers in Shadowfang must be handed over to Vincent inside. If the team is unstable before level 22, do Ruins of Lordaeron or Wailing Caverns first."}, {k="說明", text="The Sepulcher Go south, enter the castle along the north ramp of Pyrewood Village, go through the outer door and walk to the real copy door next to the courtyard. If you want to fight the hidden boss Dalaran City, take the Black Tome from the Arugal table, and then go to the Leyline Device in the Ambermill lobby to make the Tome of Dalaran.", s={{"The Sepulcher Go south, enter the castle along the north ramp of Pyrewood Village, go through the outer door and walk to the real copy door next to the courtyard"}, {"If you want to fight the hidden boss Dalaran City, take the Black Tome from the Arugal table, and then go to the Leyline Device in the Ambermill lobby to make the Tome of Dalaran"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Keeper Bel'dugur", tgt="Keeper Bel'dugur"}, [2]={npc="High Executor Hadrec", tgt="High Executor Hadrec"}, [3]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [4]={npc="Doan Karhan", tgt="Doan Karhan", tag="Optional", desc="Loot the other 3 fragments in Blackfathom Deeps before turning in."}, [5]={text="Shadowfang Keep entrance"}, [6]={hint="Find the Deathstalker Adamant and Deathstalker Vincent.", desc="Location: After Rethilgore, open the cell and follow the Deathstalker up the right stairs."}, [7]={npc="Deathstalker Vincent", tgt="Deathstalker Vincent", tag="Unverified", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: Deathstalker Vincent (56.50, 58.50)."}, [8]={hint="Bring the Book of Ur to Keeper Bel'dugur at the Apothecarium in the Undercity.", desc="DungeonsForever map 4: The Book of Ur in Fenrus's room (46.10, 62.60). Location: Climb the tower. Check the bottom of the left bookcase in Fenrus's room."}, [9]={hint="Find 3 Soran'ruk Fragments and 1 Large Soran'ruk Fragment and return them to Doan Karhan in the Barrens.", tag="Optional", desc="Location: Kill Shadowfang Darksouls on the tower path. Loot only if on the Warlock quest."}, [10]={hint="Kill Arugal and bring his head to Dalar Dawnweaver at the Sepulcher.", desc="The DungeonsForever dungeon map is available at Archmage Arugal (63.90, 20.00). Location: Go upstairs after Wolf Master Nandos and kill Arugal in his room."}, [11]={hint="Speak with Trevan Rol in the Sepulcher and bring him the materials he requires.", tag="Optional", desc="Location: Look on the table in Arugal's room. Loot only if on A Moon-Kissed Blade."}, [12]={npc="Dalar Dawnweaver", tgt="Dalar Dawnweaver"}, [13]={npc="Keeper Bel'dugur", tgt="Keeper Bel'dugur"}, [14]={npc="Doan Karhan", tgt="Doan Karhan", tag="Optional", desc="Loot all 3 small fragments in Blackfathom Deeps, then turn in in the Barrens."}}},
    ["02-13"] = {name="Thousand Needles", tips={{k="交通", text="Orgrimmar flies into the city to Taurajo; from the south end of The Barrens, take The Great Lift down to the valley, and Freewind Post opens for the first time. Thunder Bluff has Sacred Fire."}, {k="取捨", text="Do. The letter of Stonetalon Mountains Sun Rock Retreat is directly guarded by The Great Lift of Jiaotong University. Freewind Post The supply box to the west, the area shared by three types of harpies and the endurance trial."}, {k="取捨", text="Drop by later. The video first talks about Ashenvale, and then mentions Thousand Needles in the middle. Here, Freewind Post short visit is ranked before Ashenvale main line; The Shimmering Flats is left in the full circle with Thousand Needles The Shimmering Flats."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional. Rarc Tower escort, leopard cage and west side patrol follow-up is more time-consuming; do it when you have teammates or are passing the target."}, {k="提醒", text="To hit Razorfen Kraul, the entrance is at the south end of The Barrens in front of the big The Great Lift. If you have not reached the expected progress in this section, gain experience at the Screaming Harpy Slope (approximately 27, 51) on the west side of Freewind Post.", s={{"To hit Razorfen Kraul, the entrance is at the south end of The Barrens in front of the big The Great Lift"}, {"If you have not reached the expected progress in this section, gain experience at the Screaming Harpy Slope (approximately 27, 51) on the west side of Freewind Post"}}}}, danger={[1]="The Great Lift Falls can kill. When crossing Freewind Post bridge deck or north end The Great Lift, wait for the platform to be in place.", [2]="Opening supply boxes in the Harpy Cave will trigger enemies. Clear out the mobs next to the box and leave the exit open before opening it."}, grind={[1]={mob="Pesterhide Hyena", note="Freewind Post The density of the valley on the west side is medium, and there are normal mobs; fight them one by one at the bottom of the valley without going around to the harpy camp."}, [2]={mob="Screeching Harpy", note="The density of the harpies on the west side of the slope is medium, and there are normal mobs. There are other harpies in the camp at the same time. If you pick them up along the edge of the slope, complete the Screaming Harpy quest."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Nyse"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Abeqwa"}, [3]={npc="Starn"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Abeqwa"}, [5]={npc="Starn"}, [6]={npc="Montarr"}, [7]={npc="Omusa Thunderhorn"}}, steps={[1]={text="Confirm the Orgrimmar zeppelin at Zapetta's west platform south of Brill (60.74, 58.87). Enter Orgrimmar after landing. Fly through Thunder Bluff if turning in Return to Thunder Bluff. Otherwise fly directly to Camp Taurajo. If still in Tarren Mill, fly to Undercity first."}, [2]={hint="Bring Lydon's Toxin to Apothecary Zamah in Thunder Bluff.", tag="If Hillsbrad Foothills Tarren Mill is connected, Optional"}, [3]={npc="Apothecary Zamah", tgt="Apothecary Zamah", tag="If Hillsbrad Foothills Tarren Mill is connected, Optional"}, [4]={text="Take the southern Barrens road to the Great Lift and speak to the guard on the north side."}, [5]={hint="Maggran wishes you to deliver a letter to Grish Longrunner at the Great Lift in the Barrens.", tag="If Stonetalon Mountains Sun Rock Retreat is connected"}, [6]={npc="Grish Longrunner", tgt="Grish Longrunner", tag="If Stonetalon Mountains Sun Rock Retreat is connected"}, [7]={npc="Brave Moonhorn", tgt="Brave Moonhorn"}, [8]={hint="Bring the Urgent Message to Cliffwatcher Longhorn at Freewind Post."}, [9]={npc="Cliffwatcher Longhorn", tgt="Cliffwatcher Longhorn"}, [10]={text="Take the Great Lift down. Follow the valley east and ride the Freewind Post lift up. Learn Nyse's flight path (45.14, 49.11). Keep your hearth."}, [11]={npc="Cliffwatcher Longhorn", tgt="Cliffwatcher Longhorn"}, [12]={npc="Hagar Lightninghoof", tgt="Hagar Lightninghoof"}, [13]={npc="Jandia", tgt="Jandia"}, [14]={npc="Jandia", tgt="Jandia", desc="The same quest can also be found in Rau Cliffrunner (46.14, 51.71)."}, [15]={npc="Elu", tgt="Elu"}, [16]={npc="Wanted Poster - Arnak Grimtotem", npcObj=true}, [17]={text="Clear the centaur camps north of Freewind Post, then head to Dorn and the wind serpent nests."}, [18]={hint="Kill 12 Galak Scouts, 10 Galak Wranglers, and 6 Galak Windchasers, and then return to Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Freewind Post."}, [19]={npc="Dorn Plainstalker", tgt="Dorn Plainstalker"}, [20]={hint="If you have faith, leap from the planks overlooking Thousand Needles.", desc="Jump from the plank directly in front of Dorn. A successful jump teleports you back."}, [21]={npc="Dorn Plainstalker", tgt="Dorn Plainstalker"}, [22]={npc="Dorn Plainstalker", tgt="Dorn Plainstalker"}, [23]={hint="Return the Alien Egg to Hagar Lightninghoof in Freewind Post."}, [24]={npc="Cliffwatcher Longhorn", tgt="Cliffwatcher Longhorn"}, [25]={npc="Hagar Lightninghoof", tgt="Hagar Lightninghoof"}, [26]={npc="Cliffwatcher Longhorn", tgt="Cliffwatcher Longhorn"}, [27]={npc="Hagar Lightninghoof", tgt="Hagar Lightninghoof"}, [28]={text="Clear the screeching harpies and supply crates to the west. Follow the valley through Highperch to Whitereach Post."}, [29]={hint="Bring 8 Stolen Freewind Supplies to Jandia in Freewind Post.", desc="Go west from Freewind Post. The crate is in the harpy cave used for Stop the Screeching. Three collection points of the measured object 670338 in the game."}, [30]={hint="Slay 5 Screeching Harpies, 5 Screeching Roguefeather Harpies and 5 Screeching Windcaller Harpies."}, [31]={hint="Bring Grenka's Claw to Dorn Plainstalker in Thousand Needles.", desc="Clear the cave first. Break the crate at the back to spawn Grenka Bloodscreech."}, [32]={hint="Bring 10 Highperch Wyvern Eggs to Elu in Freewind Post."}, [33]={npc="Pao'ka Swiftmountain", tgt="Pao'ka Swiftmountain", tag="Escort, Optional"}, [34]={hint="Escort Pao'ka Swiftmountain from Highperch, and then talk to Motega Firemane in Whitereach Post.", tag="Escort, Optional", desc="At Highperch, loot eggs and clear manticores near the exit before escorting Pao'ka."}, [35]={npc="Motega Firemane", tgt="Motega Firemane", tag="Escort, Optional"}, [36]={hint="Report your findings to Motega Firemane."}, [37]={npc="Motega Firemane", tgt="Motega Firemane"}, [38]={npc="Motega Firemane", tgt="Motega Firemane", tag="Accept if flying to Thunder Bluff, Optional"}, [39]={npc="Wizlo Bearingshiner", tgt="Wizlo Bearingshiner", tag="Elite, Optional"}, [40]={hint="Slay the beast and bring back the Hypercapacitor Gizmo and Panther Cage Key to Wizlo Bearingshiner.", tag="Elite, Optional", desc="Group up. The elite attacks as soon as you open the cage."}, [41]={npc="Wizlo Bearingshiner", tgt="Wizlo Bearingshiner", tag="Elite, Optional"}, [42]={npc="Assassination Note", npcObj=true, tag="Drop starts it, Optional", desc="The Galak Messenger patrols between camps. Loot and use the Assassination Note."}, [43]={hint="Warn Kanati Greycloud at Whitereach Post of the plot to kill him.", tag="Drop starts it, Optional", desc="The Galak Messenger patrols between camps. Loot and use the Assassination Note."}, [44]={npc="Kanati Greycloud", tgt="Kanati Greycloud", tag="Drop starts it, Optional"}, [45]={npc="Kanati Greycloud", tgt="Kanati Greycloud", tag="Drop starts it, Optional"}, [46]={hint="Protect Kanati Greycloud from the centaur attack.", tag="Drop starts it, Optional", desc="Heal and drink before accepting. The assault starts immediately."}, [47]={npc="Kanati Greycloud", tgt="Kanati Greycloud", tag="Drop starts it, Optional"}, [48]={text="Take the western ramp up Darkcloud Pinnacle for the note, then cross the bridges north."}, [49]={hint="Locate and retrieve the three Secret Notes in Darkcloud Pinnacle.", desc="Take the ramp at 31.5, 36.7 onto the bridge. Search all three camps for the notes."}, [50]={hint="Slay Arnak Grimtotem and bring proof of your deed to Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Freewind Post."}, [51]={npc="Lakota Windsong", tgt="Lakota Windsong", tag="If time allows, Optional"}, [52]={hint="Escort Lakota Windsong from the Darkcloud Pinnacle, and then talk to Thalia Amberhide at Freewind Post.", tag="If time allows, Optional", desc="Clear the cage area and bridge first, then escort Lakota down the mountain."}, [53]={hint="Gather 10 bushels of Incendia Agave, and then consult Magatha Grimtotem on Elder Rise in Thunderbluff.", tag="If time allows, Optional"}, [54]={text="Return to Freewind Post for turn-ins. Turn in Test of Endurance to Dorn northeast of the post."}, [55]={npc="Cliffwatcher Longhorn", tgt="Cliffwatcher Longhorn"}, [56]={npc="Jandia", tgt="Jandia"}, [57]={npc="Jandia", tgt="Jandia"}, [58]={npc="Elu", tgt="Elu"}, [59]={npc="Dorn Plainstalker", tgt="Dorn Plainstalker"}, [60]={npc="Cliffwatcher Longhorn", tgt="Cliffwatcher Longhorn"}, [61]={npc="Thalia Amberhide", tgt="Thalia Amberhide", tag="Optional"}, [62]={npc="Dorn Plainstalker", tgt="Dorn Plainstalker", tag="If you see it, Optional"}, [63]={hint="Bring Fragments of Rok'Alim to Dorn Plainstalker in Thousand Needles.", tag="If you see it, Optional", desc="Rok'Alim the Pounder will patrol the western section of the valley and near Highperch."}, [64]={npc="Dorn Plainstalker", tgt="Dorn Plainstalker", tag="If you see it, Optional"}, [65]={text="If you have Sacred Fire ready and Thunder Bluff unlocked, fly there from Freewind Post. Otherwise skip the next turn-in and continue."}, [66]={npc="Magatha Grimtotem", tgt="Magatha Grimtotem", tag="Turn in at Thunder Bluff, Optional"}, [67]={npc="Brine", tgt="Brine"}, [68]={npc="Brine", tgt="Brine", desc="Get water at Ashenvale Splintertree Post and return to The Barrens to turn it in."}, [69]={text="Fly from Freewind Post or Thunder Bluff. If Splintertree Post is locked, fly to the Crossroads and run north past Mor'shan Rampart into Ashenvale, then follow the east road to Splintertree."}}},
    ["02-14"] = {name="Ashenvale", tips={{k="交通", text="Fly Splintertree Post first, then Zoramaga; choose Splintertree Post, Sun Rock Retreat, The Crossroads according to the quests to be handed over, or fly directly from Zoramaga to Orgrimmar. Reserve Tarren Mill Hearthstone."}, {k="取捨", text="Do. Splintertree Post Make a circle each for the Pioneer on the south side, the Lake Elemental on the southwestern side, and the Satyr on the north side; solve the furbolg in Zoramgar and the cave talisman together."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional. Three prey animals will patrol and only hunt when encountered en route. If the loose pages are not full, save them for future transactions, so you don't have to swipe them repeatedly."}, {k="取捨", text="Drop by later. After level 29, if you want to run The Crossroads and Orgrimmar, answer The Swarm Grows first, then Orgrimmar and then The Swarm Grows. Go to Thousand Needles The Shimmering Flats and turn in The Swarm Grows to pick up The Swarm Grows; if there is no traffic in this section, skip it."}, {k="提醒", text="Before reaching level 30, give priority to satyrs (approximately 67, 57) or thistleskin furbolgs (approximately 32, 38). A team can enter the Dark Abyss at The Zoram Strand; if all teammates are not present, continue this section first.", s={{"Before reaching level 30, give priority to satyrs (approximately 67, 57) or thistleskin furbolgs (approximately 32, 38)"}, {"A team can enter the Dark Abyss at The Zoram Strand; if all teammates are not present, continue this section first"}}}}, danger={[1]="Astranaar is an alliance town with level 40 sentries on the roadside. When going to Zoramga, go around outside the town.", [2]="The furbolg in Thistlehide Cave will block the narrow passage. Clear to the exit first and then unpack or pick up Lur escort."}, grind={[1]={mob="Felmusk Shadowstalker", note="The density outside the Magic Grass Satyr camp is medium, with normal mobs; similar patrols and other Satyrs will be close to each other. Clear along the edge of the camp and collect Satyr Horns."}, [2]={mob="Ghostpaw Alpha", note="Splintertree Post The density of the forest on the north side is medium, and there are normal mobs; use the open area to kill them one by one, close to the flight path, which is suitable for gaining experience when you don't want to enter the Sutter camp."}, [3]={mob="Xavian Rogue", note="Xavian The camp has a medium density and contains normal mobs; pay attention to hidden and patrolling monsters, clear the outside first and then go inside. Suitable for the last section of level 29, also easily make up for Satyr Horns."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Vhulgra"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Kaylisk"}, [3]={npc="Burkrum"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Kaylisk"}, [5]={npc="Burkrum"}, [6]={npc="Andruk"}, [7]={npc="Wik'Tar"}}, steps={[1]={text="Learn the flight path from Vhulgra at Splintertree Post (73.18, 61.59). Keep your Tarren Mill hearth for the return. If you want to bind in Ashenvale, see Innkeeper Kaylisk (73.99, 60.65)."}, [2]={hint="Speak with Senani Thunderheart at Splintertree Post, Ashenvale.", tag="If The Barrens Ratchet and Camp Taurajo are connected"}, [3]={npc="Senani Thunderheart", tgt="Senani Thunderheart", tag="If The Barrens Ratchet and Camp Taurajo are connected"}, [4]={npc="Senani Thunderheart", tgt="Senani Thunderheart"}, [5]={hint="Complete the quest objectives.", desc="Turn in The Ashenvale Hunt, then do The Ashenvale Hunt before starting the three hunt quests from drops."}, [6]={npc="Senani Thunderheart", tgt="Senani Thunderheart"}, [7]={npc="Mastok Wrilehiss", tgt="Mastok Wrilehiss"}, [8]={npc="Pixel", tgt="Pixel"}, [9]={npc="Kuray'bin", tgt="Kuray'bin"}, [10]={npc="Gurda Ragescar", tgt="Gurda Ragescar", tag="Check if you already have missing pages, Optional"}, [11]={text="Kill outrunners south of Splintertree Post, then go southwest to the lake."}, [12]={npc="Sharptalon's Claw", npcObj=true, tag="If you see it, Optional", desc="Kill Sharptalon and right-click the claw in your bags to start the quest."}, [13]={hint="Bring Sharptalon's Claw to Senani Thunderheart at Splintertree Post, Ashenvale.", tag="If you see it, Optional", desc="Kill Sharptalon and right-click the claw in your bags to start the quest."}, [14]={hint="Kill 9 Ashenvale Outrunners, then return to Kuray'bin at Splintertree Outpost."}, [15]={npc="Warsong Scout", tgt="Warsong Scout", tag="Requires the Warsong Report, Optional", desc="Open the Bundle of Reports, then trade the Warsong Report with the scout."}, [16]={hint="Complete the quest objectives.", tag="Requires the Warsong Report, Optional"}, [17]={npc="Warsong Scout", tgt="Warsong Scout", tag="Requires the Warsong Report, Optional"}, [18]={npc="Torek", tgt="Torek", tag="Escort, Optional"}, [19]={hint="Escort Torek on his attack against Silverwing Outpost and Duriel Moonfire, then report to Ertog Ragetusk at Splintertree Post.", tag="Escort, Optional", desc="Wait by Torek for your group. Combat starts when you accept the escort."}, [20]={hint="Dispatch 12 Befouled Water Elementals at Mystral Lake, due east of the Talondeep Path and southwest of Splintertree Post."}, [21]={npc="Befouled Water Globe", npcObj=true, tag="If it drops, Optional", desc="Find Tidreth by the lake; the water ball is quest starter. Click it after picking it up."}, [22]={hint="Bring the Befouled Water Globe to Mastok Wrilehiss at Splintertree Post, Ashenvale.", tag="If it drops, Optional", desc="Find Tidreth by the lake; the water ball is quest starter. Click it after picking it up."}, [23]={npc="Ursangous's Paw", npcObj=true, tag="If it drops, Optional", desc="Kill Usagos and pick up the claw. click on the claw in the backpack to receive the quest."}, [24]={hint="Bring Ursangous's Paw to Senani Thunderheart at Splintertree Post, Ashenvale.", tag="If it drops, Optional", desc="Kill Usagos and pick up the claw. click on the claw in the backpack to receive the quest."}, [25]={npc="Shadumbra's Head", npcObj=true, tag="If it drops, Optional", desc="Kill Sadhubra and pick up the head. click on the head in the backpack to accept the quest."}, [26]={hint="Bring Shadumbra's Head to Senani Thunderheart at Splintertree Post, Ashenvale.", tag="If it drops, Optional", desc="Kill Sadhubra and pick up the head. click on the head in the backpack to accept the quest."}, [27]={text="Follow the lake northeast toward Splintertree Post. Kill Ordanus and clear the satyr camp on the way back."}, [28]={hint="Bring Ordanus' head to Braelyn Firehand near Sun Rock Retreat.", tag="If Stonetalon Mountains Sun Rock Retreat is connected, Optional"}, [29]={hint="Collect 16 Satyr Horns for Pixel in Splintertree Post."}, [30]={npc="Warsong Outrider", tgt="Warsong Outrider", tag="Requires the Warsong Report, Optional"}, [31]={hint="Complete the quest objectives.", tag="Requires the Warsong Report, Optional"}, [32]={npc="Warsong Outrider", tgt="Warsong Outrider", tag="Requires the Warsong Report, Optional"}, [33]={npc="Kuray'bin", tgt="Kuray'bin"}, [34]={npc="Mastok Wrilehiss", tgt="Mastok Wrilehiss"}, [35]={npc="Pixel", tgt="Pixel"}, [36]={npc="Ertog Ragetusk", tgt="Ertog Ragetusk", tag="Turn in after the escort, Optional"}, [37]={npc="Senani Thunderheart", tgt="Senani Thunderheart", tag="Turn in once you have the catch, Optional"}, [38]={npc="Senani Thunderheart", tgt="Senani Thunderheart", tag="Turn in once you have the catch, Optional"}, [39]={npc="Senani Thunderheart", tgt="Senani Thunderheart", tag="Turn in once you have the catch, Optional"}, [40]={npc="Senani Thunderheart", tgt="Senani Thunderheart", tag="Turn in once you have the catch, Optional"}, [41]={hint="Complete the quest objectives.", tag="Turn in once you have the catch, Optional"}, [42]={npc="Senani Thunderheart", tgt="Senani Thunderheart", tag="Turn in once you have the catch, Optional"}, [43]={npc="Mastok Wrilehiss", tgt="Mastok Wrilehiss", tag="Accept if you loot the Water Globe, Optional"}, [44]={npc="Mastok Wrilehiss", tgt="Mastok Wrilehiss", tag="Accept if you loot the Water Globe, Optional"}, [45]={hint="Find the 12 missing pages of the Shredder Operating Manual, and put them together to form Chapters 1, 2, and 3. Return the pages to Gurda Ragescar near Splintertree Post.", tag="Requires all pages, Optional", desc="Don't farm missing pages. Use the pages in your bags to assemble the chapters. Pins are for pages 6 and 11. Loot or trade for the other pages along the way."}, [46]={npc="Gurda Ragescar", tgt="Gurda Ragescar", tag="Requires all pages, Optional"}, [47]={text="Fly to Zoram'gar Outpost if unlocked. On a first visit, take Ashenvale's road west, avoid the Alliance guards in Astranaar and continue to the coast. Learn the flight path from Andruk (12.24, 33.80)."}, [48]={hint="Bring the Befouled Water Globe to Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale.", tag="If you have the Water Globe breadcrumb, Optional"}, [49]={npc="Je'neu Sancrea", tgt="Je'neu Sancrea", tag="If you have the Water Globe breadcrumb, Optional"}, [50]={npc="Warsong Runner", tgt="Warsong Runner", tag="Requires the Warsong Report, Optional"}, [51]={hint="Complete the quest objectives.", tag="Requires the Warsong Report, Optional"}, [52]={npc="Warsong Runner", tgt="Warsong Runner", tag="Requires the Warsong Report, Optional"}, [53]={npc="Karang Amakkar", tgt="Karang Amakkar"}, [54]={npc="Mitsuwa", tgt="Mitsuwa"}, [55]={npc="Marukai", tgt="Marukai", tag="Fills an XP gap, Optional"}, [56]={hint="Bring 20 Wrathtail Heads to Marukai along the Zoram Strand.", tag="Fills an XP gap, Optional"}, [57]={npc="Marukai", tgt="Marukai", tag="Fills an XP gap, Optional"}, [58]={text="Follow the east road to Thistlefur Village. Kill furbolgs and loot the charms in the cave north of the village."}, [59]={hint="Take down 8 Thistlefur Avengers and 8 Thistlefur Shaman; most are located east of Zoram Strand in Thistlefur Village. Once completed, return to Karang Amakkar at Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale."}, [60]={hint="Bring 8 Troll Charms to Mitsuwa at the Zoram'gar Outpost."}, [61]={npc="Ruul Snowhoof", tgt="Ruul Snowhoof", tag="Escort, Optional"}, [62]={hint="Escort Ruul, then speak with Yama Snowhoof in Splintertree Post.", tag="Escort, Optional", desc="Mobs can spawn at the entrance and inside. Clear the passage before accepting."}, [63]={npc="Karang Amakkar", tgt="Karang Amakkar"}, [64]={npc="Mitsuwa", tgt="Mitsuwa"}, [65]={npc="Karang Amakkar", tgt="Karang Amakkar", tag="Return to the eastern camp, Optional"}, [66]={hint="Place Karang's Banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound. Do not let the furbolgs destroy the banner. Defeat Chief Murgut and bring Murgut's Totem to Karang Amakkar at Zoram'gar.", tag="Return to the eastern camp, Optional", desc="Clear the area before planting the flag. Be ready to control the waves."}, [67]={npc="Karang Amakkar", tgt="Karang Amakkar", tag="Return to the eastern camp, Optional"}, [68]={npc="Muglash", tgt="Muglash", tag="Group escort, Optional"}, [69]={hint="Keep Muglash safe as he travels to the brazier. Help him by putting the brazier out, then protect him as you fight against the Naga.", tag="Group escort, Optional"}, [70]={npc="Warsong Runner", tgt="Warsong Runner", tag="Group escort, Optional"}, [71]={text="Fly or hearth from Zoram'gar to Splintertree if turning in Freedom to Ruul or other quests. Otherwise stay at Zoram'gar and fly straight to the next stop."}, [72]={npc="Yama Snowhoof", tgt="Yama Snowhoof", tag="If escort is complete, Optional"}, [73]={text="If Ordanus is done or you plan to continue with Further Instructions, fly to Sun Rock Retreat (45.12, 59.84) from Zoram'gar or Splintertree. Skip the trip if Stonetalon is clear."}, [74]={npc="Braelyn Firehand", tgt="Braelyn Firehand", tag="If Stonetalon Mountains Sun Rock Retreat is connected, Optional"}, [75]={hint="Bring the new orders to Ziz Fizziks in the Stonetalon Mountains.", tag="If accepted and returning to Windshear Crag, Optional"}, [76]={npc="Ziz Fizziks", tgt="Ziz Fizziks", tag="If accepted and returning to Windshear Crag, Optional"}, [77]={npc="Ziz Fizziks", tgt="Ziz Fizziks", tag="If accepted and returning to Windshear Crag, Optional"}, [78]={hint="Bring Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle's Mechanical Arm to Ziz Fizziks in the Stonetalon Mountains.", tag="If accepted and returning to Windshear Crag, Optional", desc="Use the ramp on Windshear Crag's north side to reach the platform. The coordinates are Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle on the elevated level."}, [79]={npc="Ziz Fizziks", tgt="Ziz Fizziks", tag="If accepted and returning to Windshear Crag, Optional"}, [80]={npc="Braelyn Firehand", tgt="Braelyn Firehand", tag="Later or with a group, Optional"}, [81]={hint="Travel to the Den on Stonetalon Peak. Using the Gatekeeper's Key, obtain the druids' hidden items. Use these items to open the Talon Den Hoard.", tag="Later or with a group, Optional", desc="The guards and cave mobs are packed together. Go in with a group if you're nearby. The first three points are three storage locations, and the last point is Talon Den Hoard."}, [82]={npc="Talon Den Hoard", npcObj=true, tag="Later or with a group, Optional"}, [83]={text="With all three Warsong Reports, fly to the Crossroads and take the north road to Kadrak by Mor'shan Rampart (48.12, 5.42). From Ashenvale, you can take the east road directly south."}, [84]={hint="Open the Bundle of Reports. Take the Warsong Reports to the Warsong Scout, Warsong Runner, and Warsong Outrider. Bring back the updates they give you to Kadrak at the northern watch tower in the barrens.", tag="Turn in with all three updated reports, Optional", desc="Turn in the three updated reports here. Open and trade the reports earlier."}, [85]={npc="Kadrak", tgt="Kadrak", tag="Turn in with all three updated reports, Optional"}, [86]={npc="Ulric Frostveil", tgt="Ulric Frostveil", tag="Optional", desc="Take A Moon-Kissed Blade first; arrive at Ashenvale The Zoram Strand and then take this section."}, [87]={hint="Bring a Kor Gem to Ulric Frostveil in Ashenvale.", tag="Optional", desc="Take A Moon-Kissed Blade first; arrive at Ashenvale The Zoram Strand and then take this section."}, [88]={npc="Ulric Frostveil", tgt="Ulric Frostveil", tag="Optional", desc="Take A Moon-Kissed Blade first; arrive at Ashenvale The Zoram Strand and then take this section."}, [89]={hint="Speak with Trevan Rol in the Sepulcher and bring him the materials he requires.", tag="Optional", desc="Finish with all 3 materials. Horde can reach Deadmines via Stranglethorn and Duskwood. The drop rate only counts Whitestone Oak Lumber dropped by Goblin Woodcarver."}, [90]={npc="Trevan Rol", tgt="Trevan Rol", tag="Optional", desc="With all 3 items, fly to Orgrimmar, zeppelin to Tirisfal, then fly to the Sepulcher."}, [91]={npc="Trevan Rol", tgt="Trevan Rol", tag="Optional", desc="Do this during the Tarren Mill leg or fly there from the Sepulcher if past it."}, [92]={hint="Speak with Ott and ask him to forge your blade.", tag="Optional", desc="Do this during the Tarren Mill leg or fly there from the Sepulcher if past it."}, [93]={npc="Ott", tgt="Ott", tag="Optional", desc="Do this during the Tarren Mill leg or fly there from the Sepulcher if past it."}, [94]={npc="Ott", tgt="Ott", tag="Optional"}, [95]={hint="Watch as Ott forges your blade.", tag="Optional"}, [96]={npc="Ott", tgt="Ott", tag="Optional"}, [97]={npc="Ott", tgt="Ott", tag="Optional", desc="Obtain Moonsilver Blade after delivery.", star={"Moonsilver Blade", {"PALADIN"}}}, [98]={hint="Bring Ott's Masterwork to Trevan Rol in Silverpine Forest.", tag="Optional", desc="Obtain Moonsilver Blade after delivery."}, [99]={npc="Trevan Rol", tgt="Trevan Rol", tag="Optional", desc="Obtain Moonsilver Blade after delivery.", star={"Moonsilver Blade", {"PALADIN"}}}, [100]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger", tag="Optional", desc="Group for the level 25 elite. Train 2H Swords with Archibald before using Wolfsbane.", star={"Wolfsbane", {"PALADIN"}}}, [101]={hint="Use the Moonsilver Blade to destroy Old Fire-Eye in Silverpine Forest.", tag="Optional", desc="Group for the level 25 elite. Train 2H Swords with Archibald before using Wolfsbane."}, [102]={npc="Lumina Windsinger", tgt="Lumina Windsinger", tag="Optional", desc="Group for the level 25 elite. Train 2H Swords with Archibald before using Wolfsbane.", star={"Wolfsbane", {"PALADIN"}}}, [103]={hint="Bring to Thun'grim Firegaze 15 Smoky Iron Ingots, 10 Powdered Azurite, 10 Iron Bars and a Vial of Phlogiston.", tag="Optional", desc="Skip the gear quest for now if you're missing Phlogiston or mining materials."}, [104]={npc="Thun'grim Firegaze", tgt="Thun'grim Firegaze", tag="Optional", desc="Skip the gear quest for now if you're missing Phlogiston or mining materials."}, [105]={npc="Thun'grim Firegaze", tgt="Thun'grim Firegaze", tag="Optional", star={"Brutal Hauberk", {"WARRIOR"}}}, [106]={hint="Complete the quest objectives.", tag="Optional"}, [107]={npc="Thun'grim Firegaze", tgt="Thun'grim Firegaze", tag="Optional", star={"Brutal Hauberk", {"WARRIOR"}}}, [108]={npc="Thun'grim Firegaze", tgt="Thun'grim Firegaze", tag="Optional"}, [109]={hint="Speak with Ula'elek in Durotar.", tag="Optional"}, [110]={npc="Ula'elek", tgt="Ula'elek", tag="Optional"}, [111]={npc="Ula'elek", tgt="Ula'elek", tag="Optional", desc="Do this with Satyr Horns after finishing Brutal Hauberk."}, [112]={hint="Bring 7 Uncloven Satyr Hooves to Ula'elek at Sen'jin Village in Durotar.", tag="Optional", desc="Do this with Satyr Horns after finishing Brutal Hauberk."}, [113]={npc="Ula'elek", tgt="Ula'elek", tag="Optional", desc="Do this with Satyr Horns after finishing Brutal Hauberk."}, [114]={npc="Ula'elek", tgt="Ula'elek", tag="Optional"}, [115]={hint="Complete the quest objectives.", tag="Optional"}, [116]={npc="Ula'elek", tgt="Ula'elek", tag="Optional"}, [117]={npc="Thun'grim Firegaze", tgt="Thun'grim Firegaze", tag="Optional"}, [118]={hint="Speak with Orm Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional"}, [119]={npc="Orm Stonehoof", tgt="Orm Stonehoof", tag="Optional"}, [120]={npc="Orm Stonehoof", tgt="Orm Stonehoof", tag="Optional", desc="Only when the team or level is sufficient can the equipment be returned."}, [121]={hint="Bring a Galvanized Horn to Orm Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional", desc="Only when the team or level is sufficient can the equipment be returned."}, [122]={npc="Orm Stonehoof", tgt="Orm Stonehoof", tag="Optional", desc="Only when the team or level is sufficient can the equipment be returned."}, [123]={npc="Orm Stonehoof", tgt="Orm Stonehoof", tag="Optional"}, [124]={hint="Complete the quest objectives.", tag="Optional"}, [125]={npc="Orm Stonehoof", tgt="Orm Stonehoof", tag="Optional"}, [126]={npc="Thun'grim Firegaze", tgt="Thun'grim Firegaze", tag="Optional"}, [127]={hint="Speak with Velora Nitely in the Undercity.", tag="Optional"}, [128]={npc="Velora Nitely", tgt="Velora Nitely", tag="Optional"}, [129]={npc="Velora Nitely", tgt="Velora Nitely", tag="Optional", desc="Run Wetlands separately, which optional simply for leveling."}, [130]={hint="Bring 8 Sturdy Dragonmaw Shinbones to Velora Nitely in the Undercity.", tag="Optional", desc="Run Wetlands separately, which optional simply for leveling."}, [131]={npc="Velora Nitely", tgt="Velora Nitely", tag="Optional", desc="Run Wetlands separately, which optional simply for leveling."}, [132]={npc="Velora Nitely", tgt="Velora Nitely", tag="Optional"}, [133]={hint="Complete the quest objectives.", tag="Optional"}, [134]={npc="Velora Nitely", tgt="Velora Nitely", tag="Optional"}, [135]={hint="Fill the Empty Blue Waterskin at the Ruins of Stardust in Ashenvale and return to Brine in the Barrens.", desc="Return from Ashenvale southwest to The Barrens for delivery."}, [136]={npc="Brine", tgt="Brine", desc="Return from Ashenvale southwest to The Barrens for delivery."}, [137]={npc="Brine", tgt="Brine"}, [138]={hint="Bring the Vial of Purest Water to Islen Waterseer in the Barrens."}, [139]={npc="Islen Waterseer", tgt="Islen Waterseer"}, [140]={npc="Islen Waterseer", tgt="Islen Waterseer", desc="Purify it in Silverpine when passing through on the Tarren Mill leg."}, [141]={npc="Deino", tgt="Deino", tag="Optional", desc="Stand inside the waterfall and use the quest bottle."}, [142]={hint="Bring the Xavian Water Sample to Deino in Orgrimmar.", tag="Optional", desc="Stand inside the waterfall and use the quest bottle."}, [143]={npc="Deino", tgt="Deino", tag="Optional", desc="Stand inside the waterfall and use the quest bottle."}, [144]={npc="Deino", tgt="Deino", tag="Optional"}, [145]={hint="Bring 12 Laughing Sister's Hairs to Kil'hala at the Crossroads.", tag="Optional"}, [146]={npc="Kil'hala", tgt="Kil'hala", tag="Optional"}, [147]={npc="Kil'hala", tgt="Kil'hala", tag="Optional"}, [148]={hint="Complete the quest objectives.", tag="Optional"}, [149]={npc="Kil'hala", tgt="Kil'hala", tag="Optional"}, [150]={text="After turning in the Warsong Reports, fly from the Crossroads to Orgrimmar. Otherwise fly from your current outpost. Train level 30 skills, board the Tirisfal zeppelin at Frezza's platform (50.82, 13.54) and head to Undercity from Brill. Hearth to Tarren Mill only if you need nothing in Undercity."}}},
    ["05-d8"] = {name="Blackfathom Deeps", entrance="Ashenvale 16.50, 11.00", pickup="Find Tsunaman at Stonetalon Mountains Sun Rock Retreat to pick up Trouble in the Deeps, stay at Ashenvale Zoramgar Outpost to find Je'neu Sancrea. The Barrens Ratchet and Camp Taurajo can be connected to The Orb of Soran'ruk [Warlock only] first. Pick up A Moon-Kissed Blade at Silverpine Forest The Sepulcher and leave in the log [Undead only] [Paladin only]. Go to Ashenvale The Zoram Strand and pick up The Essence of Aku'Mai/Amongst the Ruins first. When you get the note from the outer cave, return to the outpost and turn it in before entering the book. Then pick up Seeking the Kor Gem [Undead only] [Paladin only].", pickupS={{"Find Tsunaman at Stonetalon Mountains Sun Rock Retreat to pick up Trouble in the Deeps, stay at Ashenvale Zoramgar Outpost to find Je'neu Sancrea"}, {"The Barrens Ratchet and Camp Taurajo can be connected to The Orb of Soran'ruk [Warlock only] first"}, {"Pick up A Moon-Kissed Blade at Silverpine Forest The Sepulcher and leave in the log [Undead only] [Paladin only]"}, {"Go to Ashenvale The Zoram Strand and pick up The Essence of Aku'Mai/Amongst the Ruins first"}, {"When you get the note from the outer cave, return to the outpost and turn it in before entering the book"}, {"Then pick up Seeking the Kor Gem [Undead only] [Paladin only]"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Follow the flooded cave to Ghamoo-ra's pool and find Thaelrid in the underwater side cave → past Lady Sarevess and Gelihast to Lorgus Jett in the Twilight camp. Warlocks loot shards there. Use the stone under the bridge for Aquanis and his globe → Kelris → get the group ready before lighting all four braziers for Aku'mai."}, {k="取捨", text="The Essence of Aku'Mai of the outer hole and the note can be processed in the same pass. The note is a guide for falling. If you don't get it, still clear other quests. Received Seeking the Kor Gem Can be completed in the same trip [Undead only] [Paladin only].", s={{"The Essence of Aku'Mai of the outer hole and the note can be processed in the same pass"}, {"The note is a guide for falling"}, {"If you don't get it, still clear other quests"}, {"Received Seeking the Kor Gem Can be completed in the same trip [Undead only] [Paladin only]"}}}, {k="說明", text="Water enters the outer cave of Ruins northwest of The Zoram Strand. Pass through the cave along the waterway, and go deep into the cave to find the dungeon door. Kurll The braziers around Reese will each trigger a wave of monsters, which are divided into points.", s={{"Water enters the outer cave of Ruins northwest of The Zoram Strand"}, {"Pass through the cave along the waterway, and go deep into the cave to find the dungeon door"}, {"Kurll The braziers around Reese will each trigger a wave of monsters, which are divided into points"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Tsunaman", tgt="Tsunaman"}, [2]={hint="Speak to Je'neu Sancrea in Ashenvale."}, [3]={npc="Je'neu Sancrea", tgt="Je'neu Sancrea"}, [4]={npc="Je'neu Sancrea", tgt="Je'neu Sancrea", desc="Pick up at Zoramaga first."}, [5]={hint="Bring 20 Sapphires of Aku'Mai to Je'neu Sancrea in Ashenvale.", desc="Pick up at Zoramaga first."}, [6]={npc="Damp Note", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Keep The Essence of Aku'Mai in your log after Trouble in the Deeps. Don't make the group wait for the note to drop.", preText="Trouble in the Deeps"}, [7]={hint="Bring the Damp Note to Je'neu Sancrea in Ashenvale.", tag="Optional", desc="Keep The Essence of Aku'Mai in your log after Trouble in the Deeps. Don't make the group wait for the note to drop."}, [8]={npc="Je'neu Sancrea", tgt="Je'neu Sancrea", tag="Optional", desc="Keep The Essence of Aku'Mai in your log after Trouble in the Deeps. Don't make the group wait for the note to drop."}, [9]={npc="Je'neu Sancrea", tgt="Je'neu Sancrea", tag="Optional", desc="First turn in Damp Note Allegiance to the Old Gods and pick it up from the same NPC.", preText="Allegiance to the Old Gods"}, [10]={npc="Je'neu Sancrea", tgt="Je'neu Sancrea"}, [11]={npc="Ulric Frostveil", tgt="Ulric Frostveil", tag="Optional", desc="Take A Moon-Kissed Blade. Get the Purified Kor Gem here before turning it in."}, [12]={hint="Bring a Kor Gem to Ulric Frostveil in Ashenvale.", tag="Optional"}, [13]={npc="Ulric Frostveil", tgt="Ulric Frostveil", tag="Optional"}, [14]={text="Blackfathom Deeps entrance"}, [15]={npc="Argent Guard Thaelrid", tgt="Argent Guard Thaelrid", tag="Unverified", desc="Find Thaelrid in the flooded passage by the turtle pool before the Twilight altar. DungeonsForever map 1: Argent Guard Thaelrid pickup (20.90, 73.70)."}, [16]={hint="Kill Lorgus Jett in Blackfathom Deeps and then return to Je'neu Sancrea in Ashenvale.", tag="Optional", desc="DungeonsForever map 2: Lorgus Jett (38.80, 20.00). Alternate pin: 44.1, 23.4. Location: Past Gelihast's flooded cave, find Lorgus Jett in the Twilight camp."}, [17]={hint="Find 3 Soran'ruk Fragments and 1 Large Soran'ruk Fragment and return them to Doan Karhan in the Barrens.", tag="Optional", desc="Location: Kill acolytes from the Twilight camp to the sanctum and loot three shards."}, [18]={hint="Bring the head of Twilight Lord Kelris to Bashana Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.", desc="DungeonsForever map 2: Twilight Lord Kelris (51.90, 81.60). Location: Go ashore into the moon sanctum. Kill Kelris at the Twilight altar. Order: When doing steps 18-19 on the same trip, enter the water first and then enter the sanctuary."}, [19]={hint="Bring the Fathom Core to Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale.", desc="DungeonsForever map 2: Fathom Core underwater below the altar (42.50, 74.60). Location: Dive under the bridge at the ruined altar. Use the Fathom Stone for the core. Order: Assemble first and then click the stone, which will lead to Aquinis in step 19."}, [20]={npc="Strange Water Globe", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Pick up the water polo after killing Baron Aquanis, and then pick it up from the item. DungeonsForever map 2: Baron Aquanis drops the starter (44.20, 72.70)."}, [21]={npc="Je'neu Sancrea", tgt="Je'neu Sancrea"}, [22]={npc="Je'neu Sancrea", tgt="Je'neu Sancrea"}, [23]={npc="Je'neu Sancrea", tgt="Je'neu Sancrea", tag="Optional"}, [24]={hint="Bring the Strange Water Globe to Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale."}, [25]={npc="Je'neu Sancrea", tgt="Je'neu Sancrea"}, [26]={npc="Bashana Runetotem", tgt="Bashana Runetotem"}}},
    ["03-15"] = {name="Hillsbrad Foothills", tips={{k="取捨", text="If you have not reached level 31, make up the difference by killing snow monsters at The Foothill Caverns."}, {k="取捨", text="Dalaran Patrols and Bracers of Binding have to be opened one round before, so focus on the west side. Key to the City can be picked up easily, and the copy of Dalaran City optional."}, {k="取捨", text="Infiltration needs to complete The Rescue first, leaving Alterac Mountains before picking up. Skip the coastal branch if you haven't done the first part of Elixir of Agony."}, {k="提醒", text="Helcular's Grave is close to the alliance Southshore, approaching from outside the city.", s={{"Helcular's Grave is close to the alliance Southshore, approaching from outside the city"}}}, {k="提醒", text="Bands 30-32 can be combined and accumulated with Arathi Highlands Hammerfall. If you lack experience, first fight the common snow monster (about 45, 29) at the west foot of Hillsbrad, or go to Hammerfall to make up for it.", s={{"Bands 30-32 can be combined and accumulated with Arathi Highlands Hammerfall"}, {"If you lack experience, first fight the common snow monster (about 45, 29) at the west foot of Hillsbrad, or go to Hammerfall to make up for it"}}}}, danger={[1]="Southshore has level 55 Alliance Guards. When turning in Helcular's Revenge, go from outside the town to the cemetery and avoid walking through the town.", [2]="The entrance to the Snowman Cave is refreshed. To find Hercula's Rod, clear the outside first and leave a retreat line before entering the cave."}, grind={[1]={mob="Cave Yeti", note="The slope outside the Yeti Cave on the west side has a high density and normal mobs. First fight them one by one outside the cave, avoiding overlapping strange spots at the cave entrance. start at level 30."}, [2]={mob="Ferocious Yeti", note="Near the entrance of the Yeti Cave, there is a high density of normal mobs. Mix it up with Cave Yeti, clear the outer circle first and then replenish level 31-32 experience."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Zarise"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Shay"}, [3]={npc="Innkeeper Shay"}, [4]={npc="Kayren Soothallow"}, [5]={npc="Gordon Wendham"}, [6]={npc="Thomas Mordan"}, [7]={npc="Ezekiel Graves"}}, steps={[1]={text="If you took the zeppelin from Splintertree's leg, enter Undercity from Brill's south tower. If starting in Kalimdor, fly to Orgrimmar, train and take the zeppelin. Learn Michael Garrett's flight path (63.25, 48.56) if needed."}, [2]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell", tag="Requires the Undercity prereq, Optional"}, [3]={text="Fly from Undercity to Tarren Mill."}, [4]={text="Learn the Tarren Mill flight path (60.14, 18.62) and set your hearth."}, [5]={npc="Novice Thaivand", tgt="Novice Thaivand"}, [6]={npc="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", tgt="Magus Wordeen Voidglare"}, [7]={npc="Keeper Bel'varil", tgt="Keeper Bel'varil"}, [8]={npc="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", tgt="Magus Wordeen Voidglare"}, [9]={npc="Tallow", tgt="Tallow"}, [10]={text="Foothill Caverns → Dalaran camp"}, [11]={hint="Retrieve Helcular's Rod from the Yeti and bring it back to Novice Thaivand in Tarren Mill.", desc="Find the tombstone outside Southshore. Avoid Alliance guards."}, [12]={npc="Novice Thaivand", tgt="Novice Thaivand"}, [13]={npc="Novice Thaivand", tgt="Novice Thaivand"}, [14]={hint="Find the traitors and recover their artifacts, then return to Magus Voidglare in Tarren Mill."}, [15]={hint="Bring 10 Worn Stone Tokens to Keeper Bel'varil in Tarren Mill."}, [16]={hint="Acquire the Dalaran Sewer Key for Magus Wordeen Voidglare in Tarren Mill."}, [17]={npc="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", tgt="Magus Wordeen Voidglare"}, [18]={npc="Keeper Bel'varil", tgt="Keeper Bel'varil"}, [19]={npc="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", tgt="Magus Wordeen Voidglare"}, [20]={npc="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", tgt="Magus Wordeen Voidglare"}, [21]={npc="Keeper Bel'varil", tgt="Keeper Bel'varil"}, [22]={hint="Kill 6 Dalaran Summoners and 12 Elemental Slaves, then return to Magus Voidglare in Tarren Mill."}, [23]={hint="Bring 4 Bracers of Earth Binding to Keeper Bel'varil in Tarren Mill.", desc="Hit the enslavement element near Dalaran to get the bracers."}, [24]={npc="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", tgt="Magus Wordeen Voidglare"}, [25]={npc="Keeper Bel'varil", tgt="Keeper Bel'varil"}, [26]={text="Azurelode Mine and the coast near Southshore"}, [27]={hint="Bring the Mudsnout Mixture, a Strong Troll's Blood Potion, 5 Daggerspine Scales and 5 Torn Fin Eyes to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill.", tag="Optional"}, [28]={hint="Charge the Rod of Helcular with the powers of the Flame of Azel, Flame of Veraz and the Flame of Uzel."}, [29]={npc="Helcular's Grave", npcObj=true}, [30]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon", tag="Optional"}, [31]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon", tag="Optional"}, [32]={hint="Bring a keg of Shindigger Stout to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill.", tag="Optional"}, [33]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon", tag="Optional"}, [34]={npc="Apothecary Lydon", tgt="Apothecary Lydon", tag="Optional"}, [35]={hint="Place the Tainted Keg on the rug for the captured farmers.", tag="Optional"}, [36]={npc="Dusty Rug", npcObj=true, tag="Optional"}, [37]={npc="Sorek", tgt="Sorek", desc="Start Berserker Stance before crossing to Eastern Kingdoms. Ask a city Warrior trainer."}, [38]={hint="Speak with Klannoc Macleod.", desc="Start Berserker Stance before crossing to Eastern Kingdoms. Ask a city Warrior trainer."}, [39]={npc="Klannoc Macleod", tgt="Klannoc Macleod", desc="Start Berserker Stance before crossing to Eastern Kingdoms. Ask a city Warrior trainer."}, [40]={npc="Klannoc Macleod", tgt="Klannoc Macleod", desc="Stock up before stepping onto the grate. Finish to learn Berserker Stance."}, [41]={hint="Kill Big Will, then speak to Klannoc Macleod on Fray Island.", desc="Stock up before stepping onto the grate. Finish to learn Berserker Stance."}, [42]={npc="Klannoc Macleod", tgt="Klannoc Macleod", desc="Stock up before stepping onto the grate. Finish to learn Berserker Stance."}, [43]={npc="Klannoc Macleod", tgt="Klannoc Macleod", tag="Optional", desc="Open line Whirlwind Weapon; separate from Furious Stance."}, [44]={hint="Speak with Bath'rah the Windwatcher.", tag="Optional", desc="Open line Whirlwind Weapon; separate from Furious Stance."}, [45]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional", desc="Open line Whirlwind Weapon; separate from Furious Stance."}, [46]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional", desc="Get Bloodscalp Tusks in Stranglethorn and charms near Hammerfall. Return to Bath'rah."}, [47]={hint="Defeat the Corrupt Manifestation of Water and place the Corrupted Manifestation's Bracers along with the Remaining Drops of Purest Water on the Brazier of Everfount in Silverpine Forest.", desc="Finish the water delivery at Splintertree Post. If the pact expires, see Tiev Mordune."}, [48]={npc="Brazier of Everfount", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Finish the water delivery at Splintertree Post. If the pact expires, see Tiev Mordune."}, [49]={npc="Brazier of Everfount", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified"}, [50]={hint="Speak to the Minor Manifestation of Water in Silverpine Forest."}, [51]={npc="Minor Manifestation of Water", tgt="Minor Manifestation of Water"}, [52]={npc="Minor Manifestation of Water", tgt="Minor Manifestation of Water", desc="Thousand Needles The Shimmering Flats return to Kalimdor and submit again."}, [53]={npc="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tgt="Gan'rul Bloodeye", tag="Optional", desc="Orgrimmar guide; alternatively with Seeking Strahad or directly to Ratchet."}, [54]={hint="Speak to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.", tag="Optional", desc="Orgrimmar guide; alternatively with Seeking Strahad or directly to Ratchet."}, [55]={npc="Strahad Farsan", tgt="Strahad Farsan", tag="Optional", desc="Orgrimmar guide; alternatively with Seeking Strahad or directly to Ratchet."}, [56]={npc="Carendin Halgar", tgt="Carendin Halgar", tag="Optional", desc="Undercity guide; alternatively with Seeking Strahad or directly to Ratchet."}, [57]={hint="Find Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.", tag="Optional", desc="Undercity guide; alternatively with Seeking Strahad or directly to Ratchet."}, [58]={npc="Strahad Farsan", tgt="Strahad Farsan", tag="Optional", desc="Undercity guide; alternatively with Seeking Strahad or directly to Ratchet."}, [59]={npc="Strahad Farsan", tgt="Strahad Farsan"}, [60]={hint="Speak with Jorah Annison in the Undercity."}, [61]={npc="Jorah Annison", tgt="Jorah Annison"}, [62]={npc="Jorah Annison", tgt="Jorah Annison", desc="Loot the book on the SW Hillsbrad coast and the manuscript in the S centaur cave."}, [63]={hint="Retrieve the Moldy Tome and Tattered Manuscript for Jorah Annison in the Undercity.", desc="Loot the book on the SW Hillsbrad coast and the manuscript in the S centaur cave."}, [64]={npc="Jorah Annison", tgt="Jorah Annison", desc="Loot the book on the SW Hillsbrad coast and the manuscript in the S centaur cave."}, [65]={npc="Jorah Annison", tgt="Jorah Annison", desc="Loot 3 rods from Dragonmaw Bonewarders or Shadowwarders. Bring the book/rods to Ratchet."}, [66]={hint="Bring the Reconstructed Tome and 3 Rods of Channeling to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.", desc="Loot 3 rods from Dragonmaw Bonewarders or Shadowwarders. Bring the book/rods to Ratchet."}, [67]={npc="Strahad Farsan", tgt="Strahad Farsan", desc="Loot 3 rods from Dragonmaw Bonewarders or Shadowwarders. Bring the book/rods to Ratchet."}, [68]={npc="Strahad Farsan", tgt="Strahad Farsan", desc="Use Tome of the Cabal at the circle by Ratchet's tower. Kill the felhunter."}, [69]={hint="Using the Tome of the Cabal, summon and subdue a felhunter, then return the Tome of the Cabal to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.", desc="Use Tome of the Cabal at the circle by Ratchet's tower. Kill the felhunter."}, [70]={npc="Strahad Farsan", tgt="Strahad Farsan", desc="Use Tome of the Cabal at the circle by Ratchet's tower. Kill the felhunter."}, [71]={text="Head east from Tarren Mill through Thoradin's Wall into Arathi Highlands."}}},
    ["05-d10"] = {name="City of Dalaran", entrance="Alterac Mountains 8.46, 59.21", pickup="Tarren Mill can first connect to The Grave Knight of Melisara, and then connect to Source of Power of Dr. Martin via Undercity. Hillsbrad Foothills Tarren Mill Go to level 30 and pick up Prison Break In/Key to the City from Wardian. Follow Lordamere Lake southeast to the shelter. Get the Blood Stone and the Filth Key on the same trip; return to Tarren Mill and pick up Dalaran Patrols, and then pick up Blood in the Streets after completion. Go around the lakeshore to check in with Modra's image, then leave the sewer key with you.", pickupS={{"Tarren Mill can first connect to The Grave Knight of Melisara, and then connect to Source of Power of Dr"}, {"Martin via Undercity"}, {"Hillsbrad Foothills Tarren Mill Go to level 30 and pick up Prison Break In/Key to the City from Wardian"}, {"Follow Lordamere Lake southeast to the shelter"}, {"Get the Blood Stone and the Filth Key on the same trip; return to Tarren Mill and pick up Dalaran Patrols, and then pick up Blood in the Streets after completion"}, {"Go around the lakeshore to check in with Modra's image, then leave the sewer key with you"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Pick up the goblin quests at the sewer entrance → kill Atrexis, then optionally enter the rune chamber for Lynn → take the right path to the street and loot construct cores → get the book upstairs left of the Citadel → portal to the Violet Parlor for the Archmage's Shade. Turn the book in to Rexxie by the entrance."}, {k="取捨", text="The prerequisite for the Horde starts from level 30. complete the opening quests before recruiting. If the team has a key, they can first confirm who can open the door; if they have their own key, they can easily visit again. The team wants to fight the hidden boss Lyn the Ignored, and then bring the Tome of Dalaran made from Shadowfang Keep."}, {k="說明", text="The image of Modera is at a different point than the formal door; take the sewer side of Lordamere Lake. The passage between the outdoor Dalaran City gate and NPCs in the city is restricted by camp rules.", s={{"The image of Modera is at a different point than the formal door; take the sewer side of Lordamere Lake"}, {"The passage between the outdoor Dalaran City gate and NPCs in the city is restricted by camp rules"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Doctor Martin Felben", tgt="Doctor Martin Felben"}, [2]={npc="Melisara", tgt="Melisara"}, [3]={npc="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", tgt="Magus Wordeen Voidglare"}, [4]={npc="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", tgt="Magus Wordeen Voidglare"}, [5]={hint="Find the traitors and recover their artifacts, then return to Magus Voidglare in Tarren Mill."}, [6]={hint="Acquire the Dalaran Sewer Key for Magus Wordeen Voidglare in Tarren Mill.", desc="The coordinates are the approximate actual location of the shelter storage box."}, [7]={npc="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", tgt="Magus Wordeen Voidglare"}, [8]={npc="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", tgt="Magus Wordeen Voidglare"}, [9]={npc="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", tgt="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", preText="Prison Break In, Key to the City"}, [10]={hint="Kill 6 Dalaran Summoners and 12 Elemental Slaves, then return to Magus Voidglare in Tarren Mill."}, [11]={npc="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", tgt="Magus Wordeen Voidglare"}, [12]={npc="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", tgt="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", preText="Dalaran Patrols, Key to the City"}, [13]={hint="Find a way into Dalaran along the Lordamere Lake.", desc="The coordinates are the approximate location of the player when handing in the item."}, [14]={npc="Image of Archmage Modera", tgt="Image of Archmage Modera", desc="The coordinates are the approximate location of the player at the time of handoff."}, [15]={npc="Image of Archmage Modera", tgt="Image of Archmage Modera", desc="Receive Dalaran Sewer Key (item 277507) upon pickup; the Filthy Key is prerequisite only. The coordinates are the approximate location of the player at the time of handoff.", preText="Blood in the Streets"}, [16]={text="City of Dalaran entrance"}, [17]={npc="Rexxie Copperclutch", tag="Unverified", desc="After entering, look at the Goblin in the fence on the right side of the sewer."}, [18]={hint="Defeat Atrexis the Grave Knight in the City of Dalaran for Melisara in Tarren Mill.", desc="DungeonsForever map 2: Atrexis the Grave Knight (48.90, 45.60). Location: Follow the main sewer tunnel to the open area and kill Atrexis."}, [19]={hint="Collect 6 Cracked Sentry Cores in the City of Dalaran for Doctor Martin Felben in Undercity.", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: Shattered Sentinel corpses (48.90, 43.30). Location: After the Grave Knight, go up to the street on the right. Kill Shattered Sentinels."}, [20]={hint="Collect the Founding of Dalaran from the City of Dalaran for Rexxie Copperclutch near the sewer entrance.", desc="Location: Go upstairs in the building left of the Citadel steps. Check behind the statue."}, [21]={npc="Rexxie Copperclutch", tag="Unverified"}, [22]={hint="Collect the Arcane Mote in the City of Dalaran for Magus Wordeen Voidglare in Tarren Mill.", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: the Archmage's Shade (45.70, 22.20). Location: Use the Violet Citadel portal to the Violet Parlor. Kill the Archmage's Shade."}, [23]={npc="Melisara", tgt="Melisara"}, [24]={npc="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", tgt="Magus Wordeen Voidglare"}, [25]={npc="Doctor Martin Felben", tgt="Doctor Martin Felben"}, [26]={npc="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", tgt="Magus Wordeen Voidglare", desc="Horde turn in outside to the image by the lake. Follow your quest marker.", preText="Heart of Disruption"}, [27]={hint="Speak with the Image of Archmage Modera near Dalaran.", desc="Horde turn in outside to the image by the lake. Follow your quest marker. The coordinates are the approximate location of the player at the time of handoff."}, [28]={npc="Image of Archmage Modera", tgt="Image of Archmage Modera", desc="Horde turn in outside to the image by the lake. Follow your quest marker. The coordinates are the approximate location of the player at the time of handoff."}}},
    ["05-d9"] = {name="Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard", entrance="Tirisfal Glades 85.20, 32.10", pickup="When passing through Hillsbrad Foothills Tarren Mill, unlock the flight path first; from Undercity, follow the north road Tirisfal Glades to the monastery. Complete Razorfen Kraul Going, Going, Guano! first (if you run Thousand Needles first before Razorfen Kraul, leave Hearts of Zeal to pick up en route to Alterac Mountains; fight Worrell in the cemetery first), find Faranir in the alchemy area of Undercity; after leaving the cemetery, go to the shores of Lake Rank and Ott Tarren Mill.", pickupS={{"When passing through Hillsbrad Foothills Tarren Mill, unlock the flight path first; from Undercity, follow the north road Tirisfal Glades to the monastery"}, {"Complete Razorfen Kraul Going, Going, Guano! first (if you run Thousand Needles first before Razorfen Kraul, leave Hearts of Zeal to pick up en route to Alterac Mountains; fight Worrell in the cemetery first), find Faranir in the alchemy area of Undercity; after leaving the cemetery, go to the shores of Lake Rank and Ott Tarren Mill"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Clear Crusaders and loot hearts in the entry hall → kill Vishas and find Vorrel on the rack → cross the open cemetery and descend to Bloodmage Thalnos."}, {k="取捨", text="It's a good early stage group in the graveyard; if you don't have Going, Going, Guano! as a prerequisite, also make Worrell first."}, {k="說明", text="Look at the far left entrance; the The Scarlet Crusade key is not required for the cemetery.", s={{"Look at the far left entrance; the The Scarlet Crusade key is not required for the cemetery"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell", tag="Optional", desc="Pick up only if doing Razorfen Kraul first. Fits the Shimmering Flats leg."}, [2]={hint="Bring 1 pile of Kraul Guano to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity.", tag="Optional", desc="This step is in Razorfen Kraul."}, [3]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell", tag="Optional"}, [4]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell", tag="Optional", desc="See Razorfen Kraul for Going, Going, Guano!. Hearts drop in all four wings, so pick up before the run.", preText="Going, Going, Guano!"}, [5]={text="Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard entrance"}, [6]={npc="Vorrel Sengutz", tgt="Vorrel Sengutz", tag="Unverified", desc="In the interrogation area in the front section, find Worrell on the torture rack. The DungeonsForever dungeon map is available from Vorrel Sengutz (1st map 73.60, 57.20)."}, [7]={hint="Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity wants 20 Hearts of Zeal.", tag="Optional", desc="Location: Clear living Scarlet Crusaders from the entrance hall to the interrogation room."}, [8]={hint="Return Vorrel Sengutz's wedding ring to Monika Sengutz in Tarren Mill.", desc="There may be another elite in the same room; wait until she patrols the dock."}, [9]={npc="Monika Sengutz", tgt="Monika Sengutz"}, [10]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell", tag="Optional", desc="Collect 20 pieces before returning to Undercity."}}},
    ["03-16"] = {name="Arathi Highlands: Hammerfall", short="Hammerfall", tips={{k="取捨", text="First clear Hammerfall, the raptors, syndicates and dead trees in the southeast. When reaching level 32, Arathi Highlands Hammerfall is left for advanced Call to Arms and Guile of the Raptor."}, {k="取捨", text="Ward Restocking and Silky Sutures are permanent additions. Hand over Silky Sutures first and then accept Ward Restocking. If you have reached level 32, stay for the second trip."}, {k="提醒", text="If you have not reached level 32 before Thousand Needles, fight ordinary deadwood trolls from Hammerfall to the outside of Witherbark Village (about 68, 69) to avoid going deep into the camp with many monsters.", s={{"If you have not reached level 32 before Thousand Needles, fight ordinary deadwood trolls from Hammerfall to the outside of Witherbark Village (about 68, 69) to avoid going deep into the camp with many monsters"}}}}, danger={[1]="Witherbark Village The witch doctor in the house will replenish blood, and there is a higher-level headhunter in front of the house. Prioritize clearing along the field edges, leaving no interruptions."}, grind={[1]={mob="Witherbark Axe Thrower", note="Witherbark Village Peripheral, high density, common ranged monsters. Pull out a single one from the edge of the slope, close to the original quest area, suitable for upgrading to level 32."}, [2]={mob="Witherbark Witch Doctor", note="Witherbark Village On the east side, there are high density and common spell-casting monsters. interrupt the treatment and clear out the house, keeping an eye out for the higher-level Witherbark Headhunter nearby."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Urda"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Adegwa"}, [3]={npc="Mu'uta"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Adegwa"}, [5]={npc="Graud"}}, steps={[1]={hint="Kill 8 Boulderfist Ogres and 10 Boulderfist Enforcers, then find Drum Fel in the Hammerfall outpost in Arathi Highlands."}, [2]={text="Learn Urda's flight path on arrival in Hammerfall (73.02, 32.70)."}, [3]={npc="Drum Fel", tgt="Drum Fel"}, [4]={npc="Gor'mul", tgt="Gor'mul"}, [5]={hint="Speak with Tor'gan in Hammerfall."}, [6]={npc="Tor'gan", tgt="Tor'gan"}, [7]={npc="Tor'gan", tgt="Tor'gan"}, [8]={npc="Tor'gan", tgt="Tor'gan"}, [9]={npc="Drum Fel", tgt="Drum Fel"}, [10]={npc="Doctor Gregory Victor", tgt="Doctor Gregory Victor"}, [11]={hint="Acquire 10 Highland Raptor Eyes from Highland Striders and Highland Thrashers for Tor'gan in Hammerfall."}, [12]={hint="Get 10 Bloodstone Amulets for Tor'gan in Hammerfall."}, [13]={npc="Tor'gan", tgt="Tor'gan"}, [14]={npc="Tor'gan", tgt="Tor'gan"}, [15]={npc="Tor'gan", tgt="Tor'gan"}, [16]={hint="Give the Raptor Talon Amulet to Gor'mul."}, [17]={npc="Gor'mul", tgt="Gor'mul"}, [18]={npc="Gor'mul", tgt="Gor'mul"}, [19]={hint="Speak with Tor'gan."}, [20]={npc="Tor'gan", tgt="Tor'gan"}, [21]={hint="Slay 10 Witherbark Axe Throwers, 10 Headhunters and 8 Witch Doctors, and return to Drum Fel in the Hammerfall outpost."}, [22]={hint="Return 12 Surgical Spidersilk to Doctor Gregory Victor in Hammerfall, Arathi Highlands."}, [23]={npc="Drum Fel", tgt="Drum Fel"}, [24]={npc="Doctor Gregory Victor", tgt="Doctor Gregory Victor"}, [25]={npc="Doctor Gregory Victor", tgt="Doctor Gregory Victor", desc="You must first hand in Silky Sutures to the same doctor before the supply quest will appear."}, [26]={hint="Pick up a case of Packaged Tonics at Jorell's lab in Go'shek Farm and return to Doctor Gregory Victor in Hammerfall."}, [27]={npc="Doctor Gregory Victor", tgt="Doctor Gregory Victor"}, [28]={text="Fly to Undercity to train and clear your bags. Take the zeppelin south of Brill to Orgrimmar. Fly to Freewind Post if unlocked. Otherwise fly to Camp Taurajo, take the Great Lift down and ride the Freewind Post lift up."}}},
    ["05-d13"] = {name="Scarlet Monastery: Cathedral", entrance="Tirisfal Glades 85.20, 32.10", pickup="From Arathi Highlands Hammerfall to fly Undercity, it can be played together with the library and armory when it reaches 35. en route to Journey to Hillsbrad Foothills, when passing Undercity, first look at the royal area Varimathras, and then go to Into The Scarlet Monastery after level 33; Below level 35, play it together when you return to Eastern Kingdoms and go to Alterac Mountains. Kill progress with The Scarlet Crusade key and library and armory.", pickupS={{"From Arathi Highlands Hammerfall to fly Undercity, it can be played together with the library and armory when it reaches 35. en route to Journey to Hillsbrad Foothills, when passing Undercity, first look at the royal area Varimathras, and then go to Into The Scarlet Monastery after level 33"}, {"Below level 35, play it together when you return to Eastern Kingdoms and go to Alterac Mountains"}, {"Kill progress with The Scarlet Crusade key and library and armory"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Cross the fountain courtyard and go up the steps → kill Mograine in the Cathedral → wait for Whitemane to resurrect him → kill both."}, {k="取捨", text="If Roxy or Herod is still missing, return to the partition first, and then return to the city together."}, {k="說明", text="Bring the The Scarlet Crusade key, or ask a thief with a lockpicking skill of Look To The Stars points among teammates to open the door.", s={{"Bring the The Scarlet Crusade key, or ask a thief with a lockpicking skill of Look To The Stars points among teammates to open the door"}}}}, steps={[1]={text="Prerequisite: Into The Scarlet Monastery"}, [2]={text="Scarlet Monastery: Cathedral entrance"}, [3]={hint="Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod, the Scarlet Champion and Houndmaster Loksey and then report back to Varimathras in the Undercity.", desc="Clear the area around the cathedral room first; Whitemane will resurrect Mograine. Map 1: Whitemane (49.10, 16.00). Mograine: 49.0, 27.5. Location: Cross the fountain courtyard and go up the steps. Kill both Cathedral bosses. Order: Mograine→Whitemane Resurrection→Double Kings."}, [4]={npc="Varimathras", tgt="Varimathras", desc="Return to the Undercity royal area after all four bosses are counted."}}},
    ["05-d12"] = {name="Scarlet Monastery: Armory", entrance="Tirisfal Glades 85.20, 32.10", pickup="Fly from Arathi Highlands Hammerfall to Undercity, take the same flight with the library; pick up Into The Scarlet Monastery at Undercity Royal District Varimathras, level 33 is required; if you have picked up at the library, keep the quest and bring the The Scarlet Crusade key. From Undercity take Tirisfal Glades North Road to the monastery.", pickupS={{"Fly from Arathi Highlands Hammerfall to Undercity, take the same flight with the library; pick up Into The Scarlet Monastery at Undercity Royal District Varimathras, level 33 is required; if you have picked up at the library, keep the quest and bring the The Scarlet Crusade key"}, {"From Undercity take Tirisfal Glades North Road to the monastery"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Open the Armory door → follow the barracks and hall to Herod → clear the Scarlet Trainees after he dies."}, {k="取捨", text="Teams that already have the key can clear the armory directly."}, {k="說明", text="Bring the The Scarlet Crusade key, or ask a thief with a lockpicking skill of Look To The Stars points among teammates to open the door.", s={{"Bring the The Scarlet Crusade key, or ask a thief with a lockpicking skill of Look To The Stars points among teammates to open the door"}}}}, steps={[1]={text="Prerequisite: Into The Scarlet Monastery"}, [2]={text="Scarlet Monastery: Armory entrance"}, [3]={text="Kill Herod for Into The Scarlet Monastery. Melee should back out during Whirlwind."}, [4]={text="Keep Into The Scarlet Monastery for Cathedral. Turn it in at Undercity after all four bosses.", desc="After the Armory remains, continue to the Cathedral."}}},
    ["05-d11"] = {name="Scarlet Monastery: Library", entrance="Tirisfal Glades 85.20, 32.10", pickup="Arathi Highlands Hammerfall return to Undercity and then go to the library; Thousand Needles Freewind Post Do Dorne first Test of Faith→Test of Endurance→Test of Strength. When you have passed Stonetalon Mountains Sun Rock Retreat, take the south line of Ashenvale from the tunnel to Braug, and then go to Undercity to find Pakova. When passing Thunder Bluff, take Compendium of the Fallen [orcs, tauren, and trolls only]. run Tabetha and Tiers in Thousand Needles, The Shimmering Flats, Dustwallow Marsh Brackenwall Village, and replenish [Mage only] when you return to Eastern Kingdoms later.", pickupS={{"Arathi Highlands Hammerfall return to Undercity and then go to the library"}, {"Thousand Needles Freewind Post Do Dorne first Test of Faith→Test of Endurance→Test of Strength"}, {"When you have passed Stonetalon Mountains Sun Rock Retreat, take the south line of Ashenvale from the tunnel to Braug, and then go to Undercity to find Pakova"}, {"When passing Thunder Bluff, take Compendium of the Fallen [orcs, tauren, and trolls only]. run Tabetha and Tiers in Thousand Needles, The Shimmering Flats, Dustwallow Marsh Brackenwall Village, and replenish [Mage only] when you return to Eastern Kingdoms later"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Take the book from the small left room past the gallery → kill Houndmaster Loksey → collect the books from the last corridor and the shelf before Doan → kill Arcanist Doan and loot the Scarlet Key from the strongbox behind him."}, {k="取捨", text="Get the The Scarlet Crusade key first, then open the armory and cathedral; pick up the book quests together."}, {k="說明", text="Into The Scarlet Monastery spans three wings and is completed in the cathedral.", s={{"Into The Scarlet Monastery spans three wings and is completed in the cathedral"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Dorn Plainstalker", tgt="Dorn Plainstalker", tag="Optional", desc="Thousand Needles Freewind Post has been done and optional."}, [2]={hint="If you have faith, leap from the planks overlooking Thousand Needles.", tag="Optional", desc="Thousand Needles Freewind Post has been done and optional."}, [3]={npc="Dorn Plainstalker", tgt="Dorn Plainstalker", tag="Optional", desc="Thousand Needles Freewind Post has been done and optional."}, [4]={npc="Dorn Plainstalker", tgt="Dorn Plainstalker", tag="Optional", preText="Test of Faith"}, [5]={hint="Bring Grenka's Claw to Dorn Plainstalker in Thousand Needles.", tag="Optional"}, [6]={npc="Dorn Plainstalker", tgt="Dorn Plainstalker", tag="Optional"}, [7]={npc="Dorn Plainstalker", tgt="Dorn Plainstalker", tag="Optional", preText="Test of Endurance"}, [8]={hint="Bring Fragments of Rok'Alim to Dorn Plainstalker in Thousand Needles.", tag="Optional"}, [9]={npc="Dorn Plainstalker", tgt="Dorn Plainstalker", tag="Optional"}, [10]={npc="Dorn Plainstalker", tgt="Dorn Plainstalker", tag="Optional", preText="Test of Strength"}, [11]={hint="Find Braug Dimspirit near the entrance to Talondeep Path in Stonetalon Mountains.", tag="Optional"}, [12]={npc="Braug Dimspirit", tgt="Braug Dimspirit", tag="Optional"}, [13]={npc="Braug Dimspirit", tgt="Braug Dimspirit", tag="Optional", desc="The book is in the cave; return to Braug and turn it in.", preText="Test of Lore"}, [14]={hint="Find the Legacy of the Aspects and return it to Braug Dimspirit near the entrance to Talondeep Path in Stonetalon Mountains.", tag="Optional", desc="The book is in the cave; return to Braug and turn it in."}, [15]={npc="Braug Dimspirit", tgt="Braug Dimspirit", tag="Optional", desc="The book is in the cave; return to Braug and turn it in."}, [16]={npc="Braug Dimspirit", tgt="Braug Dimspirit", tag="Optional", preText="Test of Lore"}, [17]={hint="Answer Braug Dimspirit's question successfully and then speak to him again. He will remain in Stonetalon Mountains when you are ready.", tag="Optional"}, [18]={npc="Braug Dimspirit", tgt="Braug Dimspirit", tag="Optional"}, [19]={npc="Braug Dimspirit", tgt="Braug Dimspirit", tag="Optional", preText="Test of Lore"}, [20]={hint="Find Parqual Fintallas in Undercity.", tag="Optional"}, [21]={npc="Parqual Fintallas", tgt="Parqual Fintallas", tag="Optional"}, [22]={npc="Parqual Fintallas", tgt="Parqual Fintallas", tag="Optional", preText="Test of Lore"}, [23]={npc="Sage Truthseeker", tgt="Sage Truthseeker", desc="QuestieDB omits Undead and Skyborne from the allowed races."}, [24]={npc="Varimathras", tgt="Varimathras", desc="Level 33+. If you're too low this time, pick it up later and kill Loksey again."}, [25]={npc="Deino", tgt="Deino", tag="Optional", desc="Other pickups: Ursyn Ghull in Thunder Bluff or Anastasia Hartwell in Undercity."}, [26]={hint="Speak with Tabetha.", tag="Optional"}, [27]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional"}, [28]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional", preText="Journey to the Marsh"}, [29]={hint="Speak with Magus Tirth in the Shimmering Flats.", tag="Optional"}, [30]={npc="Magus Tirth", tgt="Magus Tirth", tag="Optional"}, [31]={npc="Magus Tirth", tgt="Magus Tirth", tag="Optional", preText="Hidden Secrets"}, [32]={hint="Find the phrase to Tirth's strongbox, then return to Tirth.", tag="Optional"}, [33]={npc="Magus Tirth", tgt="Magus Tirth", tag="Optional"}, [34]={npc="Magus Tirth", tgt="Magus Tirth", tag="Optional", preText="Get the Scoop"}, [35]={text="Scarlet Monastery: Library entrance"}, [36]={hint="Find The Beginnings of the Undead Threat, and return it to Parqual Fintallas in Undercity.", tag="Optional", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: Beginnings of the Undead Threat (45.50, 29.60). Location: Check the table in the small left room near the start of the gallery."}, [37]={hint="Retrieve the Compendium of the Fallen from the Monastery in Tirisfal Glades and return to Sage Truthseeker in Thunder Bluff.", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: Compendium of the Fallen (83.40, 13.50). Location: Pass Loksey. Check the bookcase at the start of Doan's hall after the last turn."}, [38]={hint="Bring the book Rituals of Power to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.", tag="Optional", desc="Location: Check the book sticking out of the left shelf at the start of the final hall."}, [39]={text="Kill Houndmaster Loksey for Into The Scarlet Monastery."}, [40]={text="Kill Arcanist Doan and loot the Scarlet Key from the strongbox behind him."}, [41]={npc="Parqual Fintallas", tgt="Parqual Fintallas", tag="Optional"}, [42]={npc="Sage Truthseeker", tgt="Sage Truthseeker"}, [43]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional"}}},
    ["03-17"] = {name="Thousand Needles: Freewind Post & Shimmering Flats", short="Freewind Post +", tips={{k="取捨", text="The Shimmering Flats The six quest points are close to each other. Connect them first and then go around in a circle. Driver delivery Wharfmaster Dizzywig is only done next trip via Ratchet. After handing it over, take it to Wharfmaster Dizzywig and give it to Clavel's parts (Parts for Kravel), and leave it for the next time you pass the Thousand Needles The Shimmering Flats track."}, {k="取捨", text="Reserved Martek the Exiled to Badlands Kargath, brothers Family Tree to Desolace Shadowprey Village, Nesingwari Hemet Nesingwary to Stranglethorn Vale Gromgau with Booty Bay."}, {k="提醒", text="If The Swarm Grows has not been submitted yet, skip The Swarm Grows. The video reminds you that the monsters in the wormhole are of high level and turn back when you reach the entrance. Parts of the Swarm If completed, leave Dustwallow Marsh and Brackenwall Village to hand in when passing by The Crossroads.", s={{"If The Swarm Grows has not been submitted yet, skip The Swarm Grows"}, {"The video reminds you that the monsters in the wormhole are of high level and turn back when you reach the entrance"}, {"Parts of the Swarm If completed, leave Dustwallow Marsh and Brackenwall Village to hand in when passing by The Crossroads"}}}, {k="提醒", text="Bands 32-34 can be combined and accumulated with Desolace Shadowprey Village. If The Shimmering Flats has not reached 33, fight turtles, Buzzard and scorpions on the south side of the track (about 76, 85), and then go to Desolace.", s={{"Bands 32-34 can be combined and accumulated with Desolace Shadowprey Village"}, {"If The Shimmering Flats has not reached 33, fight turtles, Buzzard and scorpions on the south side of the track (about 76, 85), and then go to Desolace"}}}}, danger={[1]="The Shimmering Flats The silithid scorpions deep in the wormhole are densely packed and of high level. After completing The Swarm Grows, exit from the cave entrance."}, grind={[1]={mob="Saltstone Crystalhide", note="The Shimmering Flats On the south side of the track, there are high density and normal mobs. The terrain is open and pick them one by one along the salt land. It is suitable for level 32 experience replenishment."}, [2]={mob="Sparkleshell Borer", note="The same salt land to the east has medium density and normal mobs. When playing with the lizard, collect the Sparkleshell Tortoise shell."}, [3]={mob="Scorpid Terror", note="In the southeast of the track, there are medium density and normal mobs. Just take turns along the surface, and pay attention to other salt beasts nearby; collect the scorpion poisonous quests together."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Nyse"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Abeqwa"}, [3]={npc="Starn"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Abeqwa"}, [5]={npc="Starn"}, [6]={npc="Montarr"}, [7]={npc="Synge"}, [8]={npc="Riznek"}, [9]={npc="Synge"}}, steps={[1]={text="Learn Nyse's Freewind Post flight path (45.14, 49.11), then follow the road southeast into the Shimmering Flats."}, [2]={npc="Cliffwatcher Longhorn", tgt="Cliffwatcher Longhorn"}, [3]={npc="Moktar Krin", tgt="Moktar Krin", tag="Optional"}, [4]={npc="Fizzle Brassbolts", tgt="Fizzle Brassbolts"}, [5]={npc="Wizzle Brassbolts", tgt="Wizzle Brassbolts"}, [6]={npc="Kravel Koalbeard", tgt="Kravel Koalbeard"}, [7]={npc="Trackmaster Zherin", tgt="Trackmaster Zherin"}, [8]={npc="Pozzik", tgt="Pozzik"}, [9]={npc="Kravel Koalbeard", tgt="Kravel Koalbeard"}, [10]={hint="Bring 6 Salty Scorpid Venoms to Fizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats."}, [11]={hint="Bring 9 Hardened Tortoise Shells to Wizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats."}, [12]={hint="Bring 30 Rocket Car Parts to Kravel Koalbeard in the Shimmering Flats."}, [13]={hint="Kill 10 Saltstone Basilisks, 10 Saltstone Crystalhides and 6 Saltstone Gazers for Trackmaster Zherin on the Shimmering Flats."}, [14]={hint="Get 10 Hollow Vulture Bones for Pozzik in the Shimmering Flats."}, [15]={npc="Fizzle Brassbolts", tgt="Fizzle Brassbolts"}, [16]={npc="Wizzle Brassbolts", tgt="Wizzle Brassbolts"}, [17]={npc="Kravel Koalbeard", tgt="Kravel Koalbeard"}, [18]={npc="Trackmaster Zherin", tgt="Trackmaster Zherin"}, [19]={npc="Pozzik", tgt="Pozzik"}, [20]={npc="Fizzle Brassbolts", tgt="Fizzle Brassbolts"}, [21]={npc="Pozzik", tgt="Pozzik", tag="If passing through Ratchet, Optional"}, [22]={npc="Kravel Koalbeard", tgt="Kravel Koalbeard", tag="If passing through Ratchet, Optional"}, [23]={text="If you have the racer's delivery, make a detour to Ratchet."}, [24]={hint="Speak to Gazlowe in Ratchet.", tag="If passing through Ratchet, Optional"}, [25]={hint="Bring Kravel's Parts Order to Wharfmaster Dizzywig in Ratchet.", tag="If passing through Ratchet, Optional"}, [26]={npc="Gazlowe", tgt="Gazlowe", tag="If passing through Ratchet, Optional"}, [27]={npc="Wharfmaster Dizzywig", tgt="Wharfmaster Dizzywig", tag="If passing through Ratchet, Optional"}, [28]={npc="Gazlowe", tgt="Gazlowe", tag="Optional"}, [29]={npc="Cracked Silithid Carapace", npcObj=true, tag="Accept if it drops during The Swarm Grows, Optional", desc="Loot the Cracked Silithid Carapace during The Swarm Grows. Right-click it to start the quest."}, [30]={hint="Bring 1 Silithid Heart, 5 Silithid Talons, and 3 Intact Silithid Carapaces, to Korran at the Crossroads.", tag="Do alongside The Swarm Grows, Optional"}, [31]={hint="Kill 5 Silithid Searchers, 5 Silithid Hive Drones, and 5 Silithid Invaders and return to Moktar Krin in Thousand Needles.", tag="Optional"}, [32]={npc="Moktar Krin", tgt="Moktar Krin", tag="Optional"}, [33]={hint="Bring the Shard of Water to Islen Waterseer in the Barrens.", desc="After completion, obtain the Water Totem."}, [34]={npc="Islen Waterseer", tgt="Islen Waterseer", desc="After completion, obtain the Water Totem."}, [35]={npc="Searn Firewarder", tgt="Searn Firewarder", desc="Start Call of Air in Orgrimmar or take the Call of Air breadcrumb in Thunder Bluff."}, [36]={hint="Find Prate Cloudseer in Thousand Needles.", desc="Start Call of Air in Orgrimmar or take the Call of Air breadcrumb in Thunder Bluff."}, [37]={npc="Prate Cloudseer", tgt="Prate Cloudseer", desc="Start Call of Air in Orgrimmar or take the Call of Air breadcrumb in Thunder Bluff."}, [38]={npc="Prate Cloudseer", tgt="Prate Cloudseer", tag="Optional", desc="Save the final boss's note for Alterac. Rau Cliffrunner also offers it (46.14, 51.71)."}, [39]={hint="Defeat Charlga Razorflank in Razorfen Kraul and collect information on the quilboar's plans.", tag="Optional", desc="Keep the note from Razorfen Kraul's final boss for the Alterac turn-in. The pin marks Razorfen Kraul's entrance. Interior target coordinates are unknown."}, [40]={text="After the Shimmering Flats, retrace your route and take the lift up to Freewind Post. Fly to Sun Rock Retreat, then go southwest through the Charred Vale into Desolace."}}},
    ["05-d14"] = {name="Razorfen Kraul", entrance="The Barrens about 42.30, 89.90 (near the copy door in the Thorn Passage)", pickup="Drop by this book on your way to Thousand Needles. In The Barrens Ratchet, first pick up Blueleaf Tubers and get the gopher tool; en route to Journey to Hillsbrad Foothills, when passing Undercity, ask for Faranir to pick up Going, Going, Guano!; before entering this place, if you go through Thunder Bluff, talk to Alder to pick up A Vengeful Fate. start from Thousand Needles Freewind Post, return to The Barrens via The Great Lift, and take the thorny road on the west side to enter.", pickupS={{"Drop by this book on your way to Thousand Needles"}, {"In The Barrens Ratchet, first pick up Blueleaf Tubers and get the gopher tool; en route to Journey to Hillsbrad Foothills, when passing Undercity, ask for Faranir to pick up Going, Going, Guano!; before entering this place, if you go through Thunder Bluff, talk to Alder to pick up A Vengeful Fate. start from Thousand Needles Freewind Post, return to The Barrens via The Great Lift, and take the thorny road on the west side to enter"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Use the gopher for Blueleaf Tubers along the bramble path → Roogug on the side path → Jargba → Ramtusk → bat guano in the cave → Charlga's hut for her heart and quest loot → return to Willix's tent and escort him to the entrance."}, {k="取捨", text="If you want to follow up with Hearts of Zeal and Razorfen Downs, fight the final boss and front hall bat; only for a short time, first be a gopher or escort en route."}, {k="說明", text="On the west side of the large The Great Lift is Razorfen Kraul; on the east side is Razorfen Downs. 42.30, 89.90 are the door markers for the WoW Forever client. Find the portal from the thorn tunnel on the west side of the road.", s={{"On the west side of the large The Great Lift is Razorfen Kraul; on the east side is Razorfen Downs"}, {"42.30, 89.90 are the door markers for the WoW Forever client"}, {"Find the portal from the thorn tunnel on the west side of the road"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Mebok Mizzyrix", tgt="Mebok Mizzyrix", desc="Get the crate, command stick and manual by the Ratchet NPC before entering."}, [2]={npc="Auld Stonespire", tgt="Auld Stonespire"}, [3]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell", desc="After turning in, open Hearts of Zeal of Scarlet Monastery."}, [4]={npc="Ruga Ragetotem", tgt="Ruga Ragetotem", tag="Optional"}, [5]={hint="Bring 5 twitching antennae to Ruga Ragetotem at Camp Taurajo", tag="Optional"}, [6]={npc="Ruga Ragetotem", tgt="Ruga Ragetotem", tag="Optional"}, [7]={npc="Ruga Ragetotem", tgt="Ruga Ragetotem", tag="Optional", preText="Trial at the Field of Giants"}, [8]={hint="Speak with Thun'grim Firegaze in the Barrens.", tag="Optional"}, [9]={npc="Thun'grim Firegaze", tgt="Thun'grim Firegaze", tag="Optional"}, [10]={npc="Thun'grim Firegaze", tgt="Thun'grim Firegaze", tag="Optional", desc="Bring 15 Smoky Iron Ingots, 10 Powdered Azurite and 10 Iron Bars. Last mat: RFK.", preText="Trial at the Field of Giants, Speak with Thun'grim"}, [11]={npc="Searn Firewarder", tgt="Searn Firewarder", tag="Dungeon prereq"}, [12]={npc="Prate Cloudseer", tgt="Prate Cloudseer", tag="Dungeon prereq"}, [13]={npc="Prate Cloudseer", tgt="Prate Cloudseer", tag="Optional", desc="Level 30 Totem chain. Alternate pickup: Rau Cliffrunner (46.14, 51.71)."}, [14]={text="Razorfen Kraul entrance"}, [15]={hint="Grab a Crate with Holes.", desc="Location: Dig up tubers along the bramble path or while escorting Willix back."}, [16]={hint="Bring to Thun'grim Firegaze 15 Smoky Iron Ingots, 10 Powdered Azurite, 10 Iron Bars and a Vial of Phlogiston.", tag="Optional", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: Roogug drops Phlogiston (64.80, 42.10). Location: Take the early side path to Roogug. Clear his adds first."}, [17]={npc="Willix the Importer", tgt="Willix the Importer", tag="Unverified", desc="The escort starts from an NPC within the instance. DungeonsForever map 1: Willix the Importer escort start (37.00, 31.90)."}, [18]={hint="Escort Willix the Importer out of Razorfen Kraul.", desc="The escort starts from an NPC within the instance. Location: Find Willix in a tent by the last boss and escort him back to the entrance. Order: Complete steps 17-20 before picking up the escort."}, [19]={npc="Willix the Importer", tgt="Willix the Importer", tag="Unverified", desc="The escort starts from an NPC within the instance."}, [20]={hint="Bring 1 pile of Kraul Guano to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity.", desc="Location: Kill bats in the cave before the final boss."}, [21]={hint="Bring Razorflank's Heart to Auld Stonespire in Thunder Bluff.", desc="DungeonsForever dungeon map available Charlga Razorflank (1st map 25.80, 32.40). Location: Leave the bat cave, climb the platform and kill Charlga in the last hut."}, [22]={hint="Defeat Charlga Razorflank in Razorfen Kraul and collect information on the quilboar's plans.", tag="Optional", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: Charlga Razorflank drops the quest item (25.80, 32.40). Location: Kill Charlga in the final hut while doing step 18. Order: Pick up with step 18."}, [23]={npc="Small Scroll", npcObj=true, tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Loot and use the Small Scroll from Charlga Razorflank. Save for Undercity. DungeonsForever map 1: Charlga Razorflank drops the quest item (25.80, 32.40)."}, [24]={npc="Mebok Mizzyrix", tgt="Mebok Mizzyrix"}, [25]={npc="Auld Stonespire", tgt="Auld Stonespire"}, [26]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell", desc="After turning in Undercity, pick up Hearts of Zeal."}, [27]={hint="Take the Small Scroll to Varimathras in the Undercity.", tag="Optional"}, [28]={npc="Varimathras", tgt="Varimathras", tag="Optional"}, [29]={npc="Thun'grim Firegaze", tgt="Thun'grim Firegaze", tag="Optional"}, [30]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional", desc="Turn in in Alterac. If your log says Freewind Post, see Rau (46.14, 51.71)."}}},
    ["03-18"] = {name="Desolace: Shadowprey Village", short="Shadowprey Village", tips={{k="取捨", text="Highway Robbery Run with the Bone Collector, light a campfire and go to Bibri's hut. The three stages are all quest level 40, with a minimum level of 30. On the Lam is reserved for Stranglethorn Vale and Booty Bay."}, {k="取捨", text="Kyrgyz Line Gelkis Alliance/Stealing Supplies Shunnan Road. When Magram is selected or the reputation is reversed, skip these two steps and follow up with the Kyrgyz of Desolace Shadowprey Village."}, {k="取捨", text="Shadowprey Village When going to the west coast, do two water quests together with Book of the Ancients. Thunder Axe Fortress first fight Sceptre of Light and Erussus. If the progress is insufficient, go to the second round to make up for it."}, {k="取捨", text="If you don't encounter a convoy, just leave without waiting for the escort. Keep Hunting in Stranglethorn for the next stop."}, {k="提醒", text="If you're not at level 34 before Stranglethorn Vale, fight regular Centaurs around the Kodo Cemetery (~56, 60-68), or fight Slitherblade Naga on the west bank (35.91, 28.84).", s={{"If you're not at level 34 before Stranglethorn Vale, fight regular Centaurs around the Kodo Cemetery (~56, 60-68), or fight Slitherblade Naga on the west bank (35.91, 28.84)"}}}}, danger={[1]="The naga point on the west coast is close to the underwater crustacean shrimp man. First pull the spell-casting monsters to the beach to avoid entering two groups underwater at the same time."}, grind={[1]={mob="Dread Swoop", note="The eastern periphery of the Kodo Cemetery has a low density and normal mobs. Pay attention to other corrupted birds, which are close to the cemetery quest and are suitable for replenishing a small amount of experience."}, [2]={mob="Slitherblade Naga", note="By the water on the west coast, there are high density and normal mobs. Pick out singles along the coast and pay attention to the witches in the same area. The west coast quests can be cleared together."}, [3]={mob="Slitherblade Sorceress", note="At the southern end of the West Bank Naga area, there are medium density and ordinary spell-casting monsters. Pull the monster to the shore and fight again to prevent the underwater lobsterman from getting involved in the battle."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Thalon"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Sikewa"}, [3]={npc="Hae'Wilani"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Sikewa"}, [5]={npc="Tukk"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Felgur Twocuts", tgt="Felgur Twocuts"}, [2]={npc="Gurda Wildmane", tgt="Gurda Wildmane"}, [3]={npc="Gurda Wildmane", tgt="Gurda Wildmane"}, [4]={npc="Nataka Longhorn", tgt="Nataka Longhorn"}, [5]={hint="Deliver Cliffwatcher Longhorn Report to Nataka Longhorn at Ghost Walker Post in Desolace."}, [6]={npc="Nataka Longhorn", tgt="Nataka Longhorn"}, [7]={npc="Smeed Scrabblescrew", tgt="Smeed Scrabblescrew"}, [8]={hint="Bring five Tamed Kodos and the Kodo Kombobulator back to Smeed Scrabblescrew at Scrabblescrew's Camp."}, [9]={npc="Smeed Scrabblescrew", tgt="Smeed Scrabblescrew"}, [10]={text="Follow the south road past the Gelkis village. Learn Thalon's flight path (21.60, 74.13) and set your hearth in Shadowprey Village."}, [11]={npc="Roon Wildmane", tgt="Roon Wildmane"}, [12]={npc="Taiga Wisemane", tgt="Taiga Wisemane"}, [13]={npc="Mai'Lahii", tgt="Mai'Lahii"}, [14]={npc="Drulzegar Skraghook", tgt="Drulzegar Skraghook"}, [15]={npc="Aka'rai", tgt="Aka'rai"}, [16]={text="Coast → Thunder Axe Fortress → satyrs to the east"}, [17]={npc="Rackmore's Log", npcObj=true}, [18]={npc="Azore Aldamort", tgt="Azore Aldamort"}, [19]={npc="Flayed Demon Skin", npcObj=true, tag="If it drops, Optional", desc="Right-click the Flayed Demon Skin to start the chain. Move on if it doesn't drop."}, [20]={hint="Bring the Flayed Demon Skin to Maurin Bonesplitter in Desolace.", tag="If it drops, Optional"}, [21]={npc="Maurin Bonesplitter", tgt="Maurin Bonesplitter", tag="If it drops, Optional"}, [22]={hint="Get the Sceptre of Light and then return it to Azore Aldamort at the tower in Ethel Rethor."}, [23]={hint="Retrieve the Demon Box from Thunder Axe Fortress, and return it, along with the Demon Pick to Taiga Wisemane in Shadowprey Village.", desc="Use the demon pick on the red crystal at Thunder Axe Fortress. Kill the spawned demon."}, [24]={npc="Azore Aldamort", tgt="Azore Aldamort"}, [25]={npc="Azore Aldamort", tgt="Azore Aldamort"}, [26]={npc="Maurin Bonesplitter", tgt="Maurin Bonesplitter", tag="Optional"}, [27]={hint="Defeat a variety of Hatefury satyr at Sargeron in Desolace and then return to Aka'rai in Shadowprey Village."}, [28]={hint="Bring a Shadowstalker Scalp to Maurin Bonesplitter in Desolace.", tag="Optional"}, [29]={npc="Maurin Bonesplitter", tgt="Maurin Bonesplitter", tag="Optional"}, [30]={npc="Maurin Bonesplitter", tgt="Maurin Bonesplitter", tag="Optional"}, [31]={hint="Bring Khan Dez'hepah's Head to Felgur Twocuts in Desolace."}, [32]={npc="Felgur Twocuts", tgt="Felgur Twocuts"}, [33]={npc="Felgur Twocuts", tgt="Felgur Twocuts"}, [34]={npc="Bibbly F'utzbuckle", tgt="Bibbly F'utzbuckle"}, [35]={hint="Gain a Friendly reputation with the Gelkis, then speak with Uthek the Wise."}, [36]={npc="Uthek the Wise", tgt="Uthek the Wise"}, [37]={npc="Uthek the Wise", tgt="Uthek the Wise"}, [38]={hint="Bring 15 Centaur Ears to Felgur Twocuts in Desolace."}, [39]={hint="Acquire 5 Carved Centaur Totems by slaying centaur of any clan throughout Desolace, then return them to Gurda Wildmane at Ghost Walker Post."}, [40]={hint="Bring 6 bags of Crudely Dried Meat to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village."}, [41]={npc="Felgur Twocuts", tgt="Felgur Twocuts"}, [42]={npc="Gurda Wildmane", tgt="Gurda Wildmane"}, [43]={npc="Uthek the Wise", tgt="Uthek the Wise"}, [44]={npc="Extinguished Campfire", npcObj=true, desc="Click the Extinguished Campfire northwest of the Kodo Graveyard. Requires level 30."}, [45]={hint="Bring 10 Kodo Bones from the Kodo Graveyard to Bibbly F'utzbuckle at Kormek's Hut."}, [46]={npc="Bibbly F'utzbuckle", tgt="Bibbly F'utzbuckle"}, [47]={hint="Find someone in Desolace who knows about the pillaged campsite."}, [48]={npc="Bibbly F'utzbuckle", tgt="Bibbly F'utzbuckle"}, [49]={npc="Bibbly F'utzbuckle", tgt="Bibbly F'utzbuckle", desc="Pick up here after Highway Robbery. Turn it in at the Booty Bay inn."}, [50]={text="West coast naga and islands, then return to Shadowprey Village"}, [51]={hint="Talk to Jinar'Zillen at Shadowprey Village, and then bring Nataka Longhorn 2 Bloodbelly fish.", desc="Talk to Jinar'Zillen in Shadowprey Village for two fish. Pair with west coast quests."}, [52]={hint="Find 10 pieces of Soft-shelled Clam Meat and bring it back to Mai'Lahii at Shadowprey Village."}, [53]={hint="Slay 7 Slitherblade Myrmidon, 7 Slitherblade Naga, and 5 Slitherblade Sorceresses, and then talk to Drulzegar at Shadowprey in Desolace."}, [54]={hint="Get the Book of the Ancients and return it to Azore Aldamort at the tower in Ethel Rethor."}, [55]={hint="Bring an Oracle Crystal to Maurin Bonesplitter in Desolace.", tag="Optional"}, [56]={hint="Find Rackmore's Silver Key. Find Rackmore's Golden Key. Find and open Rackmore's Chest.", desc="Loot silver and gold keys from makrura and naga, then swim to the island chest."}, [57]={npc="Rackmore's Chest", npcObj=true}, [58]={npc="Azore Aldamort", tgt="Azore Aldamort"}, [59]={npc="Nataka Longhorn", tgt="Nataka Longhorn"}, [60]={npc="Maurin Bonesplitter", tgt="Maurin Bonesplitter", tag="Optional"}, [61]={npc="Maurin Bonesplitter", tgt="Maurin Bonesplitter", tag="Optional"}, [62]={hint="Speak to Takata Steelblade in Desolace.", tag="Optional"}, [63]={npc="Takata Steelblade", tgt="Takata Steelblade", tag="Optional"}, [64]={text="Hearth to Shadowprey Village."}, [65]={npc="Mai'Lahii", tgt="Mai'Lahii"}, [66]={npc="Drulzegar Skraghook", tgt="Drulzegar Skraghook"}, [67]={npc="Taiga Wisemane", tgt="Taiga Wisemane"}, [68]={npc="Aka'rai", tgt="Aka'rai"}, [69]={npc="Zevrost", tgt="Zevrost", tag="Optional", desc="Orgrimmar boot; choose one with Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil or go directly to Ratchet."}, [70]={hint="Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.", tag="Optional", desc="Orgrimmar boot; choose one with Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil or go directly to Ratchet."}, [71]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", desc="Orgrimmar boot; choose one with Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil or go directly to Ratchet."}, [72]={npc="Kaal Soulreaper", tgt="Kaal Soulreaper", tag="Optional", desc="Undercity guide; choose one of Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil or go directly to Ratchet."}, [73]={hint="Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.", tag="Optional", desc="Undercity guide; choose one of Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil or go directly to Ratchet."}, [74]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", desc="Undercity guide; choose one of Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil or go directly to Ratchet."}, [75]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", desc="Then in the tower, choose one of the two attendants to choose the reward branch."}, [76]={npc="Acolyte Wytula", tgt="Acolyte Wytula", tag="Optional", desc="Choose one branch. Capture a Mana Eater or Mage Hunter soul with the ruby. See Menara."}, [77]={hint="Take the Felhas Ruby and use it on one of the Felhounds found in Desolace. After successful, bring the Felhas Ruby and the Imprisoned Felhound Spirit back to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.", tag="Optional", desc="Choose one branch. Capture a Mana Eater or Mage Hunter soul with the ruby. See Menara."}, [78]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", desc="Choose one branch. Capture a Mana Eater or Mage Hunter soul with the ruby. See Menara."}, [79]={npc="Acolyte Magaz", tgt="Acolyte Magaz", tag="Optional", desc="Choose one branch. Capture a Lesser Infernal's soul with the emerald. See Menara."}, [80]={hint="Take the Infus Emerald and use it on one of the Infernals found in Desolace. After successful, bring the Infus Emerald and the Imprisoned Infernal Spirit back to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.", tag="Optional", desc="Choose one branch. Capture a Lesser Infernal's soul with the emerald. See Menara."}, [81]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", desc="Choose one branch. Capture a Lesser Infernal's soul with the emerald. See Menara."}, [82]={hint="Speak to Menara's acolytes inside the tower above Ratchet and choose one of their paths to follow.", tag="Optional"}, [83]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional"}, [84]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional"}, [85]={hint="Kill the Demon of the Orb, then speak with Tabetha.", tag="Optional"}, [86]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional"}, [87]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional"}, [88]={hint="Return the Cleansed Infernal Orb to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.", tag="Optional"}, [89]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional"}, [90]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", desc="Do your branch's finale. If The Completed Orb of Dar'Orahil or The Completed Orb of Noh'Orahil isn't shown, check Menara after Returning the Cleansed Orb."}, [91]={hint="Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete the Orb of Dar'Orahil and then speak to her again.", tag="Optional", desc="Do your branch's finale. If The Completed Orb of Dar'Orahil or The Completed Orb of Noh'Orahil isn't shown, check Menara after Returning the Cleansed Orb."}, [92]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", desc="Do your branch's finale. If The Completed Orb of Dar'Orahil or The Completed Orb of Noh'Orahil isn't shown, check Menara after Returning the Cleansed Orb."}, [93]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", desc="Do your branch's finale. If The Completed Orb of Dar'Orahil or The Completed Orb of Noh'Orahil isn't shown, check Menara after Returning the Cleansed Orb."}, [94]={hint="Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete the Orb of Noh'Orahil and then speak to her again.", tag="Optional", desc="Do your branch's finale. If The Completed Orb of Dar'Orahil or The Completed Orb of Noh'Orahil isn't shown, check Menara after Returning the Cleansed Orb."}, [95]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", desc="Do your branch's finale. If The Completed Orb of Dar'Orahil or The Completed Orb of Noh'Orahil isn't shown, check Menara after Returning the Cleansed Orb."}, [96]={text="Fly from Shadowprey Village to Orgrimmar. At the Durotar zeppelin tower (50.80, 13.60), board for Grom'gol in Stranglethorn Vale."}}},
    ["03-19"] = {name="Stranglethorn Vale", tips={{k="取捨", text="Booty Bay After the first visit, hand in On the Lam and buy wine to complete \"Cherry for Your Thoughts?\". After that, I will go to the southeastern offshore island of Arathi Highlands, and then pick up the follow-up pirate but no way."}, {k="取捨", text="Zukunda found the key and escorted him only after he found Jimmy Max. The key was in the same area as the stolen goods. If someone has escorted you, continue the main line directly. [Taiwan server quest record](https://wowamobi.com/quests/Where's the Key?)"}, {k="取捨", text="Booty Bay visited the main flight path for the first time and accepted the quest; at about level 35, only the first batch was handed in: Bloodscalp Ears, Investigate the Camp, Supply and Demand, Singing Blue Shards, Hostile Takeover, and the completed Anything of Value/Zimmix's Great Escape. Pay Supply and Demand and Singing Blue Shards before opening Some Assembly Required and Venture Company Mining."}, {k="取捨", text="Don't hand over Venture Company Mining and Excelsior first, keep Stranglethorn Vale Booty Bay and recycle it in Nangu. After Some Assembly Required is completed, leave Stranglethorn Vale and Booty Bay first, then receive Excelsior."}, {k="取捨", text="The level 42 return visit results in The Bloodsail Buccaneers→The Bloodsail Buccaneers→The Bloodsail Buccaneers→The Bloodsail Buccaneers→The Bloodsail Buccaneers, and Keep An Eye Out/Up to Snuff, Zanzil's Secret, Scaring Shaky→Return to MacKinley→Voodoo Dues. Don't rank Stranglethorn Fever/Stranglethorn Fever Fever, Message in a Bottle→Message in a Bottle Letter in a Bottle, The Captain's Chest, Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog Wine and An OOX of Your Own OOX. See the post-level 45 list of Stranglethorn Vale Booty Bay. The divided delivery principle of the video is retained, and the specific ID is the route configuration."}, {k="取捨", text="First unlock the Dragon Hunter to Raptor Mastery, and then fight Lashtail Raptor with The Defense of Grom'gol. Singing Blue Shards. Kill the crystal-spine lizard in the north first. There is no need to go around to the south valley on the first trip."}, {k="取捨", text="If you start with a blank at level 34, do the first two rounds of three hunting lines, and do Grom'gol and the Bloodcap Troll Swarm. Shadowmaw Panther can solve Panther Mastery/Mok'thardin's Enchantment at the same time, and ordinary Sin'Dall can solve Tiger Mastery in the same circle. The three pieces of loot for Speaking with Nezzliok are Stranglethorn Vale, Booty Bay and Split Bone Necklace. Stranglethorn Vale's Qingshan The Green Hills of Stranglethorn-Chapter IV will be submitted if there are loose pages."}, {k="提醒", text="The Drowned City (The Drowned City, 35-40) can be formed at level 35. First confirm the team and related quests, and enter from the seabed west of Gromgol.", s={{"The Drowned City (The Drowned City, 35-40) can be formed at level 35"}, {"First confirm the team and related quests, and enter from the seabed west of Gromgol"}}}, {k="提醒", text="At about level 34-35, first fight the bloodcap trolls at Northdale (29.76, 21.62); after level 36, go to the troll camp southeast of Grom'gol (35.55, 30.92). If you are missing anything, make up to 37 here and then take the zeppelin. Hand over the completed quests in the camp first.", s={{"At about level 34-35, first fight the bloodcap trolls at Northdale (29.76, 21.62); after level 36, go to the troll camp southeast of Grom'gol (35.55, 30.92)"}, {"If you are missing anything, make up to 37 here and then take the zeppelin"}, {"Hand over the completed quests in the camp first"}}}}, danger={[1]="The Vile Reef There are salt scale elites in the ruins. Dive from the sea surface and stick it to the outer wall to find stone slabs, leaving enough time to breathe before turning back.", [2]="Ruins of Zul'Kunda's Jimix escort will walk across the patrol path. Clear the outside of the camp before picking up the escort."}, grind={[1]={mob="Bloodscalp Warrior", note="Northdale Bloodcap ruins, medium density, normal mobs. Pick out singles along the outer wall and pay attention to the nearby Bloodscalp Shaman. It is suitable for level 34 to grind XP. collect the Blood-crested Fang for Whirlwind Weapon quest [Warriors only] in the same trip."}, [2]={mob="Lashtail Raptor", note="The woodland north of Grom'gol has a high density and normal mobs. Look for a single one along the road, avoid the salt scale elites after entering the water, and follow the velociraptor hunt."}, [3]={mob="Mosh'Ogg Brute", note="On the outskirts of the troll camp southeast of Grom'gol, there are medium density and normal mobs. Avoid the Witch Doctor and the rare monster Rolock. After level 36, make up for it to level 37 nearby."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Thysta"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Thulbek"}, [3]={npc="Krakk"}, [4]={npc="Nargatt"}, [5]={npc="Uthok"}, [6]={npc="Gringer"}, [7]={npc="Innkeeper Skindle"}, [8]={npc="Jutak"}, [9]={npc="Nixxrax Fillamug"}, [10]={npc="Haren Kanmae"}}, steps={[1]={text="Take the Grom'gol zeppelin from outside Orgrimmar. Learn Thysta's flight path (32.54, 29.35). If you're already in Stranglethorn Vale, head straight to camp."}, [2]={npc="Commander Aggro'gosh", tgt="Commander Aggro'gosh"}, [3]={npc="Nimboya", tgt="Nimboya", tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [4]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay", tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [5]={npc="Far Seer Mok'thardin", tgt="Far Seer Mok'thardin"}, [6]={npc="Nimboya", tgt="Nimboya"}, [7]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay"}, [8]={npc="Carnivorous Weed", tgt="Gemmil", desc="The same quest can also be found in Crank Fizzlebub (27.12, 77.21)."}, [9]={hint="Bring a Tablet Shard to Kin'weelay at the Grom'gol Base Camp.", desc="Swim to the slab on the outer wall of the sunken ruins. Avoid elite murloc patrols."}, [10]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay"}, [11]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay", desc="Enemies in the Water hand this in before receive it."}, [12]={text="Fly from Grom'gol to Booty Bay if unlocked. Otherwise follow the road south and learn Gringer's flight path (26.87, 77.10). Pick up the first batch before flying back."}, [13]={npc="Kebok", tgt="Kebok", tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [14]={npc="Krazek", tgt="Krazek"}, [15]={npc="Krazek", tgt="Krazek"}, [16]={npc="Krazek", tgt="Krazek"}, [17]={npc="Drizzlik", tgt="Drizzlik"}, [18]={npc="Crank Fizzlebub", tgt="Crank Fizzlebub"}, [19]={hint="Find one of the Desolace marauders."}, [20]={npc="Tokal", tgt="Tokal"}, [21]={npc="Tokal", tgt="Tokal"}, [22]={hint="Bring a Cherry Grog to Tokal, in Booty Bay, to hear the rest of her story.", desc="Just turn it in when you buy it, don't drink it."}, [23]={npc="Tokal", tgt="Tokal", desc="Pick up No Honor Among Thieves after turning in. Save it for the southeast Arathi Highlands coast."}, [24]={npc="Kebok", tgt="Kebok"}, [25]={hint="Speak with Wharfmaster Lozgil in Booty Bay.", tag="Optional"}, [26]={npc="Wharfmaster Lozgil", tgt="Wharfmaster Lozgil", tag="Optional"}, [27]={npc="Wharfmaster Lozgil", tgt="Wharfmaster Lozgil", tag="Optional"}, [28]={hint="Speak with Baron Revilgaz in Booty Bay.", tag="Optional"}, [29]={npc="Baron Revilgaz", tgt="Baron Revilgaz", tag="Optional"}, [30]={npc="Baron Revilgaz", tgt="Baron Revilgaz", tag="Optional"}, [31]={text="Northern expedition → river, troll ruins and wildlife"}, [32]={hint="Take Kravel's Crate to Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn."}, [33]={hint="Bring Roon's Kodo Horn to Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn."}, [34]={npc="Hemet Nesingwary", tgt="Hemet Nesingwary"}, [35]={npc="Hemet Nesingwary", tgt="Hemet Nesingwary"}, [36]={npc="Barnil Stonepot", tgt="Barnil Stonepot"}, [37]={hint="Speak with Hemet Nesingwary"}, [38]={npc="Hemet Nesingwary", tgt="Hemet Nesingwary"}, [39]={npc="Ajeck Rouack", tgt="Ajeck Rouack"}, [40]={npc="Sir S. J. Erlgadin", tgt="Sir S. J. Erlgadin"}, [41]={npc="Hemet Nesingwary", tgt="Hemet Nesingwary"}, [42]={hint="Bring 2 Large River Crocolisk Skins to Drizzlik in Booty Bay."}, [43]={hint="Ajeck Rouack of Nesingwary's Expedition wants you to kill 10 Young Stranglethorn Tigers."}, [44]={hint="Sir S. J. Erlgadin of Nesingwary's Expedition wants you to kill 10 Young Panthers."}, [45]={npc="Ajeck Rouack", tgt="Ajeck Rouack"}, [46]={npc="Sir S. J. Erlgadin", tgt="Sir S. J. Erlgadin"}, [47]={npc="Ajeck Rouack", tgt="Ajeck Rouack"}, [48]={npc="Sir S. J. Erlgadin", tgt="Sir S. J. Erlgadin"}, [49]={hint="Find the hunters' camp and report its location to Krazek in Booty Bay."}, [50]={hint="Ajeck Rouack of Nesingwary's Expedition wants you to kill 10 Stranglethorn Tigers."}, [51]={hint="Sir S. J. Erlgadin of Nesingwary's Expedition wants you to kill 10 Panthers."}, [52]={hint="Hemet Nesingwary wants you to kill 10 Stranglethorn Raptors."}, [53]={npc="Ajeck Rouack", tgt="Ajeck Rouack"}, [54]={npc="Sir S. J. Erlgadin", tgt="Sir S. J. Erlgadin"}, [55]={npc="Hemet Nesingwary", tgt="Hemet Nesingwary"}, [56]={npc="Ajeck Rouack", tgt="Ajeck Rouack"}, [57]={npc="Sir S. J. Erlgadin", tgt="Sir S. J. Erlgadin"}, [58]={npc="Hemet Nesingwary", tgt="Hemet Nesingwary"}, [59]={npc="Thoroughly Scavenged Supplies", npcObj=true, tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [60]={text="Clear Zuul'Kunda and the Bloodscalps before returning to Grom'gol"}, [61]={hint="Acquire 15 Bloodscalp Ears and return them to Kebok in Booty Bay.", tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [62]={hint="Bring 9 Bloodscalp Tusks to Nimboya at the Grom'gol Base Camp.", tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [63]={hint="Bring 25 Bloody Bone Necklaces to Kin'weelay at the Grom'gol Base Camp.", tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [64]={npc="Nimboya", tgt="Nimboya", tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [65]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay", tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [66]={npc="Nimboya", tgt="Nimboya", tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [67]={hint="Bring 10 Singing Crystal Shards to Crank Fizzlebub."}, [68]={hint="Retrieve 8 Tumbled Crystals and return them to Kebok in Booty Bay."}, [69]={hint="Bring the Fuel Regulator Blueprints to Baron Revilgaz in Booty Bay.", tag="Do alongside Hostile Takeover, Optional"}, [70]={npc="Zimmix Sputterspark", tgt="Zimmix Sputterspark", tag="Optional", desc="Accept at the cage west of Zul'Kunda. Check the NPC if the step is hidden."}, [71]={hint="Recover 8 Stolen Shipments from the Ruins of Zul'Kunda in Stranglethorn Vale and return your haul to someone in Booty Bay.", tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [72]={hint="Use the hide and charcoal to create a rubbing of the Third Troll Legend tablet."}, [73]={hint="Bring the Primitive Key obtained from the trolls at the Ruins of Zul'kunda in Stranglethorn Vale to Zimmix Sputterspark.", tag="Optional"}, [74]={npc="Zimmix Sputterspark", tgt="Zimmix Sputterspark", tag="Optional"}, [75]={npc="Zimmix Sputterspark", tgt="Zimmix Sputterspark", tag="If you see it, Optional", desc="Gimix is west of the ruins. Wait for the current escort to finish or skip it."}, [76]={hint="Escort Zimmix Sputterspark away from the Ruins of Zul'Kunda then tell Wharfmaster Lozgil in Booty Bay of your successful rescue.", tag="If you see it, Optional"}, [77]={hint="Bring 20 Shrunken Heads to Nimboya at the Grom'gol Base Camp.", tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [78]={npc="Nimboya", tgt="Nimboya", tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [79]={hint="Hemet Nesingwary wants you to kill 10 Lashtail Raptors."}, [80]={hint="Commander Aggro'gosh of the Grom'gol base camp wants you to kill 15 Lashtail Raptors."}, [81]={npc="Commander Aggro'gosh", tgt="Commander Aggro'gosh"}, [82]={npc="Commander Aggro'gosh", tgt="Commander Aggro'gosh"}, [83]={npc="Nimboya", tgt="Nimboya", tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [84]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay"}, [85]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay"}, [86]={npc="Commander Aggro'gosh", tgt="Commander Aggro'gosh"}, [87]={hint="Gather 10 Brinescale Tridents from Brinescale Skirmishers.", tag="Target: Brinescale Skirmisher"}, [88]={hint="Explore the Vile Reef and find the cavern entrance."}, [89]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay"}, [90]={npc="Commander Aggro'gosh", tgt="Commander Aggro'gosh"}, [91]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay"}, [92]={npc="Commander Aggro'gosh", tgt="Commander Aggro'gosh"}, [93]={hint="Slay 6 Carnivorous Weeds south of Grom'gol and then inform Gemmil's mother."}, [94]={npc="Nerrist", tgt="Nerrist"}, [95]={text="Around level 35, fly to Booty Bay once you have a batch of low-level turn-ins."}, [96]={npc="Kebok", tgt="Kebok", tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [97]={npc="Krazek", tgt="Krazek"}, [98]={npc="Drizzlik", tgt="Drizzlik"}, [99]={npc="Crank Fizzlebub", tgt="Crank Fizzlebub"}, [100]={npc="Kebok", tgt="Kebok"}, [101]={npc="Wharfmaster Lozgil", tgt="Wharfmaster Lozgil", tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [102]={npc="Wharfmaster Lozgil", tgt="Wharfmaster Lozgil", tag="Optional"}, [103]={npc="Baron Revilgaz", tgt="Baron Revilgaz", tag="Optional"}, [104]={npc="Baron Revilgaz", tgt="Baron Revilgaz", tag="Turn in on the next Shimmering Flats visit, Optional"}, [105]={npc="Drizzlik", tgt="Drizzlik"}, [106]={npc="Crank Fizzlebub", tgt="Crank Fizzlebub"}, [107]={text="After the first round of turn-ins, fly back to Grom'gol."}, [108]={text="Central coast: trolls, ogres and nearby hunts"}, [109]={hint="Bring Gan'zulah's Head and Nezzliok's Head to the bubbling cauldron at the Grom'gol Base Camp.", tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [110]={hint="Commander Aggro'gosh of the Grom'gol base camp wants you to kill 10 Ogre Brutes and 5 Ogre Witch Doctors."}, [111]={npc="Bubbling Cauldron", npcObj=true, tag="Crowded, Optional"}, [112]={npc="Commander Aggro'gosh", tgt="Commander Aggro'gosh"}, [113]={hint="Sir S. J. Erlgadin of Nesingwary's Expedition wants you to kill 10 Shadowmaw Panthers."}, [114]={hint="Far Seer Mok'thardin at the Grom'gol base camp wants 8 Shadowmaw Claws and a Pristine Tigress Fang."}, [115]={npc="Far Seer Mok'thardin", tgt="Far Seer Mok'thardin"}, [116]={npc="Far Seer Mok'thardin", tgt="Far Seer Mok'thardin"}, [117]={hint="Ajeck Rouack of Nesingwary's Expedition wants you to kill 10 Elder Stranglethorn Tigers."}, [118]={npc="Ajeck Rouack", tgt="Ajeck Rouack"}, [119]={npc="Sir S. J. Erlgadin", tgt="Sir S. J. Erlgadin"}, [120]={npc="Hemet Nesingwary", tgt="Hemet Nesingwary"}, [121]={npc="Ajeck Rouack", tgt="Ajeck Rouack"}, [122]={npc="Sir S. J. Erlgadin", tgt="Sir S. J. Erlgadin", tag="Optional"}, [123]={hint="Ajeck Rouack of Nesingwary's Expedition wants you to kill Sin'Dall and return with her paw."}, [124]={hint="Sir S. J. Erlgadin of Nesingwary's Expedition wants you to bring him the Fang of Bhag'thera.", tag="Optional"}, [125]={npc="Ajeck Rouack", tgt="Ajeck Rouack"}, [126]={npc="Sir S. J. Erlgadin", tgt="Sir S. J. Erlgadin", tag="Optional"}, [127]={hint="Bring 5 Snapjaw Crocolisks Skins to Drizzlik in Booty Bay."}, [128]={text="If Some Assembly Required is ready, save it for your next stop in Booty Bay."}, [129]={npc="Commander Aggro'gosh", tgt="Commander Aggro'gosh"}, [130]={hint="Bring the items on Bath'rah's Parchment to Bath'rah the Windwatcher in Alterac.", tag="Optional", desc="Do this with Stranglethorn quests. Get Essence of the Exile near Hammerfall."}, [131]={npc="Hemet Nesingwary", tgt="Hemet Nesingwary", tag="Optional"}, [132]={hint="Get a Crimson Trophy Quill from Gharrik in the Badlands. Then, return to Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn Vale.", tag="Optional, Target: Garrick"}, [133]={npc="Hemet Nesingwary", tgt="Hemet Nesingwary", tag="Optional"}, [134]={npc="Zevrost", tgt="Zevrost", tag="Optional", desc="Orgrimmar boot; choose one with In Search of Menara Voidrender or go directly to Ratchet."}, [135]={hint="Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.", tag="Optional", desc="Orgrimmar boot; choose one with In Search of Menara Voidrender or go directly to Ratchet."}, [136]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", desc="Orgrimmar boot; choose one with In Search of Menara Voidrender or go directly to Ratchet."}, [137]={npc="Kaal Soulreaper", tgt="Kaal Soulreaper", tag="Optional", desc="Undercity boot; choose one with In Search of Menara Voidrender or go directly to Ratchet."}, [138]={hint="Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.", tag="Optional", desc="Undercity boot; choose one with In Search of Menara Voidrender or go directly to Ratchet."}, [139]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", desc="Undercity boot; choose one with In Search of Menara Voidrender or go directly to Ratchet."}, [140]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional"}, [141]={hint="Bring Robes of the Arcana to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.", tag="Optional"}, [142]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional"}, [143]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", desc="First bring a gold ingot and turn it in to Hizik at Booty Bay."}, [144]={hint="Bring a Gold Bar to Xizk Goodstitch in Stranglethorn Vale.", tag="Optional", desc="First bring a gold ingot and turn it in to Hizik at Booty Bay."}, [145]={npc="Xizk Goodstitch", tgt="Xizk Goodstitch", tag="Optional", desc="First bring a gold ingot and turn it in to Hizik at Booty Bay."}, [146]={npc="Xizk Goodstitch", tgt="Xizk Goodstitch", tag="Optional"}, [147]={hint="Return to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.", tag="Optional"}, [148]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional"}, [149]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", desc="Loot 10 satyr blood in north Desolace and 1 Lesser Infernal Stone in the south."}, [150]={hint="Bring 10 Vials of Hatefury Blood and 1 Lesser Infernal Stone to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.", tag="Optional", desc="Loot 10 satyr blood in north Desolace and 1 Lesser Infernal Stone in the south."}, [151]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", desc="Loot 10 satyr blood in north Desolace and 1 Lesser Infernal Stone in the south."}, [152]={npc="Xizk Goodstitch", tgt="Xizk Goodstitch", tag="Optional"}, [153]={hint="Complete the quest objectives.", tag="Optional"}, [154]={npc="Xizk Goodstitch", tgt="Xizk Goodstitch", tag="Optional"}, [155]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", desc="Prepare Fine Gold Thread, Smoldering Coal ×2, Soul Shard ×1, and then return to Menara."}, [156]={hint="Bring some Fine Gold Thread, 2 Smoldering Coals, and a Soul Shard to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.", tag="Optional", desc="Prepare Fine Gold Thread, Smoldering Coal ×2, Soul Shard ×1, and then return to Menara."}, [157]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", desc="Prepare Fine Gold Thread, Smoldering Coal ×2, Soul Shard ×1, and then return to Menara."}, [158]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", star={"Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe", {"WARLOCK"}}}, [159]={hint="Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete your robe and then speak to her again.", tag="Optional"}, [160]={npc="Menara Voidrender", tgt="Menara Voidrender", tag="Optional", star={"Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe", {"WARLOCK"}}}, [161]={text="Take the zeppelin from Grom'gol to Orgrimmar, then fly to the Crossroads or Camp Taurajo."}}},
    ["05-d16"] = {name="The Drowned City", entrance="Stranglethorn Vale 21.50, 27.70", pickup="Stranglethorn Vale has been queued into the main line for the first time: Grom Gao takes The Vile Reef, do The Vile Reef first, and then take The Gurubashi Legends of Old; Booty Bay looks for Krazek and takes Shady Saltseers, The Saltseer Captain; Zukunda rubs The Gurubashi Legends of Old; returns to Grom Gao and takes Locating the Lost City, Enemies in the Water Finish it together on the West Coast and pick up The Drowned City and The Only Good Brinescale... after handover. If you have opened the Thunder Bluff flight path, fly Thunder Bluff before entering, and follow the Mulgore road to the sky observation platform to find Mazu'kon. After collecting them, return to Grom'gol and swim from the west bank to the underwater portal.", pickupS={{"Stranglethorn Vale has been queued into the main line for the first time: Grom Gao takes The Vile Reef, do The Vile Reef first, and then take The Gurubashi Legends of Old"}, {"Booty Bay looks for Krazek and takes Shady Saltseers, The Saltseer Captain"}, {"Zukunda rubs The Gurubashi Legends of Old; returns to Grom Gao and takes Locating the Lost City, Enemies in the Water Finish it together on the West Coast and pick up The Drowned City and The Only Good Brinescale... after handover"}, {"If you have opened the Thunder Bluff flight path, fly Thunder Bluff before entering, and follow the Mulgore road to the sky observation platform to find Mazu'kon"}, {"After collecting them, return to Grom'gol and swim from the west bank to the underwater portal"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Zul'Alai → Var'Taka → Captain Dreadrise → Deathless Marrow → Min'loth the Serpent. Make rubbings left of the entrance pool, left of Var'Taka, in the skull by the ships and behind Min'loth. Loot artifacts from the pirates. Primeval Elemental and Gill are optional."}, {k="取捨", text="The two front lines of Gromgao are done first to avoid a trip to the unloading area; Mulgore optional when a single delivery is too far."}, {k="說明", text="The instance door is in the underwater caves west of Grom'gol. DungeonsForever points 21.50, 27.70 match the field guide's approximately 21.4, 27.9; 22.40, 27.18 are Locating the Lost City exploration points. Bring underwater breathing potion, or ask teammates with skills to cast it.", s={{"The instance door is in the underwater caves west of Grom'gol"}, {"DungeonsForever points 21.50, 27.70 match the field guide's approximately 21.4, 27.9"}, {"22.40, 27.18 are Locating the Lost City exploration points"}, {"Bring underwater breathing potion, or ask teammates with skills to cast it"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay", desc="Stranglethorn Vale Gromgao and Booty Bay optional."}, [2]={hint="Bring a Tablet Shard to Kin'weelay at the Grom'gol Base Camp.", desc="Stranglethorn Vale Gromgao and Booty Bay optional."}, [3]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay", desc="Stranglethorn Vale Gromgao and Booty Bay optional."}, [4]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay", preText="The Vile Reef"}, [5]={hint="Use the hide and charcoal to create a rubbing of the Third Troll Legend tablet."}, [6]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay"}, [7]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay", preText="The Gurubashi Legends of Old"}, [8]={hint="Explore the Vile Reef and find the cavern entrance."}, [9]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay"}, [10]={npc="Commander Aggro'gosh", tgt="Commander Aggro'gosh", desc="After The Vile Reef, check with the commander while visiting Kin'weelay.", preText="The Vile Reef, The Gurubashi Legends of Old"}, [11]={hint="Gather 10 Brinescale Tridents from Brinescale Skirmishers.", tag="Target: Brinescale Skirmisher", desc="After The Vile Reef, check with the commander while visiting Kin'weelay."}, [12]={npc="Commander Aggro'gosh", tgt="Commander Aggro'gosh", desc="After The Vile Reef, check with the commander while visiting Kin'weelay."}, [13]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay", preText="Locating the Lost City"}, [14]={npc="Commander Aggro'gosh", tgt="Commander Aggro'gosh", preText="Enemies in the Water, Locating the Lost City"}, [15]={npc="Krazek", tgt="Krazek"}, [16]={npc="Krazek", tgt="Krazek"}, [17]={npc="Mazu'kon", tgt="Mazu'kon", tag="Optional", desc="Mazu'kon is at Skywatcher Plateau in Mulgore. Go if you have transport unlocked."}, [18]={text="The Drowned City entrance"}, [19]={hint="Use the hide and charcoal to create rubbings of the tablets found in the Drowned City.", desc="Wowhead Forever player report. Exact instance coordinates are unknown. Location: Left of pool, left of Var'Taka, skull by Captain Dreadrise, behind last boss. Order: Make rubbings en route based on four landmarks."}, [20]={hint="Slay Var'Taka in the Drowned City.", desc="Deal with the priest next to you first and pay attention to breathing underwater. The DungeonsForever dungeon map is available at Var'Taka (1st map 47.80, 71.70). Location: Past Zul'Alai, find the boss next to two priestesses in the flooded archive."}, [21]={hint="Collect 10 Voodoo Infused Artifacts from Saltseer pirates in the Drowned City.", desc="If you can't collect them all, continue to clear the pirates in the ship area. Location: Clear Saltseer pirates by the ships and loot the artifacts. Order: Same zone cleanup as step 21."}, [22]={hint="Slay 3 Saltseer Coroners and Captain Dreadrise in the Drowned City.", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: Captain Dreadrise (51.00, 26.30). Location: Clear coroners along the passages near the captain in the ship area. Order: Interactive glowing pearl after killing the captain."}, [23]={hint="Recover an Ancient Gurubashi Idol from the Drowned City.", tag="Optional", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: Deathless Marrow drops the item (27.30, 49.80). Location: Pass the captain and pearl barrier, then kill Deathless Marrow."}, [24]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay"}, [25]={npc="Commander Aggro'gosh", tgt="Commander Aggro'gosh"}, [26]={npc="Krazek", tgt="Krazek"}, [27]={npc="Krazek", tgt="Krazek"}, [28]={npc="Mazu'kon", tgt="Mazu'kon", tag="Optional"}, [29]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay", tag="Optional", desc="Turn in if you're already flying to Orgrimmar. This can wait until after the run.", preText="The Drowned City"}, [30]={hint="Take the tablet etchings to Master Gadrin in Sen'jin Village in Durotar.", tag="Optional", desc="Turn in if you're already flying to Orgrimmar. This can wait until after the run."}, [31]={npc="Master Gadrin", tgt="Master Gadrin", tag="Optional", desc="Turn in if you're already flying to Orgrimmar. This can wait until after the run."}}},
    ["05-d15"] = {name="Gnomeregan", entrance="Stranglethorn Vale 27.60, 77.48", pickup="Before Stranglethorn Vale Booty Bay, first look for Sovik and Nogg in the Orgrimmar Honor Valley. Take a boat from Ratchet to Booty Bay, or fly Grom to Booty Bay; after completing Chief Engineer Scooty→Gnomer-gooooone! in Scooty, keep the goblin transponder to enter.", pickupS={{"Before Stranglethorn Vale Booty Bay, first look for Sovik and Nogg in the Orgrimmar Honor Valley"}, {"Take a boat from Ratchet to Booty Bay, or fly Grom to Booty Bay; after completing Chief Engineer Scooty→Gnomer-gooooone! in Scooty, keep the goblin transponder to enter"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Go left and downhill to the Clean Zone → escort Kernobee from the quarters on the right → Electrocutioner 6000 → Crowd Pummeler 9-60 → Thermaplugg, then use his code on the safe. Use the Sparklematic in the Clean Zone if you loot a Grime-Encrusted Ring."}, {k="取捨", text="Fight again when the equipment or quest experience is worth it; it is the easiest to submit it together with the Booty Bay quest."}, {k="說明", text="After teleporting to the facility at Dun Morogh, follow the underground corridor to the instance door; do not take Ironforge. If Scooty is not solved yet, complete the transmission chain first.", s={{"After teleporting to the facility at Dun Morogh, follow the underground corridor to the instance door; do not take Ironforge"}, {"If Scooty is not solved yet, complete the transmission chain first"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Nogg", tgt="Nogg"}, [2]={npc="Sovik", tgt="Sovik", preText="Rig Wars"}, [3]={hint="Speak with Scooty in Booty Bay."}, [4]={npc="Scooty", tgt="Scooty"}, [5]={npc="Scooty", tgt="Scooty", preText="Chief Engineer Scooty"}, [6]={hint="Wait for Scooty to calibrate the Goblin Transponder."}, [7]={npc="Scooty", tgt="Scooty"}, [8]={text="Gnomeregan entrance"}, [9]={hint="Retrieve the Rig Blueprints and Thermaplugg's Safe Combination from Gnomeregan and bring them to Nogg in Orgrimmar.", desc="During the battle, someone presses the button next to the bunker to control the bomb. DungeonsForever map 4: Mekgineer Thermaplugg (31.30, 30.00). The safe is separate. Location: Follow the workshop tunnel to the round room. Kill the last boss and open the safe."}, [10]={npc="Kernobee", tgt="Kernobee", tag="Unverified", desc="Find Kernobee near the clean area; clear the escort route first. DungeonsForever map 2: Kernobee escort start (82.00, 79.10). Alt pin: 82.8, 81.0."}, [11]={hint="Escort Kernobee to the Clockwerk Run exit and then report to Scooty in Booty Bay.", desc="Location: Pick up Kernobee by the Clean Zone quarters. Escort him to the front entrance. Order: Do steps 9-10 first before going deeper into Tail King."}, [12]={npc="Grime-Encrusted Ring", npcObj=true, tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="With 3 silvers, follow the machine dialogue."}, [13]={hint="Figure out a way to remove the grime from the Grime-Encrusted Ring.", tag="Optional", desc="With 3 silvers, follow the machine dialogue. Location: Turn left and go down to the Clean Zone. Find the Sparklematic by the wall. Order: First get the ring from the Dark Iron Agent."}, [14]={npc="The Sparklematic 5200", npcObj=true, tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="With 3 silvers, follow the machine dialogue."}, [15]={npc="The Sparklematic 5200", npcObj=true, tag="Optional, Unverified", preText="Grime-Encrusted Ring"}, [16]={npc="Scooty", tgt="Scooty"}, [17]={npc="Nogg", tgt="Nogg"}, [18]={hint="You may either keep the ring, or you may find the person responsible for the imprint and engravings on the inside of the band.", tag="Optional"}, [19]={npc="Nogg", tgt="Nogg", tag="Optional"}}},
    ["03-20"] = {name="Dustwallow Marsh: Brackenwall Village", short="Brackenwall Village", tips={{k="取捨", text="Black Shield The Black Shield, Suspicious Hoofprints, Captain Reiser Lieutenant Paval Reethe The three burned down the hotel in the same building. Collect them first and then enter the village."}, {k="取捨", text="Soothing Spices Take 3 copies before leaving the city. Moonsteel Broadsword Just turn it in if you already have it. Buying or forging it specially will increase the rebate. Stinky's Escape is submitted at Ratchet. If you don't pass by it, keep it or skip it."}, {k="提醒", text="Brackenwall Village and Desolace Shadowprey Village share the experience zone of 37→38. If the quest of Desolate Return has been handed in, fight ordinary spider monsters and raptors in the north of Dust Mud, and rely on Dustwallow Marsh Brackenwall Village to get 38 monster points from the Northern Swamp quest.", s={{"Brackenwall Village and Desolace Shadowprey Village share the experience zone of 37→38"}, {"If the quest of Desolate Return has been handed in, fight ordinary spider monsters and raptors in the north of Dust Mud, and rely on Dustwallow Marsh Brackenwall Village to get 38 monster points from the Northern Swamp quest"}}}}, danger={[1]="The venomous spiders of the North Swamp overlap with the Velociraptor Patrol Trail. Pick a single one along the outside, avoiding the intersection in the grass."}, grind={[1]={mob="Withervine Mire Beast", note="The withered vine land in the northern swamp has a high density and normal mobs. Mixed with other withered vine monsters, they were cleared one by one along the land, and the level was close to the threshold of leaving the station."}, [2]={mob="Darkfang Venomspitter", note="On the east side of the North Swamp, there are medium density and normal mobs. Pay attention to poison wounds and raptor patrols, and change points when someone clears monsters in the withered vine area."}, [3]={mob="Bloodfen Screecher", note="The forest edge of the northern swamp has high density and normal mobs. There are crocodiles and other velociraptors nearby. Pick one alone along the shore and leave the station after reaching 38."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Shardi"}, [2]={npc="Krak"}, [3]={npc="Ogg'marr"}, [4]={npc="Zanara"}, [5]={npc="Balai Lok'Wein"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Korran", tgt="Korran", tag="Optional"}, [2]={text="Head east from Camp Taurajo into Dustwallow Marsh. Stop first at the burned-out inn by the road."}, [3]={npc="Black Shield", npcObj=true}, [4]={npc="Hoofprints", npcObj=true}, [5]={npc="Theramore Guard Badge", npcObj=true}, [6]={node="Brackenwall Village", desc="Open flight path to Shardi."}, [7]={text="Keep your Shadowprey Village hearth for the return on the next leg."}, [8]={hint="Bring the Blackened Iron Shield to Krog in Brackenwall Village."}, [9]={hint="Report about the suspicious prints at the Shady Rest Inn to Krog in Brackenwall Village."}, [10]={hint="Bring Reethe's Badge to Krog in Brackenwall Village."}, [11]={npc="Krog", tgt="Krog"}, [12]={npc="Krog", tgt="Krog"}, [13]={npc="Krog", tgt="Krog"}, [14]={npc="Krog", tgt="Krog"}, [15]={hint="Show the Blackened Iron Shield to Do'gol in Brackenwall Village."}, [16]={npc="Do'gol", tgt="Do'gol"}, [17]={npc="Do'gol", tgt="Do'gol"}, [18]={npc="Nazeer Bloodpike", tgt="Nazeer Bloodpike"}, [19]={npc="Mudcrush Durtfeet", tgt="Mudcrush Durtfeet"}, [20]={npc="Ogron", tgt="Ogron"}, [21]={hint="Go with Ogron to speak with Reethe, then return to Krog in Brackenwall Village."}, [22]={npc="Krog", tgt="Krog"}, [23]={hint="Kill 9 Theramore Infiltrators, then return to Nazeer Bloodpike in Brackenwall Village."}, [24]={npc="Nazeer Bloodpike", tgt="Nazeer Bloodpike"}, [25]={npc="Nazeer Bloodpike", tgt="Nazeer Bloodpike"}, [26]={text="North road escort → Swamplight Manor → coast"}, [27]={npc="\"Stinky\" Ignatz", tgt="Stinky Ignatz", tag="Turn in when passing Ratchet, Optional"}, [28]={hint="Escort \"Stinky\" Ignatz, then speak with Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet.", tag="Optional"}, [29]={npc="\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl", tgt="Swamp Eye Jarl"}, [30]={hint="Bring 3 Soothing Spices to \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl in Dustwallow Marsh."}, [31]={npc="\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl", tgt="Swamp Eye Jarl"}, [32]={npc="\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl", tgt="Swamp Eye Jarl"}, [33]={npc="Loose Dirt", npcObj=true}, [34]={hint="Bring 40 Unpopped Darkmist Eyes to \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl at the Swamplight Manor."}, [35]={hint="Bring the Spy's Report to Nazeer Bloodpike in Brackenwall Village."}, [36]={hint="Acquire 6 Acidic Venom Sacs for Do'gol in Brackenwall Village."}, [37]={hint="Bring the Captain's Documents to Nazeer Bloodpike in Brackenwall Village."}, [38]={hint="Mudcrush Durtfeet in northern Dustwallow wants 12 Mirefin Heads."}, [39]={npc="\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl", tgt="Swamp Eye Jarl"}, [40]={npc="Nazeer Bloodpike", tgt="Nazeer Bloodpike"}, [41]={npc="Do'gol", tgt="Do'gol"}, [42]={npc="Nazeer Bloodpike", tgt="Nazeer Bloodpike"}, [43]={npc="Mudcrush Durtfeet", tgt="Mudcrush Durtfeet"}, [44]={npc="Do'gol", tgt="Do'gol"}, [45]={hint="Talk with Krog in Brackenwall Village."}, [46]={npc="Krog", tgt="Krog"}, [47]={npc="Krog", tgt="Krog", tag="Optional"}, [48]={text="Optional return trip and cross-zone quests"}, [49]={npc="\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl", tgt="Swamp Eye Jarl", tag="Requires Moonsteel Broadsword, Optional"}, [50]={hint="Bring a Moonsteel Broadsword to Jarl in Dustwallow Marsh.", tag="Requires Moonsteel Broadsword, Optional", desc="Bring a Moonsteel Broadsword to turn in."}, [51]={npc="\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl", tgt="Swamp Eye Jarl", tag="Requires Moonsteel Broadsword, Optional"}, [52]={npc="Loose Dirt", npcObj=true, tag="Optional"}, [53]={hint="Bring the Defiant Orc Head to Nazeer Bloodpike in Brackenwall Village.", tag="Optional"}, [54]={npc="Nazeer Bloodpike", tgt="Nazeer Bloodpike", tag="Optional"}, [55]={npc="Nazeer Bloodpike", tgt="Nazeer Bloodpike", tag="Optional"}, [56]={npc="Deino", tgt="Deino", tag="Optional", desc="Use Orgrimmar or see Uthelnay's counterparts in Thunder Bluff and Undercity."}, [57]={hint="Speak with Tabetha.", tag="Optional"}, [58]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional"}, [59]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional", desc="Keep 10 Totem Bundles. Combine them at the Circle of Outer Binding."}, [60]={hint="Bring 1 Jade and the Bolt Charged Bramble to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.", tag="Optional", desc="Keep 10 Totem Bundles. Combine them at the Circle of Outer Binding."}, [61]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional", desc="Keep 10 Totem Bundles. Combine them at the Circle of Outer Binding."}, [62]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional"}, [63]={hint="Speak with Magus Tirth in the Shimmering Flats.", tag="Optional"}, [64]={npc="Magus Tirth", tgt="Magus Tirth", tag="Optional"}, [65]={npc="Magus Tirth", tgt="Magus Tirth", tag="Optional", desc="Select the chicken and type /beckon, wait for it to turn into a human and talk to it."}, [66]={hint="Find the phrase to Tirth's strongbox, then return to Tirth.", tag="Optional", desc="Select the chicken and type /beckon, wait for it to turn into a human and talk to it."}, [67]={npc="Magus Tirth", tgt="Magus Tirth", tag="Optional", desc="Select the chicken and type /beckon, wait for it to turn into a human and talk to it."}, [68]={npc="Magus Tirth", tgt="Magus Tirth", tag="Optional", desc="Team up and go into the library and look for books on the shelves."}, [69]={hint="Bring the book Rituals of Power to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.", tag="Optional", desc="Team up and go into the library and look for books on the shelves. Take the Library wing at Scarlet Monastery. Pin marks the entrance only."}, [70]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional", desc="Team up and go into the library and look for books on the shelves."}, [71]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional", desc="It will only be reported after both wand material lines are completed.", star={"Icefury Wand / Nether Force Wand / Ragefire Wand"}}, [72]={hint="Speak with Tabetha after her ritual.", tag="Optional", desc="It will only be reported after both wand material lines are completed."}, [73]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional", desc="It will only be reported after both wand material lines are completed.", star={"Icefury Wand / Nether Force Wand / Ragefire Wand"}}, [74]={text="Return to Brackenwall Village and fly to Shadowprey Village. If the route is unavailable, change flights at the Crossroads. Save your hearth for the return from Mannoroc Coven."}}},
    ["03-21"] = {name="Desolace: Shadowprey Village", short="Shadowprey Village", tips={{k="取捨", text="The video features this return visit. When you are lacking experience at level 37, make up the Centaur on the southeast side and the nearby Burning Legion portal; Desolace Shadowprey Village must be handed over to Hand of Iruxos to receive Portals of the Legion. Ghost-o-plasm Round Up use boxes to lure monsters out and deal with them one by one."}, {k="取捨", text="Ongeku The target of Er Ongeku is in Swamp of Sorrows. Pick it up first, leaving Swamp of Sorrows and Stonard en route. Khan Jehn I won't get it until I return to the village and pay Ongeku, so I'll make up for it later."}, {k="提醒", text="Before reach 38, fight the ordinary demons in the outer circle of Mannoroc Coven (about 50.40, 70.40); if you are slow to kill, return to the Centaur area southeast of the Kodo Cemetery.", s={{"Before reach 38, fight the ordinary demons in the outer circle of Mannoroc Coven (about 50.40, 70.40); if you are slow to kill, return to the Centaur area southeast of the Kodo Cemetery"}}}}, danger={[1]="Mannoroc Coven There is an elite lord on the south side. If you just want to grind XP or materials, just fight the mage hunter on the east side."}, grind={[1]={mob="Lesser Infernal", note="Mannoroc Coven North outer circle, high density, normal mobs. Keep an eye out for other demons around you. take the Lesser Infernal stone [Warlock only] needed for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe quest."}, [2]={mob="Nether Maiden", note="The same outer circle as the assembly hall has a medium density and ordinary spell-casting monsters. Use the terrain to pull out a group of monsters, which can be used in rotation with Lesser Infernal."}, [3]={mob="Mage Hunter", note="On the east side of the assembly hall, there are medium density and normal mobs. Look for a single one along the outer edge, avoiding the elite lords in the south; if there are many people in the outer circle, switch here to gain experience."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Thalon"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Sikewa"}, [3]={npc="Hae'Wilani"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Sikewa"}, [5]={npc="Tukk"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Taiga Wisemane", tgt="Taiga Wisemane"}, [2]={text="From Shadowprey Village, go to Ghost Walker Post first. Follow the south road to Mannoroc Coven."}, [3]={npc="Hornizz Brimbuzzle", tgt="Hornizz Brimbuzzle"}, [4]={npc="Uthek the Wise", tgt="Uthek the Wise", tag="Gelkis chain with a prerequisite, Optional"}, [5]={hint="Banish 6 Portals at Mannoroc Coven and return to Taiga Wisemane at Shadowprey Village.", desc="Use Taiga's Hand of Iruxos on the portal in the hall six times."}, [6]={hint="Bring 8 Ghost-o-plasms and the Crate of Ghost Magnets to Hornizz Brimbuzzle in Desolace.", desc="Set the crate down in the Valley of Bones. Step back and pull the ghosts one by one."}, [7]={npc="Hornizz Brimbuzzle", tgt="Hornizz Brimbuzzle"}, [8]={npc="Taiga Wisemane", tgt="Taiga Wisemane"}, [9]={npc="Deino", tgt="Deino", tag="Optional", desc="Use Orgrimmar or see Uthelnay's counterparts in Thunder Bluff and Undercity."}, [10]={hint="Speak with Tabetha.", tag="Optional"}, [11]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional"}, [12]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional"}, [13]={hint="Bring an Infernal Orb to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.", tag="Optional"}, [14]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional"}, [15]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional", desc="First fill up the blood volume and mana, and then ask Tabetha to start the expulsion."}, [16]={hint="Kill the Demon of the Orb, then speak with Tabetha.", tag="Optional", desc="First fill up the blood volume and mana, and then ask Tabetha to start the expulsion."}, [17]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional", desc="First fill up the blood volume and mana, and then ask Tabetha to start the expulsion."}, [18]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional", desc="First confirm with the team that they will take the entrance with Obsidian Sentinel."}, [19]={hint="Retrieve an Obsidian Power Source and bring it to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.", tag="Optional", desc="First confirm with the team that they will take the entrance with Obsidian Sentinel. Use Uldaman's back door for Obsidian Sentinel. Pin marks the entrance only."}, [20]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional", desc="First confirm with the team that they will take the entrance with Obsidian Sentinel."}, [21]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional", desc="There is a time limit after taking it, and it starts again when the mana is full."}, [22]={hint="Kill 12 Mana Surges in the allowed time limit.", tag="Optional", desc="There is a time limit after taking it, and it starts again when the mana is full."}, [23]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional", desc="There is a time limit after taking it, and it starts again when the mana is full."}, [24]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional"}, [25]={hint="Complete the quest objectives.", tag="Optional"}, [26]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional"}, [27]={text="Hearth to Shadowprey if bound there. Otherwise run back to the flight master. Fly to Orgrimmar to train."}}},
    ["03-22"] = {name="Alterac Mountains", tips={{k="取捨", text="Tarren Mill first confirms The Rescue/WANTED: Syndicate Personnel, the two pre-processing can be done in the same trip on Durnholde Keep. After entering the mountain, turn in Infiltration and then take Gol'dir. Gol'dir and find it together with the syndicate camp target in Vadus."}, {k="提醒", text="Use Arathi Highlands Hammerfall to reach a total of 40; go to Arathi Highlands Hammerfall and see the level difference. If you lack a lot of experience, first fight ordinary members of the syndicate camp (58.44, 70.00), and then go to Hammerfall.", s={{"Use Arathi Highlands Hammerfall to reach a total of 40; go to Arathi Highlands Hammerfall and see the level difference"}, {"If you lack a lot of experience, first fight ordinary members of the syndicate camp (58.44, 70.00), and then go to Hammerfall"}}}}, danger={[1]="Broken Ridge Ruins There are elite trolls in the city. When clearing the barbarians, stay on the outer mountain road and wait for the team to arrive before entering."}, grind={[1]={mob="Syndicate Spy", note="Outside the syndicate camp, there is a high density of normal mobs. Pay attention to the stealth and wizard, and look for a single one along the edge of the camp. Only replenish a small amount and go to Hammerfall."}, [2]={mob="Crushridge Brute", note="The mountain road outside Broken Ridge has a high density and normal mobs. There are also elites in the city, so staying on the outside can save you some detours, making it suitable for one person to replenish monsters."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Zarise"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Shay"}, [3]={npc="Innkeeper Shay"}, [4]={npc="Kayren Soothallow"}, [5]={npc="Gordon Wendham"}, [6]={npc="Thomas Mordan"}, [7]={npc="Ezekiel Graves"}}, steps={[1]={text="Board the Tirisfal zeppelin outside Orgrimmar. From Brill's south tower, head to Undercity, fly to Tarren Mill and set your hearth."}, [2]={npc="Melisara", tgt="Melisara", tag="Group, Optional"}, [3]={npc="Krusk", tgt="Krusk"}, [4]={npc="WANTED", npcObj=true, desc="Also find object WANTED (62.57, 20.66) in the same quest."}, [5]={hint="Krusk in Tarren Mill needs you to free Drull and Tog'thar from Durnholde Keep.", desc="Loot both keys from Durnholde guards, then free the two prisoners."}, [6]={hint="Kill 10 Syndicate Rogues and 10 Syndicate Watchmen. Return to High Executor Darthalia in Tarren Mill for your reward."}, [7]={npc="Krusk", tgt="Krusk"}, [8]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia"}, [9]={npc="Krusk", tgt="Krusk"}, [10]={npc="WANTED", npcObj=true, desc="Also find object WANTED (62.57, 20.66) in the same quest."}, [11]={hint="Retrieve information about Gol'dir's whereabouts for Krusk in Tarren Mill."}, [12]={hint="Kill 10 Crushridge Maulers for Melisara in Tarren Mill.", tag="Group, Optional", desc="Crushridge Mauler is an elite, find a team first and then enter Ruins of Alterac."}, [13]={npc="Krusk", tgt="Krusk"}, [14]={npc="Melisara", tgt="Melisara", tag="Group, Optional"}, [15]={npc="Melisara", tgt="Melisara", tag="Optional"}, [16]={npc="Krusk", tgt="Krusk"}, [17]={hint="Free Gol'dir then return to Krusk in Tarren Mill."}, [18]={hint="Kill Baron Vardus and deliver his head to High Executor Darthalia in Tarren Mill.", desc="Check near Gol'dir for Vardus, then search the Syndicate camps farther north."}, [19]={npc="Gol'dir", tgt="Gol'dir"}, [20]={npc="Gol'dir", tgt="Gol'dir"}, [21]={hint="Return the information gathered by Gol'dir to Krusk in Tarren Mill."}, [22]={npc="Krusk", tgt="Krusk"}, [23]={npc="High Executor Darthalia", tgt="High Executor Darthalia"}, [24]={hint="Kill Targ, Muckrake, and Glommus and bring their heads to Melisara in Tarren Mill.", tag="Optional"}, [25]={npc="Melisara", tgt="Melisara", tag="Optional"}, [26]={npc="Melisara", tgt="Melisara", tag="Group, Optional"}, [27]={hint="Kill Mug'Thol, and return his head with the Crown of Will to Melisara in Tarren Mill.", tag="Group, Optional"}, [28]={npc="Melisara", tgt="Melisara", tag="Group, Optional"}, [29]={npc="Melisara", tgt="Melisara", tag="Group, Optional"}, [30]={hint="Deliver the Crown of Will to Sharlindra in the Undercity.", tag="Group, Optional"}, [31]={npc="Sharlindra", tgt="Sharlindra", tag="Group, Optional"}, [32]={npc="Myrokos Silentform", tgt="Myrokos Silentform", tag="Optional", desc="Requires 24; quest level 36. Do it on this trip to Alterac."}, [33]={hint="Steal Barton's Scouting Report by pickpocketing it from him. Then, bring the report to Myrokos Silentform at Ravenholdt Manor.", tag="Optional, Target: Barton", desc="Requires 24; quest level 36. Do it on this trip to Alterac."}, [34]={npc="Myrokos Silentform", tgt="Myrokos Silentform", tag="Optional", desc="Requires 24; quest level 36. Do it on this trip to Alterac."}, [35]={npc="Myrokos Silentform", tgt="Myrokos Silentform", tag="Optional", desc="Loot the uniform from the footlocker. Stay disguised in Stromgarde for the follow-up."}, [36]={hint="Steal a Syndicate uniform from Northfold Manor to infiltrate Stromgarde Keep.", tag="Optional", desc="Loot the uniform from the footlocker. Stay disguised in Stromgarde for the follow-up."}, [37]={npc="Syndicate Footlocker", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Loot the uniform from the footlocker. Stay disguised in Stromgarde for the follow-up."}, [38]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional", desc="Take the RFK note to Rau Cliffrunner only if the log points to Freewind Post."}, [39]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional", desc="After turning in Elemental Aid, go to Basra first; if you turn in Freewind Post, go to Lawn."}, [40]={hint="Speak with Prate Cloudseer in Thousand Needles.", tag="Optional", desc="Following Elemental Aid."}, [41]={npc="Prate Cloudseer", tgt="Prate Cloudseer", tag="Optional", desc="Following Elemental Aid."}, [42]={npc="Prate Cloudseer", tgt="Prate Cloudseer", tag="Optional", desc="Accept from Bath'rah if offered. Get fire/earth at stops 25/27; return for air and water."}, [43]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Take this side quest if Bath'rah offers it. It can wait until after leveling."}, [44]={hint="Return to Rau Cliffrunner in Thousand Needles at Freewind Post.", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Take this side quest if Bath'rah offers it. It can wait until after leveling."}, [45]={npc="Rau Cliffrunner", tgt="Rau Cliffrunner", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Take this side quest if Bath'rah offers it. It can wait until after leveling."}, [46]={text="After the Syndicate camp, go east through Thoradin's Wall back into Arathi Highlands."}}},
    ["03-23"] = {name="Arathi Highlands: Hammerfall", short="Hammerfall", tips={{k="取捨", text="Stone Fist, Velociraptor, and Syndicate advanced quests can be cleared together during a return visit. If you haven't done it in the low-level version, skip the follow-up with the same name. Stones of Binding is touched along the circle line. Breaking the Keystone Fozruk is suitable for chasing after a team."}, {k="取捨", text="Faldir's Cove is salvaged in one go, Sunken Treasure and Drowned Sorrows. Complete Sunken Treasure first to unlock Sunken Treasure, then go to Sunken Treasure to get the treasure hunting goggles, and do the underwater Deep Sea Salvage/Drowned Sorrows. Sunken Treasure is left for Stranglethorn Vale Booty Bay, and the delivery of Sunken Treasure back to the bay is waiting for you."}, {k="取捨", text="The video suggests Stromgarde Keep do it when you have the energy to spare. To save on running the map, first make the crystal and hammer-fall suburbs. Stromgarde Keep can be jumped in the later part Sigil of Arathor-Trol'kalar."}, {k="提醒", text="Passing Stonard, drive to the flying point first. The Swamp of Sorrows quest is left to Swamp of Sorrows Stonard.", s={{"Passing Stonard, drive to the flying point first"}, {"The Swamp of Sorrows quest is left to Swamp of Sorrows Stonard"}}}, {k="提醒", text="If you have not reached level 40 before Riverglades, first clear the ordinary kobolds (about 84, 31) in Gansu Canyon on the east side of Hammerfall. When the monster begins to turn gray, fight the ordinary Deadwood Troll outside Witherbark Village (about 68, 69).", s={{"If you have not reached level 40 before Riverglades, first clear the ordinary kobolds (about 84, 31) in Gansu Canyon on the east side of Hammerfall"}, {"When the monster begins to turn gray, fight the ordinary Deadwood Troll outside Witherbark Village (about 68, 69)"}}}}, danger={[1]="The guards of Stromgarde Keep will gather at the door. Before crossing the talisman chain, pull the guards separately. Don't attack two groups at the same time from inside the house.", [2]="Faldir's Cove There are underwater monsters in the sunken ship. Wear treasure hunting goggles and pay attention to oxygen before entering the ship."}, grind={[1]={mob="Drywhisker Surveyor", note="Hammerfall The east side of Drywhisker Gorge is deep, with medium density and normal mobs. The cave is narrow and you may encounter the rare geomancer Flintag, so advance step by step from the entrance."}, [2]={mob="Drywhisker Digger", note="Drywhisker Gorge Cave, high density, normal mobs. Mixed with the prospector, go on the same journey with the crystal quest, and pay attention to the rebirth when you turn back in the cave."}, [3]={mob="Cresting Exile", note="Hammerfall The northwest water element area has high density and normal mobs. Slightly higher than kobolds and can hit level 40. collect the elemental charms of Whirlwind Weapon quest in the same trip [Warriors only]."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Urda"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Adegwa"}, [3]={npc="Mu'uta"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Adegwa"}, [5]={npc="Graud"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Shards of Myzrael", npcObj=true}, [2]={npc="Tor'gan", tgt="Tor'gan"}, [3]={npc="Drum Fel", tgt="Drum Fel"}, [4]={npc="Tor'gan", tgt="Tor'gan", tag="Optional"}, [5]={hint="Travel to Hammerfall in the Arathi Highlands and speak with Zengu."}, [6]={npc="Zengu", tgt="Zengu"}, [7]={npc="Zengu", tgt="Zengu", tag="Optional"}, [8]={hint="Gather 12 Motes of Myzrael, then bring them to the Iridescent Shards in Drywhisker Gorge."}, [9]={npc="Iridescent Shards", npcObj=true}, [10]={npc="Iridescent Shards", npcObj=true}, [11]={hint="Acquire 12 Raptor Hearts from Highland Fleshstalkers for Tor'gan."}, [12]={hint="Kill 10 Boulderfist Brutes and 4 Boulderfist Magi, and return to Drum Fel in the Hammerfall outpost."}, [13]={hint="Retrieve Marez Cowl's Bloodstone Orb and bring it to Tor'gan in Hammerfall.", tag="Optional"}, [14]={npc="Tor'gan", tgt="Tor'gan"}, [15]={npc="Drum Fel", tgt="Drum Fel"}, [16]={npc="Tor'gan", tgt="Tor'gan", tag="Optional"}, [17]={npc="Tor'gan", tgt="Tor'gan"}, [18]={hint="Give Tor'gan's Orb to Gor'mul."}, [19]={npc="Gor'mul", tgt="Gor'mul"}, [20]={npc="Gor'mul", tgt="Gor'mul"}, [21]={hint="Speak with Tor'gan."}, [22]={npc="Tor'gan", tgt="Tor'gan"}, [23]={npc="Drum Fel", tgt="Drum Fel", tag="Optional"}, [24]={npc="Korin Fel", tgt="Korin Fel", tag="Optional"}, [25]={hint="Kill 7 Boulderfist Shaman and 3 Boulderfist Lords and return to Drum Fel in the Hammerfall outpost.", tag="Optional"}, [26]={hint="Slay Or'Kalar and bring his Head to Korin Fel in the Hammerfall outpost.", tag="Optional"}, [27]={npc="Drum Fel", tgt="Drum Fel", tag="Optional"}, [28]={npc="Korin Fel", tgt="Korin Fel", tag="Optional"}, [29]={hint="Get the Sigil of Strom for Zengu in Hammerfall.", tag="Optional"}, [30]={npc="Zengu", tgt="Zengu", tag="Optional"}, [31]={npc="Zengu", tgt="Zengu", tag="Optional"}, [32]={hint="Retrieve the 11 Sigil Fragments from the defenders in Stromgarde, and bring them to Tor'gan in Hammerfall.", tag="Optional"}, [33]={npc="Tor'gan", tgt="Tor'gan", tag="Optional"}, [34]={npc="Tor'gan", tgt="Tor'gan", tag="Optional"}, [35]={hint="Bring the restored Sigil of Thoradin to Zengu in Hammerfall.", tag="Optional"}, [36]={npc="Zengu", tgt="Zengu", tag="Optional"}, [37]={hint="Gather the Burning Key, the Cresting Key and the Thundering Key from the Stone of West Binding, the Stone of East Binding and the Stone of Outer Binding."}, [38]={npc="Stone of Inner Binding", npcObj=true}, [39]={npc="Stone of Inner Binding", npcObj=true, tag="Group, Optional"}, [40]={hint="Find and kill Fozruk. Bring the Rod of Order to the Keystone in the Arathi Highlands.", tag="Group, Optional"}, [41]={npc="Keystone", npcObj=true, tag="Group, Optional"}, [42]={npc="Keystone", npcObj=true, tag="Group, Optional"}, [43]={hint="Speak with Zaruk in Hammerfall.", tag="Group, Optional"}, [44]={npc="Zaruk", tgt="Zaruk", tag="Group, Optional"}, [45]={npc="Zaruk", tgt="Zaruk", tag="Optional", desc="Turn in Myzrael's Allies at Hammerfall, then pick up from Zaruk. Save for Badlands."}, [46]={text="Faldir's Cove"}, [47]={npc="Lolo the Lookout", tgt="Lolo the Lookout"}, [48]={hint="Talk to Captain O'Breen in Faldir's Cove."}, [49]={npc="Shakes O'Breen", tgt="Shakes O'Breen"}, [50]={npc="Professor Phizzlethorpe", tgt="Professor Phizzlethorpe"}, [51]={hint="Escort Professor Phizzlethorpe to the cave and back.", desc="Clear around the professor. Escort him into the cave, then back to Booty Bay."}, [52]={npc="Doctor Draxlegauge", tgt="Doctor Draxlegauge"}, [53]={npc="First Mate Nilzlix", tgt="First Mate Nilzlix"}, [54]={npc="Captain Steelgut", tgt="Captain Steelgut"}, [55]={npc="Doctor Draxlegauge", tgt="Doctor Draxlegauge"}, [56]={hint="First Mate Nilzlix wants you to retrieve the Charts and Logs from the Maiden's Folly and the Spirit of Silverpine."}, [57]={hint="Captain Steelgut in Faldir's Cove wants you to kill 10 Daggerspine Raiders and 3 Daggerspine Sorceresses."}, [58]={hint="Doctor Draxlegauge in Faldir's Cove wants you to collect 10 Elven Gems and return the Goggles of Gem Hunting once you are done.", desc="Accept Sunken Treasure for the goggles. Wear them for the underwater gems. Pair with Deep Sea Salvage and Drowned Sorrows."}, [59]={npc="First Mate Nilzlix", tgt="First Mate Nilzlix"}, [60]={npc="Captain Steelgut", tgt="Captain Steelgut"}, [61]={npc="Doctor Draxlegauge", tgt="Doctor Draxlegauge"}, [62]={npc="Doctor Draxlegauge", tgt="Doctor Draxlegauge"}, [63]={hint="Take the Elven Gems to Captain O'Breen."}, [64]={npc="Shakes O'Breen", tgt="Shakes O'Breen"}, [65]={npc="Shakes O'Breen", tgt="Shakes O'Breen"}, [66]={npc="Tor'gan", tgt="Tor'gan"}, [67]={npc="Bath'rah's Cauldron", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Buy charms on the AH if needed. Use the same cauldron to accept and turn in."}, [68]={hint="Loot from: Drywhisker Kobold, Drywhisker Surveyor, Drywhisker Digger", tag="Optional", desc="Buy charms on the AH if needed. Use the same cauldron to accept and turn in."}, [69]={npc="Bath'rah's Cauldron", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Buy charms on the AH if needed. Use the same cauldron to accept and turn in."}, [70]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional"}, [71]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional", desc="If the quest is level 40 and is an elite, form a team first and then trigger it."}, [72]={hint="Bring the Whirlwind Heart to Bath'rah Windwatcher.", tag="Optional", desc="If the quest is level 40 and is an elite, form a team first and then trigger it."}, [73]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional", desc="If the quest is level 40 and is an elite, form a team first and then trigger it."}, [74]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional", star={"Whirlwind Axe / Whirlwind Sword / Whirlwind Warhammer"}}, [75]={hint="Complete the quest objectives.", tag="Optional"}, [76]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional", star={"Whirlwind Axe / Whirlwind Sword / Whirlwind Warhammer"}}, [77]={npc="Syndicate Footlocker", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Use the uniform before entering to avoid attacks that will break the disguise."}, [78]={hint="While disguised as a member of the Syndicate, find someone inside Stromgarde Keep who knows about the secret deal.", tag="Optional", desc="Use the uniform before entering to avoid attacks that will break the disguise."}, [79]={npc="Anastasia Miller", tgt="Anastasia Miller", tag="Optional", desc="Use the uniform before entering to avoid attacks that will break the disguise."}, [80]={npc="Anastasia Miller", tgt="Anastasia Miller", tag="Optional", desc="The exact coordinates of the money box are not recorded in native QuestieDB."}, [81]={hint="Find something within Stromgarde Keep to convince Anastasia to give up details of the secret deal.", tag="Optional", desc="The exact coordinates of the money box are not recorded in native QuestieDB. Go to the second floor of the house next to Stromgarde Keep to find Anastasia's Stash."}, [82]={npc="Anastasia Miller", tgt="Anastasia Miller", tag="Optional", desc="The exact coordinates of the money box are not recorded in native QuestieDB."}, [83]={npc="Anastasia Miller", tgt="Anastasia Miller", tag="Optional", desc="The cargo is guarded by two guards; coordinates were provided by the Wowhead player."}, [84]={hint="Break up the secret deal, and take the object being traded to the Syndicate. Then, return to Myrokos Silentform at Ravenholdt Manor.", tag="Optional", desc="The cargo is guarded by two guards; coordinates were provided by the Wowhead player."}, [85]={npc="Myrokos Silentform", tgt="Myrokos Silentform", tag="Optional", desc="The cargo is guarded by two guards; coordinates were provided by the Wowhead player."}, [86]={text="Return to Hammerfall. If Rog'mar and Stonard are unlocked, fly to Rog'mar. On a first visit, fly to Stonard instead. If Stonard is locked, fly to Grom'gol and run north through Duskwood, skirting Darkshire's guards. Go east through Deadwind Pass into Swamp of Sorrows. If Grom'gol is locked, take its zeppelin from the tower south of Brill.", tag="I haven't used this flight path yet, so I have to use the running one for the first time."}}},
    ["05-d17"] = {name="Razorfen Downs", entrance="The Barrens about 49.10, 93.40 (dungeon door deep in the thorn passage)", pickup="Fly Undercity first when leaving Arathi Highlands Hammerfall. Thousand Needles The Shimmering Flats type Razorfen Kraul first and pick up An Unholy Alliance. Alterac Mountains to Arathi Highlands Hammerfall When passing Undercity, first hand over Varimathras, and then find Andrew in the same city to pick up Bring the End. Take the zeppelin from Tirisfal back to Orgrimmar, fly to Thunder Bluff, go to the northwest of Mulgore to find Sutara and pick up The Coldbringer's Eye; fly to Taolajo to the south, and find Merem outside the door. If you transfer from Eastern Kingdoms to Powderfuse Port, take a boat to Steamwheedle Port and then go north to Thousand Needles.", pickupS={{"Fly Undercity first when leaving Arathi Highlands Hammerfall"}, {"Thousand Needles The Shimmering Flats type Razorfen Kraul first and pick up An Unholy Alliance"}, {"Alterac Mountains to Arathi Highlands Hammerfall When passing Undercity, first hand over Varimathras, and then find Andrew in the same city to pick up Bring the End"}, {"Take the zeppelin from Tirisfal back to Orgrimmar, fly to Thunder Bluff, go to the northwest of Mulgore to find Sutara and pick up The Coldbringer's Eye; fly to Taolajo to the south, and find Merem outside the door"}, {"If you transfer from Eastern Kingdoms to Powderfuse Port, take a boat to Steamwheedle Port and then go north to Thousand Needles"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Clear to Belnistrasz's cell near Mordresh Fire Eye → turn in the oathstone and escort him to the idol, with Plaguemaw the Rotting if encountered → take the spiral ramp to Amnennar and look for the Coldbringer's Eye nearby."}, {k="取捨", text="Only teams that have reached level 40 can complete the entire game. The Coldbringer's Eye and Bring the End are the same as the final boss. Level 34 is now only suitable for catching eyeballs first, and do A Host of Evil outside the door if you can."}, {k="說明", text="Team of Five, Keyless. The entrance is on the east road on the north side of The Great Lift, which is different from Razorfen Kraul on the west side. If you have transferred to Riverglades, take a boat from Powderfuse Port to Steamwheedle Port and then go north.", s={{"Team of Five, Keyless"}, {"The entrance is on the east road on the north side of The Great Lift, which is different from Razorfen Kraul on the west side"}, {"If you have transferred to Riverglades, take a boat from Powderfuse Port to Steamwheedle Port and then go north"}}}, {k="提醒", text="Team of Five, Keyless. The entrance is on the east road on the north side of The Great Lift, which is different from Razorfen Kraul on the west side. If you have transferred to Riverglades, take a boat from Powderfuse Port to Steamwheedle Port and then go north.", s={{"Team of Five, Keyless"}, {"The entrance is on the east road on the north side of The Great Lift, which is different from Razorfen Kraul on the west side"}, {"If you have transferred to Riverglades, take a boat from Powderfuse Port to Steamwheedle Port and then go north"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Small Scroll", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="The previous trip Razorfen Kraul picked up Small Scroll from Calgary, which optional."}, [2]={hint="Take the Small Scroll to Varimathras in the Undercity."}, [3]={npc="Varimathras", tgt="Varimathras"}, [4]={npc="Varimathras", tgt="Varimathras", desc="After An Unholy Alliance, pick up here. Targets are in the brambles outside Razorfen Downs.", preText="An Unholy Alliance"}, [5]={npc="Andrew Brownell", tgt="Andrew Brownell", desc="Level 37 can be picked up in the Undercity magic zone first."}, [6]={npc="Sutara Plainstalker", tgt="Sutara Plainstalker", desc="New in WoW Forever. Mulgore 34.56, 23.00; QuestieDB did not provide a shared flag."}, [7]={npc="Myriam Moonsinger", tgt="Myriam Moonsinger", desc="Pick up from Myriam outside in the southern Barrens (49.01, 94.94). Clear outside."}, [8]={hint="Bring Ambassador Malcin's Head to Varimathras in the Undercity."}, [9]={hint="Kill 8 Razorfen Battleguard, 8 Razorfen Thornweavers, and 8 Death's Head Cultists and return to Myriam Moonsinger near the entrance to Razorfen Downs."}, [10]={npc="Myriam Moonsinger", tgt="Myriam Moonsinger"}, [11]={text="Razorfen Downs entrance"}, [12]={npc="Belnistrasz", tgt="Belnistrasz", tag="Unverified", desc="Find Belnistrasz in the cells. Everyone should finish the oath before the escort. DungeonsForever map 1: Belnistrasz dialogue objective (80.20, 21.70)."}, [13]={hint="If you agree to aid Belnistrasz, speak with him again and hand the Oathstone he gave you back to him.", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: Belnistrasz dialogue objective (80.20, 21.70). Location: Find Belnistrasz in the cells near Mordresh Fire Eye. Order: The whole team must first hand over the oath stone and then pick up the escort."}, [14]={npc="Belnistrasz", tgt="Belnistrasz", tag="Unverified", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: Belnistrasz dialogue objective (80.20, 21.70)."}, [15]={npc="Belnistrasz", tgt="Belnistrasz", tag="Unverified", desc="Follow the NPC closely after starting and wait until the whole team is ready.", preText="Scourge of the Downs"}, [16]={hint="Escort Belnistrasz to the Quilboar's idol in Razorfen Downs.", desc="Location: Escort Belnistrasz from his cell to the idol and protect him."}, [17]={npc="Belnistrasz's Brazier", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: idol ritual (82.20, 19.60). Exact brazier pin unconfirmed."}, [18]={hint="Andrew Brownell wants you to kill Amnennar the Coldbringer and return his skull.", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: Amnennar the Coldbringer (45.00, 59.10). Location: Leave the cells and take the spiral ramp up to Amnennar."}, [19]={hint="Recover The Coldbringer's Eye from Razorfen Downs.", desc="Location: Find the Coldbringer's Eye in Amnennar's lair. Order: Same area as step 17."}, [20]={npc="Sutara Plainstalker", tgt="Sutara Plainstalker"}, [21]={npc="Andrew Brownell", tgt="Andrew Brownell"}, [22]={npc="Varimathras", tgt="Varimathras"}}},
    ["03-24"] = {tips={{k="取捨", text="For the first time, clear Farm, Jackal, Riverbank and Rog'mar surrounding beasts. Leave the team to do Chogg'Zac Twilight No More! and the subsequent headline. Bolder'ok's wild boar and quarry can be directly connected. For Twilight and Shore Stays above level 42, Riverglades, Bolder'ok and Powderfuse Port, the photos are taken in two runs."}, {k="取捨", text="First drive Rog'mar at this station, and travel to and from Kargath or Stonard to avoid traveling on the ground. Supplies can be found at Toka."}, {k="提醒", text="If you have not reached level 41 after completing the station quest, replenish the ordinary wild boars on the south side of Na'zok Farm (70.62, 33.08), or continue to fight in the wild beast area (about 61, 50) on the south side of Rog'mar. The advanced twilight quests of Bolder'ok remain Riverglades Bolder'ok and Powderfuse Port.", s={{"If you have not reached level 41 after completing the station quest, replenish the ordinary wild boars on the south side of Na'zok Farm (70.62, 33.08), or continue to fight in the wild beast area (about 61, 50) on the south side of Rog'mar"}, {"The advanced twilight quests of Bolder'ok remain Riverglades Bolder'ok and Powderfuse Port"}}}}, danger={[1]="South of Rog'mar are Farholde Scout and the priest. Pick up the lone scouts first to prevent the priests from entering the battle together.", [2]="Sunnyglade's Twilight Ritual Cave is narrow. Clear the cave entrance first and then dismantle the ritual circle. Don't let the Shadow Mage respawn behind it."}, grind={[1]={mob="Low Plains Buzzard", note="Rog'mar The south side of the grassland has dense database points and normal mobs. There are level 41-42 elite beasts nearby, pick one en route; replenish Feathers for Fletching feathers at the same time."}, [2]={mob="Farholde Scout", note="The Farholde Scout area south of Rog'mar has a high density and normal mobs. Watch for the priest to join the battle with other scouts, and clear out the area along the river and do Show Them How It's Done."}, [3]={mob="Farholde Priest", note="To the west of the south bank, there are medium density and ordinary spell-casting monsters. Interrupt the treatment first, don't pull the scout at the same time; make up for it when you have already left the western section of Show Them How It's Done."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Grakna"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Toka"}, [3]={npc="Gur'dok"}, [4]={npc="Naluk"}, [5]={npc="Maka"}, [6]={npc="Breyk"}, [7]={npc="Thultazor"}}, steps={[1]={node="Stonard", desc="Unlock Breyk's flight path if arriving overland. Skip if you came straight to Rog'mar."}, [2]={text="Fly from Stonard if Rog'mar is unlocked. Otherwise enter Riverglades from Swamp of Sorrows and take the southern road north past Terral's Watch (about 60, 64; video 26:56-27:13). If you flew from Hammerfall, go straight to the flight master.", tag="I haven't used this flight path yet, so I have to use the running one for the first time."}, [3]={node="Rog'mar", desc="Unlock the flight path towards Grakna."}, [4]={text="Set your hearth with Innkeeper Toka (57.58, 45.47)."}, [5]={hint="Report to Krom'rosh at the Rog'mar outpost in the Riverglades."}, [6]={hint="Find Tan'jani at Rog'mar in the Riverglades."}, [7]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh"}, [8]={npc="Tan'jani", tgt="Tan'jani"}, [9]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh"}, [10]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh"}, [11]={npc="Gur'dok", tgt="Kreza Darkthorn"}, [12]={npc="Tan'jani", tgt="Tan'jani"}, [13]={text="Southern farms and southwest gnolls"}, [14]={hint="Slay 12 Meadowsbrook Farmhands, then return to Krom'rosh with news of your success.", tag="Target: Meadowsbrook Farmhand"}, [15]={hint="Steal 6 Feed Satchels from the Alliance farm in Meadowsbrook then return to Krom'rosh."}, [16]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh"}, [17]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh"}, [18]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh"}, [19]={hint="Deliver the Stolen Feed to Gorg in Rog'mar."}, [20]={npc="Gorg", tgt="Gorg"}, [21]={npc="Gorg", tgt="Gorg"}, [22]={hint="Feed 8 Rog'mar Trainees at the training grounds.", tag="Target: Rog'mar Trainee"}, [23]={npc="Gorg", tgt="Gorg"}, [24]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh"}, [25]={hint="Slay 8 Farholde Priests and 12 Farholde Scouts south of the river.", tag="Target: Farholde Priest / Farholde Scout"}, [26]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh"}, [27]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul"}, [28]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul"}, [29]={text="Riverside lumber camps and Sunnyglade"}, [30]={hint="Retrieve 10 Woodworker's Axe from the lumberjacks at Turner's Logging Camp for Kreza Darkthorn in Rog'mar.", tag="Target: Turner's Mill Lumberjack"}, [31]={hint="Collect Wood Bundles from Peasant Woodpiles in Turner's Logging Camp then fletch them into 20 Makeshift Stickin' Spears."}, [32]={npc="Gur'dok", tgt="Kreza Darkthorn"}, [33]={npc="Gur'dok", tgt="Kreza Darkthorn", desc="After Borrowed Blades, pick up here. Save the sword for Friz in Powderfuse Port."}, [34]={npc="Tan'jani", tgt="Tan'jani"}, [35]={npc="Tan'jani", tgt="Tan'jani"}, [36]={hint="Impale 10 Freshwater Crocolisks then return to Tran'jani in Rog'mar.", tag="Target: Freshwater Crocolisk"}, [37]={npc="Tan'jani", tgt="Tan'jani"}, [38]={hint="Defeat 8 Twilight Raiders and 8 Twilight Neophytes within Sunnyglade for Tran'gul in Rog'mar.", tag="Target: Twilight Raider/Twilight Shadowmancer/Twilight Neophyte"}, [39]={hint="Retrieve 3 Twilight Missives from Twilight Shadowmancers in Sunnyglade for Tran'gul in Rog'mar.", tag="Target: Twilight Shadowmancer"}, [40]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul"}, [41]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul"}, [42]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul"}, [43]={hint="Convince a Twilight's Hammer miner in Sunnyglade to divulge their secrets."}, [44]={npc="Clubtoe", tgt="Clubtoe"}, [45]={npc="Clubtoe", tgt="Clubtoe"}, [46]={hint="Find missing ogres in the caves beneath Sunnyglade for Clubtoe."}, [47]={npc="Empowered Brute", tgt="Twilight Brute"}, [48]={npc="Empowered Brute", tgt="Twilight Brute"}, [49]={npc="Clubtoe", tgt="Clubtoe"}, [50]={hint="Kill 5 Empowered Brutes and 10 Twilight Ritualists then return to Clubtoe in Sunnyglade.", tag="Target: Empowered Brute/Twilight Ritualist"}, [51]={hint="Destroy 5 Twilight Ritual Circles found throughout the caves underneath Sunnyglade."}, [52]={npc="Clubtoe", tgt="Clubtoe"}, [53]={npc="Clubtoe", tgt="Clubtoe"}, [54]={npc="Clubtoe", tgt="Clubtoe", tag="Group, Optional"}, [55]={hint="Kill Chogg'Zac in the Sunnyglade cave and collect their heads for Clubtoe.", tag="Group, Optional, Target: Chogg'Zac", desc="Chogg'Zac is a level 41 elite in the Clearwood Caverns."}, [56]={npc="Clubtoe", tgt="Clubtoe", tag="Group, Optional"}, [57]={npc="Clubtoe", tgt="Clubtoe", tag="Group, Optional"}, [58]={hint="Deliver the head of Chogg to Tran'gul in Rog'mar.", tag="Group, Optional"}, [59]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul", tag="Group, Optional"}, [60]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul", tag="Group, Optional"}, [61]={text="Hunts around Rog'mar"}, [62]={npc="Picked Carcass", tgt="Picked Carcass", desc="Click the Gnawed Corpse on the ground among beasts to the south."}, [63]={hint="Bring the Gnawed Skull to Neza Bloodsnout at Rog'mar."}, [64]={npc="Neza Bloodsnout", tgt="Neza Bloodsnout"}, [65]={npc="Neza Bloodsnout", tgt="Neza Bloodsnout"}, [66]={hint="Bring an Intact Tallstrider Beak to Neza Bloodsnout at Rog'mar.", tag="Target: Roving Tallstrider"}, [67]={npc="Neza Bloodsnout", tgt="Neza Bloodsnout"}, [68]={npc="Neza Bloodsnout", tgt="Neza Bloodsnout"}, [69]={hint="Bring 6 Plains Buzzard Feathers to Neza Bloodsnout at Rog'mar.", tag="Target: Low Plains Buzzard"}, [70]={npc="Neza Bloodsnout", tgt="Neza Bloodsnout"}, [71]={npc="Neza Bloodsnout", tgt="Neza Bloodsnout"}, [72]={hint="Bring 4 samples of Glade Viper Venom to Neza Bloodsnout at Rog'mar.", tag="Target: Glade Viper"}, [73]={npc="Neza Bloodsnout", tgt="Neza Bloodsnout"}, [74]={npc="Neza Bloodsnout", tgt="Neza Bloodsnout"}, [75]={hint="Gather 6 Prized Lion Hides for Neza Bloodsnout at Rog'mar.", tag="Target: Wildplains Patriarch/Wildplains Huntress"}, [76]={npc="Neza Bloodsnout", tgt="Neza Bloodsnout"}, [77]={npc="Neza Bloodsnout", tgt="Neza Bloodsnout", tag="Optional", star={"Bloodsnout Striker", {"WARRIOR", "PALADIN"}}}, [78]={hint="Locate Snargl in the Bristle Hills, kill him, and retrieve his snout for Neza Bloodsnout.", tag="Optional, Target: Snargl"}, [79]={npc="Neza Bloodsnout", tgt="Neza Bloodsnout", tag="Optional", star={"Bloodsnout Striker", {"WARRIOR", "PALADIN"}}}, [80]={npc="Gur'dok", tgt="Kreza Darkthorn"}, [81]={hint="Gather 40 Stolen Ore from gnolls in the Bristle Hills for Kreza Darkthorn.", tag="Target: Redridge Brute / Redridge Mystic / Redridge Trapper"}, [82]={npc="Gur'dok", tgt="Kreza Darkthorn"}, [83]={npc="Neza Bloodsnout", tgt="Neza Bloodsnout"}, [84]={hint="Kill 8 Redridge Mystics, 8 Redridge Trappers, and 6 Redridge Brutes for Neza Bloodsnout at Rog'mar.", tag="Target: Redridge Mystic / Redridge Trapper / Redridge Brute"}, [85]={npc="Neza Bloodsnout", tgt="Neza Bloodsnout"}, [86]={text="Levels 40-41: short northern loop"}, [87]={hint="Deliver Chogg's head to the ogre city to the north.", tag="Group, Optional"}, [88]={npc="Clugfist", tgt="Clugfist", tag="Group, Optional"}, [89]={npc="Na'zok", tgt="Na'zok"}, [90]={npc="Na'zok", tgt="Na'zok"}, [91]={npc="Gorgegut", tgt="Gorgegut", desc="Also find Hamur (67.24, 21.75) for the same quest."}, [92]={hint="Gather 10 Chunks of Boar Meat for Na'zok near Bolder'ok."}, [93]={hint="Return 10 Young Paletusks to Na'zok's farm near Bolder'ok.", tag="Target: Young Paletusk", desc="Use quest items on young wild boars to drive them back to Farm."}, [94]={hint="Gather 10 Good Rocks for Hamur in Bolder'ok."}, [95]={npc="Na'zok", tgt="Na'zok"}, [96]={npc="Na'zok", tgt="Na'zok"}, [97]={npc="Hamur", tgt="Hamur"}, [98]={npc="Hamur", tgt="Hamur"}, [99]={hint="Deliver 10 Heavy Weightstones to Hamur in Bolder'ok.", desc="Bring the materials to Hamur. Craft the Heavy Weightstone or buy it from a player."}, [100]={npc="Hamur", tgt="Hamur"}, [101]={npc="Neza Bloodsnout", tgt="Neza Bloodsnout", tag="Optional"}, [102]={hint="Use the Tallstrider Call to call forth the leader of the lion pride. Slay the beast and retrieve its hide for Neza Bloodsnout at Rog'mar.", tag="Optional, Target: Ombassa", desc="Use quest props to lure out the level 41 elite Ombassa. Find teammates first."}, [103]={npc="Neza Bloodsnout", tgt="Neza Bloodsnout", tag="Optional"}, [104]={npc="Garen Largo", tgt="Garen Largo", desc="Accept in Undercity at 40, then head to the keep. Alodan also offers it (25.42, 14.71)."}, [105]={hint="Speak with Danitha Morr at Bandarion Keep.", desc="Pick it up when returning to Undercity at level 40, and then go to Bandarion Keep."}, [106]={npc="Danitha Morr", tgt="Danitha Morr", desc="Pick it up when returning to Undercity at level 40, and then go to Bandarion Keep."}, [107]={npc="Danitha Morr", tgt="Danitha Morr", desc="Pick up after Report to Danitha. Finish this chain before buying a mount if you want the Warhorse."}, [108]={hint="Speak with Danitha Morr to learn to summon your Warhorse.", desc="Pick up after Report to Danitha. Finish this chain before buying a mount if you want the Warhorse."}, [109]={npc="Danitha Morr", tgt="Danitha Morr", desc="Pick up after Report to Danitha. Finish this chain before buying a mount if you want the Warhorse."}, [110]={npc="Zevrost", tgt="Zevrost", tag="Optional"}, [111]={hint="Speak to Strahad Farsan in the Barrens.", tag="Optional"}, [112]={npc="Strahad Farsan", tgt="Strahad Farsan", tag="Optional"}, [113]={npc="Kaal Soulreaper", tgt="Kaal Soulreaper", tag="Optional"}, [114]={hint="Speak to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.", tag="Optional"}, [115]={npc="Strahad Farsan", tgt="Strahad Farsan", tag="Optional"}, [116]={npc="Strahad Farsan", tgt="Strahad Farsan", desc="Turn in the local lead-in, then pick up from Strahad."}, [117]={hint="Speak to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet to learn the ability to summon a Felsteed.", desc="Turn in the local lead-in, then pick up from Strahad."}, [118]={npc="Strahad Farsan", tgt="Strahad Farsan", desc="Turn in the local lead-in, then pick up from Strahad."}, [119]={text="Fly from Rog'mar to Kargath if unlocked. On a first visit, use the west pass north of the Twilight camp to enter Badlands, then go northwest to Kargath (video 27:55-28:03). Keep your Rog'mar hearth for the return.", tag="I haven't used this flight path yet, so I have to use the running one for the first time."}}},
    ["03-25"] = {name="Badlands: Kargath", tips={{k="取捨", text="Rock Elemental shares some strange points with Desolation Reagent Badlands Reagent Run, so connect them first and then fight. The mandible of the mountain dog costs 30, then clear it all the way, and then leave after enough."}, {k="取捨", text="Frost Oil, Gyrochronatom and potions are ready before doing Coolant Heads Prevail-Liquid Stone. Broken Alliances Stay higher or have a team."}, {k="提醒", text="The film puts the level 40 learning of riding skills in this main city transition. If you have reached 40 and have gold coins, learn it first when passing by the trainer of your clan. See \"Professional Quests\" and \"Level 40 Riding Skills of All Races\" at the end of the article.", s={{"The film puts the level 40 learning of riding skills in this main city transition"}, {"If you have reached 40 and have gold coins, learn it first when passing by the trainer of your clan"}, {"See \"Professional Quests\" and \"Level 40 Riding Skills of All Races\" at the end of the article"}}}, {k="提醒", text="If you have not reached level 42 before leaving Kargath, play ordinary Greater Rock Elemental southwest of Badlands (about 6.65, 73.85). When Rock Elemental is crowded, hunt mountain dogs along the southeast ridge of Kargath and Buzzard.", s={{"If you have not reached level 42 before leaving Kargath, play ordinary Greater Rock Elemental southwest of Badlands (about 6.65, 73.85)"}, {"When Rock Elemental is crowded, hunt mountain dogs along the southeast ridge of Kargath and Buzzard"}}}}, danger={[1]="On the east side of Badlands are the level 39-40 elite Grotto Seer and Stonevault Basher. Keep distance when passing the outer ring of Uldaman."}, grind={[1]={mob="Greater Rock Elemental", note="Kargath The southern mountain wall has high density and normal mobs. There are Fire Ogres nearby, so clear the outside along the rock wall; before level 42, if you find it difficult, go to the ridge instead."}, [2]={mob="Ridge Stalker Patriarch", note="Kargath Southeast ridge, medium density, normal mobs. Avoid elite and rare patrols, suitable for level 41 solo training or changing points when the Rock Elemental area is crowded."}, [3]={mob="Giant Buzzard", note="Kargath Southeast slope, medium density, normal mobs. Can be played in rotation with the Ridge Walker; collect it together when you have Buzzard wings or stomach pouch quests."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Gorrik"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Shul'kar"}, [3]={npc="Sranda"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Shul'kar"}, [5]={npc="Grawl"}}, steps={[1]={node="Kargath", desc="Open flight path to Gorrik."}, [2]={text="Leave to train skills or learn Riding if needed. Fly back to Kargath afterward."}, [3]={npc="Jarkal Mossmeld", tgt="Jarkal Mossmeld"}, [4]={npc="Neeka Bloodscar", tgt="Neeka Bloodscar"}, [5]={npc="Neeka Bloodscar", tgt="Neeka Bloodscar"}, [6]={npc="Gorn", tgt="Gorn", tag="Optional"}, [7]={text="Rock elementals and central mob loop"}, [8]={npc="Lotwil Veriatus", tgt="Lotwil Veriatus"}, [9]={npc="Lotwil Veriatus", tgt="Lotwil Veriatus", tag="When you have the items, Optional"}, [10]={hint="Find Frost Oil and bring it to Lotwil Veriatus in Badlands.", tag="When you have the items, Optional", desc="Get Frost Oil first, then give it to Rootwell. Turn in here. Ask an alchemist to make Frost Oil if you need it."}, [11]={npc="Lotwil Veriatus", tgt="Lotwil Veriatus", tag="When you have the items, Optional"}, [12]={npc="Lotwil Veriatus", tgt="Lotwil Veriatus", tag="When you have the items, Optional"}, [13]={hint="Bring a Gyrochronatom to Lotwil Veriatus in the Badlands.", tag="When you have the items, Optional", desc="Prepare Gyrochronatom first, and engineers can use Crafting. The pin marks the material turn-in."}, [14]={npc="Lotwil Veriatus", tgt="Lotwil Veriatus", tag="When you have the items, Optional"}, [15]={npc="Lucien Tosselwrench", tgt="Lucien Tosselwrench", tag="When you have the items, Optional"}, [16]={hint="Bring a Healing Potion and a Lesser Invisibility Potion to Lucien Tosselwrench in the Badlands.", tag="When you have the items, Optional"}, [17]={npc="Lucien Tosselwrench", tgt="Lucien Tosselwrench", tag="When you have the items, Optional"}, [18]={hint="Find 10 Small Stone Shards and bring them to Lotwil Veriatus in the Badlands."}, [19]={npc="Lotwil Veriatus", tgt="Lotwil Veriatus"}, [20]={npc="Lotwil Veriatus", tgt="Lotwil Veriatus"}, [21]={hint="Bring Fizzle's Letter to Martek the Exiled in the Badlands."}, [22]={npc="Martek the Exiled", tgt="Martek the Exiled"}, [23]={npc="Martek the Exiled", tgt="Martek the Exiled"}, [24]={npc="Rigglefuzz", tgt="Rigglefuzz"}, [25]={hint="Find Theldurin the Lost.", tag="Optional"}, [26]={npc="Theldurin the Lost", tgt="Theldurin the Lost", tag="Optional"}, [27]={npc="Theldurin the Lost", tgt="Theldurin the Lost", tag="Optional"}, [28]={hint="Bring 3 Large Stone Slabs to Lotwil Veriatus in the Badlands."}, [29]={npc="Lotwil Veriatus", tgt="Lotwil Veriatus"}, [30]={npc="Lotwil Veriatus", tgt="Lotwil Veriatus"}, [31]={hint="Bring 5 Bracers of Rock Binding to Lotwil Veriatus in the Badlands.", desc="Farm Stonebound Bracers from normal Greater Rock Elementals in the southwest."}, [32]={hint="Bring 10 Indurium Flakes to Martek the Exiled in the Badlands."}, [33]={hint="Bring 4 Buzzard Wings to Rigglefuzz."}, [34]={hint="Bring the Torn Scroll Fragment, the Crumpled Scroll Fragment and the Singed Scroll Fragment to Theldurin the Lost.", tag="Optional"}, [35]={npc="Lotwil Veriatus", tgt="Lotwil Veriatus"}, [36]={npc="Martek the Exiled", tgt="Martek the Exiled"}, [37]={npc="Rigglefuzz", tgt="Rigglefuzz"}, [38]={npc="Theldurin the Lost", tgt="Theldurin the Lost", tag="Optional"}, [39]={hint="Bring 5 Buzzard Gizzards, 10 Crag Coyote Fangs, and 5 Rock Elemental Shards to Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath, Badlands."}, [40]={hint="Bring 30 Coyote Jawbones to Neeka Bloodscar in Kargath."}, [41]={hint="Kill Boss Tho'grun and bring the Sign of the Earth to Gorn in Kargath.", tag="Group, Optional"}, [42]={npc="Jarkal Mossmeld", tgt="Jarkal Mossmeld"}, [43]={npc="Neeka Bloodscar", tgt="Neeka Bloodscar"}, [44]={npc="Gorn", tgt="Gorn", tag="Group, Optional"}, [45]={npc="Jarkal Mossmeld", tgt="Jarkal Mossmeld", tag="Only for an Uldaman run, Optional"}, [46]={text="If you know Riding, fly from Kargath to Grom'gol, then on to Booty Bay. Otherwise visit your racial riding trainer. If you're near Orgrimmar or Undercity, take the Grom'gol zeppelin."}}},
    ["05-d18"] = {name="Uldaman", entrance="Badlands Approximately 42.60, 10.80 (main entrance positioning, along the excavation site into the ground); actual door point of the back door?", pickup="Badlands Kargath goes to Uldaman; Alterac Mountains, Arathi Highlands Hammerfall to Undercity first connects to Patrick's Reclaimed Treasures. From Hammerfall or Grom Goofy Badlands Kargath, go to Jarkal Mossmeld Badlands Reagent Run→Uldaman Reagent Run, then find Rigglefuzz and Seldulin. If you reach level 35, do Tabetha first in Dustwallow Marsh [Mage only]. When you want to make a necklace, get the Broken Necklace on the first trip. hand it to Delan while traveling to and from Orgrimmar, and then get the dungeon from Kargath on the second trip.", pickupS={{"Badlands Kargath goes to Uldaman"}, {"Alterac Mountains, Arathi Highlands Hammerfall to Undercity first connects to Patrick's Reclaimed Treasures"}, {"From Hammerfall or Grom Goofy Badlands Kargath, go to Jarkal Mossmeld Badlands Reagent Run→Uldaman Reagent Run, then find Rigglefuzz and Seldulin"}, {"If you reach level 35, do Tabetha first in Dustwallow Marsh [Mage only]", {class={"MAGE"}}}, {"When you want to make a necklace, get the Broken Necklace on the first trip. hand it to Delan while traveling to and from Orgrimmar, and then get the dungeon from Kargath on the second trip"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Main entrance → Revelosh → loot the journal from the remains. Return to Kargath for the translation before the next run. Mages can reach the Obsidian Sentinel from the back door. Second dig site → Galgann → Grimlok → Archaedas → Discs of Norgannon."}, {k="取捨", text="Give priority to picking up Uldaman Reagent Run, Reclaimed Treasures, and Power Stones. When you reach 40, get the disc and the backpack. The necklace requires more than two trips, so skip it if you want to level up quickly."}, {k="說明", text="Team of five. At level 34, pick up Undercity Reclaimed Treasures first, then Badlands en route and then make the outer cave; King Qingwei recommends level 42. The front door is suitable for full cleaning and necklaces, and the back door is suitable for only the second half. To do the mage quest, go through the back door [Mage only]. Some information only marks the entrance of the hole on the ground. When looking for the door, follow the main road inside the cave.", s={{"Team of five"}, {"At level 34, pick up Undercity Reclaimed Treasures first, then Badlands en route and then make the outer cave"}, {"King Qingwei recommends level 42"}, {"The front door is suitable for full cleaning and necklaces, and the back door is suitable for only the second half"}, {"To do the mage quest, go through the back door [Mage only]"}, {"Some information only marks the entrance of the hole on the ground"}, {"When looking for the door, follow the main road inside the cave"}}}, {k="提醒", text="Team of five. At level 34, pick up Undercity Reclaimed Treasures first, then Badlands en route and then make the outer cave; King Qingwei recommends level 42. The front door is suitable for full cleaning and necklaces, and the back door is suitable for only the second half. To do the mage quest, go through the back door [Mage only]. Some information only marks the entrance of the hole on the ground. When looking for the door, follow the main road inside the cave.", s={{"Team of five"}, {"At level 34, pick up Undercity Reclaimed Treasures first, then Badlands en route and then make the outer cave"}, {"King Qingwei recommends level 42"}, {"The front door is suitable for full cleaning and necklaces, and the back door is suitable for only the second half"}, {"To do the mage quest, go through the back door [Mage only]"}, {"Some information only marks the entrance of the hole on the ground"}, {"When looking for the door, follow the main road inside the cave"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Patrick Garrett", tgt="Patrick Garrett", desc="Pick up in Undercity at level 33. The chest is outside the portal."}, [2]={npc="Rigglefuzz", tgt="Rigglefuzz", desc="Loot Power Stones from Shadowforge dwarves outside on the same trip."}, [3]={npc="Theldurin the Lost", tgt="Theldurin the Lost", desc="Seldulin is south of Badlands; pick it up after passing by."}, [4]={npc="Jarkal Mossmeld", tgt="Jarkal Mossmeld", desc="If you turned in this quest at Kargath, pick up Uldaman Reagent Run directly."}, [5]={hint="Bring 5 Buzzard Gizzards, 10 Crag Coyote Fangs, and 5 Rock Elemental Shards to Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath, Badlands."}, [6]={npc="Jarkal Mossmeld", tgt="Jarkal Mossmeld"}, [7]={npc="Jarkal Mossmeld", tgt="Jarkal Mossmeld", desc="Pick up from Jarkal in Kargath after turning in Badlands Reagent Run.", preText="Badlands Reagent Run"}, [8]={npc="Deino", tgt="Deino", desc="At 35, do this between Brackenwall and Shadowprey. Skip if turned in."}, [9]={hint="Speak with Tabetha."}, [10]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha"}, [11]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha"}, [12]={hint="Bring an Infernal Orb to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh."}, [13]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha"}, [14]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", preText="The Infernal Orb"}, [15]={hint="Kill the Demon of the Orb, then speak with Tabetha."}, [16]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha"}, [17]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", desc="Pick up after Tabetha's exorcism. Ask the group to clear the back-entrance sentinel.", preText="The Exorcism"}, [18]={hint="Get Patrick Garrett's family treasure from their family chest in the South Common Hall of Uldaman, and bring it to him in the Undercity."}, [19]={hint="Bring 8 Dentrium Power Stones and 8 An'Alleum Power Stones to Rigglefuzz in the Badlands."}, [20]={hint="Bring the Tablet of Ryun'eh to Theldurin the Lost."}, [21]={npc="Dran Droffers", tgt="Dran Droffers", desc="Optional chain. Loot a Shattered Necklace from dig site or dungeon dwarves."}, [22]={hint="Look for a valuable necklace within the Uldaman dig site and bring it back to Dran Droffers in Orgrimmar. The necklace may be damaged."}, [23]={npc="Dran Droffers", tgt="Dran Droffers"}, [24]={npc="Dran Droffers", tgt="Dran Droffers", desc="Skip this chain if running Uldaman once. Pick up from Dran after turning in Necklace Recovery.", preText="Necklace Recovery"}, [25]={text="Uldaman entrance"}, [26]={hint="Bring 12 Magenta Fungus Caps to Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath.", desc="The pin marks Magenta Cap Clusters outside the portal. Location: Gather mushrooms outside the main door, then finish along the excavation tunnels."}, [27]={hint="Retrieve an Obsidian Power Source and bring it to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.", desc="DungeonsForever dungeon map available in Obsidian Sentinel (1st map 28.80, 61.80). Location: Take the back entrance. The Obsidian Sentinel is nearby."}, [28]={hint="Find a clue as to the gems' whereabouts in the depths of Uldaman.", desc="Map 1: Remains of a Paladin (54.20, 63.20), also the Translating the Journal pickup. Location: Take the main entrance. Find the body in the room past Revelosh. Order: After completion, go to steps 30 and 33."}, [29]={npc="Remains of a Paladin", tgt="Remains of a Paladin", tag="Unverified", desc="Map 1: Remains of a Paladin (54.20, 63.20), also the Translating the Journal pickup."}, [30]={npc="Remains of a Paladin", tgt="Remains of a Paladin", tag="Unverified", desc="Pick up the diary at the corpse and return to Kargath to unlock the next trip. DungeonsForever map 1: Remains of a Paladin (54.20, 63.20).", preText="Necklace Recovery, Take 2"}, [31]={hint="Find someone who can translate the paladin's journal. The closest location that might have someone is Kargath, in the Badlands."}, [32]={npc="Jarkal Mossmeld", tgt="Jarkal Mossmeld"}, [33]={npc="Jarkal Mossmeld", tgt="Jarkal Mossmeld", preText="Translating the Journal"}, [34]={hint="Let Jarkal borrow the necklace. In exchange, he will translate the journal for you."}, [35]={npc="Jarkal Mossmeld", tgt="Jarkal Mossmeld"}, [36]={npc="Jarkal Mossmeld", tgt="Jarkal Mossmeld", desc="Kargath will be picked up after getting the translation; be cleared on the second trip.", preText="Translating the Journal"}, [37]={hint="Recover all three gems and a power source for the necklace from Uldaman, and then bring them to Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath. Jarkal believes a power source might be found on the strongest construct present in Uldaman.", desc="Location: Check the second dig site's urn, then Galgann, Grimlok and the final boss. Order: Take the topaz first, then the red and sapphire, and finally the energy source."}, [38]={npc="The Discs of Norgannon", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="For level 40 and above, kill Archaedas and click The Discs of Norgannon in the end room. DungeonsForever map 1: Discs of Norgannon (38.60, 5.50)."}, [39]={hint="Speak with stone watcher and learn what ancient lore it keeps. Once you have learned what lore it has to offer, activate the Discs of Norgannon.", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: Discs of Norgannon (38.60, 5.50). Location: Kill Archaedas and use the Discs of Norgannon in the vault behind him. Order: Listen to the Stone Keeper first, then order the disk."}, [40]={npc="The Discs of Norgannon", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="DungeonsForever map 1: Discs of Norgannon (38.60, 5.50)."}, [41]={npc="The Discs of Norgannon", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Receive and send items on the same disk and return Thunder Bluff. DungeonsForever map 1: Discs of Norgannon (38.60, 5.50), also used in The Platinum Discs.", preText="The Platinum Discs"}, [42]={npc="Jarkal Mossmeld", tgt="Jarkal Mossmeld"}, [43]={npc="Rigglefuzz", tgt="Rigglefuzz"}, [44]={npc="Theldurin the Lost", tgt="Theldurin the Lost"}, [45]={npc="Patrick Garrett", tgt="Patrick Garrett"}, [46]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha"}, [47]={hint="Take the miniature version of the Discs of Norgannon to the one of the sages in Thunder Bluff."}, [48]={npc="Sage Truthseeker", tgt="Sage Truthseeker"}, [49]={npc="Jarkal Mossmeld", tgt="Jarkal Mossmeld"}, [50]={npc="Jarkal Mossmeld", tgt="Jarkal Mossmeld", preText="Find the Gems and Power Source"}, [51]={hint="Deliver the Necklace and Gem Salvage to Dran Droffers in Orgrimmar."}, [52]={npc="Dran Droffers", tgt="Dran Droffers"}, [53]={npc="Dran Droffers", tgt="Dran Droffers", preText="Deliver the Gems"}, [54]={hint="Visit Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath to see if he was successful."}, [55]={npc="Jarkal Mossmeld", tgt="Jarkal Mossmeld"}}},
    ["03-26"] = {name="Stranglethorn Vale", tips={{k="取捨", text="On your second Booty Bay visit, turn in Sunken Treasure, Venture Company Mining, and Excelsior. Do Bloodsail The Bloodsail Buccaneers → The Bloodsail Buccaneers → The Bloodsail Buccaneers near shore, then pair The Bloodsail Buccaneers with Keep An Eye Out and Up to Snuff. Turn in The Bloodsail Buccaneers before accepting The Bloodsail Buccaneers for the three captains. Finish Scaring Shaky → Return to MacKinley to unlock Voodoo Dues."}, {k="取捨", text="First pick up Cortello's Riddle (Cortello's Riddle) on the blood sailboat, and then pick up the first section at Swamp of Sorrows Stonard. If Excelsior and Venture Company Mining are not finished, make up for them en route to avoid having to fly again for a single piece. Deal with the Voodoo Dues on shore first before boarding the ship."}, {k="提醒", text="Stranglethorn Vale Booty Bay to Riverglades Bolder'ok and Powderfuse Port can be trained to a total of 45. If you want to gain a little experience at this station first, after collecting the three ships with blood sails, hit the ordinary The Bloodsail Buccaneers on the shore (about 32, 79).", s={{"Stranglethorn Vale Booty Bay to Riverglades Bolder'ok and Powderfuse Port can be trained to a total of 45"}, {"If you want to gain a little experience at this station first, after collecting the three ships with blood sails, hit the ordinary The Bloodsail Buccaneers on the shore (about 32, 79)"}}}}, danger={[1]="There are many types of trolls in Mosh'og Hills and some are elite. When playing The Offense of Grom'gol, pull from the bottom of the mountain to avoid entering the camp at once.", [2]="The stairs on the Blood Sailboat are narrow and there are few exits. Before boarding the ship, clear the shore and clear it layer by layer before disembarking."}, grind={[1]={mob="Bloodsail Swashbuckler", note="Booty Bay Outer beach, high density, normal mobs. Clear the shore first, and pay attention to other players who are also solving the blood sail quest; after completing the ship line, gain experience nearby."}, [2]={mob="Bloodsail Warlock", note="On the south bank of the Blood Sail, there are high density of ordinary spell-casting monsters. Clear the melee group first, then recruit the warlock; cycling on shore can save time on boarding the ship."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Gringer"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Skindle"}, [3]={npc="Jutak"}, [4]={npc="Nixxrax Fillamug"}, [5]={npc="Haren Kanmae"}, [6]={npc="Thysta"}, [7]={npc="Innkeeper Thulbek"}, [8]={npc="Krakk"}, [9]={npc="Nargatt"}}, steps={[1]={text="On arrival at Grom'gol, fly to Booty Bay for the next quest batch. Pick up camp quests first if you started nearby."}, [2]={hint="Take the Sample Elven Gem to Fleet Master Seahorn in Booty Bay."}, [3]={npc="Fleet Master Seahorn", tgt="Fleet Master Seahorn"}, [4]={npc="Fleet Master Seahorn", tgt="Fleet Master Seahorn", tag="Later, on the way, Optional"}, [5]={npc="First Mate Crazz", tgt="First Mate Crazz"}, [6]={npc="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley", tgt="Sea Wolf MacKinley"}, [7]={npc="Privateer Bloads", tgt="Privateer Bloads"}, [8]={npc="Crank Fizzlebub", tgt="Crank Fizzlebub"}, [9]={npc="Kebok", tgt="Kebok"}, [10]={npc="Drizzlik", tgt="Drizzlik"}, [11]={npc="Drizzlik", tgt="Drizzlik"}, [12]={npc="Wharfmaster Lozgil", tgt="Wharfmaster Lozgil", tag="Requires the Zul'Kunda escort, Optional"}, [13]={npc="Krazek", tgt="Krazek", tag="Do at Stonard in Swamp of Sorrows, Optional", desc="Do Parts for Kravel in Ratchet and Delivery to the Gnomes at the Shimmering Flats, then turn in The Rumormonger in Booty Bay."}, [14]={text="Scout the north beach, then unlock the Bloodsail quests in Booty Bay"}, [15]={hint="First Mate Crazz wants you to check the cove north of Booty Bay."}, [16]={npc="Bloodsail Correspondence", npcObj=true}, [17]={npc="Bloodsail Correspondence", npcObj=true}, [18]={hint="Report your findings to First Mate Crazz in Booty Bay."}, [19]={npc="First Mate Crazz", tgt="First Mate Crazz"}, [20]={npc="First Mate Crazz", tgt="First Mate Crazz"}, [21]={hint="Report the planned Bloodsail attack to Fleet Master Seahorn."}, [22]={npc="Fleet Master Seahorn", tgt="Fleet Master Seahorn"}, [23]={npc="Fleet Master Seahorn", tgt="Fleet Master Seahorn"}, [24]={npc="Dizzy One-Eye", tgt="Dizzy One-Eye"}, [25]={npc="Deeg", tgt="Deeg"}, [26]={text="For the extra camp quests, fly from Booty Bay to Grom'gol and clear south toward the port."}, [27]={hint="Take the Defiant Orc Head to Kin'weelay in the Grom'gol Base Camp in Stranglethorn Vale.", tag="Optional"}, [28]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay", tag="Optional"}, [29]={npc="Bubbling Cauldron", npcObj=true, tag="Turn in on your Dustwallow return, Optional"}, [30]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay", tag="Requires Bloody Bone Necklaces and The Vile Reef"}, [31]={npc="Bubbling Cauldron", npcObj=true}, [32]={npc="Hemet Nesingwary", tgt="Hemet Nesingwary"}, [33]={npc="Commander Aggro'gosh", tgt="Commander Aggro'gosh", tag="Optional"}, [34]={hint="Hemet Nesingwary wants you to kill 10 Jungle Stalkers."}, [35]={hint="Bring 10 Jungle Stalker Feathers to Far Seer Mok'thardin at the Grom'gol base camp.", tag="Do alongside Raptor Mastery"}, [36]={npc="Hemet Nesingwary", tgt="Hemet Nesingwary"}, [37]={npc="Far Seer Mok'thardin", tgt="Far Seer Mok'thardin", tag="Do alongside Raptor Mastery"}, [38]={npc="Hemet Nesingwary", tgt="Hemet Nesingwary", tag="Group or solo, Optional"}, [39]={hint="Hemet Nesingwary wants you to kill Tethis, an elusive, dangerous raptor in Stranglethorn.", tag="Group or solo, Optional"}, [40]={npc="Hemet Nesingwary", tgt="Hemet Nesingwary", tag="Group or solo, Optional"}, [41]={npc="Hemet Nesingwary", tgt="Hemet Nesingwary", tag="Group or solo, Optional", star={"Master Hunter's Bow / Master Hunter's Rifle"}}, [42]={hint="Hemet Nesingwary wants you to bring him the head of King Bangalash, the great white tiger.", tag="Group or solo, Optional"}, [43]={npc="Hemet Nesingwary", tgt="Hemet Nesingwary", tag="Group or solo, Optional", star={"Master Hunter's Bow / Master Hunter's Rifle"}}, [44]={hint="Commander Aggro'gosh of the Grom'gol base camp wants you to kill ogres at the Mosh'Ogg Ogre Mount.", tag="Optional", desc="The four targets of Mosh'Og are all elite, and they can only be cleared by teaming up."}, [45]={hint="Bring 25 Split Bone Necklaces to Kin'weelay at the Grom'gol Base camp."}, [46]={hint="Bring a Balia'mah Trophy, a Ziata'jai Trophy and a Zul'Mamwe Trophy to the Bubbling Cauldron at the Grom'gol Base Camp."}, [47]={npc="Commander Aggro'gosh", tgt="Commander Aggro'gosh", tag="Optional"}, [48]={npc="Kin'weelay", tgt="Kin'weelay"}, [49]={npc="Bubbling Cauldron", npcObj=true}, [50]={text="Pickups in central and southern Stranglethorn → Bloodsail Compound"}, [51]={hint="Acquire 18 Skullsplitter Tusks and return them to Kebok."}, [52]={hint="Bring 10 Singing Blue Crystals to Crank Fizzlebub in Booty Bay."}, [53]={hint="Bring an Elder Crocolisk Skin to Drizzlik in Booty Bay."}, [54]={hint="Bring 10 Bundles of Akiris Reed to Privateer Bloads in Booty Bay.", tag="Target: Naga Explorer / Brinescale Skirmisher"}, [55]={hint="Bring 12 samples of Zanzil's Mixture to Crank Fizzlebub in Booty Bay."}, [56]={hint="Bring 5 Mistvale Giblets to \"Shaky\" Phillipe in Booty Bay."}, [57]={hint="Fleet Master Seahorn in Booty Bay wants you to kill 10 Bloodsail Swashbucklers and bring back the Bloodsail Charts and the Bloodsail Orders."}, [58]={hint="Dizzy One-Eye in Booty Bay wants you to retrieve his eye from the Bloodsail Buccaneers."}, [59]={hint="Deeg in Booty Bay wants you to bring him 15 shares of Snuff."}, [60]={npc="Kebok", tgt="Kebok"}, [61]={npc="Crank Fizzlebub", tgt="Crank Fizzlebub"}, [62]={npc="Drizzlik", tgt="Drizzlik"}, [63]={npc="Privateer Bloads", tgt="Privateer Bloads"}, [64]={npc="Crank Fizzlebub", tgt="Crank Fizzlebub"}, [65]={npc="\"Shaky\" Phillipe", tgt="Shaky Phillipe"}, [66]={npc="\"Shaky\" Phillipe", tgt="Shaky Phillipe"}, [67]={hint="Bring Shaky's Payment to \"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley."}, [68]={npc="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley", tgt="Sea Wolf MacKinley"}, [69]={npc="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley", tgt="Sea Wolf MacKinley"}, [70]={npc="Fleet Master Seahorn", tgt="Fleet Master Seahorn"}, [71]={npc="Dizzy One-Eye", tgt="Dizzy One-Eye"}, [72]={npc="Deeg", tgt="Deeg"}, [73]={npc="Fleet Master Seahorn", tgt="Fleet Master Seahorn"}, [74]={text="Final loop: board the ships and collect debts"}, [75]={hint="Bring Maury's Clubbed Foot, Jon-Jon's Golden Spyglass, and Chucky's Huge Ring to \"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley in Booty Bay."}, [76]={hint="Fleet-Master Seahorn in Booty Bay wants you to kill Captain Stillwater, Captain Keelhaul and Fleet Master Firallon."}, [77]={npc="Cortello's Riddle", npcObj=true, desc="Start from the puzzle item on the Bloodsail ship. Turn in under the Swamp bridge."}, [78]={npc="Fleet Master Seahorn", tgt="Fleet Master Seahorn"}, [79]={npc="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley", tgt="Sea Wolf MacKinley"}, [80]={npc="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley", tgt="Sea Wolf MacKinley", tag="Optional"}, [81]={hint="Bring Maury's Key to \"Sea Wolf\" Mackinley in Booty Bay.", tag="Optional"}, [82]={npc="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley", tgt="Sea Wolf MacKinley", tag="Optional"}, [83]={text="After the Bloodsail and debt quests, fly to Stonard from Booty Bay or Grom'gol. If locked, fly to Grom'gol and take the road through eastern Duskwood and Deadwind Pass."}}},
    ["03-27"] = {name="Swamp of Sorrows: Stonard", short="Stonard", tips={{k="取捨", text="Galen's Escape is the escort mentioned in the video. clear the monsters en route and then unlock the cage. The items are delivered in the safe and do not need to be returned to the safe."}, {k="取捨", text="Lack of Surplus →Lack of Surplus, Threat From the Sea →Threat From the Sea→1427→Continued Threat, Fresh Meat Return visit to the East Coast after level 47. South Seas The film only goes to this area at about 30:50."}, {k="提醒", text="After delivering the Kotello Scroll on the west side, go to The Harborage, and collect the two lost branch lines together with the crystal quest. If you want to replenish a small amount of experience, fight the ordinary swamp monsters in the outer circle of Pool of Tears (about 60, 55), or go to the east wind coast at the next stop to replenish it.", s={{"After delivering the Kotello Scroll on the west side, go to The Harborage, and collect the two lost branch lines together with the crystal quest"}, {"If you want to replenish a small amount of experience, fight the ordinary swamp monsters in the outer circle of Pool of Tears (about 60, 55), or go to the east wind coast at the next stop to replenish it"}}}}, danger={[1]="Before looking for Galin, clear the cage and the camp exit. It is easy to not take care of the escort and your own health when you pull the monster after opening the cage."}, grind={[1]={mob="Wyrmkin Dreamwalker", note="Pool of Tears In the northern outer circle, the density is medium and normal mobs. Pull it from the land side to avoid being led to Green Wyrmkin in the same area; it is close to the original route, suitable for short-term monster replenishment."}, [2]={mob="Marsh Inkspewer", note="Stonard The southeastern murloc area has medium density and normal mobs. Pick the lone murloc outside the camp first to avoid chasing monsters from the same group. It is suitable for levels 42-43."}, [3]={mob="Marsh Flesheater", note="On the southern edge of the same fish-man area, there are medium density and normal mobs. Pay attention to the higher-level Oracles in the same area. Before level 44, take turns with the Inkjet Murlocs."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Breyk"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Karakul"}, [3]={npc="Gharash"}, [4]={npc="Thultash"}, [5]={npc="Thultazor"}}, steps={[1]={text="Check that Breyk's Stonard flight path is unlocked (46.07, 54.83)."}, [2]={hint="Bring Neeka's Report to Helgrum the Swift in Stonard."}, [3]={npc="Helgrum the Swift", tgt="Helgrum the Swift"}, [4]={npc="Fel'zerul", tgt="Fel'zerul"}, [5]={text="Under the west bridge and at the Harborage"}, [6]={hint="Solve the riddle!"}, [7]={npc="A Soggy Scroll", npcObj=true}, [8]={npc="A Soggy Scroll", npcObj=true, tag="Later, on the way"}, [9]={npc="Magtoor", tgt="Magtoor"}, [10]={npc="Karana", tgt="Karana"}, [11]={npc="Pelluk", tgt="Pelluk"}, [12]={hint="Bring 10 Specks of Dream Dust to Krazek in Booty Bay. Dream Dust is gathered from the dragon whelps of the Swamp of Sorrows.", tag="Optional"}, [13]={hint="Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring a Draenethyst Shard to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village in Desolace.", tag="Optional"}, [14]={hint="Slay 10 Lost Ones in the Fallow Sanctuary."}, [15]={hint="Find the Lost One Fisherman who stole Pelluk's lure, and take it back."}, [16]={hint="Bring 6 Draenethyst crystals to Magtoor at The Harborage in the Swamp of Sorrows."}, [17]={npc="Noboru's Cudgel", npcObj=true, tag="If it drops, Optional", desc="After killing the patrolling Nobolu, click on the dropped stick to accept the quest."}, [18]={hint="Bring Noboru's Cudgel to the leader of The Harborage in the Swamp of Sorrows.", tag="If it drops, Optional"}, [19]={npc="Magtoor", tgt="Magtoor", tag="If it drops, Optional"}, [20]={text="Northeast escort and Pool of Tears"}, [21]={npc="Galen Goodward", tgt="Galen Goodward"}, [22]={hint="Escort Galen out of danger, then find his camp in the Swamp of Sorrows and open his strongbox.", desc="Clear the cage and exit. Escort Galen and turn in at the safe at the end."}, [23]={npc="Galen's Strongbox", npcObj=true}, [24]={npc="Magtoor", tgt="Magtoor"}, [25]={npc="Karana", tgt="Karana"}, [26]={npc="Pelluk", tgt="Pelluk"}, [27]={hint="Fel'zerul in Stonard wants you to gather 10 Atal'ai Artifacts."}, [28]={npc="Fel'zerul", tgt="Fel'zerul"}, [29]={npc="Fel'zerul", tgt="Fel'zerul", tag="Do with Sunken Temple, Optional"}, [30]={npc="Owen Thadd", tgt="Owen Thadd", tag="Optional", desc="Return to the Library once you have all the outdoor and dungeon materials."}, [31]={hint="Track down and collect the spellbook materials requested by the librarian.", tag="Optional", desc="Return to the Library once you have all the outdoor and dungeon materials."}, [32]={npc="Owen Thadd", tgt="Owen Thadd", tag="Optional", desc="Return to the Library once you have all the outdoor and dungeon materials."}, [33]={text="Fly from Stonard to Rog'mar in Riverglades. Joining midway without the flight path? Run there by road and unlock it on arrival."}}},
    ["03-28"] = {tips={{k="取捨", text="The entire northern line and Twilight's Shroud are optional. Characters who have completed Twilight No More can return to Bolder'ok first, hand in Clugfist's Decree, and then pick up The Wayward Warrior at Rog'mar. Powderfuse Port For the first time, the pirates took away the smuggled goods. For the second time, they collected the gunpowder barrels and killed the bombardiers and sent the smuggling express. After delivering the goods, they went out to sea to blow up the ship. The sea monster line needs to go around the cave, only if you are inexperienced and the NPC provides a quest."}, {k="提醒", text="If you have less than 45, fight Eastsea Buccaneer and the Musketeers along the east wind coast (approximately 84, 35-43), and supplies can be found near the port. If there is a team at level 40-45, play Krol'dok Stronghold (Krol'dok Stronghold), and first receive Rog'mar's Eye of Mugg/Tome of Twilight.", s={{"If you have less than 45, fight Eastsea Buccaneer and the Musketeers along the east wind coast (approximately 84, 35-43), and supplies can be found near the port"}, {"If there is a team at level 40-45, play Krol'dok Stronghold (Krol'dok Stronghold), and first receive Rog'mar's Eye of Mugg/Tome of Twilight"}}}, {k="交通", text="After reaching level 45, take the neutral ship at Powderfuse Port Pier (80.60, 54.60) to Tanaris Steamwheedle Port (68.60, 23.00), and then go to Gadgetzan. If you want to stay at Eastern Kingdoms, return to Rog'mar flight path en route. Tribe characters arriving from Tanaris must also go to the flight path Rog'mar by land."}}, danger={[1]="Scoutmaster Vargas is elite. After forming a team and then getting closer, separate the surrounding patrols first.", [2]="Eastwind Shore's Musketeers tend to join the fight from a distance. When clearing out pirates, they pull out along the beach and clear the way to the ship before blowing up the ship."}, grind={[1]={mob="Eastsea Buccaneer", note="Powderfuse Port On the north side of the Dongfeng Coast, there are dense database points and normal mobs. Mix with the Musketeers and pull each one along the beach; can be completed Unfriendly Competition."}, [2]={mob="Eastsea Musketeer", note="In the middle section of the Dongfeng Coast, there are dense database points and common ranged monsters. Intersect with pirates and use the terrain to pull to the shore in melee combat; suitable for reaching level 45."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Grakna"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Zizplink"}, [3]={npc="Mika Darby"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Zizplink"}, [5]={npc="Grizzek"}, [6]={npc="Krikshank"}}, steps={[1]={text="Take the north loop to Clugfist only after turning in Twilight No More! and taking Land of Giants. Return to Rog'mar with Clugfist's Decree before heading west to Twilight's Shroud. If skipping the chain, go east from Rog'mar to Powderfuse Port.", tag="Optional"}, [2]={npc="Clugfist", tgt="Clugfist", tag="Requires the northern prereq, Optional"}, [3]={npc="Clugfist", tgt="Clugfist", tag="Requires the northern prereq, Optional"}, [4]={hint="Kill 7 Twilight Maulers and 7 Twilight Firecallers for Clugfist in Bolder'ok.", tag="Requires the northern prereq, Optional, Target: Twilight Mauler/Twilight Firecaller"}, [5]={hint="Collect Skullthumper from Klunk for Clugfist in Bolder'ok.", tag="Requires the northern prereq, Optional, Target: Klunk"}, [6]={npc="Jom-jom", tgt="Jom-jom", tag="If passing by, Optional"}, [7]={hint="Escort Jom-jom to Clugfist at Bolder'ok.", tag="If passing by, Optional"}, [8]={npc="Clugfist", tgt="Clugfist", tag="If passing by, Optional"}, [9]={npc="Clugfist", tgt="Clugfist", tag="Requires the northern prereq, Optional"}, [10]={npc="Clugfist", tgt="Clugfist", tag="Requires the northern prereq, Optional"}, [11]={npc="Clugfist", tgt="Clugfist", tag="Requires the northern prereq, Optional"}, [12]={hint="Report to Krom'rosh in Rog'mar.", tag="Requires the northern prereq, Optional"}, [13]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh", tag="Requires the northern prereq, Optional"}, [14]={text="Twilight camp west of Rog'mar"}, [15]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh", tag="Optional"}, [16]={hint="Find Da'grosh in the hills west of Rog'mar.", tag="Optional"}, [17]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh", tag="Optional"}, [18]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh", tag="Optional"}, [19]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh", tag="Optional"}, [20]={hint="Defeat 8 Twilight Fanatics, 8 Twilight Corrupters, and 8 Twilight Champions within the Twilight's Shroud for Da'grosh.", tag="Target: Twilight Fanatic/Twilight Corrupter/Twilight Champion, Optional"}, [21]={hint="Rescue 5 Rog'mar Scouts within the Twilight's Shroud for Da'grosh.", tag="Target: Rog'mar Scout, Optional", desc="Loot five keys from Twilight cultists. Free five Rog'mar Scouts from their cages."}, [22]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh", tag="Optional"}, [23]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh", tag="Optional"}, [24]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh", tag="Hard, Optional"}, [25]={hint="Defeat Overlord Kilgar within the Twilight's Shroud and bring his head to Da'grosh.", tag="Hard, Optional, Target: Overlord Kilgar"}, [26]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh", tag="Hard, Optional"}, [27]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh", tag="Optional"}, [28]={hint="Deliver the missive to Krom'rosh at Rog'mar.", tag="Optional"}, [29]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh", tag="Optional"}, [30]={text="Optional group quest: Scoutmaster Vargas"}, [31]={npc="Wanted", npcObj=true, tag="Group, Optional, Unverified"}, [32]={hint="Bring the Scoutmaster's Eye to Neza Bloodsnout in Rog'mar.", tag="Group, Optional, Target: Scoutmaster Vargas /Scout Reynolds", desc="Group up for the elite scoutmaster. Bring the evidence back to Rog'mar."}, [33]={npc="Neza Bloodsnout", tgt="Neza Bloodsnout", tag="Group, Optional"}, [34]={text="South of Powderfuse Port → port pickups → Eastwind Shore"}, [35]={npc="Painted Hide", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Optional detour to the sea monster's cave near the keep. Accept if time allows."}, [36]={hint="Find someone at Powderfuse Port who can identify the monster from the painted hide.", tag="Optional"}, [37]={npc="Trapclaw", tgt="Argo Brinewhistle", tag="Optional"}, [38]={npc="Trapclaw", tgt="Argo Brinewhistle", tag="Optional", desc="Optional detour to the sea monster's cave near the keep. Accept if time allows."}, [39]={hint="Deliver the Twice Reordered Package to Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz at Powderfuse Port in the Riverglades.", tag="Optional"}, [40]={npc="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz", tgt="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz", tag="Optional"}, [41]={hint="Deliver the blade to Kreza Darkthorn's acquaintance at the docks east of Rog'mar."}, [42]={npc="Friz Frazzlespark", tgt="Friz Frazzlespark"}, [43]={npc="Friz Frazzlespark", tgt="Friz Frazzlespark", desc="Horde: take the Rog'mar sword chain. If Friz has no quest, start at the docks."}, [44]={npc="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz", tgt="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz"}, [45]={npc="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz", tgt="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz"}, [46]={npc="Fimbo Greasemitz", tgt="Fimbo Greasemitz"}, [47]={npc="WANTED!", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified"}, [48]={hint="Kill 8 Murloc Oracles and 8 Murloc Warriors along the Eastwind Shore.", tag="Target: Murloc Warrior / Murloc Oracle"}, [49]={hint="Gather 12 Murloc Eyes and 6 pieces of Sand Crawler Meat for Fimbo Greasemitz.", tag="Target: Murloc Oracle / Murloc Tideskimmer /Murloc Raider/ Sand Crawler /Shore Crawler"}, [50]={hint="Bring Trapclaw's Pincer to Fimbo Greasemitz.", tag="Target: Trapclaw"}, [51]={hint="Kill 10 Eastsea Buccaneers and 10 Eastsea Musketeers along the Eastwind Shore, north of Powderfuse Port.", tag="Target: Eastsea Buccaneer / Eastsea Musketeer"}, [52]={hint="Collect 8 Smuggled Goods for Friz Frazzlespark at Powderfuse Port."}, [53]={npc="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz", tgt="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz"}, [54]={npc="Fimbo Greasemitz", tgt="Fimbo Greasemitz"}, [55]={npc="Fimbo Greasemitz", tgt="Fimbo Greasemitz"}, [56]={npc="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz", tgt="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz"}, [57]={npc="Friz Frazzlespark", tgt="Friz Frazzlespark"}, [58]={npc="Friz Frazzlespark", tgt="Friz Frazzlespark"}, [59]={npc="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz", tgt="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz"}, [60]={npc="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz", tgt="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz"}, [61]={hint="Steal 5 Eastsea Powder Kegs for Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz."}, [62]={hint="Kill 8 Eastsea Raiders and 8 Eastsea Bombardiers for Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz."}, [63]={hint="Collect 15 Beast Entrails and 8 Rotflesh Mushrooms for Argo Brinewhistle.", tag="Optional", desc="First pin: adult boars. Second: cave entrance. Ogres inside."}, [64]={hint="Deliver The Friz Special to Captain Bentcoin in Eastwind Shore."}, [65]={npc="Captain Haynes", tgt="Captain Bentcoin"}, [66]={npc="Trapclaw", tgt="Argo Brinewhistle", tag="Optional"}, [67]={npc="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz", tgt="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz"}, [68]={npc="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz", tgt="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz"}, [69]={npc="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz", tgt="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz", desc="Turn in the powder keg and Unchecked Expansion together, then take the ship quest."}, [70]={hint="Plant a remote explosive charge on each of the Eastsea's three boats.", desc="Bring the explosives given in quest to the three pirate ships and place one on each ship. Pins mark shore mobs. On each ship, look for cannonballs beside the cannon one deck down."}, [71]={npc="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz", tgt="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz"}, [72]={npc="Trapclaw", tgt="Argo Brinewhistle", tag="Optional"}, [73]={hint="Use the Big Ball o' Bait to lure out the sea monster. Then, bring its head to Argo Brinewhistle.", tag="Target: Monstrous Threshadon, Optional", desc="Use the bait by the sunken wreck at Murloc Island. Kill the summon and loot its head."}, [74]={npc="Trapclaw", tgt="Argo Brinewhistle", tag="Optional"}, [75]={text="Optional dungeon: Krol'dok Stronghold"}, [76]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh", tag="Group only, Optional"}, [77]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul", tag="Group only, Optional"}, [78]={hint="Infiltrate Krol'dok Stronghold and return to Krom'rosh with proof of their leader's demise.", tag="Group only, Optional", desc="Pin marks Krol'dok Stronghold's entrance. Overlord's indoor coords unknown."}, [79]={hint="Recover the Tome of Twilight from Krol'dok Stronghold.", tag="Group only, Optional", desc="Pin marks Krol'dok Stronghold's entrance. Nar'gurk drops the book. Indoor coords unknown."}, [80]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh", tag="Group only, Optional"}, [81]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul", tag="Group only, Optional"}, [82]={npc="Fahrad", tgt="Fahrad", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Level 45 solo instance. Pick up when the estate offers it."}, [83]={hint="Speak to Fahrad when you're ready to hear his plan.", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Level 45 solo instance. Pick up when the estate offers it."}, [84]={npc="Fahrad", tgt="Fahrad", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Level 45 solo instance. Pick up when the estate offers it."}, [85]={npc="Fahrad", tgt="Fahrad", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Requires 45; quest level 50. Run the dungeon after reaching Tanaris."}, [86]={hint="Find The Talisman of Kazdor inside of Zul'Farrak. Then, bring it to Fahrad at Ravenholdt Manor. You must complete the job alone.", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Requires 45; quest level 50. Run the dungeon after reaching Tanaris. The pin marks Zul'Farrak's entrance. Interior target coordinates are unknown."}, [87]={npc="Fahrad", tgt="Fahrad", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Requires 45; quest level 50. Run the dungeon after reaching Tanaris."}, [88]={hint="Collect 5 Twisted Fire Totems, 5 Twisted Earth Totems, 5 Twisted Air Totems, and 5 Twisted Water Totems for Prate Cloudseer in Thousand Needles.", tag="Optional", desc="Fire: Badlands. Earth: Swamp of Sorrows. Wind: Desolace. Water: Dustwallow. Turn in at 1K."}, [89]={npc="Prate Cloudseer", tgt="Prate Cloudseer", tag="Optional", desc="Fire: Badlands. Earth: Swamp. Wind: Desolace. Water: Dustwallow. Check log for turn-in."}, [90]={npc="Rau Cliffrunner", tgt="Rau Cliffrunner", tag="Optional", desc="Finish all four corrupted totems. Watch for quilboar after triggering the steam pools."}, [91]={hint="Use the Twisted Totems to put an end to the quilboar ritual.", tag="Optional, Target: Ravaging Tempest", desc="Finish all four corrupted totems. Watch for quilboar after triggering the steam pools."}, [92]={npc="Rau Cliffrunner", tgt="Rau Cliffrunner", tag="Optional", desc="Finish all four corrupted totems. Watch for quilboar after triggering the steam pools."}, [93]={npc="Rau Cliffrunner", tgt="Rau Cliffrunner", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Heed My Call of Freewind Post needs to be completed first.", star={"Rage of the Storm / Lightning's Grasp / Tidebringer's Claw"}}, [94]={hint="Deliver the Eye of the Tempest to Bath'rah the Windwatcher in Alterac Mountains.", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Heed My Call of Freewind Post needs to be completed first."}, [95]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Heed My Call of Freewind Post needs to be completed first.", star={"Rage of the Storm / Lightning's Grasp / Tidebringer's Claw"}}}},
    ["05-d19"] = {name="Krol'dok Stronghold", entrance="Riverglades 48.60, 26.30", pickup="Go to Riverglades Rog'mar, first make the Sunnyglade and Clubtoe chains of Tran'gul, run the Clugfist frontend of Bolder'ok; then go west from Rog'mar to Twilight Base Camp to find Da'grosh and Crag'rog, and return Rog'mar Hand in the letter and then receive the eye and the book. Fly Rog'mar or walk from Kargath into the river forest and look for the door at The Uplands due north of Sunnyglade. Thick Leather ×4 and Iron Bar ×12 can be prepared for molding later.", pickupS={{"Go to Riverglades Rog'mar, first make the Sunnyglade and Clubtoe chains of Tran'gul, run the Clugfist frontend of Bolder'ok; then go west from Rog'mar to Twilight Base Camp to find Da'grosh and Crag'rog, and return Rog'mar Hand in the letter and then receive the eye and the book"}, {"Fly Rog'mar or walk from Kargath into the river forest and look for the door at The Uplands due north of Sunnyglade"}, {"Thick Leather ×4 and Iron Bar ×12 can be prepared for molding later"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Mine: Slavecrusher Grox → Twilight Commander Zarmok → moulding in Ashka's smithy → Nar'gurk for Tome of Twilight → Bossman Toof at the bridge → Overlord Mugg for Eye of Mugg. Loot cultist ears throughout."}, {k="取捨", text="Complete the prerequisites of Riverglades Rog'mar, Riverglades Bolder'ok and Powderfuse Port first and then form a team. complete all three in the same trip. The molding materials can be prepared and handed over when they are ready."}, {k="說明", text="The entrance is directly north of Sunnyglade, and there is a fortress portal next to the city gate. Features a native DungeonsForever entry point; earlier markup of the Wowhead River Forest Overview differs from this. Alliance quests such as the 94800 series are not included in the Horde route.", s={{"The entrance is directly north of Sunnyglade, and there is a fortress portal next to the city gate"}, {"Features a native DungeonsForever entry point; earlier markup of the Wowhead River Forest Overview differs from this"}, {"Alliance quests such as the 94800 series are not included in the Horde route"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh", tag="Dungeon prereq"}, [2]={hint="Slay 12 Meadowsbrook Farmhands, then return to Krom'rosh with news of your success.", tag="Dungeon prereq"}, [3]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh", tag="Dungeon prereq"}, [4]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh", tag="Dungeon prereq"}, [5]={hint="Steal 6 Feed Satchels from the Alliance farm in Meadowsbrook then return to Krom'rosh.", tag="Dungeon prereq"}, [6]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh", tag="Dungeon prereq"}, [7]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh", tag="Dungeon prereq"}, [8]={hint="Slay 8 Farholde Priests and 12 Farholde Scouts south of the river.", tag="Dungeon prereq"}, [9]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh", tag="Dungeon prereq"}, [10]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul"}, [11]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul"}, [12]={hint="Defeat 8 Twilight Raiders and 8 Twilight Neophytes within Sunnyglade for Tran'gul in Rog'mar.", tag="Target: Twilight Raider/Twilight Shadowmancer/Twilight Neophyte"}, [13]={hint="Retrieve 3 Twilight Missives from Twilight Shadowmancers in Sunnyglade for Tran'gul in Rog'mar.", tag="Target: Twilight Shadowmancer"}, [14]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul"}, [15]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul"}, [16]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul", preText="Encroaching Twilight, Twilight Missives"}, [17]={hint="Convince a Twilight's Hammer miner in Sunnyglade to divulge their secrets."}, [18]={npc="Clubtoe", tgt="Clubtoe"}, [19]={npc="Clubtoe", tgt="Clubtoe", preText="Digging for Answers"}, [20]={hint="Find missing ogres in the caves beneath Sunnyglade for Clubtoe."}, [21]={npc="Empowered Brute", tgt="Twilight Brute"}, [22]={npc="Empowered Brute", tgt="Twilight Brute", preText="The Purple Ones"}, [23]={npc="Clubtoe", tgt="Clubtoe", preText="The Purple Ones"}, [24]={hint="Kill 5 Empowered Brutes and 10 Twilight Ritualists then return to Clubtoe in Sunnyglade.", tag="Target: Empowered Brute/Twilight Ritualist"}, [25]={hint="Destroy 5 Twilight Ritual Circles found throughout the caves underneath Sunnyglade.", desc="QuestieDB There is no independent point in the ritual circle. Find it along the cave."}, [26]={npc="Clubtoe", tgt="Clubtoe"}, [27]={npc="Clubtoe", tgt="Clubtoe"}, [28]={npc="Clubtoe", tgt="Clubtoe", desc="Elite, please ask your teammates to complete it first.", preText="The Purple Ones, Sickening Lights"}, [29]={hint="Kill Chogg'Zac in the Sunnyglade cave and collect their heads for Clubtoe.", tag="Target: Chogg'Zac", desc="Elite, please ask your teammates to complete it first."}, [30]={npc="Clubtoe", tgt="Clubtoe", desc="Elite, please ask your teammates to complete it first."}, [31]={npc="Clubtoe", tgt="Clubtoe", preText="Twilight No More!"}, [32]={hint="Deliver the head of Chogg to Tran'gul in Rog'mar."}, [33]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul"}, [34]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul", preText="Spread the Word"}, [35]={hint="Deliver Chogg's head to the ogre city to the north."}, [36]={npc="Clugfist", tgt="Clugfist"}, [37]={npc="Clugfist", tgt="Clugfist", preText="Land of Giants"}, [38]={hint="Kill 7 Twilight Maulers and 7 Twilight Firecallers for Clugfist in Bolder'ok.", tag="Target: Twilight Mauler/Twilight Firecaller"}, [39]={npc="Clugfist", tgt="Clugfist"}, [40]={npc="Clugfist", tgt="Clugfist", preText="Land of Giants"}, [41]={hint="Collect Skullthumper from Klunk for Clugfist in Bolder'ok.", tag="Target: Klunk"}, [42]={npc="Clugfist", tgt="Clugfist"}, [43]={npc="Clugfist", tgt="Clugfist", preText="Unworthy Champion"}, [44]={hint="Report to Krom'rosh in Rog'mar."}, [45]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh"}, [46]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh", preText="Clugfist's Decree"}, [47]={hint="Find Da'grosh in the hills west of Rog'mar."}, [48]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh"}, [49]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh", preText="The Wayward Warrior"}, [50]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh", preText="The Wayward Warrior"}, [51]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh", tag="Optional", preText="The Wayward Warrior"}, [52]={hint="Look for the Bolder'ok ogre in the nearby cave.", tag="Optional"}, [53]={npc="Ogre Miner", tgt="Crag'rog", tag="Optional"}, [54]={npc="Ogre Miner", tgt="Crag'rog", tag="Optional", desc="Pick it up from Crag'rog inside the Veil of Twilight.", preText="Rumblings of Discontent"}, [55]={hint="Defeat 8 Twilight Fanatics, 8 Twilight Corrupters, and 8 Twilight Champions within the Twilight's Shroud for Da'grosh.", tag="Target: Twilight Fanatic/Twilight Corrupter/Twilight Champion"}, [56]={hint="Rescue 5 Rog'mar Scouts within the Twilight's Shroud for Da'grosh.", tag="Target: Rog'mar Scout"}, [57]={hint="Recruit 5 Ogre Miners.", tag="Optional", desc="List three verified mining sites, other locations?."}, [58]={npc="Ogre Miner", tgt="Crag'rog", tag="Optional"}, [59]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh"}, [60]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh"}, [61]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh", desc="If still unavailable after Carving a Path and Break Their Chains, do Klarg's lead.", preText="Carving a Path, Break Their Chains"}, [62]={hint="Defeat Overlord Kilgar within the Twilight's Shroud and bring his head to Da'grosh.", tag="Target: Overlord Kilgar"}, [63]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh"}, [64]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh", desc="Da'grosh Given after delivering the head of Overlord Kilgar.", preText="Bring Me His Head"}, [65]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh", preText="Bring Me His Head"}, [66]={hint="Deliver the missive to Krom'rosh at Rog'mar."}, [67]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh"}, [68]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh", preText="It Is Time, Brother..."}, [69]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul", preText="It Is Time, Brother..."}, [70]={text="Krol'dok Stronghold entrance"}, [71]={hint="Collect 15 Cultist Ears from the Twilight's Hammer in Krol'dok Stronghold.", desc="Clear cultists near Zarmok first, then check your count. Dungeon map: Zarmok (39.10, 69.40) is one source of the ears. Location: Clear around Zarmok after the mine. Loot more ears in the stronghold passages."}, [72]={npc="Krol'dok Moulding", npcObj=true, tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Tunk drops the mold; right click to start the quest. Find Tunk in the smithy by War Handler Ashka. Loot and use the moulding."}, [73]={hint="Recover the Tome of Twilight from Krol'dok Stronghold.", desc="Dungeon custom map Nar'gurk 34.70, 50.30,. Location: Pass Ashka and look for Nar'gurk in the Twilight caster area."}, [74]={hint="Infiltrate Krol'dok Stronghold and return to Krom'rosh with proof of their leader's demise.", desc="Dungeon custom map Mugg 71.00, 14.30,. Location: Cross Bossman Toof's bridge. Kill Overlord Mugg in the last room."}, [75]={npc="Krom'rosh", tgt="Krom'rosh"}, [76]={npc="Tran'gul", tgt="Tran'gul"}, [77]={hint="Find someone in Rog'mar who may know about the mould.", tag="Optional"}, [78]={npc="Gur'dok", tgt="Kreza Darkthorn", tag="Optional"}, [79]={npc="Gur'dok", tgt="Kreza Darkthorn", tag="Optional", desc="Prepare materials at the auction site in advance.", preText="Krol'dok Moulding"}, [80]={hint="Bring 4 Thick Leather and 12 Iron Bar to Kreza Darkthorn.", tag="Optional", desc="Prepare materials at the auction site in advance."}, [81]={npc="Gur'dok", tgt="Kreza Darkthorn", tag="Optional", desc="Prepare materials at the auction site in advance."}, [82]={npc="Da'grosh", tgt="Da'grosh", desc="From Rog'mar, head west back to Da'grosh."}}},
    ["04-29"] = {name="Tanaris: Steamwheedle Port & Gadgetzan", short="Steamwheedle Port +", tips={{k="取捨", text="For the first time, Steamwheedle Port cleared the pirate hat, kills, WANTED and the cargo box together. TUGs: Feralas first and then return to clear the port pirates; this route takes a boat from Powderfuse Port to Steamwheedle Port, clear the coast first and keep the same video station sequence."}, {k="取捨", text="Screecher Spirits will be left at Feralas Camp Mojache; Dunemaul Dues will be left at Dunemaul Compound; Deliver to MacKinley will be left at Stranglethorn Vale Booty Bay when going to Swamp of Sorrows."}, {k="提醒", text="If you have not reached the level required for the next stop, fight the normal mobs at 59.40, 24.71 in the wasteland camp and 70.90, 42.48 at the Lost Rigger Cove entrance. The grouped Zul'Farrak can carry Scarab Shells, Divino-matic Rod, Troll Temper, Tanaris Gadgetzan and Dunemaul Compound.", s={{"If you have not reached the level required for the next stop, fight the normal mobs at 59.40, 24.71 in the wasteland camp and 70.90, 42.48 at the Lost Rigger Cove entrance"}, {"The grouped Zul'Farrak can carry Scarab Shells, Divino-matic Rod, Troll Temper, Tanaris Gadgetzan and Dunemaul Compound"}}}}, danger={[1]="Kalif will patrol, possibly with an escort. Clear Wastewander Bandit en route first, then wait until he reaches an open area and then attack."}, grind={[1]={mob="Southsea Pirate", note="At the entrance of Lost Rigger Cove, normal mobs are densely packed, and it is easy to collide with the pirate quest. Clear along the outside towards the beach to collect pirate quest drops."}, [2]={mob="Southsea Swashbuckler", note="The normal mobs on the outer edge of the pier will be replaced when the pirate entrance is robbed by monsters. Pull from the outer edge to avoid attracting monsters at the dock at the same time."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Bulkrek Ragefist"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Fizzgrimble"}, [3]={npc="Wrinkle Goodsteel"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Fizzgrimble"}, [5]={npc="Blizrik Buckshot"}, [6]={npc="Gikkix"}}, steps={[1]={text="Take the Steamwheedle Port boat at Powderfuse Port (80.60, 54.60) to Tanaris (68.60, 23.00). From Orgrimmar, fly to Gadgetzan if unlocked. Otherwise take the south ramp out of the Shimmering Flats from Freewind Post."}, [2]={text="Pick up at the port, then resupply in town"}, [3]={npc="Haughty Modiste", tgt="Haughty Modiste"}, [4]={npc="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle", tgt="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle"}, [5]={npc="Wanted Poster", npcObj=true}, [6]={npc="Wanted Poster", npcObj=true}, [7]={npc="Stoley", tgt="Stoley"}, [8]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya", desc="Do in Feralas. Turn in at Steamwheedle Port during the Tanaris visit."}, [9]={npc="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle", tgt="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle", tag="Optional", desc="Do at Dunemaul Compound. Turn in at Steamwheedle Port."}, [10]={text="Follow the road west to Gadgetzan. Learn the Horde flight path from Bulkrek Ragefist (51.60, 25.44) and set your hearth with Innkeeper Fizzgrimble (52.51, 27.91). Rebind in Camp Mojache later."}, [11]={npc="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle", tgt="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle"}, [12]={npc="Spigot Operator Luglunket", tgt="Spigot Operator Luglunket"}, [13]={npc="Tran'rek", tgt="Tran'rek", tag="Optional", desc="Pick up only if running Zul'Farrak."}, [14]={npc="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle", tgt="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle", tag="Optional", desc="Zul'Farrak dropped from the ladder event.", star={"Masons Fraternity Ring", {"ROGUE", "HUNTER", "DRUID"}}}, [15]={npc="Trenton Lighthammer", tgt="Trenton Lighthammer", tag="Optional", desc="Pick up only if running Zul'Farrak."}, [16]={text="Wastewander camps and Lost Rigger Cove"}, [17]={hint="Take down 10 Wastewander Bandits and Thieves east of Gadgetzan, then report back to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle."}, [18]={hint="Bring 5 Wastewander Water Pouches to Spigot Operator Luglunket in Gadgetzan."}, [19]={npc="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle", tgt="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle"}, [20]={npc="Spigot Operator Luglunket", tgt="Spigot Operator Luglunket"}, [21]={npc="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle", tgt="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle"}, [22]={hint="Take down 10 Wastewander Shadow Mages, 8 Wastewander Rogues, and 6 Wastewander Assassins for Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan.", desc="Enter the wasteland camp from the southeast of Gadgetzan."}, [23]={hint="Bring the head of Caliph Scorpidsting to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan.", desc="Maybe bring a follower; wait until he gets to the edge of the camp before pulling him."}, [24]={hint="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle of Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris wants you to kill 10 Southsea Pirates, 10 Southsea Freebooters, 10 Southsea Dock Workers and 10 Southsea Swashbucklers."}, [25]={hint="Haughty Modiste wants you to collect 20 Southsea Pirate Hats and return them to her at Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris.", desc="Search all corpses when doing Southsea Shakedown."}, [26]={hint="Bring Andre's Head to Security Chief Bilgewhizzle in Steamwheedle Port."}, [27]={hint="Bring Stoley's Shipment to Stoley in Steamwheedle Port."}, [28]={npc="Ship Schedule", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Loot a pirate's footlocker, then right-click the schedule inside to start the quest."}, [29]={hint="Report the Ship Schedules to an authority in Steamwheedle Port.", tag="Optional"}, [30]={text="Follow the coast north to Steamwheedle Port and turn in the pirate and cargo quests together."}, [31]={npc="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle", tgt="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle"}, [32]={npc="Haughty Modiste", tgt="Haughty Modiste"}, [33]={npc="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle", tgt="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle"}, [34]={npc="Stoley", tgt="Stoley"}, [35]={npc="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle", tgt="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle", tag="Optional"}, [36]={npc="Stoley", tgt="Stoley", desc="Stay first, Swamp of Sorrows Stonard and Dongfeng Coast at Booty Bay."}, [37]={text="Return to Gadgetzan for the second Wastewander batch and the wanted quests. Hearth if bound there."}, [38]={npc="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle", tgt="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle"}, [39]={npc="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle", tgt="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle"}}},
    ["04-30"] = {name="Feralas: Camp Mojache", tips={{k="取捨", text="Reach The Battle Plans all the way to the front of the Wooden Claw Jackal, and open two quests, Feralas Camp Mojache and Rage Scar Hold Southeast Zu'kash, that can be done together."}, {k="取捨", text="If you pick up the OOX-22/FE locator, keep it in your backpack; escort it with Shore Strider/water element for return visit Feralas Camp Mojache."}, {k="提醒", text="If you have not reached level 47, replenish Feral Scar Vale Snowman 55.29, 53.76, or Gordunni Ogre 75.13, 34.86 on the north side of the camp; after defeating it, return to the camp and submit the documents.", s={{"If you have not reached level 47, replenish Feral Scar Vale Snowman 55.29, 53.76, or Gordunni Ogre 75.13, 34.86 on the north side of the camp; after defeating it, return to the camp and submit the documents"}}}}, danger={[1]="The Gordunni camp north of Mosache is a mix of mages and barbarians. Before digging for cobalt, clear the retreat path and do not run all the way deep into the camp."}, grind={[1]={mob="Feral Scar Yeti", note="Feral Scar Vale On the outer slope, ordinary snowmen are concentrated. beat them continuously and collect their skins. There are players with the same quest at the entrance of the cave, taking turns along the slope."}, [2]={mob="Hulking Feral Scar", note="Feral Scar Vale In the southwest, the average snowman has a slightly higher level. Draw the monster closer from the outside and avoid the dense holes."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Shyn"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Greul"}, [3]={npc="Cawind Trueaim"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Greul"}, [5]={npc="Cawind Trueaim"}, [6]={npc="Tarhus"}}, steps={[1]={text="Fly from Gadgetzan to Camp Mojache if unlocked. On a first visit, head north into the Shimmering Flats and take the west road through Thousand Needles into Feralas.", tag="I haven't used this flight path yet, so I have to use the running one for the first time."}, [2]={node="Camp Mojache", desc="Open flight path to Shyn."}, [3]={text="Set your hearth with Innkeeper Greul (74.80, 45.18)."}, [4]={npc="Krueg Skullsplitter", tgt="Krueg Skullsplitter"}, [5]={npc="Orwin Gizzmick", tgt="Orwin Gizzmick"}, [6]={npc="Hadoken Swiftstrider", tgt="Hadoken Swiftstrider"}, [7]={npc="Jangdor Swiftstrider", tgt="Jangdor Swiftstrider"}, [8]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i"}, [9]={npc="Rok Orhan", tgt="Rok Orhan"}, [10]={text="Around camp and first Gordunni quests to the north"}, [11]={hint="Bring 10 Woodpaw Gnoll Manes to Hadoken Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache."}, [12]={hint="Rok Orhan in Camp Mojache wants you to kill 10 Gordunni Ogres, 10 Gordunni Ogre-Magi, and 5 Gordunni Brutes."}, [13]={hint="Orwin Gizzmick in Camp Mojache wants 12 samples of Gordunni Cobalt.", desc="Use the quest shovel next to the blue mound at Gordunni Camp."}, [14]={npc="Gordunni Scroll", npcObj=true, desc="Click Gordunni Scroll on the ground on the north side."}, [15]={hint="Bring the Gordunni Scroll to Rok Orhan in Camp Mojache."}, [16]={npc="Hadoken Swiftstrider", tgt="Hadoken Swiftstrider"}, [17]={npc="Rok Orhan", tgt="Rok Orhan"}, [18]={npc="Orwin Gizzmick", tgt="Orwin Gizzmick"}, [19]={npc="Rok Orhan", tgt="Rok Orhan"}, [20]={npc="Hadoken Swiftstrider", tgt="Hadoken Swiftstrider"}, [21]={npc="Rok Orhan", tgt="Rok Orhan"}, [22]={npc="Rok Orhan", tgt="Rok Orhan"}, [23]={hint="Kill 5 Woodpaw Alphas and return to Hadoken Swiftstrider within one hour.", desc="One-hour timer. Kill five in Woodpaw Hills to the south, then return immediately."}, [24]={npc="Hadoken Swiftstrider", tgt="Hadoken Swiftstrider"}, [25]={npc="Hadoken Swiftstrider", tgt="Hadoken Swiftstrider"}, [26]={hint="Find the gnoll battle plans somewhere in the gnoll camps to the south of Camp Mojache."}, [27]={npc="Woodpaw Battle Map", npcObj=true}, [28]={npc="Woodpaw Battle Map", npcObj=true}, [29]={hint="Bring the Woodpaw Battle Plans to Hadoken Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache."}, [30]={npc="Hadoken Swiftstrider", tgt="Hadoken Swiftstrider"}, [31]={npc="Hadoken Swiftstrider", tgt="Hadoken Swiftstrider"}, [32]={npc="Hadoken Swiftstrider", tgt="Hadoken Swiftstrider"}, [33]={text="Faerie dragons in the middle, then west to Feral Scar Vale"}, [34]={hint="Bring 10 Iridescent Sprite Darter Wings to Krueg Skullsplitter in Camp Mojache."}, [35]={hint="Capture the spirits of 3 screechers in Feralas, then return to Yeh'kinya in Steamwheedle Port.", desc="Tanaris Gadgetzan and Dunemaul Compound should be returned to Steamwheedle Port."}, [36]={hint="Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.", desc="Feral Scar Vale Snowmen inside and outside the cave drop thick snowman skins."}, [37]={text="After Feral Scar Vale, hearth to Camp Mojache and turn in together."}, [38]={npc="Krueg Skullsplitter", tgt="Krueg Skullsplitter"}, [39]={npc="Jangdor Swiftstrider", tgt="Jangdor Swiftstrider"}, [40]={npc="Krueg Skullsplitter", tgt="Krueg Skullsplitter"}, [41]={npc="Jangdor Swiftstrider", tgt="Jangdor Swiftstrider"}, [42]={hint="Bring 20 Grimtotem Horns to Krueg Skullsplitter in Camp Mojache.", desc="Get the horns at the Grimtotem camp northwest of Camp Mojache, then return."}, [43]={npc="Krueg Skullsplitter", tgt="Krueg Skullsplitter"}, [44]={npc="Krueg Skullsplitter", tgt="Krueg Skullsplitter"}, [45]={text="Stop in Orgrimmar for the Feralas follow-up en route to Swamp of Sorrows"}, [46]={text="Fly from Camp Mojache to Orgrimmar, usually via Camp Taurajo or other unlocked stops. Keep your Camp Mojache hearth for after the eastern Swamp of Sorrows loop."}, [47]={hint="Take the Shrunken Head to Neeru Fireblade in Orgrimmar."}, [48]={hint="Bring the Crate of Grimtotem Horns to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar."}, [49]={npc="Neeru Fireblade", tgt="Neeru Fireblade"}, [50]={npc="Belgrom Rockmaul", tgt="Belgrom Rockmaul"}, [51]={npc="Neeru Fireblade", tgt="Neeru Fireblade", desc="Leave Feralas Camp Mojache and Rage Scar Hold to return to Mosaic."}}},
    ["04-31"] = {name="Swamp of Sorrows: Stonard", short="Stonard", tips={{k="取捨", text="Swamp of Sorrows Stonard has done the Lost and Escort on the north side. This trip only covers the coast; pay Lack of Surplus/Lack of Surplus before opening the fish chain, collect crabs on the outbound trip and pay on the return trip."}, {k="提醒", text="For Sunken Temple, pick up The Atal'ai Exile in Stonard and turn it in during the Revantusk/Jintha'Alor leg. Below 47, grind non-elite crabs on the east coast near 91.00, 70.80. Near 49, save grinding for the Rage Scar yetis on the next leg.", s={{"For Sunken Temple, pick up The Atal'ai Exile in Stonard and turn it in during the Revantusk/Jintha'Alor leg"}, {"Below 47, grind non-elite crabs on the east coast near 91.00, 70.80"}, {"Near 49, save grinding for the Rage Scar yetis on the next leg"}}}}, danger={[1]="The murlocs on the east wind coast often stand side by side, and the inkjet and the wise man will add monsters from behind. Pull alone from the shore, don't chase it into the water."}, grind={[1]={mob="Monstrous Crawler", note="Swamp of Sorrows Common crabs on the east coast are densely distributed and can be peeled. It is only suitable for those who have just entered the station or are just a short distance away, and can be shared with coastal quest players."}, [2]={mob="Elder Rage Scar", note="If it is close to 49, wait until the next stop is Feralas before calling again. Rage Scar Hold The level of the ordinary snowman is more suitable. The outer slope can be pulled separately, and the quest team can easily be encountered at the entrance of the cave."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Breyk"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Karakul"}, [3]={npc="Gharash"}, [4]={npc="Thultash"}, [5]={npc="Thultazor"}}, steps={[1]={text="Fly from Orgrimmar to Ratchet and take the boat to Booty Bay. Keep your Camp Mojache hearth."}, [2]={text="Booty Bay turn-ins along the way"}, [3]={hint="Bring Stoley's Bottle to \"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley in Booty Bay."}, [4]={npc="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley", tgt="Sea Wolf MacKinley"}, [5]={npc="Krazek", tgt="Krazek", tag="Optional", desc="Swamp of Sorrows Stonard Only hand in Dream Dust in the Swamp if you have collected all."}, [6]={npc="Whiskey Slim", tgt="Whiskey Slim", desc="Pick up the grog on the Hinterlands coast. Turn in when you revisit Booty Bay."}, [7]={text="Stonard to the southeast coast"}, [8]={text="Fly from Booty Bay to Stonard. If locked, run north through Stranglethorn Vale, then along eastern Duskwood and through Deadwind Pass. Learn the flight path from Breyk (46.07, 54.83)."}, [9]={npc="Dar", tgt="Dar"}, [10]={npc="Dar", tgt="Dar"}, [11]={hint="Bring 8 Unprepared Sawtooth Flanks to Tok'Kar in Swamp of Sorrows.", desc="Kill Saltjaw Crocolisks southwest of the Pool of Tears. Check the shore for more."}, [12]={hint="Bring 10 Monstrous Crawler Legs to Dar in the Swamp of Sorrows.", desc="Kill crabs along the northern coast. Collect ten legs before heading south."}, [13]={npc="Tok'Kar", tgt="Tok'Kar"}, [14]={npc="Tok'Kar", tgt="Tok'Kar"}, [15]={hint="Bring 6 Sawtooth Snapper Claws to Tok'Kar in the Swamp of Sorrows."}, [16]={npc="Tok'Kar", tgt="Tok'Kar"}, [17]={npc="Tok'Kar", tgt="Tok'Kar"}, [18]={hint="Speak to Katar in the Swamp of Sorrows."}, [19]={npc="Katar", tgt="Katar"}, [20]={npc="Katar", tgt="Katar", desc="After 1427, see Katar. Find Oracles farther north. Check all three kill counts."}, [21]={hint="Kill 10 Marsh Murlocs, 10 Marsh Inkspewer, and 10 Marsh Flesheater, then return to Katar in the Swamp of Sorrows.", desc="After 1427, see Katar. Find Oracles farther north. Check all three kill counts."}, [22]={npc="Katar", tgt="Katar", desc="After 1427, see Katar. Find Oracles farther north. Check all three kill counts."}, [23]={npc="Katar", tgt="Katar"}, [24]={hint="Speak with Tok'Kar in the Swamp of Sorrows."}, [25]={npc="Tok'Kar", tgt="Tok'Kar"}, [26]={npc="Katar", tgt="Katar", desc="After 1427, see Katar. Find Oracles farther north. Check all three kill counts."}, [27]={hint="Kill 10 Marsh Inkspewers, 10 Marsh Flesheaters, and 10 Marsh Oracles, then return to Katar in the Swamp of Sorrows.", desc="After 1427, see Katar. Find Oracles farther north. Check all three kill counts."}, [28]={npc="Katar", tgt="Katar", desc="After 1427, see Katar. Find Oracles farther north. Check all three kill counts."}, [29]={text="Retrace your route west to Stonard and turn the crab legs in to Dar."}, [30]={npc="Dar", tgt="Dar"}, [31]={text="Hearth to Camp Mojache after the turn-in. Otherwise fly to Booty Bay, take the Ratchet boat and fly to Camp Mojache."}}},
    ["04-32"] = {name="Feralas: Camp Mojache & Dire Maul", short="Feralas: Camp Mojache +", tips={{k="取捨", text="The Furious Snowman and the Feral Scar Vale Snowman are two batches; first pay The Mark of Quality in Feralas Camp Mojache, and then clear this time Improved Quality. Perfect Yeti Hide is only handed in when it drops."}, {k="取捨", text="Save one trip across the sea by returning from Hearthstone after using the Murloc Chain. The Hinterlands Revantusk Village and Jintha'Alor then take Testing the Vessel Moonkin Essence, and keep Feralas Camp Mojache for subsequent Hippogryph Muisek-Weapons of Spirit."}, {k="提醒", text="When the video returns to Ferras, it is close to level 49; if make up for it, beat the Wrath-Scarred Snowman in the outer circle at Rage Scar Hold 55.73,33.05 to 54.39,33.10, and give priority to pulling it alone.", s={{"When the video returns to Ferras, it is close to level 49; if make up for it, beat the Wrath-Scarred Snowman in the outer circle at Rage Scar Hold 55.73,33.05 to 54.39,33.10, and give priority to pulling it alone"}}}}, danger={[1]="The entrance to the Furious Snowman's cave is narrow, and Elder Rage Scar will enter the battle at the same time as the monsters at the entrance. Hit the outside first and then get into the hole."}, grind={[1]={mob="Rage Scar Yeti", note="Rage Scar Hold An ordinary snowman on the outer slope. Make a circle along the slope and collect the snowman skin, leaving the outer circle if there is someone grabbing it in the cave."}, [2]={mob="Elder Rage Scar", note="Advanced ordinary snowmen in the same camp can be increased to 49. It is easy to pull two people in a narrow hole at the same time, so clear the door first."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Shyn"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Greul"}, [3]={npc="Cawind Trueaim"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Greul"}, [5]={npc="Cawind Trueaim"}, [6]={npc="Tarhus"}}, steps={[1]={hint="Deliver Neeru's Herb Pouch to Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Feralas."}, [2]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i"}, [3]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", desc="Use the container on Hinterlands owlbeast corpses. Turn in at Camp Mojache."}, [4]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tag="Optional", desc="Save Natural Materials as you go. Finish collecting and turn in at Camp Mojache."}, [5]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", desc="Tanaris Gadgetzan and Broken Pillar cross Malvon at Tanaris."}, [6]={npc="Talo Thornhoof", tgt="Talo Thornhoof", desc="Save for Felwood's bears and maulers. Turn in at Camp Mojache on the next visit."}, [7]={hint="Bring 20 Zukk'ash Carapaces to Hadoken Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas."}, [8]={hint="Defeat Stinglasher in the Writhing Deep, bringing its glands back to Hadoken Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas."}, [9]={hint="Rok Orhan in Camp Mojache wants you to kill 10 Gordunni Shaman, 10 Gordunni Warlocks, and 5 Gordunni Maulers."}, [10]={hint="Rok Orhan in Camp Mojache wants you to find a Gordunni Orb."}, [11]={text="Follow the road back to Camp Mojache for The Ogres of Feralas and The Zukk'ash Infestation. Save the northern yetis for the next loop."}, [12]={npc="Hadoken Swiftstrider", tgt="Hadoken Swiftstrider"}, [13]={npc="Hadoken Swiftstrider", tgt="Hadoken Swiftstrider"}, [14]={npc="Rok Orhan", tgt="Rok Orhan"}, [15]={npc="Rok Orhan", tgt="Rok Orhan"}, [16]={npc="Hadoken Swiftstrider", tgt="Hadoken Swiftstrider", desc="Leave Tanaris Gadgetzan and Dunemaul Compound to be submitted together via Orgrimmar."}, [17]={npc="Rok Orhan", tgt="Rok Orhan", desc="Leave Tanaris Gadgetzan and Dunemaul Compound via Orgrimmar."}, [18]={text="Rage Scar yetis and the return trip"}, [19]={hint="Bring 10 Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.", desc="Go west along the main road and go around to Rage Scar Hold 55.73,33.05 to get ten pelts."}, [20]={npc="Perfect Yeti Hide", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="The Furious Snowman only picks up the perfect fur after it drops."}, [21]={hint="Bring the Perfect Yeti Hide to Jangdor Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.", tag="Optional"}, [22]={text="Hearth to Camp Mojache when the yetis are done, or take the main road back. Turn in and fly to Gadgetzan."}, [23]={npc="Jangdor Swiftstrider", tgt="Jangdor Swiftstrider"}, [24]={npc="Jangdor Swiftstrider", tgt="Jangdor Swiftstrider", tag="Optional"}}},
    ["05-d20"] = {name="Maraudon", entrance="Desolace 29.10, 62.50", pickup="Before Desolace Shadowprey Village, pick up Shadowshard Fragments from Orgrimmar Uthel'nay, but the minimum level is 39. Leave Feralas Camp Mojache and go to Desolace Shadowprey Village. First find Wacker and Selendra, then go around Willow and Centaur Pariah. If you want to do the eternal version of the Aquarius branch, first go to Southeast Sindra. After completing the Crystal Tower and the Magister's Guide, go to the Forgotten Garden to pick up Word of the Woods→Rot and Regret. The Min. level 35 for Syndra Quest is topped up by Wowhead WoW Forever. Enter Maraudon and take Cavindra before entering the orange door.", pickupS={{"Before Desolace Shadowprey Village, pick up Shadowshard Fragments from Orgrimmar Uthel'nay, but the minimum level is 39"}, {"Leave Feralas Camp Mojache and go to Desolace Shadowprey Village"}, {"First find Wacker and Selendra, then go around Willow and Centaur Pariah"}, {"If you want to do the eternal version of the Aquarius branch, first go to Southeast Sindra"}, {"After completing the Crystal Tower and the Magister's Guide, go to the Forgotten Garden to pick up Word of the Woods→Rot and Regret"}, {"The Min. level 35 for Syndra Quest is topped up by Wowhead WoW Forever"}, {"Enter Maraudon and take Cavindra before entering the orange door"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Orange: Noxxion and Razorlash. Purple: Lord Vyletongue. Collect statues, khan gems and other quest loot → Celebras at the junction, then follow his scepter ritual → Earth Song Falls → the Princess → Rotgrip's pool if needed."}, {k="取捨", text="If you want to get the scepter for the first time, go to the orange and purple lines. If you only play the princess and the crocodile, your teammates can go directly into the inner zone if they have the scepter. If a quest requires a shadow monster outside the door or a different branch, don't skip the shortcut."}, {k="說明", text="29.10 and 62.50 are the wilderness cave entrances. The orange and purple instance doors must be found along the color caves; the individual world coordinates of the instance doors are?. The purple and orange lines meet near Poison Water Falls.", s={{"29.10 and 62.50 are the wilderness cave entrances"}, {"The orange and purple instance doors must be found along the color caves; the individual world coordinates of the instance doors are?"}, {"The purple and orange lines meet near Poison Water Falls"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Uthel'nay", tgt="Uthel'nay"}, [2]={npc="Vark Battlescar", tgt="Vark Battlescar"}, [3]={npc="Selendra", tgt="Selendra"}, [4]={npc="Willow", tgt="Willow"}, [5]={npc="Centaur Pariah", tgt="Centaur Pariah", desc="Centaur Pariah patrols south of Desolace; the coordinate is one of its points."}, [6]={npc="Shen'dralar Pylon", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Listed as Temple Crystal Tower; exact coordinates of other towers?."}, [7]={hint="Explore Shen'dralas in an effort to find other pylons like the one you found.", tag="Optional", desc="Listed as Temple Crystal Tower; exact coordinates of other towers?."}, [8]={npc="Mordent Evenshade", tgt="Mordent Evenshade", tag="Optional", desc="Listed as Temple Crystal Tower; exact coordinates of other towers?."}, [9]={npc="Mordent Evenshade", tgt="Mordent Evenshade", tag="Optional", preText="Strange Pylons"}, [10]={hint="Recover shards and fragments of the pylons, found guarded at the Magram and Gelkis villages. Return them to Mordent Evenshade.", tag="Optional", desc="The coordinates are, in order, two items from Magram and Kyrgyz Centaur Villages."}, [11]={npc="Mordent Evenshade", tgt="Mordent Evenshade", tag="Optional"}, [12]={npc="Mordent Evenshade", tgt="Mordent Evenshade", tag="Optional", desc="The amount of mana is based on the quest log.", preText="Fragments of the Pylons"}, [13]={hint="Acquire the Mana Sieve from within the temple in Shen'dralas and use it to collect Ancient Mana Crystals. Once you have acquired enough mana, empower the pylons and return to Mordent Evenshade.", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="The amount of mana is based on the quest log. Collect 8 mana, 4 per tower. Both towers can be interacted with while stealthed."}, [14]={npc="Mordent Evenshade", tgt="Mordent Evenshade", tag="Optional", desc="The amount of mana is based on the quest log."}, [15]={npc="Mordent Evenshade", tgt="Mordent Evenshade", tag="Optional, Unverified", preText="Powering the Pylons"}, [16]={hint="Speak with Mordent Evenshade in Shen'dralas for information about the crystals you repaired.", tag="Optional, Unverified"}, [17]={npc="Mordent Evenshade", tgt="Mordent Evenshade", tag="Optional, Unverified"}, [18]={npc="Mordent Evenshade", tgt="Mordent Evenshade", tag="Optional, Unverified", preText="A Brief History Lesson"}, [19]={hint="Locate Magister Kirandis inside the temple of Shen'dralas.", tag="Optional, Unverified"}, [20]={npc="Magister Kirandis", tgt="Magister Kirandis", tag="Optional, Unverified"}, [21]={npc="Mithera", tgt="Mithera", tag="Dungeon prereq"}, [22]={npc="Mithera", tgt="Mithera", tag="Dungeon prereq"}, [23]={npc="Mithera", tgt="Mithera", tag="Optional, Unverified", preText="Meeting the Magister"}, [24]={hint="Find Woodwyrd in the Forlorn Gardens at Shen'dralas in the Desolace.", tag="Optional, Unverified"}, [25]={npc="Woodwyrd", tgt="Woodwyrd", tag="Optional, Unverified"}, [26]={npc="Woodwyrd", tgt="Woodwyrd", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Pay Word of the Woods first; bring it into the inner area of Maraudon.", preText="Word of the Woods"}, [27]={npc="Cavindra", tgt="Cavindra", desc="Cavindra stands outside the orange door. Each leader on both sides drops one piece."}, [28]={hint="Collect 10 Shadowshard Fragments from Maraudon and return them to Uthel'nay in Orgrimmar."}, [29]={text="Maraudon entrance"}, [30]={text="Orange side: Foulspore Cavern (45-53). Look for orange crystals and the pool deep in the cave. Fill the vial before entering the portal."}, [31]={hint="Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon.", desc="Location: Fill the vial at the pool outside the orange portal. Find vines inside."}, [32]={text="Purple side: Wicked Grotto (45-53). Take the purple crystal passage at the three-way fork. Loot the diamond from Lord Vyletongue."}, [33]={hint="Collect 15 Theradric Crystal Carvings for Willow in Desolace.", desc="QuestieDB says 15; older guides may list 25. Follow your quest log. Location: Kill centaurs outside both portals and loot statues as you go."}, [34]={hint="Read the Pariah's Instructions. Afterwards, obtain the Amulet of Union from Maraudon and return it to the Centaur Pariah in southern Desolace.", desc="Three khans patrol by the fork and outer tunnels. One is inside each portal. Location: Find three khans at the fork and outer caves, then one inside each portal."}, [35]={hint="Recover the two parts of the Scepter of Celebras: the Celebrian Rod and the Celebrian Diamond.", desc="Map: Noxxion 34.80,10.70; Vyletongue 37.70,69.40; Celebras 24.50,14.40. Location: Get the rod on orange and the diamond on purple. Kill Celebras where they meet. Order: Both the orange and purple lines must be present; materials must be submitted only when all materials are collected."}, [36]={npc="Celebras the Redeemed", tgt="Celebras the Redeemed", tag="Unverified", desc="Talk to Celebras the Redeemed after defeating the boss. After killing Celebras (24.50, 14.40), turn in to the Redeemed in the same room."}, [37]={npc="Celebras the Redeemed", tgt="Celebras the Redeemed", tag="Unverified", desc="Celebras's room (24.50, 14.40): follow the Redeemed through the ritual.", preText="Legends of Maraudon"}, [38]={hint="Assist Celebras the Redeemed while he creates the Scepter of Celebras.", desc="Celebras's room (24.50, 14.40): follow the Redeemed through the ritual. Location: Follow Celebras the Redeemed through the ritual in his boss room."}, [39]={npc="Celebras the Redeemed", tgt="Celebras the Redeemed", tag="Unverified", desc="Celebras's room (24.50, 14.40): follow the Redeemed through the ritual."}, [40]={text="Inner route: Earth Song Falls (48-57). Descend from the orange/purple junction or have a player with the scepter open the shortcut."}, [41]={hint="Venture to Maraudon and recover a Vial of Earth Song Water and return it to Woodwyrd at the Forlorn Gardens in Desolace.", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Rotgrip patrols the pool (41.20, 81.50). Look for the small spring at the surface. Location: Drop into Rotgrip's pool below the Princess. Find the spring at the surface. Order: Do step 39 first before going into the water."}, [42]={hint="Slay Princess Theradras and return to Selendra near Shadowprey Village in Desolace.", desc="DungeonsForever map: Princess in Zaetar's Grave (26.00, 78.30). Location: Follow Earth Song Falls into Zaetar's cavern and reach the Princess's platform."}, [43]={npc="Zaetar's Spirit", tgt="Zaetar's Spirit", tag="Unverified", desc="Zaetar's Spirit appears after the Princess dies. Pick up now and turn in outside. DungeonsForever Dungeon Map Reference Points 23.70, 78.00. Soul Mark from Dungeon Seed of Life."}, [44]={npc="Selendra", tgt="Selendra"}, [45]={npc="Vark Battlescar", tgt="Vark Battlescar"}, [46]={npc="Willow", tgt="Willow"}, [47]={npc="Centaur Pariah", tgt="Centaur Pariah"}, [48]={npc="Uthel'nay", tgt="Uthel'nay"}, [49]={hint="Venture to Maraudon and recover a Vial of Earth Song Water and return it to Woodwyrd at the Forlorn Gardens in Desolace.", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Coordinates listed are for Woodwyrd."}, [50]={npc="Woodwyrd", tgt="Woodwyrd", tag="Optional, Unverified"}, [51]={hint="Seek out Remulos in Moonglade and give him the Seed of Life.", desc="Wait for Moonglade to arrive."}, [52]={npc="Keeper Remulos", tgt="Keeper Remulos", desc="Can wait for Moonglade."}}},
    ["04-33"] = {name="Tanaris: Gadgetzan & Sandfury camp", short="Tanaris: Gadgetzan +", tips={{k="取捨", text="After turning in the northern pool, open 82 first; hand over 82 and open 10, and then run sand hammer, Thistleshrub Valley and southern insect nest together."}, {k="取捨", text="If you have a team, download Zul'Farrak, and four dungeon quests can be done at the same time. No team directly skips four items and The Ancient Egg."}, {k="取捨", text="Submit 32 and Zukk'ash Report first; March of the Silithid requires level 50. If you have reached the threshold, confirm it in the dark alley area. After completing it, keep Tanaris, Gadgetzan and Broken Pillar."}, {k="提醒", text="Under 50, the ordinary trolls in Dunemaul Compound 40.75, 50.67 are concentrated and drop cloth; if you want to upgrade in Searing Gorge, keep this small experience gap first.", s={{"Under 50, the ordinary trolls in Dunemaul Compound 40.75, 50.67 are concentrated and drop cloth; if you want to upgrade in Searing Gorge, keep this small experience gap first"}}}}, danger={[1]="The entrance to the Sentipal Hive is easy to pull. Only hunt in the open space outside the nest mouth, do not chase one into the narrow channel."}, grind={[1]={mob="Dunemaul Brute", note="On the outside of Dunemaul Compound, there are many ordinary melee monsters, which drop cloth and overlap with ogre quests. Someone who grabs monsters can move along the periphery."}, [2]={mob="Centipaar Swarmer", note="The normal mobs outside the scorpion nest on the west side are densely packed and of high level. Just pull along the nest mouth, and the narrow path will easily attract a group."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Bulkrek Ragefist"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Fizzgrimble"}, [3]={npc="Wrinkle Goodsteel"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Fizzgrimble"}, [5]={npc="Blizrik Buckshot"}}, steps={[1]={text="Fly from Camp Mojache to Gadgetzan and set your hearth there for now."}, [2]={text="Pick up at Gadgetzan, then go west for the water sample and Noxious Lair"}, [3]={npc="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser", tgt="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser"}, [4]={npc="Marin Noggenfogger", tgt="Marin Noggenfogger"}, [5]={npc="Andi Lynn", tgt="Andi Lynn"}, [6]={npc="Tran'rek", tgt="Tran'rek"}, [7]={npc="Quinn", tgt="Quinn", tag="Optional", desc="Loot desert scraps if you pass them."}, [8]={hint="Use the untapped dowsing widget near the pool of water by Sandsorrow Watch. Once you have collected the sample, return the tapped dowsing widget to Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser in Gadgetzan.", desc="Use the Untapped Dowsing Widget at the Sandsorrow Watch pool. Return with the sample."}, [9]={npc="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser", tgt="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser"}, [10]={npc="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser", tgt="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser"}, [11]={hint="Bring five Centipaar insect parts from the Noxious Lair to Alchemist Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan."}, [12]={npc="Alchemist Pestlezugg", tgt="Alchemist Pestlezugg"}, [13]={npc="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser", tgt="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser"}, [14]={text="South to Sandfury and Thistleshrub Valley, then follow the foothills to the hive"}, [15]={hint="Andi Lynn in Gadgetzan wants you to destroy the Dunemaul Compound by killing 10 Dunemaul Brutes, 10 Dunemaul Enforcers, and Gor'marok the Ravager."}, [16]={hint="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle of Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris wants you to recover a particularly shiny bangle bracelet lost near the Dunemaul ogre compound.", tag="Optional", desc="Do this only if you picked it up on the Steamwheedle Port and Gadgetzan leg."}, [17]={hint="Collect a Laden Dew Gland and bring it to Marin Noggenfogger in Gadgetzan.", desc="Play the dew collector at Thistleshrub Valley and pick up a full dew gland ×1."}, [18]={hint="Tran'rek in Gadgetzan wants you to kill 8 Gnarled Thistleshrubs and 8 Thistleshrub Rootshapers."}, [19]={hint="Discover the fate of Junior Surveyor Scrimshank, and bring either him or his surveying equipment to Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser in Gadgetzan.", desc="Go underground in the southern rift to find Scrimshank's Surveying Gear."}, [20]={hint="Quinn wants you to recover 7 pieces of Desert Debris and return to her in Gadgetzan.", tag="Optional", desc="Pin marks a confirmed spawn. Alliance quests can drop scraps. Check outside Gadgetzan."}, [21]={text="Return to Gadgetzan for turn-ins. Hearth if ready. Pick up The Thirsty Goblin and the insect research quest on the way."}, [22]={npc="Andi Lynn", tgt="Andi Lynn"}, [23]={npc="Tran'rek", tgt="Tran'rek"}, [24]={npc="Marin Noggenfogger", tgt="Marin Noggenfogger"}, [25]={npc="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser", tgt="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser"}, [26]={npc="Quinn", tgt="Quinn", tag="Optional"}, [27]={npc="Marin Noggenfogger", tgt="Marin Noggenfogger"}, [28]={hint="Marin Noggenfogger wants you to speak with Sprinkle in Gadgetzan."}, [29]={npc="Sprinkle", tgt="Sprinkle"}, [30]={npc="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser", tgt="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser"}, [31]={hint="Check in Gadgetzan for Alchemist Pestlezugg and his analysis of the insect parts."}, [32]={npc="Alchemist Pestlezugg", tgt="Alchemist Pestlezugg"}, [33]={npc="Alchemist Pestlezugg", tgt="Alchemist Pestlezugg"}, [34]={hint="Deliver the report to Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser in Gadgetzan. Be sure he gives you a copy of the report, as Alchemist Pestlezugg has requested."}, [35]={npc="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser", tgt="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser"}, [36]={npc="Sprinkle", tgt="Sprinkle", desc="Gather Violet Tragan at Valorwind Lake in the Hinterlands. Turn in at Gadgetzan."}, [37]={npc="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser", tgt="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser", desc="Turn in at the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar. Do the prerequisites with Zukk'ash Report."}, [38]={text="Optional Steamwheedle Port and Zul'Farrak"}, [39]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya", desc="Feralas Camp Mojache Three Screamer Souls have been completed."}, [40]={npc="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle", tgt="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle", tag="Optional"}, [41]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya", tag="Optional", desc="Turn in Screecher Spirits first. Pick this up once you have a Zul'Farrak group."}, [42]={hint="Bring the First and Second Mosh'aru Tablets to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris.", tag="Optional"}, [43]={hint="Bring 5 Uncracked Scarab Shells to Tran'rek in Gadgetzan.", tag="Optional", desc="Clear Zul'Farrak from the graveyard Scarab."}, [44]={hint="Bring the Divino-matic Rod to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan.", tag="Optional", desc="Complete the Hundred Man Ladder event and get the stick from Sergeant Bly."}, [45]={hint="Bring 20 Vials of Troll Temper to Trenton Lighthammer in Gadgetzan.", tag="Optional"}, [46]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya", tag="Optional"}, [47]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya", tag="Optional", desc="After The Prophecy of Mosh'aru, get the Ancient Egg in the Hinterlands. Turn in at Steamwheedle Port."}, [48]={npc="Tran'rek", tgt="Tran'rek", tag="Optional"}, [49]={npc="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle", tgt="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle", tag="Optional", star={"Masons Fraternity Ring", {"ROGUE", "HUNTER", "DRUID"}}}, [50]={npc="Trenton Lighthammer", tgt="Trenton Lighthammer", tag="Optional"}, [51]={text="Fly from Gadgetzan to Orgrimmar. See Zilzibin in the Drag, then turn in the Gordunni Orb in the hut."}, [52]={hint="Take the report to Zilzibin Drumlore in Orgrimmar."}, [53]={hint="Deliver the Camp Mojache Zukk'ash Report to Zilzibin Drumlore. He resides in the Drag of Orgrimmar."}, [54]={hint="Bring the Gordunni Orb to Uthel'nay in the Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar."}, [55]={npc="Zilzibin Drumlore", tgt="Zilzibin Drumlore"}, [56]={npc="Zilzibin Drumlore", tgt="Zilzibin Drumlore"}, [57]={npc="Uthel'nay", tgt="Uthel'nay"}}},
    ["05-d21"] = {name="Zul'Farrak", entrance="Tanaris 38.70, 20.00", pickup="First go to Tanaris Gadgetzan to pick up three local quests, then go to Steamwheedle Port to pick up Yeh'kinya Screecher Spirits; catch the soul at Feralas, return to Tanaris first go to Steamwheedle Port to hand in Screecher Spirits, pick up The Prophecy of Mosh'aru, and then join the team at Gadgetzan Rendezvous. When passing through The Shimmering Flats of Thousand Needles, pick up Gahz'rilla. before Swamp of Sorrows, go around Dustwallow Marsh to solve the Tabetha side quest [Mage only].", pickupS={{"First go to Tanaris Gadgetzan to pick up three local quests, then go to Steamwheedle Port to pick up Yeh'kinya Screecher Spirits; catch the soul at Feralas, return to Tanaris first go to Steamwheedle Port to hand in Screecher Spirits, pick up The Prophecy of Mosh'aru, and then join the team at Gadgetzan Rendezvous"}, {"When passing through The Shimmering Flats of Thousand Needles, pick up Gahz'rilla. before Swamp of Sorrows, go around Dustwallow Marsh to solve the Tabetha side quest [Mage only]"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Antu'sul's side path → Theka for the first Mosh'aru Tablet → Zum'rah's graveyard → pyramid stairs event for the Divino-matic Rod → Velratha for the second tablet → optional Gahz'rilla at the pool → Chief Ukorz. Loot scarab shells and Troll Temper throughout."}, {k="取捨", text="Priority will be given to Gadgetzan San Ren and Mosaru Slate; if you already have a mallet, hit Gahz'rilla; Tabetha will be reserved for the characters who will go through Dustwallow Marsh."}, {k="說明", text="Brush Tanaris Steamwheedle Port and Gadgetzan first; brush Tanaris Gadgetzan and Dunemaul Compound after completing Yeh'kinya. Mosaru Slate is also Hakkar chain front.", s={{"Brush Tanaris Steamwheedle Port and Gadgetzan first; brush Tanaris Gadgetzan and Dunemaul Compound after completing Yeh'kinya"}, {"Mosaru Slate is also Hakkar chain front"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle", tgt="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle"}, [2]={npc="Tran'rek", tgt="Tran'rek"}, [3]={npc="Trenton Lighthammer", tgt="Trenton Lighthammer"}, [4]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya", desc="Pick up in Steamwheedle Port, then do Feralas. Take The Prophecy of Mosh'aru after turning this in."}, [5]={hint="Capture the spirits of 3 screechers in Feralas, then return to Yeh'kinya in Steamwheedle Port."}, [6]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya"}, [7]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya", preText="Screecher Spirits"}, [8]={npc="Wizzle Brassbolts", tgt="Wizzle Brassbolts", tag="Optional", desc="Bring a Mallet of Zul'Farrak. Get the Sacred Mallet at Zul's altar, use at Jintha'Alor."}, [9]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional", desc="Tabetha is provided directly; level 40 Undercity Tabetha's Task is a skippable guide."}, [10]={text="Zul'Farrak entrance"}, [11]={hint="Bring 5 Uncracked Scarab Shells to Tran'rek in Gadgetzan.", desc="Location: Kill scarabs around Theka the Martyr's room. Order: Also do the first stone slab in step 15."}, [12]={hint="Bring 20 Vials of Troll Temper to Trenton Lighthammer in Gadgetzan.", desc="The team agrees on the allocation first, and one drop may not be enough. Location: Clear Sandfury trolls along the main route from the entrance."}, [13]={hint="Bring the Tiara of the Deep to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.", tag="Optional", desc="DungeonsForever dungeon map reference points 34.50, 35.80. Hydromancer Velratha. Location: Pass the pyramid and find Velratha by the pool. Order: Also do the second stone slab in step 15."}, [14]={hint="Bring Gahz'rilla's Electrified Scale to Wizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats.", tag="Optional", desc="DungeonsForever map: gong (28.90, 44.60), Gahz'rilla (29.60, 39.40). Location: Ring the gong by Velratha's pool to summon Gahz'rilla. Order: In the same district, clear Veresa first and then sound the gong."}, [15]={hint="Bring the Divino-matic Rod to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan.", desc="Open the cages and finish the stair event. Turn hostile after clearing the waves. DungeonsForever dungeon map reference points 23.90, 20.60. Sergeant Bly. Location: Open the cages atop the pyramid. Go down the steps and hold off the waves. Order: Defend the wave and then challenge Sergeant Bly."}, [16]={hint="Bring the First and Second Mosh'aru Tablets to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris.", desc="Zul'Farrak map: Theka (56.70, 31.50), Velratha (34.50, 35.80). Location: Loot Theka in the scarab room and Velratha by the pool. Order: Beetle House and Step 10, Pool and Steps 12-13."}, [17]={npc="Tran'rek", tgt="Tran'rek"}, [18]={npc="Trenton Lighthammer", tgt="Trenton Lighthammer"}, [19]={npc="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle", tgt="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle"}, [20]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya"}, [21]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya", desc="Pick up now. Loot the egg in Jintha'Alor before the Temple of Atal'Hakkar.", preText="The Prophecy of Mosh'aru"}, [22]={npc="Wizzle Brassbolts", tgt="Wizzle Brassbolts", tag="Optional"}, [23]={npc="Tabetha", tgt="Tabetha", tag="Optional"}}},
    ["04-34"] = {name="Searing Gorge: Thorium Point", short="Thorium Point", tips={{k="交通", text="Unlock the Horde flight path at Thorium Point. Fly to Undercity or Hammerfall before the Hinterlands."}, {k="取捨", text="Four groups of monsters can be killed along the same circle. If STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass does not drop enough, separate groups first. WANTED: Overseer Maltorius and What the Flux? are in the same hole. If they can form a group, they can clear them en route."}, {k="取捨", text="Thorium Point After payment, the number has reached 50 and leave the station. The second half of the Torch and the southeast Wooden Outhouse each require additional turns, so do it if you lack experience."}, {k="提醒", text="There is still a little experience left, so fight the heavy combat puppet at 44.76, 38.72 on the east side of The Cauldron, or return to the north slope and fight the ordinary black iron foreman at 41.21, 23.33.", s={{"There is still a little experience left, so fight the heavy combat puppet at 44.76, 38.72 on the east side of The Cauldron, or return to the north slope and fight the ordinary black iron foreman at 41.21, 23.33"}}}}, danger={[1]="Foreman Martorius is deep in the black iron mines near The Slag Pit. Use a team to clear passages section by section, and skip bounties if you go alone."}, grind={[1]={mob="Heavy War Golem", note="The Cauldron The ordinary golem on the east edge can be killed by hitting it along the outer circle of the high place. Don't bet on Forge when you have a lot of quests."}, [2]={mob="Dark Iron Taskmaster", note="Thorium Point The ordinary black iron monster on the south side can be defeated and dropped in quests before the return point. There may be tension in the camp."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Grisha"}, [2]={npc="Master Smith Burninate"}, [3]={npc="Master Smith Burninate"}, [4]={npc="Master Smith Burninate"}}, steps={[1]={text="Fly from Orgrimmar to Ratchet. Pick up the Un'Goro lead-in at the docks before taking the boat to Booty Bay. Fly to Kargath."}, [2]={npc="Liv Rizzlefix", tgt="Liv Rizzlefix", desc="Requires 49. Do at Fire Plume Ridge in Un'Goro. Turn in at Ratchet."}, [3]={text="Take the southwest road out of Kargath into Searing Gorge, then follow the northern road to Thorium Point."}, [4]={node="Thorium Point", desc="Point to tribal flight manager Grisha."}, [5]={text="Pick up at Thorium Point, then loop through the Cauldron and Slag Pit"}, [6]={npc="Wanted/Missing/Lost & Found", npcObj=true}, [7]={npc="Hansel Heavyhands", tgt="Hansel Heavyhands"}, [8]={npc="Hansel Heavyhands", tgt="Hansel Heavyhands"}, [9]={npc="Hansel Heavyhands", tgt="Hansel Heavyhands"}, [10]={npc="Wanted/Missing/Lost & Found", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="The two drops can be collected en route with kills."}, [11]={npc="Wanted/Missing/Lost & Found", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Martorius Elite, only pick it up if you form a team."}, [12]={npc="Master Smith Burninate", tgt="Master Smith Burninate", tag="Optional", desc="Can be obtained at the same time as the Martorius team line."}, [13]={npc="Kalaran Windblade", tgt="Kalaran Windblade"}, [14]={hint="Listen as Kalaran Windblade tells his story."}, [15]={npc="Kalaran Windblade", tgt="Kalaran Windblade"}, [16]={npc="Kalaran Windblade", tgt="Kalaran Windblade"}, [17]={hint="Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Greater Lava Spiders in the Searing Gorge. You can find Greater Lava Spiders in the plateaus and lava pools of the Searing Gorge."}, [18]={hint="Slay 15 Dark Iron Taskmasters and 15 Dark Iron Slavers. Return to Taskmaster Scrange in the Searing Gorge once you have accomplished this task."}, [19]={hint="Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Heavy War Golems."}, [20]={hint="Collect 4 Hearts of Flame and 4 globes of Golem Oil and return the items to Kalaran Windblade.", desc="The Cauldron Kill the surrounding puppets and fire elements easily."}, [21]={hint="Find and return the Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass to Taskmaster Scrange in the Searing Gorge.", tag="Optional"}, [22]={hint="Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Incendosaurs.", desc="Kill Incendosaurs in the Slag Pit alongside the Dark Iron mobs."}, [23]={hint="Somewhere in the Slag Pit of the Cauldron you will find the Secret Plans: Fiery Flux that Overseer Maltorius stole. Find those plans and return them to Master Smith Burninate in the Searing Gorge.", tag="Optional", desc="The Slag Pit Drawing near Martorius in the depths. Wait until it's safe to pick it up."}, [24]={hint="Deep within the Slag Pit of the Cauldron, in the Searing Gorge, you will find the traitorous Dark Iron dwarf named Overseer Maltorius.", tag="Optional"}, [25]={npc="Kalaran Windblade", tgt="Kalaran Windblade"}, [26]={npc="Kalaran Windblade", tgt="Kalaran Windblade", tag="Optional", desc="If you are not experienced enough and are willing to enter The Cauldron again, try again."}, [27]={hint="Bring 8 Thorium Plated Daggers to Kalaran Windblade.", tag="Optional", desc="The Black Iron Foreman and Slave Trader in The Slag Pit can be dropped."}, [28]={npc="Kalaran Windblade", tgt="Kalaran Windblade", tag="Optional"}, [29]={text="Return to Thorium Point and turn in all the Cauldron quests together."}, [30]={npc="Hansel Heavyhands", tgt="Hansel Heavyhands"}, [31]={npc="Taskmaster Scrange", tgt="Taskmaster Scrange"}, [32]={npc="Hansel Heavyhands", tgt="Hansel Heavyhands"}, [33]={npc="Hansel Heavyhands", tgt="Hansel Heavyhands"}, [34]={npc="Taskmaster Scrange", tgt="Taskmaster Scrange", tag="Optional"}, [35]={npc="Master Smith Burninate", tgt="Master Smith Burninate", tag="Optional"}, [36]={npc="Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker", tgt="Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker", tag="Optional"}, [37]={text="Extra XP or the torch if you still need it"}, [38]={npc="Kalaran Windblade", tgt="Kalaran Windblade", tag="Optional", desc="Complete Forging the Shaft. Kill Twilight mobs in the west cave for the Symbol of Ragnaros."}, [39]={hint="Find and return a Symbol of Ragnaros to Kalaran Windblade.", tag="Optional", desc="Complete Forging the Shaft. Kill Twilight mobs in the west cave for the Symbol of Ragnaros."}, [40]={npc="Kalaran Windblade", tgt="Kalaran Windblade", tag="Optional", desc="Complete Forging the Shaft. Kill Twilight mobs in the west cave for the Symbol of Ragnaros."}, [41]={npc="Kalaran Windblade", tgt="Kalaran Windblade", tag="Optional"}, [42]={hint="Wait for Kalaran Windblade to complete the Torch of Retribution.", tag="Optional"}, [43]={npc="Kalaran Windblade", tgt="Kalaran Windblade", tag="Optional"}, [44]={npc="Kalaran Windblade", tgt="Kalaran Windblade", tag="Optional"}, [45]={hint="Take the Torch of Retribution.", tag="Optional"}, [46]={npc="Torch of Retribution", npcObj=true, tag="Optional"}, [47]={npc="Kalaran Windblade", tgt="Kalaran Windblade", tag="Optional"}, [48]={hint="Speak with Squire Maltrake.", tag="Optional"}, [49]={npc="Squire Maltrake", tgt="Squire Maltrake", tag="Optional"}, [50]={npc="Squire Maltrake", tgt="Squire Maltrake", tag="Optional", desc="Light fires at the four sentry towers and pull away the guards on the towers first."}, [51]={hint="Set the North, South, East, and West Sentry Towers on fire by using the Torch of Retribution inside each of the buildings.", tag="Optional", desc="Light fires at the four sentry towers and pull away the guards on the towers first."}, [52]={npc="Squire Maltrake", tgt="Squire Maltrake", tag="Optional", desc="Light fires at the four sentry towers and pull away the guards on the towers first."}, [53]={npc="Hoard of the Black Dragonflight", npcObj=true, tag="Optional"}, [54]={hint="Open the chest.", tag="Optional"}, [55]={npc="Hoard of the Black Dragonflight", npcObj=true, tag="Optional"}, [56]={npc="Wooden Outhouse", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Detour to the Wooden Outhouse if heading southeast or short on XP. Bring 15 Silk Cloth."}, [57]={hint="Kill 8 Dark Iron Geologists and bring 15 pieces of Silk Cloth to the person locked in the outhouse in Searing Gorge.", tag="Optional", desc="Detour to the Wooden Outhouse if heading southeast or short on XP. Bring 15 Silk Cloth."}, [58]={npc="Wooden Outhouse", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Detour to the Wooden Outhouse if heading southeast or short on XP. Bring 15 Silk Cloth."}}},
    ["05-d22"] = {name="Alcaz Prison", entrance="Dustwallow Marsh 75.30, 14.10", pickup="When going to Swamp of Sorrows, open Dustwallow Marsh Brackenwall Village flight points before reaching level 48. Before heading to Searing Gorge, take The Missing Kor'kron (34.28, 39.35) to Eitrigg in the lobby of Orgrimmar Wisdom Valley Thrall, then fly Brackenwall Village to find Nazeer Bloodpike. Swim along the northeastern coast to Alcaz Island, turn in The Elite of the Elite and Right Place, Wrong Time at the sergeant's office on the island side, take No Orc Left Behind and go underground in the island tower. Leave Thrall Needs to Know until next time Orgrimmar.", pickupS={{"When going to Swamp of Sorrows, open Dustwallow Marsh Brackenwall Village flight points before reaching level 48"}, {"Before heading to Searing Gorge, take The Missing Kor'kron (34.28, 39.35) to Eitrigg in the lobby of Orgrimmar Wisdom Valley Thrall, then fly Brackenwall Village to find Nazeer Bloodpike"}, {"Swim along the northeastern coast to Alcaz Island, turn in The Elite of the Elite and Right Place, Wrong Time at the sergeant's office on the island side, take No Orc Left Behind and go underground in the island tower"}, {"Leave Thrall Needs to Know until next time Orgrimmar"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Find Commander Folkar in the upper cells → kill Overseer Wrex for the key → clear The Questioner and Tidemistress Ca'zass, looting bandanas → open the lower cells for Katerina the Cleaner and Blazeroar → read the note in the hidden room and return to Folkar upstairs."}, {k="取捨", text="Priority is given to the Kharon rescue chain from The Missing Kor'kron to Thrall Needs to Know; if the headscarf is not filled in one trip, delivery will be postponed."}, {k="說明", text="The Horde can avoid Theramore; swim to the northeastern coast via Brackenwall Village. The sergeant is on the island side, and the dungeon door is in the underground corridor of the island tower.", s={{"The Horde can avoid Theramore; swim to the northeastern coast via Brackenwall Village"}, {"The sergeant is on the island side, and the dungeon door is in the underground corridor of the island tower"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Eitrigg", tgt="Eitrigg", desc="Starting from level 48, look for Eitrigg in the lobby of Thrall in Wisdom Valley."}, [2]={hint="Speak with Nazeer Bloodspike in Brackenwall Village."}, [3]={npc="Nazeer Bloodpike", tgt="Nazeer Bloodpike"}, [4]={npc="Nazeer Bloodpike", tgt="Nazeer Bloodpike", preText="The Missing Kor'kron"}, [5]={hint="Find the missing Kor'kron Elites."}, [6]={npc="Sergeant Ulka", tgt="Sergeant Ulka"}, [7]={npc="Sergeant Ulka", tgt="Sergeant Ulka", preText="The Elite of the Elite"}, [8]={hint="Speak with Sergeant Ulka to learn more about the situation on Alcaz Isle."}, [9]={npc="Sergeant Ulka", tgt="Sergeant Ulka"}, [10]={npc="Sergeant Ulka", tgt="Sergeant Ulka", preText="Right Place, Wrong Time"}, [11]={npc="Sergeant Ulka", tgt="Sergeant Ulka", tag="Optional", desc="Do The Missing Kor'kron-Right Place, Wrong Time from Orgrimmar to the island, then check the sergeant's quests."}, [12]={npc="Sergeant Ulka", tgt="Sergeant Ulka", tag="Optional", desc="The sergeant offers this in game. Unlock unconfirmed; do The Missing Kor'kron-Right Place, Wrong Time first."}, [13]={text="Alcaz Prison entrance"}, [14]={hint="Enter the Alcaz Prison and find Commander Folkar.", desc="Location: Take the upper hall and find Commander Folkar in a cell."}, [15]={npc="Commander Folkar", tag="Unverified"}, [16]={npc="Commander Folkar", tag="Unverified", preText="No Orc Left Behind"}, [17]={hint="Enter the Alcaz Prison and slay 15 Strashasz Soldiers, 8 Strashaz Enchantresses, and bring the head of Tidemistress Ca'zass to Sergeant Ulka.", tag="Optional", desc="Location: Find Tidemistress Ca'zass by the upper cells. Clear naga along the hall."}, [18]={hint="Enter Alcaz Prison and collect 8 Blood Red Bandanas from the human guards there.", tag="Optional", desc="It may be necessary to swipe more times and check the quantity before issuing the order. Location: Kill human guards along the upper prison hall until you have all the drops."}, [19]={hint="Look for King Varian Wrynn in Alcaz Prison.", desc="Location: Open the lower door and kill the last boss. Find the note in the hidden room. Order: Get the key from the warden first."}, [20]={npc="Quest object", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified"}, [21]={npc="Quest object", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", preText="The Honor of the Kor'kron"}, [22]={hint="Report back to Commander Folkar.", desc="Location: Return from the last boss's hidden room to the commander in his upper cell. Order: Read step 18 note first."}, [23]={npc="Commander Folkar", tag="Unverified"}, [24]={npc="Commander Folkar", tag="Unverified", preText="Bad News for Folkar"}, [25]={npc="Sergeant Ulka", tgt="Sergeant Ulka", tag="Optional"}, [26]={hint="Bring word of Varian Wrynn's fate to Thrall in Orgrimmar."}, [27]={npc="Thrall", tgt="Thrall"}, [28]={npc="Eitrigg", tgt="Eitrigg", tag="Optional"}}},
    ["04-35"] = {name="The Hinterlands: Revantusk & Jintha'Alor", short="Hinterlands: Revantusk +", tips={{k="取捨", text="Do |Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog can be completed on the same beach as the Turtle quest; Moonkin Hunt the Savages and Testing the Vessel can be completed at the same time."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional|Job Opening: Guard Captain of Revantusk Village defeat 80 elites, so there is no ready-made team. Jintha'Alor If it is difficult to clear the area alone, do the coastal and inland quests first."}, {k="取捨", text="Don't pay it yet | Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog should be handed over to Booty Bay; Testing the Vessel should be handed over to Camp Mojache; Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient and The Ancient Egg should be reserved for Tanaris, Gadgetzan and Broken Pillar."}, {k="提醒", text="Below level 52, collect turtles and wild beasts along the coast of The Hinterlands, or clear Jintha'Alor with your team.", s={{"Below level 52, collect turtles and wild beasts along the coast of The Hinterlands, or clear Jintha'Alor with your team"}}}}, danger={[1]="Jintha'Alor There are groups of evil branch elites and healing monsters on the upper level. Those who formed a team walked along the stairs step by step, and those who did not formed a team stayed on the coast.", [2]="Gammerita is an elite sea turtle patrolling the coast. Keep an eye on it when you're patching up regular turtles, and get out of the way if there's no team."}, grind={[1]={mob="Saltwater Snapjaw", note="Revantusk Village Common turtles on the northern beach can be beaten and skinned in a straight line along the coast. Shared with players who collect turtle meat, no need to enter the Jintha'Alor elite area."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Gorkas"}, [2]={npc="Lard"}, [3]={npc="Smith Slagtree"}, [4]={npc="Lard"}, [5]={npc="Renn'az"}, [6]={npc="Mystic Yayo'jin"}}, steps={[1]={text="Fly from Searing Gorge to Revantusk Village. If locked, fly to Tarren Mill and use the pass north of Durnholde Keep. Follow the Hinterlands road east, then go south along the coast.", tag="I haven't used this flight path yet, so I have to use the running one for the first time."}, [2]={node="Revantusk Village", desc="Open flight path to Gorkas."}, [3]={text="You can set your hearth at Revantusk Village for this leg."}, [4]={text="Pick up at Revantusk Village → coast"}, [5]={npc="Katoom the Angler", tgt="Katoom the Angler"}, [6]={npc="Katoom the Angler", tgt="Katoom the Angler"}, [7]={npc="Huntsman Markhor", tgt="Huntsman Markhor"}, [8]={npc="Huntsman Markhor", tgt="Huntsman Markhor"}, [9]={npc="Lard", tgt="Lard"}, [10]={npc="Huntsman Markhor", tgt="Huntsman Markhor"}, [11]={npc="Primal Torntusk", tgt="Primal Torntusk"}, [12]={npc="Primal Torntusk", tgt="Primal Torntusk"}, [13]={npc="Huntsman Markhor", tgt="Huntsman Markhor", tag="Optional", desc="Do this only if you see the rare Razorbeak gryphon on the way."}, [14]={npc="Smith Slagtree", tgt="Smith Slagtree", tag="Optional", desc="Go around to the Northeast Temple."}, [15]={npc="Call to Arms!", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Jintha'Alor Elite at high places. Pick up when there is already a team."}, [16]={npc="Call to Arms!", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Pick up only if you plan to kill 80 elites in Jintha'Alor.", star={"Rune of the Guard Captain", {"PALADIN", "WARRIOR", "ROGUE", "HUNTER"}}}, [17]={hint="Katoom the Angler at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 15 Saltwater Snapjaw turtles. Return to him when you have completed this task."}, [18]={hint="Katoom the Angler at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill Gammerita and retrieve Katoom's Best Lure from her corpse.", desc="On the same line as Snapjaws, Mon! and Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog; call again when you see it."}, [19]={hint="Whiskey Slim in Booty Bay wants you to bring him the bottles of Pupellyverbos Port he lost.", desc="Accept at the Stonard/Eastwind Shore stop. Head north up the beach for the bottle."}, [20]={hint="Lard at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to find Lard's Lunch. Return to him when this task is complete."}, [21]={hint="Solve the riddle!", tag="Optional", desc="Requires Cortello's Riddle turned in and Cortello's Riddle active. Turn in Cortello's Riddle at the scroll under the bridge."}, [22]={npc="Cortello's Treasure", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Not held Cortello's Riddle Skip."}, [23]={text="Inland wildkin and Silvermanes → Jintha'Alor altar"}, [24]={hint="Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 10 Silvermane Stalkers and 10 Silvermane Howlers. Return to him once the task is complete."}, [25]={hint="Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 20 Savage Owlbeasts. Return to him once the task is complete."}, [26]={hint="Travel to the Hinterlands, and locate the Wildkin. Kill 10, and use the Muisek Vessel to shrink and capture the fallen Wildkin.", desc="Pick up on the Camp Mojache/Rage Scar Hold leg. Turn in in Feralas later."}, [27]={hint="Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill a Razorbeak Skylord and retrieve its Skylord Plume. Return to him once the task is complete.", tag="Optional", desc="If you encounter it, call again."}, [28]={hint="Smith Slagtree at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to find Slagtree's Lost Tools. Return to him once this task is complete.", tag="Optional"}, [29]={hint="Sprinkle in Gadgetzan wants you to collect a Violet Tragan and return it to her.", desc="Accept on the first Gadgetzan/Dunemaul visit. Turn in at Gadgetzan."}, [30]={hint="Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to recover 10 Vessels of Tainted Blood from Jintha'alor. Return to Primal Torntusk when this task is complete.", desc="Go with the Elder Torntusk quest and pay attention to the ladder patrol."}, [31]={hint="Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to recover his twin brother's remains. Find and return Huntsman Malkhor's Skull and Huntsman Malkhor's Bones to Huntsman Markhor.", desc="The target is in two places, get both items."}, [32]={hint="Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to rescue her mate, Elder Torntusk, from Jintha'alor."}, [33]={npc="Elder Torntusk", tgt="Elder Torntusk"}, [34]={npc="Elder Torntusk", tgt="Elder Torntusk"}, [35]={hint="Elder Torntusk at Jintha'alor wants you to kill Hitah'ya the Keeper to get the Shackle Key to his bindings. Return to Elder Torntusk when you have recovered the key."}, [36]={npc="Elder Torntusk", tgt="Elder Torntusk"}, [37]={npc="Elder Torntusk", tgt="Elder Torntusk"}, [38]={hint="Bring the Ancient Egg to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris.", tag="Optional", desc="Do if accepted during the Dunemaul stop. Turn in at Steamwheedle Port."}, [39]={hint="You have been ordered to slay Vile Priestess Hexx and 20 Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guards. See Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands once this task is complete.", tag="Optional"}, [40]={hint="You have been tasked with the decimation of 20 Vilebranch Berserkers, 20 Vilebranch Shadow Hunters, 20 Vilebranch Blood Drinkers, and 20 Vilebranch Soul Eaters.", tag="Optional"}, [41]={text="Hearth to Revantusk Village for all turn-ins if bound there."}, [42]={hint="Elder Torntusk at Jintha'alor wants you to return to Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village with news of his rescue."}, [43]={npc="Primal Torntusk", tgt="Primal Torntusk"}, [44]={npc="Huntsman Markhor", tgt="Huntsman Markhor"}, [45]={npc="Primal Torntusk", tgt="Primal Torntusk"}, [46]={npc="Katoom the Angler", tgt="Katoom the Angler"}, [47]={npc="Katoom the Angler", tgt="Katoom the Angler"}, [48]={npc="Huntsman Markhor", tgt="Huntsman Markhor"}, [49]={npc="Huntsman Markhor", tgt="Huntsman Markhor"}, [50]={npc="Lard", tgt="Lard"}, [51]={npc="Huntsman Markhor", tgt="Huntsman Markhor", tag="Optional"}, [52]={npc="Smith Slagtree", tgt="Smith Slagtree", tag="Optional"}, [53]={npc="Primal Torntusk", tgt="Primal Torntusk", tag="Optional"}, [54]={npc="Primal Torntusk", tgt="Primal Torntusk", tag="Optional", star={"Rune of the Guard Captain", {"PALADIN", "WARRIOR", "ROGUE", "HUNTER"}}}, [55]={npc="Christoph Walker", tgt="Christoph Walker", tag="Optional", desc="Accept from Christoph Walker in Undercity before Hinterlands. Turn in in Blasted Lands."}, [56]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional", desc="Buy four materials on the AH. Head north from Tarren Mill to Bath'rah for Elemental Mastery."}, [57]={hint="Bring the elements earth, air, fire and water to Bath'rah the Windwatcher.", tag="Optional", desc="Buy four materials on the AH. Head north from Tarren Mill to Bath'rah for Elemental Mastery."}, [58]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional", desc="Buy four materials on the AH. Head north from Tarren Mill to Bath'rah for Elemental Mastery."}, [59]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional", desc="Choose one of Elemental Mastery or Mastering the Elements to complete; leave it to Western Plague to collect materials."}, [60]={npc="Miles Dexter", tgt="Miles Dexter", tag="Optional", desc="Accept in Undercity's Rogues' Quarter on your first trip to the Hinterlands."}, [61]={hint="Speak with Lord Jorach Ravenholdt in Ravenholdt Manor.", tag="Optional", desc="Accept in Undercity's Rogues' Quarter on your first trip to the Hinterlands."}, [62]={npc="Lord Jorach Ravenholdt", tgt="Lord Jorach Ravenholdt", tag="Optional", desc="Accept in Undercity's Rogues' Quarter on your first trip to the Hinterlands."}, [63]={npc="Lord Jorach Ravenholdt", tgt="Lord Jorach Ravenholdt", tag="Optional", desc="Take it from Ravenholdt Manor and leave Azshara."}}},
    ["04-36"] = {name="Blasted Lands", tips={{k="取捨", text="Do | Five collections to do together. A total of 5 jaw bones, 6 wild boar lungs, 6 scorpion claws, 11 lizard brains, and 14 Buzzard gizzards are required for the full cross. Materials will be deducted every time you turn in a quest."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional|Hand in the faster quests first. When Buzzard or lizard competition is fierce, leave unfinished The Basilisk's Bite or Vulture's Vigor and continue with Stranglethorn Vale Booty Bay."}, {k="提醒", text="If you want to gain experience, stay in the north at 46-53, 15-27 and hunt wild beasts along the hillside. There are higher level enemies to the south.", s={{"If you want to gain experience, stay in the north at 46-53, 15-27 and hunt wild beasts along the hillside"}, {"There are higher level enemies to the south"}}}}, danger={[1]="The levels of monsters south of the Blood Mage Camp are higher than those on the northern slope. Only do northern collections when staying on the outer circle of the hillside."}, grind={[1]={mob="Scorpok Stinger", note="There is a whole patch of common scorpions on the east side of the blood mage camp. easily close the scorpion pincers and skin them. Monsters often attack from the roadside to avoid elite patrols."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Breyk"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Karakul"}, [3]={npc="Gharash"}, [4]={npc="Thultash"}, [5]={npc="Thultazor"}}, steps={[1]={text="Fly from Revantusk Village to Stonard, then follow the road south into the Blasted Lands. Visit the two Bloodmages in the north (50.55, 14.20 and 50.64, 14.30)."}, [2]={npc="Bloodmage Drazial", tgt="Bloodmage Drazial"}, [3]={npc="Bloodmage Drazial", tgt="Bloodmage Drazial"}, [4]={npc="Bloodmage Drazial", tgt="Bloodmage Drazial"}, [5]={npc="Bloodmage Lynnore", tgt="Bloodmage Lynnore"}, [6]={npc="Bloodmage Lynnore", tgt="Bloodmage Lynnore"}, [7]={hint="Bring three Snickerfang Jowls, two Blasted Boar Lungs, and one Scorpok Pincer to Bloodmage Drazial."}, [8]={hint="Bring three Blasted Boar Lungs, two Scorpok Pincers, and one Basilisk Brain to Bloodmage Drazial."}, [9]={hint="Bring three Scorpok Pincers, two Vulture Gizzards, and one Blasted Boar Lung to Bloodmage Drazial."}, [10]={hint="Bring ten Basilisk Brains and two Vulture Gizzards to Bloodmage Lynnore."}, [11]={hint="Bring ten Vulture Gizzards and two Snickerfang Jowls to Bloodmage Lynnore."}, [12]={npc="Bloodmage Drazial", tgt="Bloodmage Drazial"}, [13]={npc="Bloodmage Drazial", tgt="Bloodmage Drazial"}, [14]={npc="Bloodmage Drazial", tgt="Bloodmage Drazial"}, [15]={npc="Bloodmage Lynnore", tgt="Bloodmage Lynnore"}, [16]={npc="Bloodmage Lynnore", tgt="Bloodmage Lynnore"}, [17]={npc="Kum'isha the Collector", tgt="Kum'isha the Collector", tag="Optional", desc="If not, skip it."}, [18]={hint="In your journeys throughout the Blasted Lands, should you ever come across a Flawless Draenethyst Sphere, take the item back to Kum'isha the Collector.", tag="Optional", desc="If not, skip it."}, [19]={npc="Kum'isha the Collector", tgt="Kum'isha the Collector", tag="Optional", desc="If not, skip it."}, [20]={npc="Kum'isha the Collector", tgt="Kum'isha the Collector", tag="Optional", desc="If not, skip it."}, [21]={hint="Bring Kum'isha Imperfect Draenethyst Fragments and be rewarded for each one you turn in.", tag="Optional", desc="If not, skip it."}, [22]={npc="Kum'isha the Collector", tgt="Kum'isha the Collector", tag="Optional", desc="If not, skip it."}, [23]={hint="Speak with the Fallen Hero of the Horde at the entrance to the Blasted Lands.", tag="Optional"}, [24]={npc="Fallen Hero of the Horde", tgt="Fallen Hero of the Horde", tag="Optional"}, [25]={npc="Fallen Hero of the Horde", tgt="Fallen Hero of the Horde", tag="Optional", desc="En route with the Blood Mage's Wild Boar Lung quest; fight it in the north in advance."}, [26]={hint="Kill 7 Helboar in the Blasted Lands and return to the Fallen Hero of the Horde.", tag="Optional", desc="En route with the Blood Mage's Wild Boar Lung quest; fight it in the north in advance."}, [27]={npc="Fallen Hero of the Horde", tgt="Fallen Hero of the Horde", tag="Optional", desc="En route with the Blood Mage's Wild Boar Lung quest; fight it in the north in advance."}, [28]={npc="Fallen Hero of the Horde", tgt="Fallen Hero of the Horde", tag="Optional", desc="The enemy is dense, so rely on the outer circle of the camp to pull alone."}, [29]={hint="Slaughter the Shadowsworn in the Blasted Lands and return to the Fallen Hero of the Horde.", tag="Optional", desc="The enemy is dense, so rely on the outer circle of the camp to pull alone."}, [30]={npc="Fallen Hero of the Horde", tgt="Fallen Hero of the Horde", tag="Optional", desc="The enemy is dense, so rely on the outer circle of the camp to pull alone."}, [31]={npc="Fallen Hero of the Horde", tgt="Fallen Hero of the Horde", tag="Optional", desc="Do now with a group or save for the Eastern Kingdoms trip to Light's Hope Chapel.", star={"Diamond Flask", {"WARRIOR"}}}, [32]={text="Retrace your route to Stonard and fly to Booty Bay."}}},
    ["04-37"] = {name="Stranglethorn Vale: Booty Bay (return)", short="Booty Bay", tips={{k="取捨", text="Do | This trip gives priority to paying Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog for level 50. The low-level quests of Stranglethorn Vale Gromgau and Booty Bay, Stranglethorn Vale Booty Bay have been processed in batches; those that are still in the log and have been completed can also be returned at the same port."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional|If there is no wine or pending quests for The Hinterlands, this stop can only be transferred by boat. The Captain's Chest and Stranglethorn Fever ​​If you want to leave the city and then come back, do it when you lack experience or have a team."}, {k="提醒", text="Booty Bay is a neutral port. Go to Ratchet from the passenger ship to avoid accidentally boarding other ferries.", s={{"Booty Bay is a neutral port"}, {"Go to Ratchet from the passenger ship to avoid accidentally boarding other ferries"}}}}, grind={[1]={mob="Blood Elf Reclaimer", note="Booty Bay This stop is mainly for delivery and boating. If you are missing level 53, follow the same path to the next stop Azshara and then fight ordinary blood elves. The quest point is easy to collide with the team, so make up for it outside the camp."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Gringer"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Skindle"}, [3]={npc="Jutak"}, [4]={npc="Nixxrax Fillamug"}, [5]={npc="Haren Kanmae"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Whiskey Slim", tgt="Whiskey Slim", desc="Accept on the Stonard/Eastwind Shore stop. Collect grog in the Hinterlands."}, [2]={npc="Captain Hecklebury Smotts", tgt="Captain Hecklebury Smotts", tag="Optional", desc="A level 47 quest. If you want to gain experience and haven't completed it yet, take it."}, [3]={npc="Fin Fizracket", tgt="Fin Fizracket", tag="Optional", desc="Group up first. Several waves of gorillas attack."}, [4]={hint="Bring Smotts' Chest to Hecklebury Smotts in Booty Bay.", tag="Optional"}, [5]={npc="Witch Doctor Unbagwa", tgt="Witch Doctor Unbagwa", tag="Optional", desc="Take Stranglethorn Fever first, and then complete this tooth-crossing event."}, [6]={hint="Loot from: Mistvale Gorilla, Jungle Thunderer, Enraged Silverback Gorilla", tag="Optional", desc="Take Stranglethorn Fever first, and then complete this tooth-crossing event."}, [7]={npc="Witch Doctor Unbagwa", tgt="Witch Doctor Unbagwa", tag="Optional", desc="Take Stranglethorn Fever first, and then complete this tooth-crossing event."}, [8]={hint="Seek out Witch Doctor Unbagwa and have him summon Mokk the Savage. Bring the Heart of Mokk to Fin Fizracket.", tag="Optional", desc="Summoned by the cross-tooth incident of Stranglethorn Fever."}, [9]={npc="Captain Hecklebury Smotts", tgt="Captain Hecklebury Smotts", tag="Optional"}, [10]={npc="Fin Fizracket", tgt="Fin Fizracket", tag="Optional"}, [11]={text="Take the boat to Ratchet and fly to Orgrimmar. You can pick up Betrayed from Belgrom before heading to Valormok in Azshara."}}},
    ["04-38"] = {name="Azshara: Valormok & Temple of Arkkoroc", short="Azshara: Valormok +", tips={{k="取捨", text="Do | Thalassian Base Camp, three seals and Remtori are put together; Ruins of Eldarath is used to pick up four stone slabs and Naga runestones at the same time."}, {k="取捨", text="Skipable | The video skips two team quests. [Video] Candidates for the WoW Forever that can be confirmed as elite include Ley of the Land and Deadliest Catch, both of which have been skipped on this site."}, {k="取捨", text="Then drop by | Delivery to Andron Gant to transfer Undercity to Andron Gant (54.81, 76.33), and leave Eastern Plaguelands Light's Hope Chapel for transfer. The city return quest requires returning to Azshara, so this route optional."}, {k="提醒", text="If you are below level 53, replenish the Ruins of Eldarath Naga or Thalassian Base Camp Blood Elf, and find the drops from quests when fighting monsters.", s={{"If you are below level 53, replenish the Ruins of Eldarath Naga or Thalassian Base Camp Blood Elf, and find the drops from quests when fighting monsters"}}}}, danger={[1]="Ruins of Eldarath There are a lot of Naga monsters inside. When picking up slates, go in and out along the outer wall. After interrupting, drag the monster out of the room."}, grind={[1]={mob="Blood Elf Reclaimer", note="Thalassian Base Camp The level of ordinary blood elves is just right, and it will be dropped by collecting blood elves. It is possible to continuously pull the magic system in the camp and fight from the outside edge."}, [2]={mob="Spitelash Myrmidon", note="Ruins of Eldarath is an ordinary naga. If you pass by, successfully collect the naga quest. Attach Ruins to the outer wall with a single pull to avoid the dense legal system on the inside."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Kroum"}, [2]={npc="Gruul Darkblade"}, [3]={npc="Kurll"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Gryshka"}, [5]={npc="Kaja"}, [6]={npc="Horthus"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Belgrom Rockmaul", tgt="Belgrom Rockmaul", desc="Orgrimmar Honor Valley pick up. The guide to the new version of the Betrayal Line."}, [2]={npc="Jes'rimon", tgt="Jes'rimon", tag="Optional", desc="Optional. Pick up now, then kill Ravasaurs in Un'Goro."}, [3]={text="Fly from Orgrimmar to Valormok if unlocked. For a first visit, run east from Splintertree Post through Talrendis Point and continue to Valormok.", tag="I haven't used this flight path yet, so I have to use the running one for the first time."}, [4]={text="Loh'atu in the west → pickups at Valormok"}, [5]={npc="Loh'atu", tgt="Loh'atu"}, [6]={npc="Loh'atu", tgt="Loh'atu"}, [7]={hint="Destroy 6 Highborne Apparitions and 6 Highborne Lichlings before returning to Loh'atu in Azshara."}, [8]={hint="Kill 6 Haldarr Satyr, 2 Haldarr Tricksters, 2 Haldarr Felsworn and then return to Loh'atu on the border of Ashenvale."}, [9]={npc="Loh'atu", tgt="Loh'atu"}, [10]={npc="Loh'atu", tgt="Loh'atu"}, [11]={node="Valormok", desc="Open flight path to Kroum."}, [12]={hint="Deliver the Sealed Letter to Ag'tor Bloodfist in Azshara."}, [13]={npc="Ag'tor Bloodfist", tgt="Ag'tor Bloodfist"}, [14]={npc="Ag'tor Bloodfist", tgt="Ag'tor Bloodfist"}, [15]={npc="Jediga", tgt="Jediga"}, [16]={text="Thalassian Base Camp → temple and Ruins of Eldarath → Valormok"}, [17]={npc="Kim'jael", tgt="Kim'jael"}, [18]={hint="Search the Thalassian Base Camp for Kim'jael's Compass, Scope, Stuffed Chicken and Wizzlegoober, then return them to him in Azshara."}, [19]={npc="Kim'jael", tgt="Kim'jael"}, [20]={npc="Kim'jael", tgt="Kim'jael"}, [21]={hint="Kill 10 Blood Elf Reclaimers, and 10 Blood Elf Surveyors before seeking out Magus Rimtori's camp. Once you've found it, look for something that might be important to her that can be used to draw her into a fight.", desc="Wowhead Forever lists 6 of each. QuestieDB lists 10. Check your quest log."}, [22]={npc="Kaldorei Tome of Summoning", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified"}, [23]={npc="Sin'dorei Tome of Summoning", tgt="Sin'dorei Tome of Summoning", tag="Unverified", desc="The eternal version of the betrayal line. One of each type, complete Betrayed first."}, [24]={hint="Bring the Seal of the Warden, Seal of the Warrior, and Seal of the Ranger to the Sin'dorei Tome of Summoning.", tag="Target: Lieutenant Suncrest/Majis Eagle Helmet/Ranger Lydrea/Skyborne Test, Unverified", desc="The eternal version of the betrayal line. One of each type, complete Betrayed first."}, [25]={npc="Sin'dorei Tome of Summoning", tgt="Sin'dorei Tome of Summoning", tag="Unverified", desc="The eternal version of the betrayal line. One of each type, complete Betrayed first."}, [26]={npc="Sin'dorei Tome of Summoning", tgt="Sin'dorei Tome of Summoning", tag="Unverified"}, [27]={hint="Break the Seals of the Sin'dorei, then bring Magus Rimtori's head to Ag'tor Bloodfist in Valormok.", tag="Unverified"}, [28]={hint="Find Some Rune that the naga have in their possession in the Ruins of Eldarath and return it to Kim'jael in Azshara."}, [29]={hint="Find the Tablet of Beth'Amara, the Tablet of Jin'yael, the Tablet of Markri, and the Tablet of Sael'hai before returning to Jediga in Azshara."}, [30]={npc="Kim'jael", tgt="Kim'jael"}, [31]={npc="Jediga", tgt="Jediga"}, [32]={npc="Ag'tor Bloodfist", tgt="Ag'tor Bloodfist", tag="Unverified"}, [33]={npc="Ag'tor Bloodfist", tgt="Ag'tor Bloodfist", tag="Unverified"}, [34]={npc="Jediga", tgt="Jediga", tag="Optional", desc="Pay via Thunder Bluff before the next stop."}, [35]={npc="Jediga", tgt="Jediga", tag="Optional", desc="Please submit this reply to Orgrimmar."}, [36]={npc="Jediga", tgt="Jediga", tag="Optional", desc="Leave it until later via Undercity."}, [37]={text="Fly from Valormok to Orgrimmar for the head and tablet turn-ins. The Thunder Bluff tablet turn-in takes another flight."}, [38]={hint="Bring the Head of Magus Rimtori to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar.", tag="Unverified"}, [39]={npc="Belgrom Rockmaul", tgt="Belgrom Rockmaul", tag="Unverified"}, [40]={hint="Bring the Tablet of Jin'yael to Jes'rimon in Orgrimmar.", tag="Optional"}, [41]={npc="Jes'rimon", tgt="Jes'rimon", tag="Optional"}, [42]={npc="Zilzibin Drumlore", tgt="Zilzibin Drumlore", tag="Optional", desc="Pick up from Zilzibin in Orgrimmar before Feralas. Requires 32 or Zukk'ash Report. Save for Tanaris."}, [43]={hint="Bring the Tablet of Beth'Amara to Magatha in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional"}, [44]={npc="Magatha Grimtotem", tgt="Magatha Grimtotem", tag="Optional"}, [45]={npc="Ormak Grimshot", tgt="Ormak Grimshot", tag="Optional", desc="Visit a Hunter trainer in Orgrimmar. Enter Azshara from its west flight path."}, [46]={hint="Speak to Ogtinc in Azshara.", tag="Optional", desc="Visit a Hunter trainer in Orgrimmar. Enter Azshara from its west flight path."}, [47]={npc="Ogtinc", tgt="Ogtinc", tag="Optional", desc="Visit a Hunter trainer in Orgrimmar. Enter Azshara from its west flight path."}, [48]={npc="Ogtinc", tgt="Ogtinc", tag="Optional"}, [49]={hint="Bring a pair of Perfect Courser Antlers to Ogtinc in Azshara. Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast of the Ruins of Eldarath.", tag="Optional"}, [50]={npc="Ogtinc", tgt="Ogtinc", tag="Optional"}, [51]={npc="Ogtinc", tgt="Ogtinc", tag="Optional"}, [52]={hint="Bring 6 Wavethrasher Scales to Ogtinc in Azshara. Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath.", tag="Optional"}, [53]={npc="Ogtinc", tgt="Ogtinc", tag="Optional"}, [54]={npc="Ogtinc", tgt="Ogtinc", tag="Optional", desc="Run Sunken Temple during the Eastern Kingdoms trip.", star={"Devilsaur Eye", {"HUNTER"}}}, [55]={npc="Uthel'nay", tgt="Uthel'nay", tag="Optional", desc="First find a trainer in Orgrimmar Spiritual Valley."}, [56]={hint="Seek out Sanath Lim-yo and gain passage to see Archmage Xylem.", tag="Optional", desc="First find a trainer in Orgrimmar Spiritual Valley."}, [57]={npc="Sanath Lim-yo", tgt="Sanath Lim-yo", tag="Optional", desc="First find a trainer in Orgrimmar Spiritual Valley."}, [58]={npc="Archmage Xylem", tgt="Archmage Xylem", tag="Optional", desc="Do with northern Azshara's blood elf quests after accepting from Archmage Xylem."}, [59]={hint="Bring 10 Glittering Dust to Archmage Xylem.", tag="Optional", desc="Do with northern Azshara's blood elf quests after accepting from Archmage Xylem."}, [60]={npc="Archmage Xylem", tgt="Archmage Xylem", tag="Optional", desc="Do with northern Azshara's blood elf quests after accepting from Archmage Xylem."}, [61]={npc="Archmage Xylem", tgt="Archmage Xylem", tag="Optional"}, [62]={hint="Collect 6 Enchanted Coral and return them to Archmage Xylem.", tag="Optional"}, [63]={npc="Archmage Xylem", tgt="Archmage Xylem", tag="Optional"}, [64]={npc="Archmage Xylem", tgt="Archmage Xylem", tag="Optional", desc="Run Sunken Temple on the next Eastern Kingdoms trip.", star={"Fire Ruby", {"MAGE"}}}, [65]={hint="Retrieve the Sealed Azure Bag from the Timbermaw Shaman in Azshara. Then take the bag to Archmage Xylem, also found in Azshara.", tag="Optional, Target: Timbermaw Shaman /Blackmaw Shaman", desc="Kill Blackmaw Shamans for drops to avoid losing Timbermaw reputation."}, [66]={npc="Archmage Xylem", tgt="Archmage Xylem", tag="Optional", desc="From the base of the mountain Sanath Lim-yo (28.11, 50.09) go to Xirem's Tower."}, [67]={npc="Archmage Xylem", tgt="Archmage Xylem", tag="Optional"}, [68]={hint="Bring 10 Encoded Fragments to Archmage Xylem in Azshara.", tag="Optional"}, [69]={npc="Archmage Xylem", tgt="Archmage Xylem", tag="Optional"}, [70]={npc="Archmage Xylem", tgt="Archmage Xylem", tag="Optional", desc="Run Sunken Temple during the Eastern Kingdoms leg.", star={"Duskbat Drape", {"ROGUE"}}}, [71]={npc="Ur'kyo", tgt="Ur'kyo", tag="Optional", desc="Go to Orgrimmar to find a priest trainer and buy Undead Rot x1."}, [72]={hint="Seek out Ogtinc in Azshara.", tag="Optional", desc="Go to Orgrimmar to find a priest trainer and buy Undead Rot x1."}, [73]={npc="Ogtinc", tgt="Ogtinc", tag="Optional", desc="Go to Orgrimmar to find a priest trainer and buy Undead Rot x1."}, [74]={npc="Ogtinc", tgt="Ogtinc", tag="Optional"}, [75]={hint="Acquire 4 Healthy Courser Glands and bring them to Ogtinc in Azshara. Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath.", tag="Optional"}, [76]={npc="Ogtinc", tgt="Ogtinc", tag="Optional"}, [77]={npc="Ogtinc", tgt="Ogtinc", tag="Optional", desc="Buy from players or the AH to skip a Plaguelands detour."}, [78]={hint="Acquire an Ichor of Undeath for Ogtinc in Azshara. Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath.", tag="Optional", desc="Buy from players or the AH to skip a Plaguelands detour."}, [79]={npc="Ogtinc", tgt="Ogtinc", tag="Optional", desc="Buy from players or the AH to skip a Plaguelands detour."}, [80]={npc="Ogtinc", tgt="Ogtinc", tag="Optional", desc="Run Sunken Temple during the Eastern Kingdoms trip.", star={"Blessed Prayer Beads", {"PRIEST"}}}}},
    ["04-39"] = {name="Feralas: Camp Mojache (return)", short="Feralas: Camp Mojache", tips={{k="取捨", text="Do |Testing the Vessel is handed in at Camp Mojache, followed by Hippogryph Muisek-Mountain Giant Muisek; each stage must be handed in first before the next container can be obtained."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional|Natural Materials If you lack too many materials, skip; the Beiquan side quest is the same trip as the farther Western Giant, so do it when you have time."}, {k="提醒", text="If you are short of a small amount of experience, refine Fey Dragon at 69.45, 44.95, or go to the Northwest Harpy Camp.", s={{"If you are short of a small amount of experience, refine Fey Dragon at 69.45, 44.95, or go to the Northwest Harpy Camp"}}}}, grind={[1]={mob="Northspring Slayer", note="Northspring Harpy The normal mobs outside the camp can be easily collected if you are doing the Beiquan quest. Just for the experience, there is no need to turn back from the camp, stay until the next stop."}, [2]={mob="Groddoc Thunderer", note="If the harpy point is occupied, attack the ordinary orangutan on the southeast side instead; the open space is easy to retreat to, so avoid multiple consecutive pulls along the outside."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Shyn"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Greul"}, [3]={npc="Cawind Trueaim"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Greul"}, [5]={npc="Cawind Trueaim"}, [6]={npc="Tarhus"}}, steps={[1]={text="Fly to Camp Mojache if unlocked. Joining here with no flight path? Fly to Freewind Post, follow the valley west into Feralas and learn the Camp Mojache flight path from Shyn."}, [2]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", desc="Accept on the Camp Mojache/Dire Maul stop. Trap owlbeast souls in the Hinterlands."}, [3]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", desc="Once completed, return to the witch doctor to pick up the next one."}, [4]={hint="Kill 10 Frayfeather Hippogryphs of any type, then use the Muisek Vessel to shrink and capture them.", desc="Once completed, return to the witch doctor to pick up the next one."}, [5]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", desc="Once completed, return to the witch doctor to pick up the next one."}, [6]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i"}, [7]={hint="Kill 8 Sprite Darters or Sprite Dragons. Use the Muisek Vessel to shrink and capture the fallen Faerie Dragons."}, [8]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i"}, [9]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i"}, [10]={hint="Kill 3 Wandering Forest Walkers. Use the Muisek Vessel to shrink and capture the fallen Treants."}, [11]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i"}, [12]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i"}, [13]={npc="Talo Thornhoof", tgt="Talo Thornhoof", tag="Optional", desc="Go to the Northspring Harpy area and pick it up when you have the ability to play elite."}, [14]={npc="Talo Thornhoof", tgt="Talo Thornhoof", tag="Optional"}, [15]={hint="Kill 7 Land Walkers or Cliff Giants. Use the Muisek Vessel to shrink and capture the fallen Mountain Giants."}, [16]={hint="Talo Thornhoof wants you to kill 4 Northspring Harpies, 4 Northspring Roguefeathers, 4 Northspring Windcallers, and 4 Northspring Slayers.", tag="Optional"}, [17]={hint="Talo Thornhoof in Camp Mojache wants Edana Hatetalon's Dark Heart.", tag="Optional", desc="The summoning point is at the North Spring Altar."}, [18]={hint="Bring 2 Splintered Logs, 6 Encrusted Minerals, 20 pieces of Resilient Sinew, and 40 Metallic Fragments to Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Camp Mojache.", tag="Optional", desc="Accept on the Camp Mojache/Dire Maul stop. Gather as you go. Skip extra backtracking."}, [19]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i"}, [20]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tag="Optional"}, [21]={npc="Talo Thornhoof", tgt="Talo Thornhoof", tag="Optional"}, [22]={npc="Talo Thornhoof", tgt="Talo Thornhoof", tag="Optional"}, [23]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tag="Optional", desc="After completing Mountain Giant Muisek and Natural Materials."}, [24]={hint="Witch Doctor Uzer'i wants you to wait for a moment while he prepares the weapons.", tag="Optional", desc="After completing Mountain Giant Muisek and Natural Materials."}, [25]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tag="Optional", desc="After completing Mountain Giant Muisek and Natural Materials."}, [26]={text="Fly from Camp Mojache to Gadgetzan in Tanaris."}}},
    ["04-40"] = {name="Tanaris: Gadgetzan & Broken Pillar", short="Tanaris: Gadgetzan +", tips={{k="取捨", text="Do | Gadgetzan First, complete the three sections Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient→Noggenfogger Elixir, and then go to Broken Pillar after accepting the Un'Goro quest."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional | The Stone Circle needs to be returned to Ratchet; this site can only do The Sunken Temple and Gahz'ridian. If you connect The Stone Circle for a copy link, make another appointment to return it after picking up the stone ring at The Barrens Ratchet."}, {k="取捨", text="Later, Super Sticky and Bungle in the Jungle with front-end are all made in Un'Goro Crater Marshal's Refuge. Yuka Screwspigot Burning Steppes Flame Crest intersects with Blackrock Mountain."}, {k="提醒", text="If you still have less experience, solve Gahz'ridian near the broken pillar and play Dunemaul Ogre; also form a team to play Zul'Farrak for Tanaris.", s={{"If you still have less experience, solve Gahz'ridian near the broken pillar and play Dunemaul Ogre; also form a team to play Zul'Farrak for Tanaris"}}}}, grind={[1]={mob="Hazzali Swarmer", note="The ordinary scorpions outside Hazali's nest are closer to this level and have sufficient density. If left on the surface, it will be easy to pull around the hole."}, [2]={mob="Glasshide Petrifier", note="Before Broken Pillar or Un'Goro, follow the south path and kill common lizards. The refresh is dispersed and will not be separated by the Dunemaul Compound quest team."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Bulkrek Ragefist"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Fizzgrimble"}, [3]={npc="Wrinkle Goodsteel"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Fizzgrimble"}, [5]={npc="Blizrik Buckshot"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Sprinkle", tgt="Sprinkle", desc="Accept in Tanaris. Gather mushrooms in the Hinterlands. Turn in first at Gadgetzan."}, [2]={npc="Sprinkle", tgt="Sprinkle", desc="Submit Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient first."}, [3]={hint="Sprinkle wants to you take the Violet Powder to Marin Noggenfogger in Gadgetzan.", desc="Submit Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient first."}, [4]={npc="Marin Noggenfogger", tgt="Marin Noggenfogger", desc="Submit Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient first."}, [5]={npc="Marin Noggenfogger", tgt="Marin Noggenfogger"}, [6]={hint="Marin Noggenfogger wants you to speak to him again after he creates his elixir."}, [7]={npc="Marin Noggenfogger", tgt="Marin Noggenfogger"}, [8]={hint="Speak to Alchemist Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan.", tag="Optional", desc="Before leaving Orgrimmar for Valormok, see Zilzibin after 32 or Zukk'ash Report."}, [9]={npc="Alchemist Pestlezugg", tgt="Alchemist Pestlezugg", tag="Optional"}, [10]={npc="Alchemist Pestlezugg", tgt="Alchemist Pestlezugg", tag="Optional", desc="Turn in Horde quest March of the Silithid first. Save the follow-up for Un'Goro."}, [11]={npc="Tran'rek", tgt="Tran'rek", desc="Un'Goro Crater Marshal's Refuge Go to Un'Goro to fight the tar monster."}, [12]={text="If you have the Ancient Egg, turn it in at Steamwheedle Port to the east. Otherwise go straight south to the Broken Pillar."}, [13]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya", tag="Optional", desc="Accept in Tanaris. Get the egg at Jintha'Alor. Yeh'kinya is in Steamwheedle Port."}, [14]={npc="Yorba Screwspigot", tgt="Yorba Screwspigot", tag="Optional", desc="Pick up at Steamwheedle Port. Turn in at Flame Crest on the way to Blackrock Depths."}, [15]={hint="Find Marvon Rivetseeker in Tanaris.", desc="Pick up at Camp Mojache before the Rage Scar Hold loop."}, [16]={npc="Marvon Rivetseeker", tgt="Marvon Rivetseeker"}, [17]={npc="Marvon Rivetseeker", tgt="Marvon Rivetseeker"}, [18]={npc="Marvon Rivetseeker", tgt="Marvon Rivetseeker", tag="Optional", desc="Turn in The Sunken Temple first. Get the Stone Circle in Ratchet if you plan to run Sunken Temple."}, [19]={hint="Marvon Rivetseeker in Tanaris wants you to collect 30 Gahz'ridian Ornaments.", desc="Broken Pillar Search around first and scan along the outer circle."}, [20]={npc="Marvon Rivetseeker", tgt="Marvon Rivetseeker"}, [21]={hint="Retrieve the Stone Circle from Marvon Rivetseeker's workshop in Ratchet.", tag="Optional", desc="Grab it during any later Ratchet stop."}, [22]={npc="Marvon Rivetseeker", tgt="Marvon Rivetseeker", tag="Optional"}, [23]={npc="Marvon Rivetseeker", tgt="Marvon Rivetseeker", tag="Optional", desc="Only answer when calling Sunken Temple."}, [24]={npc="Torwa Pathfinder", tgt="Torwa Pathfinder", tag="Optional", desc="Find Torwa Pathfinder at Un'Goro's southeast entrance. Gather on the next leg."}, [25]={text="Follow the Tanaris road south from the Broken Pillar, then head west into Un'Goro Crater."}}},
    ["05-d23"] = {name="The Temple of Atal'Hakkar", entrance="Swamp of Sorrows 69.50, 52.50 (road sign outside the temple building)", pickup="Go to Swamp of Sorrows Stonard to complete 1424 and keep The Atal'ai Exile; from The Hinterlands Revantusk Village flight path to The Hinterlands south side exile handover The Atal'ai Exile, pick up 1444 and 1446, if complete Zul'Farrak slate chain then go Jintha'Alor Get eggs. Feralas first pick up The Sunken Temple; Tanaris Gadgetzan and Dunemaul Compound first go to Malvon to open the stone ring quest, fly Ratchet to pick up the items, and then return to Malvon to pick up the two temple quests. After spawning Tanaris Steamwheedle Port, fly from Gadgetzan to Ratchet, then take a boat to Booty Bay, fly Stonard to hand over 1444, pick up 1445 and go to the temple.", pickupS={{"Go to Swamp of Sorrows Stonard to complete 1424 and keep The Atal'ai Exile; from The Hinterlands Revantusk Village flight path to The Hinterlands south side exile handover The Atal'ai Exile, pick up 1444 and 1446, if complete Zul'Farrak slate chain then go Jintha'Alor Get eggs"}, {"Feralas first pick up The Sunken Temple"}, {"Tanaris Gadgetzan and Dunemaul Compound first go to Malvon to open the stone ring quest, fly Ratchet to pick up the items, and then return to Malvon to pick up the two temple quests"}, {"After spawning Tanaris Steamwheedle Port, fly from Gadgetzan to Ratchet, then take a boat to Booty Bay, fly Stonard to hand over 1444, pick up 1445 and go to the temple"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Take the right entrance path to the lower ring → check the altar, activate the statues and kill Atal'alarion → clear the six upper balconies → east from the Pit of Sacrifice for Jammal'an → optional Hakkar event west → four dragonkin → Eranikus and the Essence Font. Loot idols from Atal'ai trolls throughout."}, {k="取捨", text="Stonard and The Hinterlands local chains are given priority; Mosalu chain is suitable for people who have brushed Zul'Farrak and went to Jintha'Alor; Shihuan arranges a trip to Ratchet at Tanaris, Gadgetzan and Dunemaul Compound."}, {k="說明", text="The coordinates point outside the building Pool of Tears. Enter the temple along the stairs on the south side, pass through the Hall of Masks and the Hall of Ceremonies to the dungeon door on the middle floor of the Hall of Bones.", s={{"The coordinates point outside the building Pool of Tears"}, {"Enter the temple along the stairs on the south side, pass through the Hall of Masks and the Hall of Ceremonies to the dungeon door on the middle floor of the Hall of Bones"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Fel'zerul", tgt="Fel'zerul", desc="If you have completed the main route, continue directly from The Atal'ai Exile."}, [2]={hint="Fel'zerul in Stonard wants you to gather 10 Atal'ai Artifacts."}, [3]={npc="Fel'zerul", tgt="Fel'zerul"}, [4]={npc="Fel'zerul", tgt="Fel'zerul", preText="Pool of Tears"}, [5]={hint="Bring the Bundle of Atal'ai Artifacts to the Atal'ai Exile in the Hinterlands."}, [6]={npc="Atal'ai Exile", tgt="Atal'ai Exile"}, [7]={npc="Atal'ai Exile", tgt="Atal'ai Exile", preText="The Atal'ai Exile"}, [8]={npc="Atal'ai Exile", tgt="Atal'ai Exile"}, [9]={hint="Return to Fel'Zerul in Stonard."}, [10]={npc="Fel'zerul", tgt="Fel'zerul"}, [11]={npc="Fel'zerul", tgt="Fel'zerul", preText="Return to Fel'Zerul"}, [12]={npc="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", tgt="Witch Doctor Uzer'i"}, [13]={hint="Find Marvon Rivetseeker in Tanaris."}, [14]={npc="Marvon Rivetseeker", tgt="Marvon Rivetseeker"}, [15]={npc="Marvon Rivetseeker", tgt="Marvon Rivetseeker", preText="The Sunken Temple"}, [16]={hint="Retrieve the Stone Circle from Marvon Rivetseeker's workshop in Ratchet."}, [17]={npc="Marvon Rivetseeker", tgt="Marvon Rivetseeker"}, [18]={npc="Marvon Rivetseeker", tgt="Marvon Rivetseeker", preText="The Stone Circle"}, [19]={npc="Marvon Rivetseeker", tgt="Marvon Rivetseeker", preText="The Stone Circle"}, [20]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya", desc="Pick up in Steamwheedle Port, then do Feralas. Take The Prophecy of Mosh'aru after turning this in."}, [21]={hint="Capture the spirits of 3 screechers in Feralas, then return to Yeh'kinya in Steamwheedle Port."}, [22]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya"}, [23]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya", preText="Screecher Spirits"}, [24]={hint="Bring the First and Second Mosh'aru Tablets to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris.", desc="Leaving follow-up The Ancient Egg for temple quest The God Hakkar. Zul'Farrak map: Theka (56.70, 31.50), Velratha (34.50, 35.80)."}, [25]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya"}, [26]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya", desc="Jintha'Alor has elite packs. Do this with the Revantusk and Jintha'Alor quests.", preText="The Prophecy of Mosh'aru"}, [27]={hint="Bring the Ancient Egg to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris."}, [28]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya"}, [29]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya", preText="The Ancient Egg"}, [30]={text="The Temple of Atal'Hakkar entrance"}, [31]={hint="Find the Altar of Hakkar in the Sunken Temple in Swamp of Sorrows.", desc="Location: Take the flat right route downstairs. Find the Altar of Hakkar on the ring. Order: Hand over the altar first and then proceed to step 32."}, [32]={npc="Altar of Hakkar", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified"}, [33]={hint="Travel into the Sunken Temple and discover the secret hidden in the circle of statues.", desc="A trap will be triggered if the order is wrong. Idol of Hakkar 50.10, 63.10 on the underground floor of DungeonsForever dungeon. Location: Activate the six statues on the lower ring, then kill the boss in the center. Order: South → North → Southwest → Southeast → Northwest → Northeast."}, [34]={npc="Idol of Hakkar", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Idol of Hakkar 50.10, 63.10 on the underground floor of DungeonsForever dungeon."}, [35]={hint="Collect 20 Fetishes of Hakkar and bring them to Fel'Zerul in Stonard.", desc="Location: Kill Atal'ai trolls along the lower ring and upper balconies."}, [36]={hint="The Atal'ai Exile in The Hinterlands wants the Head of Jammal'an.", desc="Jammalan on the boss level above DungeonsForever dungeon 73.20, 38.40. Location: Clear six upper balconies, then take the east hall from the Pit of Sacrifice. Order: Kill the six balcony guards first to remove the barrier."}, [37]={hint="Bring the Filled Egg of Hakkar to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris.", desc="Take the west passage to Hakkar's room. Get everyone inside before starting. Hakkar event on the boss floor above the DungeonsForever dungeon 21.20, 45.10. Location: Take the west hall from the Pit of Sacrifice. Group up before using the egg. Order: The west corridor leads to Hakkar, the east corridor leads to Jamalan."}, [38]={npc="Essence of Eranikus", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="After killing Shade of Eranikus, right-click its drop to accept it. Shade of Eranikus 66.40, 87.40 on the boss floor above the DungeonsForever dungeon."}, [39]={hint="Place the Essence of Eranikus in the Essence Font located in this lair in the Sunken Temple.", desc="Essence Font 70.70, 81.50 for the boss floor above the DungeonsForever dungeon. Location: Kill the four dragonkin bosses. Use the Font in the Dreamer's room. Order: The final boss dropped the essence, then caught it and had sex in the same room."}, [40]={npc="Essence Font", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Essence Font 70.70, 81.50 for the boss floor above the DungeonsForever dungeon."}, [41]={npc="Fel'zerul", tgt="Fel'zerul"}, [42]={npc="Atal'ai Exile", tgt="Atal'ai Exile"}, [43]={npc="Yeh'kinya", tgt="Yeh'kinya"}}},
    ["04-41"] = {name="Un'Goro Crater: Marshal's Refuge", short="Marshal's Refuge", tips={{k="取捨", text="Do | Crystals of Power, dinosaur material, tar and blood petal flowers go hand in hand. Watch for the patrolling Devilsaur before approaching the middle."}, {k="取捨", text="Don't pay it yet | It's a Secret to Everybody will be reserved for Winterspring; Volcanic Activity and Marvon's Workshop will be reserved for Ratchet. The Bait for Lar'korwi, three crystal towers, orangutans, Fire Plume Ridge rescue and Finding the Source stay Un'Goro Crater Marshal's Refuge."}, {k="取捨", text="Then drop by | Bone-Bladed Weapons. If you have all the claws, please pay via Orgrimmar next time to Jes'rimon (55.52, 34.08). Pawn Captures Queen needs to be hatched and killed in the south, skip it."}, {k="提醒", text="If you are close to reaching level 54, gain experience at the tar monster in the north (51.77, 25.14) or Diemetradon east of Marshal's Refuge (50.78, 19.90).", s={{"If you are close to reaching level 54, gain experience at the tar monster in the north (51.77, 25.14) or Diemetradon east of Marshal's Refuge (50.78, 19.90)"}}}}, danger={[1]="Un'Goro Plains is patrolled by level 54-55 elite Devilsaur. Go north to the camp and take the east edge, give way first when you see it."}, grind={[1]={mob="Tar Lurker", note="The ordinary tar monster on the south side of the camp can absorb thick tar. Refresh near the water, pull alone along the coast and pay attention to the Devilsaur patrol."}, [2]={mob="Un'Goro Thunderer", note="Common orangutans at the entrance of Northeastern Orangutan Cave. Overlapping with the orangutan quest, it is easy to pull in the cave, and if there are people in the outer circle, return to the tar pool."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Gryfe"}, [2]={npc="Gibbert"}, [3]={npc="Nergal"}, [4]={npc="Nergal"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Torwa Pathfinder", tgt="Torwa Pathfinder"}, [2]={hint="Find the carcass of Lar'korwi's freshest kill and steal a Piece of Threshadon Carcass before returning to Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater."}, [3]={npc="Torwa Pathfinder", tgt="Torwa Pathfinder"}, [4]={npc="Torwa Pathfinder", tgt="Torwa Pathfinder"}, [5]={hint="Bring 2 Ravasaur Pheromone Glands to Torwa Pathfinder near the entrance to Un'Goro Crater."}, [6]={npc="Torwa Pathfinder", tgt="Torwa Pathfinder"}, [7]={npc="Torwa Pathfinder", tgt="Torwa Pathfinder", desc="Leave it to Un'Goro Crater Marshal's Refuge Un'Goro's return visit."}, [8]={hint="Bring 8 White Ravasaur Claws to Jes'rimon in Orgrimmar.", tag="Optional", desc="Azshara Valormok Orgrimmar Do it after connecting first."}, [9]={npc="A Wrecked Raft", npcObj=true}, [10]={hint="Look around in the pond for a clue about who this wrecked raft may belong to."}, [11]={npc="A Small Pack", npcObj=true}, [12]={npc="A Small Pack", npcObj=true}, [13]={hint="Examine the items inside the pack and bring them to their owner.", desc="The contents of the bag are retained."}, [14]={text="Go north along the eastern edge to Marshal's Refuge. Avoid the devilsaurs in the middle."}, [15]={node="Marshal's Refuge", desc="Open flight path to Gryfe."}, [16]={npc="Linken", tgt="Linken"}, [17]={npc="Linken", tgt="Linken", desc="Save to turn in to Donova in Winterspring."}, [18]={npc="Williden Marshal", tgt="Williden Marshal"}, [19]={npc="Spark Nilminer", tgt="Spark Nilminer"}, [20]={npc="Shizzle", tgt="Shizzle"}, [21]={npc="Larion", tgt="Larion"}, [22]={npc="J.D. Collie", tgt="J.D. Collie"}, [23]={text="Northern tar mobs → loop around camp → return to camp"}, [24]={hint="Collect 12 samples of Super Sticky Tar for Tran'rek in Gadgetzan.", desc="Pick up on the Gadgetzan and Broken Pillar leg."}, [25]={hint="Bring 8 Dinosaur Bones to Spark Nilminer in Un'Goro Crater."}, [26]={hint="Collect 8 Webbed Diemetradon Scales and 8 Webbed Pterrordax Scales for Shizzle in Marshal's Refuge."}, [27]={hint="Hunt 5 Bloodpetal Lashers, 5 Bloodpetal Threshers, 5 Bloodpetal Flayers and 5 Bloodpetal Trappers for Larion at Marshal's Refuge."}, [28]={hint="Bring a Crate of Foodstuffs and Research Equipment to Williden Marshal in Un'Goro Crater."}, [29]={hint="Collect 9 samples of Un'Goro Ash from the fire elementals around the volcano in Un'Goro Crater, and return them to Liv Rizzlefix in Ratchet.", desc="Do if picked up in Ratchet before Thorium Point. Turn in on the Ratchet return."}, [30]={npc="A Mangled Journal", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Starts from a drop. Keep moving if it doesn't drop."}, [31]={hint="Return the journal to Williden Marshal somewhere in Un'Goro Crater.", tag="Optional", desc="Starts from a drop. Keep moving if it doesn't drop."}, [32]={npc="Williden Marshal", tgt="Williden Marshal", tag="Optional", desc="Starts from a drop. Keep moving if it doesn't drop."}, [33]={hint="Bring a Gorishi Scent Gland and 5 Un'Goro Soil samples to Alchemist Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan.", tag="Optional", desc="Do if accepted earlier in Tanaris. Take one southern loop before leaving."}, [34]={hint="Collect 7 Power Crystals of each color: red, blue, yellow, and green. Bring them to J.D. Collie at Marshal's Refuge."}, [35]={npc="Williden Marshal", tgt="Williden Marshal"}, [36]={npc="Spark Nilminer", tgt="Spark Nilminer"}, [37]={npc="Shizzle", tgt="Shizzle"}, [38]={npc="Larion", tgt="Larion"}, [39]={npc="J.D. Collie", tgt="J.D. Collie"}, [40]={npc="J.D. Collie", tgt="J.D. Collie"}, [41]={npc="J.D. Collie", tgt="J.D. Collie"}, [42]={npc="J.D. Collie", tgt="J.D. Collie"}, [43]={npc="Larion", tgt="Larion", desc="Ratchet delivered."}, [44]={text="Fly from Marshal's Refuge to Gadgetzan and turn in any gathering quests there."}, [45]={npc="Tran'rek", tgt="Tran'rek"}, [46]={npc="Alchemist Pestlezugg", tgt="Alchemist Pestlezugg", tag="Optional"}, [47]={hint="Collect 8 Bloodcap and 8 Gorishi Stings, and return to Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater.", tag="Optional", desc="Do alongside the southern hive and flower quests."}, [48]={npc="Torwa Pathfinder", tgt="Torwa Pathfinder", tag="Optional"}, [49]={npc="Torwa Pathfinder", tgt="Torwa Pathfinder", tag="Optional", desc="Just use the quest items; leave immediately after completion, no need to kill elites."}, [50]={hint="Stab a Devilsaur with the Devilsaur Barb. Return to Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater when you have completed this task.", tag="Optional", desc="Just use the quest items; leave immediately after completion, no need to kill elites."}, [51]={npc="Torwa Pathfinder", tgt="Torwa Pathfinder", tag="Optional", desc="Just use the quest items; leave immediately after completion, no need to kill elites."}, [52]={npc="Torwa Pathfinder", tgt="Torwa Pathfinder", tag="Optional", desc="Group for Sunken Temple on the next Eastern Kingdoms trip.", star={"Grizzled Pelt", {"DRUID"}}}, [53]={text="Fly from Gadgetzan to Ratchet, boat to Booty Bay and fly to Kargath. Save the ravasaurs' claws for the Undercity stop on the way back to Orgrimmar."}}},
    ["04-42"] = {name="Burning Steppes: Flame Crest & Blackrock Mountain", short="Flame Crest +", tips={{k="取捨", text="Do | Kargath connects to Dreadmaul Rock and The Rise of the Machines first, Flame Crest opens and runs Dreadmaul Rock and Ruins of Thaurissan together."}, {k="取捨", text="Don't turn it in yet|Felnok Steelspring, pick it up first, leave Winterspring Everlook to hand over."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional|Disharmony of Flame, The Rise of the Machines. If you want to go to Blackrock Mountain or make an extra trip to Badlands, skip it if you are short of time for single practice. If you want to call Blackrock Depths, follow up separately."}, {k="提醒", text="If you are short of experience, fight the Dark Iron dwarves and puppets around Ruins of Thaurissan; Blackrock Depths can form a team. First, complete the dungeon quests in Kargath and Flame Crest.", s={{"If you are short of experience, fight the Dark Iron dwarves and puppets around Ruins of Thaurissan"}, {"Blackrock Depths can form a team"}, {"First, complete the dungeon quests in Kargath and Flame Crest"}}}}, danger={[1]="The mine walkway leading to Blackrock Depths is narrow, and Overmaster Pyron will patrol the road. Clear out the normal mobs at the entrance first and then take action.", [2]="Ruins of Thaurissan Spellcasting monsters and patrols will enter the battle together. Pull from outside the broken wall, and don't stand at the intersection of the two patrol roads."}, grind={[1]={mob="War Reaver", note="Ruins of Thaurissan The ordinary puppets on the outside can be hit continuously along the outer wall and supplemented with Ruins kills. Watch out for spellcasters mixed in with Ruins."}, [2]={mob="Thaurissan Firewalker", note="Ordinary dwarves in the same piece of Ruins can mend cloth and kill them en route. Spellcasters and patrols may enter the battle together, pulling from outside the broken wall."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Vahgruk"}, [2]={npc="Yuka Screwspigot"}, [3]={npc="Gruna"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Shul'kar"}, [5]={npc="Sranda"}, [6]={npc="Grawl"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Thal'trak Proudtusk", tgt="Thal'trak Proudtusk", desc="Pick up at Kargath and leave at Dreadmaul Rock in the east."}, [2]={npc="Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania", tgt="Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania", desc="Pick up at Kargath, and play puppets with elements at Burning Steppes."}, [3]={npc="Thunderheart", tgt="Thunderheart", tag="Optional", desc="Pick up at Kargath. Do it only if you want to go to Blackrock Mountain."}, [4]={text="Fly from Kargath to Flame Crest if unlocked. Otherwise take Blackrock Mountain through Searing Gorge into Burning Steppes and head east along the north side.", tag="I haven't used this flight path yet, so I have to use the running one for the first time."}, [5]={hint="Travel to the quarry in Blackrock Mountain and slay Overmaster Pyron. Return to Thunderheart when you have completed this assignment.", tag="Optional", desc="Outside the dungeon entrance, pay attention to patrols around the area."}, [6]={node="Flame Crest", desc="Open flight path to Vahgruk."}, [7]={hint="Speak with Yuka Screwspigot in the Burning Steppes.", tag="Optional", desc="Tanaris Gadgetzan and Broken Pillar Steamwheedle Port are handed over together."}, [8]={npc="Yuka Screwspigot", tgt="Yuka Screwspigot", tag="Optional"}, [9]={npc="Maxwort Uberglint", tgt="Maxwort Uberglint"}, [10]={npc="Tinkee Steamboil", tgt="Tinkee Steamboil"}, [11]={text="Dreadmaul Rock in the east → Ruins of Thaurissan → Kargath"}, [12]={hint="Venture forth to the Burning Steppes and find out what became of Sha'ni Proudtusk."}, [13]={npc="Sha'ni Proudtusk", tgt="Sha'ni Proudtusk"}, [14]={npc="Sha'ni Proudtusk", tgt="Sha'ni Proudtusk"}, [15]={hint="Recover Sha'ni's Nose-Ring from Krom'Grul and return it to Thal'trak in Kargath. Search the various caves and mines in Dreadmaul Rock."}, [16]={hint="Bring 8 Broodling Essence and the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 to Tinkee Steamboil at the Flame Crest in the Burning Steppes.", desc="Use the props first, and then pick up the essence left behind after killing them."}, [17]={hint="Bring the Tablet Transcript to Maxwort Uberglint in the Burning Steppes."}, [18]={hint="Venture to the Burning Steppes and recover 10 Fractured Elemental Shards for Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania.", desc="Can be played together with the stone route."}, [19]={npc="Maxwort Uberglint", tgt="Maxwort Uberglint"}, [20]={npc="Tinkee Steamboil", tgt="Tinkee Steamboil"}, [21]={npc="Tinkee Steamboil", tgt="Tinkee Steamboil", desc="Save to turn in to Felnok Steelspring in Everlook."}, [22]={text="Fly from Flame Crest to Kargath. Turn in the snouts, shards and Pyron quest if complete."}, [23]={npc="Thal'trak Proudtusk", tgt="Thal'trak Proudtusk"}, [24]={npc="Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania", tgt="Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania"}, [25]={npc="Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania", tgt="Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania", tag="Optional", desc="Go east only for the Blackrock Depths follow-up."}, [26]={hint="Take the Elemental Shard Sample to Lotwil Veriatus.", tag="Optional", desc="Go east only for the Blackrock Depths follow-up."}, [27]={npc="Lotwil Veriatus", tgt="Lotwil Veriatus", tag="Optional", desc="Go east only for the Blackrock Depths follow-up."}, [28]={npc="Thunderheart", tgt="Thunderheart", tag="Optional"}, [29]={text="Fly from Kargath to Undercity before crossing Western Plaguelands into Eastern Plaguelands."}}},
    ["05-d24"] = {name="Blackrock Depths", entrance="Searing Gorge 34.80, 85.30 (Blackrock Mountain external road mark)", pickup="Open at Searing Gorge Thorium Point and go to Burning Steppes Flame Crest first to find Yuka and Maxwater. Fly Kargath to pick up boards Thunderheart, WANTED and Vivian, enter Blackrock Mountain, kill Pailong outside the gate, return to Kargath, turn in Disharmony of Flame, pick up Disharmony of Fire, The Last Element; then enter the mountain via Thorium Point or Flame Crest.", pickupS={{"Open at Searing Gorge Thorium Point and go to Burning Steppes Flame Crest first to find Yuka and Maxwater"}, {"Fly Kargath to pick up boards Thunderheart, WANTED and Vivian, enter Blackrock Mountain, kill Pailong outside the gate, return to Kargath, turn in Disharmony of Flame, pick up Disharmony of Fire, The Last Element; then enter the mountain via Thorium Point or Flame Crest"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Optional Pyron outside → Ironfury dwarves in the Detention Block and Ring of Law → Incendius at the Black Anvil → Fineous in the Hall of Crafting and the monument for the Shadowforge Key → Heart in the vault and Ribbly and the recipe in the Grim Guzzler, in either order → pass the Seven and the lava bridge for the Core Fragment. Loot elementals and golems throughout."}, {k="取捨", text="Prioritize the Kargath and Flame Crest quests on the first trip; if you have enough time, do the treasure house or Molten Core gate."}, {k="說明", text="The north entrance leads to Blackrock Mountain. Go down the central chain inside and pass through the grindstone and Pylon to find the actual copy door. also enter the mountain via Burning Steppes 29.40, 38.30.", s={{"The north entrance leads to Blackrock Mountain"}, {"Go down the central chain inside and pass through the grindstone and Pylon to find the actual copy door. also enter the mountain via Burning Steppes 29.40, 38.30"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Yuka Screwspigot", tgt="Yuka Screwspigot"}, [2]={npc="Maxwort Uberglint", tgt="Maxwort Uberglint", tag="Optional", desc="Collect 12 Relic Coffer Keys. Pick up only if your group plans to do the vault."}, [3]={npc="WANTED", npcObj=true}, [4]={npc="Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave", tgt="Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave"}, [5]={npc="Thunderheart", tgt="Thunderheart", desc="Enter Blackrock Mountain from the north. Pyron is in the Grinding Quarry."}, [6]={hint="Travel to the quarry in Blackrock Mountain and slay Overmaster Pyron. Return to Thunderheart when you have completed this assignment."}, [7]={npc="Thunderheart", tgt="Thunderheart"}, [8]={npc="Thunderheart", tgt="Thunderheart", preText="Disharmony of Flame"}, [9]={npc="Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave", tgt="Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave", preText="Disharmony of Flame"}, [10]={npc="Franclorn Forgewright", tgt="Franclorn Forgewright", desc="Go as a ghost to the hanging tomb in Blackrock Mountain to find Forgewright."}, [11]={hint="Speak with Franclorn Forgewright if you are interested in obtaining a key to the city major.", desc="The pin marks Franclorn's tomb in Blackrock Mountain. Visit as a ghost."}, [12]={npc="Franclorn Forgewright", tgt="Franclorn Forgewright"}, [13]={npc="Franclorn Forgewright", tgt="Franclorn Forgewright", preText="Dark Iron Legacy"}, [14]={npc="Lothos Riftwaker", tgt="Lothos Riftwaker", tag="Optional", desc="Level 55+. Do this on the way past the Seven to the Molten Core portal."}, [15]={text="Blackrock Depths entrance"}, [16]={hint="Venture to Blackrock Depths and destroy the vile aggressors!", desc="Location: Enter the Detention Block and clear guards toward the Ring of Law."}, [17]={hint="Enter Blackrock Depths and track down Lord Incendius. Slay him and return any source of information you may find to Thunderheart.", desc="Detention Block map: Lord Incendius (56.10, 31.20). Location: Follow the Dark Iron Highway down to the Black Anvil. Kill Incendius."}, [18]={hint="Slay Fineous Darkvire and recover the great hammer, Ironfel. Take Ironfel to the Shrine of Thaurissan and place it on the statue of Franclorn Forgewright.", desc="Map: Fineous in Hall of Crafting (63.40,20.50); monument (56.10,96.80). Location: Get the hammer in the Hall of Crafting. Take it to the Shrine of Thaurissan. Order: Defeat Fernos first, then click on the monument."}, [19]={npc="Monument of Franclorn Forgewright", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="DungeonsForever map: Monument of Franclorn Forgewright (56.10, 96.80)."}, [20]={hint="Travel to Blackrock Depths and recover 10 Essence of the Elements. Your first inclination is to search the golems and golem makers. You remember Vivian Lagrave also muttering something about elementals.", desc="Location: Kill elementals and golems along the Dark Iron Highway. Pyron is outside."}, [21]={hint="Bring Ribbly's Head to Yuka Screwspigot in the Burning Steppes.", desc="DungeonsForever map: talk to Ribbly by the tables (49.20, 63.90) to start the fight. Location: Cross Shadowforge City to the Grim Guzzler. Find Ribbly by the tables."}, [22]={hint="Bring the Lost Thunderbrew Recipe to Vivian Lagrave in Kargath.", desc="Work with your teammates to clear out the enemies near the bar before taking action. Break the kegs at 47.60, 57.50. Both factions loot the recipe from the same mob. Location: Break three kegs in the back room of the Grim Guzzler and wait for Hurley."}, [23]={hint="Bring the Heart of the Mountain to Maxwort Uberglint in the Burning Steppes.", tag="Optional", desc="DungeonsForever map: Black Vault (61.30, 68.50), quest The Heart of the Mountain. Location: Open 12 relic coffers in the Black Vault, then loot the Heart in the hidden room."}, [24]={hint="Venture to the Molten Core entry portal in Blackrock Depths and recover a Core Fragment. Return to Lothos Riftwaker in Blackrock Mountain when you have recovered the Core Fragment.", tag="Optional", desc="DungeonsForever map: Core Fragment (65.70, 29.60), quest Attunement to the Core. Location: Pass the Seven and cross the lava bridge. The fragment is by the Core portal."}, [25]={npc="Thunderheart", tgt="Thunderheart"}, [26]={npc="Warlord Goretooth", tgt="Warlord Goretooth"}, [27]={npc="Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave", tgt="Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave"}, [28]={npc="Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave", tgt="Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave"}, [29]={npc="Yuka Screwspigot", tgt="Yuka Screwspigot"}, [30]={npc="Maxwort Uberglint", tgt="Maxwort Uberglint", tag="Optional"}, [31]={npc="Lothos Riftwaker", tgt="Lothos Riftwaker", tag="Optional"}}},
    ["04-43"] = {name="Eastern Plaguelands: Light's Hope Chapel", short="Light's Hope Chapel", tips={{k="取捨", text="Do | If you go to Eastern Plague for the first time, open the Light's Hope Chapel flight path first, and the chapel book is in the same place. The main quests of Tirion, Nathanos, and Darrowshire are left to the later stages."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional|Augustus' Receipt Book To wrap around to Terrordale, pure transition optional. If the book in the chapel is picked up in the video, it corresponds to the eternal version A Study of the Light."}, {k="提醒", text="If you are under level 54, fight ordinary plague monsters along the road outside Light's Hope, or go to the next stop to clear out the ordinary undead of Felstone Field (approximately 38, 56).", s={{"If you are under level 54, fight ordinary plague monsters along the road outside Light's Hope, or go to the next stop to clear out the ordinary undead of Felstone Field (approximately 38, 56)"}}}}, danger={[1]="When walking Terrordale to find the receipt book, the undead in the house and on the stairs may be pulled at the same time. Clear the downstairs first and then go upstairs."}, grind={[1]={mob="Carrion Grub", note="The ordinary Carrion Grub in the southwest of Holy Light's Hope can be pulled alone en route, and it can also collect the Carrion Grub meat required for Fording's quest. Avoid the group of higher undead to the north."}, [2]={mob="Noxious Plaguebat", note="The ordinary bats in the open space on the west side of the chapel can quickly replenish supplies after replenishing experience. Overlaps with Plaguebat quest, turn south when encountering a player."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Georgia"}, [2]={npc="Jessica Chambers"}, [3]={npc="Craftsman Wilhelm"}, [4]={npc="Jessica Chambers"}, [5]={npc="Caretaker Alen"}}, steps={[1]={hint="Bring the Tablet of Markri to Andron Gant in Undercity.", tag="Optional"}, [2]={npc="Andron Gant", tgt="Andron Gant", tag="Optional"}, [3]={text="Head east from outside Undercity through the Bulwark and Western Plaguelands. Follow the southern road east through Eastern Plaguelands and stay out of Stratholme."}, [4]={npc="Augustus the Touched", tgt="Augustus the Touched", tag="Optional", desc="Off the main road. Skip if you're only unlocking the Light's Hope flight path."}, [5]={hint="Bring Augustus' Receipt Book to Augustus the Touched in Terrordale.", tag="Optional", desc="Off the main road. Skip if you're only unlocking the Light's Hope flight path."}, [6]={npc="Augustus the Touched", tgt="Augustus the Touched", tag="Optional", desc="Off the main road. Skip if you're only unlocking the Light's Hope flight path."}, [7]={node="Light's Hope Chapel", desc="Open the tribal flight path to Georgia."}, [8]={npc="Book", tgt="Jennea Cannon", npcObj=true, desc="The Forever book is at the back left of the chapel. Turn it in in Undercity."}, [9]={hint="Use/collect: Book", desc="Adopt QuestieDB eternal version map coordinates."}, [10]={text="Fly from Light's Hope Chapel to Undercity. Turn in library quests if you have any."}, [11]={npc="Oran Snakewrithe", tgt="Oran Snakewrithe", desc="Oran and Owen Thadd are in Undercity's Magic Quarter. Check which offers the turn-in."}, [12]={hint="Bring the Voodoo Feathers from the trolls in the Sunken Temple to the Fallen Hero of the Horde.", tag="Optional, Target: Gasher / Zul'Lor / Gasher / Hukku / Mijan / Hukku / Zolo / Loro / Loro", desc="Enter the dungeon together with the temple quest of Swamp of Sorrows."}, [13]={npc="Fallen Hero of the Horde", tgt="Fallen Hero of the Horde", tag="Optional", desc="Return Blasted Lands north entrance, optional Diamond Flask and other equipment.", star={"Diamond Flask", {"WARRIOR"}}}, [14]={hint="Bring the Tooth of Morphaz to Ogtinc in Azshara. Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath.", tag="Optional", desc="Form a team and go from Stonard to Sunken Temple and find the green dragon Morphaz."}, [15]={hint="Retrieve the Arcane Shard from Morphaz and return to Archmage Xylem.", tag="Optional", desc="Form a team and go from Stonard to Sunken Temple and find the green dragon Morphaz."}, [16]={hint="Return the Azure Key to Lord Jorach Ravenholdt.", tag="Optional", desc="Form a team and go from Stonard to Sunken Temple and find the green dragon Morphaz."}, [17]={npc="Lord Jorach Ravenholdt", tgt="Lord Jorach Ravenholdt", tag="Optional", desc="Fly Stonard to Tarren Mill, then turn in at the manor. Ebon Mask is a reward option.", star={"Duskbat Drape", {"ROGUE"}}}, [18]={hint="Retrieve a Putrid Vine from the guardian at the bottom of the Sunken Temple and return to Torwa Pathfinder.", tag="Optional", desc="Group for Sunken Temple. Tell the party you need the snake statues downstairs."}, [19]={hint="Kill Morphaz in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar, and return his blood to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood. The entrance to the sunken temple can be found in the Swamp of Sorrows.", tag="Optional", desc="Form a team and go from Stonard to Sunken Temple and find the green dragon Morphaz."}, [20]={text="Stay in the Eastern Kingdoms. The next leg goes east from Undercity to the Bulwark."}}},
    ["04-44"] = {name="Western Plaguelands: The Bulwark", short="The Bulwark", tips={{k="交通", text="Walk to get to The Bulwark. Go to Tirisfal Glades or Undercity on the west side, and take the zeppelin outside the city back to Orgrimmar."}, {k="取捨", text="Do | Felstone Field's plague cauldron and package are in the same place. hand in Better Late Than Never and The Jeremiah Blues together when you return to the city."}, {k="取捨", text="Then en route | I completed the first pot of this trip, leaving one round of Dalson's Tears's Target: Dalson's Tears and Andorhal's Scholomance quests. Jeremiah's Good Luck Charm /Two Halves Become One was only made after returning to the Western Plague in the later period."}, {k="提醒", text="If you have not reached level 55, supplement the ordinary skeletons and ghouls (about 38, 56) outside Felstone Field; avoid the high-level elites in Andorhal.", s={{"If you have not reached level 55, supplement the ordinary skeletons and ghouls (about 38, 56) outside Felstone Field; avoid the high-level elites in Andorhal"}}}}, danger={[1]="There is a level 61 elite \"Summoner\" Araki in the center of Andorhal. All Along the Watchtowers When walking along the edge of the city, do not go through the central square."}, grind={[1]={note="Felstone Field Ordinary undead, the plague pot route is en route, and it is easier to pull outside the farmland than among the houses. quest players often move around the perimeter."}, [2]={mob="Slavering Ghoul", note="Same as Farm. Ordinary ghoul, can fill in the gap between skeleton refresh. Don't chase monsters into Andorhal."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Argent Quartermaster Hasana"}, [2]={npc="Michael Garrett"}, [3]={npc="Innkeeper Norman"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Norman"}, [5]={npc="Eleanor Rusk"}, [6]={npc="Thomas Mordan"}, [7]={npc="Ezekiel Graves"}}, steps={[1]={text="Leave Undercity and follow Tirisfal's east road to the Bulwark (83.13, 68.94). Keep Undercity's flight path available for city turn-ins at the end."}, [2]={npc="High Executor Derrington", tgt="High Executor Derrington", desc="Take Bottled Flame from the chest by Derington. Bring the Scourge Banner too."}, [3]={hint="Proceed to the Scarlet Crusade's base camp between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears and destroy their command tent.", desc="Use bottle fire to burn the tent first, then use the military flag."}, [4]={npc="High Executor Derrington", tgt="High Executor Derrington", desc="Use bottle fire to burn the tent first, then use the military flag."}, [5]={npc="High Executor Derrington", tgt="High Executor Derrington"}, [6]={npc="High Executor Derrington", tgt="High Executor Derrington"}, [7]={hint="Speak with Shadow Priestess Vandis at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."}, [8]={npc="Shadow Priestess Vandis", tgt="Shadow Priestess Vandis"}, [9]={npc="Shadow Priestess Vandis", tgt="Shadow Priestess Vandis"}, [10]={text="Go east from the Bulwark to Felstone Field. Take the Scourge Cauldron sample, then check Janice's house and the stables."}, [11]={hint="Go to Felstone Field in Western Plaguelands to locate and defeat the Cauldron Lord present there. It may have a key that will allow access to the cauldron. You must have the Empty Felstone Field Bottle with you to secure a sample of the poisons used inside the cauldron.", desc="First make sure you have the empty bottle given by Fandis."}, [12]={npc="Scourge Cauldron", npcObj=true}, [13]={npc="Scourge Cauldron", npcObj=true, desc="After getting the sample, pick it up in the same cauldron for the return journey."}, [14]={npc="Janice Felstone", tgt="Janice Felstone"}, [15]={hint="The ramblings of the ghostly woman indicated that she needed a package delivered. She claimed that it was where her horse was. As to where the horse is or where the package was to be delivered - the ghost remains incomprehensible.", desc="Interact with the package inside the stable."}, [16]={npc="Janice's Parcel", npcObj=true}, [17]={npc="Janice's Parcel", npcObj=true, desc="Choose Horde quest Better Late Than Never. Collect the package here and turn it in at Undercity."}, [18]={text="Go east from Felstone Field to Dalson's Tears. Do the farmhouse diary and key now. Save the Scourge Cauldron for next time."}, [19]={npc="Mrs. Dalson's Diary", npcObj=true}, [20]={hint="Complete the quest objectives."}, [21]={npc="Mrs. Dalson's Diary", npcObj=true}, [22]={npc="Outhouse", npcObj=true, desc="Read the journal, then find a Wandering Skeleton. Open the outhouse to spawn the farmer."}, [23]={hint="Loot from: Wandering Skeleton", desc="Read the journal, then find a Wandering Skeleton. Open the outhouse to spawn the farmer."}, [24]={npc="Outhouse", npcObj=true, desc="Read the journal, then find a Wandering Skeleton. Open the outhouse to spawn the farmer."}, [25]={npc="Locked Cabinet", npcObj=true, desc="Clear around the outhouse. Open the cache and turn in right away."}, [26]={hint="Loot from: Farmer Dalson", desc="Clear around the outhouse. Open the cache and turn in right away."}, [27]={npc="Locked Cabinet", npcObj=true, desc="Clear around the outhouse. Open the cache and turn in right away."}, [28]={text="Circle Andorhal, visiting each tower, then return to the Bulwark. Wait for high-level guards to patrol away before approaching the doors."}, [29]={hint="Using the Beacon Torch, mark each tower in Andorhal; you will need to stand in the doorway of the tower to successfully mark it.", desc="Use the torch at the door, no need to enter the tower to fight the guards."}, [30]={npc="High Executor Derrington", tgt="High Executor Derrington"}, [31]={hint="Bring the Filled Felstone Field Bottle to Shadow Priestess Vandis at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."}, [32]={npc="Shadow Priestess Vandis", tgt="Shadow Priestess Vandis"}, [33]={text="Return to Undercity and turn in the package near the guild registrar."}, [34]={hint="Check with the Royal Overseers of the Undercity to learn the whereabouts of a Jeremiah Felstone. There is usually a census officer located near guild and tabard registration."}, [35]={npc="Royal Overseer Bauhaus", tgt="Royal Overseer Bauhaus"}, [36]={npc="Royal Overseer Bauhaus", tgt="Royal Overseer Bauhaus"}, [37]={hint="Find Jeremiah Payson in the Undercity and see if he is in fact Jeremiah Felstone. If he is, then perhaps he'd like the package Janice Felstone made for him."}, [38]={npc="Jeremiah Payson", tgt="Jeremiah Payson"}, [39]={npc="Jeremiah Payson", tgt="Jeremiah Payson", desc="Keep the half amulet. Turn in at Felstone Field on the Bulwark visit."}, [40]={npc="Knight of Mourning", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="After Undercity turn-ins, look southwest before boarding. The knight has several spawns."}, [41]={hint="Speak with the Knight of Mourning to learn more about his unfinished quest.", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="After Undercity turn-ins, look southwest before boarding. The knight has several spawns."}, [42]={npc="Knight of Mourning", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="After Undercity turn-ins, look southwest before boarding. The knight has several spawns."}, [43]={npc="Knight of Mourning", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Finish The Knight of Mourning. Run Blackmaw Hold after crossing to Orgrimmar. Keep the relic for Tirisfal.", star={"Sword of Mourning", {"PALADIN"}}}, [44]={hint="Bring the pieces for the spirit totem to Bath'rah the Windwatcher.", tag="Optional", desc="During the Farm quest of Fighting the Plague, also clear out spiders, bears and vultures."}, [45]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional", desc="Undercity Fly before taking off. Tarren Mill talk to Basla."}, [46]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional", desc="Accept with a Sunken Temple group. Finish on the next Eastern Kingdoms visit.", star={"Enamored Water Spirit", {"SHAMAN"}}}, [47]={text="Take the Orgrimmar zeppelin from the tower outside Undercity."}}},
    ["04-45"] = {name="Felwood: South & Bloodvenom Post", short="Felwood: South +", tips={{k="交通", text="Bloodvenom Post opens the flight path, and the next station will still start from this point. If passing through Ashenvale Splintertree Post, follow the avenue to bypass the guards in the alliance town."}, {k="取捨", text="Do |The Southern Dead Wood Furbolg directly opens Timbermaw reputation; Jaedenar, Southern Lore and Jade Fire Satyr Moonwell can be run in succession."}, {k="取捨", text="Then drop by | Cleansing Felwood and pick up Blood Amber from the north. After harvesting, return to the south later to save the trip back immediately."}, {k="提醒", text="Before reaching level 55, give priority to the dead wood furbolgs in the outer circle of Shatter Scar Vale (approximately 41, 42) with ordinary elements or to supplement Timbermaw's reputation.", s={{"Before reaching level 55, give priority to the dead wood furbolgs in the outer circle of Shatter Scar Vale (approximately 41, 42) with ordinary elements or to supplement Timbermaw's reputation"}}}}, danger={[1]="Shatter Scar Vale Thermal energy elements will be refreshed in pairs near the pit. Pull alone from the slope, don't step to the bottom of the pit to the next group."}, grind={[1]={mob="Entropic Beast", note="Shatter Scar Vale The ordinary elements in the outer circle overlap with the thermal kill quest. When there is a quest at the entrance, players will take turns from the outside to the inside."}, [2]={mob="Entropic Horror", note="The same piece of ordinary element points has a higher variant, mixed with Entropic Beast. The terrain is narrow, so pay attention to refreshing them in pairs."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Brakkar"}, [2]={npc="Altsoba Ragetotem"}, [3]={npc="Bale"}, [4]={npc="Bale"}, [5]={npc="Innkeeper Kaylisk"}, [6]={npc="Innkeeper Kaylisk"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Jes'rimon", tgt="Jes'rimon", tag="Optional", desc="Accept at Valormok. Farm White Ravasaur Claws in Un'Goro."}, [2]={text="Fly to Splintertree Post, follow the road west, then take the north road into Felwood. Stop first at Emerald Sanctuary."}, [3]={npc="Grazle", tgt="Grazle"}, [4]={npc="Maybess Riverbreeze", tgt="Maybess Riverbreeze", desc="Collect Blood Amber in north Felwood. Kill treants next. Turn in back south."}, [5]={npc="Greta Mosshoof", tgt="Greta Mosshoof"}, [6]={npc="Taronn Redfeather", tgt="Taronn Redfeather"}, [7]={hint="Grazle wants you to prove yourself by killing 6 Deadwood Warriors, 6 Deadwood Pathfinders, and 6 Deadwood Gardeners. Return to him in southern Felwood near the Emerald Sanctuary when you are done.", desc="Earn Timbermaw rep. If still hostile, grind at the northern camp later."}, [8]={npc="Grazle", tgt="Grazle"}, [9]={npc="Grazle", tgt="Grazle", desc="Pick it up first, then pick it up at the northernmost point of Felwood at the next stop."}, [10]={text="Follow the main road north through Jaedenar to Bloodvenom Post."}, [11]={node="Bloodvenom Post", desc="Open flight path to Brakkar."}, [12]={hint="Enter Jaedenar and slay 4 Jaedenar Hounds, 4 Jaedenar Guardsmen, 6 Jaedenar Adepts, and 6 Jaedenar Cultists before returning to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood."}, [13]={npc="Winna Hazzard", tgt="Winna Hazzard"}, [14]={npc="Dreka'Sur", tgt="Dreka'Sur"}, [15]={text="Follow the road north to Shatter Scar Vale for the corruption survey. Loop back to Emerald Sanctuary via the western satyr moonwell and southern orc camp."}, [16]={hint="Seek out and destroy 2 Entropic Beasts and 2 Entropic Horrors while exploring Shatter Scar Vale. After checking to see if the craters there are still filled with corrupt fel water, return to Taronn Redfeather in Felwood.", desc="Walk to the quest exploration area, single kill elements will not complete all objectives."}, [17]={hint="Collect a sample of corrupted water from the Jadefire Satyrs' moonwell and bring it to Winna Hazzard at Bloodvenom Post.", desc="Here and the other port Moonwell in the center of Jaedenar are two different targets."}, [18]={hint="Kill Overlord Ror and return his claw to Dreka'Sur at Bloodvenom Post in Felwood.", desc="Target is deep in the south camp. Clear along the ramp before pulling."}, [19]={npc="Greta Mosshoof", tgt="Greta Mosshoof"}, [20]={npc="Taronn Redfeather", tgt="Taronn Redfeather"}, [21]={npc="Greta Mosshoof", tgt="Greta Mosshoof", desc="Use the empty water bottle to fill with water at Jaedenar center Moonwell next trip."}, [22]={text="Return to Bloodvenom Post to turn in the water sample and Rell's claw. Restock if needed."}, [23]={npc="Winna Hazzard", tgt="Winna Hazzard"}, [24]={npc="Dreka'Sur", tgt="Dreka'Sur"}, [25]={npc="Ogtinc", tgt="Ogtinc", tag="Optional", desc="Turn in to Ogtinc in Azshara before Felwood. Devilsaur Eye is a reward option.", star={"Devilsaur Eye", {"HUNTER"}}}, [26]={npc="Archmage Xylem", tgt="Archmage Xylem", tag="Optional", desc="Turn in to Xylem in Azshara before Felwood. Fire Ruby is a reward option.", star={"Fire Ruby", {"MAGE"}}}, [27]={npc="Niby the Almighty", tgt="Niby the Almighty", tag="Optional"}, [28]={hint="Speak with Impsy in Felwood.", tag="Optional"}, [29]={npc="Impsy", tgt="Impsy", tag="Optional"}, [30]={npc="Impsy", tgt="Impsy", tag="Optional", desc="Get Jaedenar essence first. Fly to Azshara via Orgrimmar or to Blasted Lands via Stonard."}, [31]={npc="Impsy", tgt="Impsy", tag="Optional", desc="If you already have the trainer version An Imp's Request, directly submit An Imp's Request and then pick up The Wrong Stuff."}, [32]={hint="Bring a piece of felcloth to Impsy in Felwood.", tag="Optional", desc="If you already have the trainer version An Imp's Request, directly submit An Imp's Request and then pick up The Wrong Stuff."}, [33]={npc="Impsy", tgt="Impsy", tag="Optional", desc="If you already have the trainer version An Imp's Request, directly submit An Imp's Request and then pick up The Wrong Stuff."}, [34]={npc="Impsy", tgt="Impsy", tag="Optional"}, [35]={hint="Bring 10 Rotting Wood and 4 Bloodvenom Essence to Impsy in Felwood.", tag="Optional"}, [36]={npc="Impsy", tgt="Impsy", tag="Optional"}, [37]={npc="Impsy", tgt="Impsy", tag="Optional", desc="Accept if you plan to run Sunken Temple during the Eastern Kingdoms leg.", star={"Soul Harvester", {"WARLOCK"}}}, [38]={npc="Greta Mosshoof", tgt="Greta Mosshoof", tag="Optional", desc="Emerald Sanctuary Find Greta; optional Blessed Prayer Beads and other equipment.", star={"Blessed Prayer Beads", {"PRIEST"}}}}},
    ["04-46"] = {name="Felwood: Bloodvenom Post to Timbermaw Hold", short="Bloodvenom Post +", tips={{k="交通", text="Bloodvenom Post After supplies, go north along the avenue. Look at the fork in the cave and go to the exit Winterspring."}, {k="取捨", text="Do |North Irontree Woods Solve Blood Amber and Corrupted Power together, and finally gain the reputation of the Woodbolg."}, {k="取捨", text="Stop by later|Completed Cleansing Felwood Please keep the items first and return them to Emerald Sanctuary later. Seeking Spiritual Aid Leave Ratchet."}, {k="提醒", text="If Timbermaw's reputation reaches \"Indifference\", safely exit the cave. If the reputation is still hostile, or has not reached level 56, replenish furbolgs in the north at Deadwood Village (approximately 62, 8).", s={{"If Timbermaw's reputation reaches \"Indifference\", safely exit the cave"}, {"If the reputation is still hostile, or has not reached level 56, replenish furbolgs in the north at Deadwood Village (approximately 62, 8)"}}}}, danger={[1]="Timbermaw Hold While still hostile to you, the guards in the cave may join the fight in groups. First hit the dead wood furbolg outside to raise it to indolence and then pierce the hole."}, grind={[1]={mob="Deadwood Avenger", note="North Deadwood Village is an ordinary furbolg. Go to Timbermaw Hold and fight it to gain reputation and feathers. It is easy to pull the tents together, so clear the outer ring first."}, [2]={mob="Deadwood Den Watcher", note="Ordinary furbolgs in the same village are close to the road. When encountering a reputation group, pick off single monsters along the road. Don't fight the Timbermaw guard."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Brakkar"}, [2]={npc="Altsoba Ragetotem"}, [3]={npc="Bale"}, [4]={npc="Bale"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Winna Hazzard", tgt="Winna Hazzard"}, [2]={npc="Trull Failbane", tgt="Trull Failbane", desc="Kill owlbeasts in Winterspring, then turn in at Bloodvenom Post."}, [3]={text="Go south to Jaedenar's central moonwell, collect water and turn it in at Emerald Sanctuary. Release the kitten at the Jadefire moonwell afterward."}, [4]={hint="Take the Empty Canteen to the Moon Well in the center of Jaedenar and fill it before returning to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood."}, [5]={npc="Greta Mosshoof", tgt="Greta Mosshoof"}, [6]={npc="Greta Mosshoof", tgt="Greta Mosshoof", desc="Stay at Islen Waterseer south of Ratchet."}, [7]={hint="Take Winna's kitten to the corrupted moonwell, release it, then bring it back to Winna.", desc="Walk with the kitten. Click it by Winna before turning in."}, [8]={npc="Winna Hazzard", tgt="Winna Hazzard"}, [9]={text="Follow the main road north from Bloodvenom Post through Irontree Woods and Deadwood Village. Find Nafien at the Timbermaw entrance."}, [10]={hint="Bring 15 Blood Amber to Maybess Riverbreeze in Felwood.", desc="Save the items for Maybess when you next visit south Felwood."}, [11]={hint="Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache in Feralas wants you to kill 12 Angerclaw Grizzlies and 12 Felpaw Ravagers in Felwood.", tag="If already accepted", desc="Requires pickup at Camp Mojache. Turn in there."}, [12]={hint="Travel north along the main road in Felwood and speak with the furbolg named Nafien. He stands guard outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold."}, [13]={npc="Nafien", tgt="Nafien"}, [14]={npc="Nafien", tgt="Nafien"}, [15]={hint="Nafien would like you to kill 6 Deadwood Den Watchers, 6 Deadwood Avengers, and 6 Deadwood Shamans. Return to him in northern Felwood near the entrance to Timbermaw Hold.", desc="Check Timbermaw rep after the north camp. If hostile, grind Deadwood until Unfriendly."}, [16]={npc="Nafien", tgt="Nafien"}, [17]={npc="Nafien", tgt="Nafien", desc="Go from the cave to the exit Winterspring and exit the cave to find Salfa."}, [18]={text="At Unfriendly with Timbermaw Hold, enter the tunnel and take the Winterspring exit. Avoid attacking the Timbermaw furbolgs."}}},
    ["04-47"] = {name="Winterspring: Everlook", tips={{k="交通", text="Unlock Everlook's flight path and set your hearth. Next, fly to Camp Mojache. If its flight path is locked, fly to Freewind Post and follow the road west into Feralas."}, {k="取捨", text="Do | Frostfire Hot Springs Donova quests should be completed first, and the owl beasts should be cleared en route; Everlook Wendigo and Chimera can be done in the same trip."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional | Ursius is an elite, Winterfall Activity must turn back to the west to the cave entrance. Do it if you have a team or lack of progress."}, {k="取捨", text="Then drop by | Everlook Report and Duke Nicholas's book will be placed on the taskbar first, and Eastern Kingdoms will be handed in together in the next round."}, {k="提醒", text="If you are not yet level 56, fight the ordinary snow monsters on the east side of Everlook (about 64, 40) or the furbolgs on the east side of Winter Spring Village to avoid the patrolling elites.", s={{"If you are not yet level 56, fight the ordinary snow monsters on the east side of Everlook (about 64, 40) or the furbolgs on the east side of Winter Spring Village to avoid the patrolling elites"}}}}, danger={[1]="Everlook There is elite Ursius of the Shardtooth patrolling to the north. Avoid it when fighting an ordinary bear alone, and then complete its quest if you have formed a team.", [2]="The shamans and patrolling furbolgs in Winterfall tend to form groups. If you lack experience, look for lone guards outside the village."}, grind={[1]={mob="Ice Thistle Yeti", note="Everlook The ordinary snowman on the east side relies on supply points and can collect fur smoothly. There are often players with the same quest at the entrance of the cave, so fight along the foot of the mountain first."}, [2]={mob="Winterfall Den Watcher", note="Ordinary furbolgs in the outer circle of Winterspring Village can restore Timbermaw's reputation and related drops. Spellcasting monsters in the village are easy to pull in succession, avoiding elite patrols."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Yugrek"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Vizzie"}, [3]={npc="Nixxrak"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Vizzie"}, [5]={npc="Wixxrak"}}, steps={[1]={hint="Travel through Timbermaw Hold and exit into Winterspring. Speak with Salfa, who stands guard outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold.", tag="If Felwood Bloodvenom Post and Timbermaw Hold are connected"}, [2]={npc="Salfa", tgt="Salfa", tag="If Felwood Bloodvenom Post and Timbermaw Hold are connected"}, [3]={npc="Salfa", tgt="Salfa", tag="Optional", desc="Do in Winterfall Village east of Everlook. Turn in on the next trip west to the tunnel."}, [4]={text="Head south from the tunnel to Frostfire Hot Springs and pick up Donova's furbolg quests before going to the western Winterfall camp."}, [5]={hint="Take Linken's Sword to Donova Snowden in Winterspring.", tag="If Un'Goro Crater Marshal's Refuge is connected"}, [6]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden", tag="If Un'Goro Crater Marshal's Refuge is connected"}, [7]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden", desc="Get the elixir in north Feralas. Turn in when you return to Frostfire Hot Springs."}, [8]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden"}, [9]={hint="Donova Snowden in Winterspring wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Pathfinders, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Totemics."}, [10]={npc="Empty Firewater Flask", npcObj=true, tag="If it drops", desc="Right-click Empty Firewater Flask to start the chain. Farm Winterfall furbolgs if needed."}, [11]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden"}, [12]={hint="Bring the Empty Firewater Flask to Donova Snowden in Winterspring.", tag="If you have the Firewater Flask"}, [13]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden", tag="If you have the Firewater Flask"}, [14]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden", desc="Save it for the next trip to North Felwood and look for the steamer in the Deadwood Camp."}, [15]={text="Head east to Everlook and clear both kinds of wildkin on the way."}, [16]={node="Everlook", desc="Open flight path to Yugrek."}, [17]={text="Set your hearth with Innkeeper Vizzie (61.36, 38.83)."}, [18]={hint="Trull Failbane in Felwood wants you to kill 15 Raging Owlbeasts and 15 Ragged Owlbeasts.", tag="If Felwood Bloodvenom Post and Timbermaw Hold are connected", desc="After finishing, keep it until you return to Felwood Bloodvenom Post."}, [19]={hint="Give Tinkee's Letter to Felnok Steelspring.", tag="If Burning Steppes Flame Crest and Blackrock Mountain are connected"}, [20]={npc="Felnok Steelspring", tgt="Felnok Steelspring", tag="If Burning Steppes Flame Crest and Blackrock Mountain are connected"}, [21]={npc="Felnok Steelspring", tgt="Felnok Steelspring", tag="Requires quest Felnok Steelspring"}, [22]={npc="Umi Rumplesnicker", tgt="Umi Rumplesnicker"}, [23]={npc="Gregor Greystone", tgt="Gregor Greystone", desc="Next trip to The Bulwark, turn over to Argent Officer Garush."}, [24]={npc="Gregor Greystone", tgt="Gregor Greystone", desc="Leave it to Eastern Plaguelands Light's Hope Chapel."}, [25]={npc="Jessica Redpath", tgt="Jessica Redpath", desc="Bring the Everlook report too. Turn this in at Darrowshire in Eastern Plaguelands."}, [26]={npc="Storm Shadowhoof", tgt="Storm Shadowhoof", tag="Elite, Optional"}, [27]={text="Clear the yeti cave and surrounding area east of Everlook, then loop north and east if needed."}, [28]={hint="Collect 10 Thick Yeti Furs for Umi Rumplesnicker in Everlook.", desc="The next section requires Snow Monster Point, so pick up Are We There, Yeti? on a later trip."}, [29]={npc="Umi Rumplesnicker", tgt="Umi Rumplesnicker"}, [30]={hint="Bring 8 Uncracked Chillwind Horns to Felnok Steelspring.", tag="Requires quest Felnok Steelspring"}, [31]={npc="Felnok Steelspring", tgt="Felnok Steelspring", tag="Requires quest Felnok Steelspring"}, [32]={npc="Felnok Steelspring", tgt="Felnok Steelspring", tag="Optional", desc="Report back to Tinkee the next time you pass through Burning Steppes."}, [33]={hint="Storm Shadowhoof at Everlook in Winterspring wants you to kill Ursius.", tag="Elite, Optional", desc="Level 56 elites, form a team and fight again."}, [34]={npc="Storm Shadowhoof", tgt="Storm Shadowhoof", tag="Elite, Optional"}, [35]={hint="Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring.", tag="Return to the cave entrance, Optional"}, [36]={npc="Salfa", tgt="Salfa", tag="Return to the cave entrance, Optional"}}},
    ["05-d25"] = {name="Lower Blackrock Spire", entrance="Searing Gorge 34.80, 85.30 (Blackrock Mountain external road mark)", pickup="In Burning Steppes Flame Crest, unlock the flight path first. After level 55, return to Flame Crest and find Kibler to pick up two pieces. Go to Winterspring Everlook to find Kilram, cross the sea and return to Eastern Kingdoms, then fly Kargath to Gautus, Jaramafo, and Lexlort to take over. Take Searing Gorge or Flame Crest to the upper balcony on the east side of Blackrock Mountain and enter the common teleportation door; return to Kargath and turn in Warlord's Command, pick up Eitrigg's Wisdom and keep it.", pickupS={{"In Burning Steppes Flame Crest, unlock the flight path first"}, {"After level 55, return to Flame Crest and find Kibler to pick up two pieces"}, {"Go to Winterspring Everlook to find Kilram, cross the sea and return to Eastern Kingdoms, then fly Kargath to Gautus, Jaramafo, and Lexlort to take over"}, {"Take Searing Gorge or Flame Crest to the upper balcony on the east side of Blackrock Mountain and enter the common teleportation door; return to Kargath and turn in Warlord's Command, pick up Eitrigg's Wisdom and keep it"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Lower entrance → Omokk → Vosh'gajin → Bijou and her belongings down the ramp → Voone → eggs and Mother Smolderweb → Halycon and Gizrul → Wyrmthalak. Loot the gems from Omokk, Voone and Wyrmthalak."}, {k="取捨", text="Prioritize the three king files, Worg, egg and Bijou; if the team already has someone who can open the upper level, they can skip the seal chain."}, {k="說明", text="Enter the lower level after opening the server. Blackrock Mountain External road signs are also available Burning Steppes 29.40, 38.30; after entering the mountain, follow the upward path to the east high platform, enter the door and go down to the right.", s={{"Enter the lower level after opening the server"}, {"Blackrock Mountain External road signs are also available Burning Steppes 29.40, 38.30; after entering the mountain, follow the upward path to the east high platform, enter the door and go down to the right"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Kilram", tgt="Kilram"}, [2]={npc="Kibler", tgt="Kibler"}, [3]={npc="Kibler", tgt="Kibler"}, [4]={npc="Warlord Goretooth", tgt="Warlord Goretooth", desc="If no quest window opens, talk to the NPC and use the orders from your bags."}, [5]={npc="Galamav the Marksman", tgt="Galamav the Marksman"}, [6]={npc="Lexlort", tgt="Lexlort"}, [7]={text="Lower Blackrock Spire entrance"}, [8]={npc="Scarshield Infiltrator", tgt="Scarshield Infiltrator", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Level 57+. Talk to the Scarshield Infiltrator on the upper balcony: that's Vaelan."}, [9]={hint="Travel to Blackrock Spire and find out what happened to Bijou.", desc="Location: Head down the ramp from Vosh'gajin's room. Look for Bijou on the side platform."}, [10]={npc="Bijou", tgt="Bijou", tag="Unverified"}, [11]={npc="Bijou", tgt="Bijou", tag="Unverified", preText="Operative Bijou"}, [12]={hint="Find Bijou's Belongings and return them to her. You recall her mentioning that she stashed them on the bottom floor of the city.", desc="Location: From Bijou's platform, return to the center, then search the lower level."}, [13]={npc="Bijou", tgt="Bijou", tag="Unverified"}, [14]={npc="Bijou", tgt="Bijou", tag="Unverified", preText="Bijou's Belongings"}, [15]={hint="Travel to Blackrock Spire and collect 15 Spire Spider Eggs for Kibler.", desc="Location: Loot eggs along the webbed tunnels. Clear the spiders around each clutch first."}, [16]={hint="Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay Shadow Hunter Vosh'gajin. Recover Vosh'gajin's Snakestone and return to Kilram.", desc="DungeonsForever Dungeon Map Reference Points 5​​​5.50, 69.40. Shadowhunter Washgarth. Location: Pass Omokk and follow the tunnel to Shadow Hunter Vosh'gajin. Order: Fight Washgarth first, then follow the ramp in its room to find Bijou."}, [17]={hint="Travel to Blackrock Spire and find Bloodaxe Worg Pups. Use the cage to carry the ferocious little beasts. Bring back a Caged Worg Pup to Kibler.", desc="First tell the team to keep a young wolf to avoid being killed by range attacks. Location: Past the spiders and troll fork, enter the wolf room and cage a pup."}, [18]={hint="Slay Halycon, pack mistress of the Bloodaxe worg.", desc="Location: Go right at the fork after the spiders. Take the left side into the wolf den."}, [19]={hint="Slay Highlord Omokk, War Master Voone, and Overlord Wyrmthalak. Recover Important Blackrock Documents. Return to Warlord Goretooth in Kargath when the mission has been accomplished.", desc="The file location will change. Find the first three rooms when you encounter them. Map: Omokk 35.10,55.30; Voone 52.50,54.90; Wyrmthalak 57.80,60.50. Check each room. Location: Check each of the three bosses' rooms and Urok's tribute pile for the documents. Order: Ormoc → Vaughn → Vimsa Rarc."}, [20]={hint="Find the three gemstones of command: The Gemstone of Smolderthorn, Gemstone of Spirestone, and Gemstone of Bloodaxe. Return them, along with the Unadorned Seal of Ascension, to Vaelan.", tag="Optional", desc="Agree on gem and seal loot first. For UBRS, only one player needs a finished seal. Map: Omokk 35.10,55.30; Voone 52.50,54.90; Wyrmthalak 57.80,60.50. Check each room. Location: Loot one gem from each boss. Check trash for the Unadorned Seal. Order: Ormoc → Vaughn → Vimsa Rarc."}, [21]={npc="Scarshield Infiltrator", tgt="Scarshield Infiltrator", tag="Optional, Unverified"}, [22]={npc="Scarshield Infiltrator", tgt="Scarshield Infiltrator", tag="Optional, Unverified", preText="Seal of Ascension"}, [23]={hint="Take Bijou's Reconnaissance Report back to Grandmaster Lexlort in Kargath."}, [24]={npc="Warlord Goretooth", tgt="Warlord Goretooth"}, [25]={npc="Galamav the Marksman", tgt="Galamav the Marksman"}, [26]={npc="Lexlort", tgt="Lexlort"}, [27]={npc="Kibler", tgt="Kibler"}, [28]={npc="Kibler", tgt="Kibler"}, [29]={npc="Kilram", tgt="Kilram"}, [30]={npc="Warlord Goretooth", tgt="Warlord Goretooth", desc="Save for Orgrimmar. See Eitrigg in the Valley of Wisdom.", preText="Warlord's Command"}, [31]={hint="Travel to the Wyrmbog in Dustwallow Marsh. Find the ancient drake, Emberstrife and beat him without mercy until his will is broken.", tag="Optional", desc="Group for elites. Stop damage before controlling the dragon."}, [32]={npc="Scarshield Infiltrator", tgt="Scarshield Infiltrator", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Return to Blackrock Spire and find Vielan in the lower door."}}},
    ["04-48"] = {name="Feralas: Camp Mojache (short visit)", short="Feralas: Camp Mojache", tips={{k="交通", text="The main transitions are Everlook flying to Mosache, and Mosache flying to Ratchet. If Booty Bay has been arranged for delivery, it can be made up by ship Ratchet."}, {k="取捨", text="Do | Feralas Camp Mojache and Rage Scar Hold, Felwood's The Strength of Corruption is a quest that can be handed in when you return to the village."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional|The coast side quest is on the west side. If the locator is not missing, don't look for it; only add the coast if you want to gain experience or go to The Twin Colossals."}, {k="提醒", text="There is no requirement to practice alone on this site. If the difference is 56, go to the next station to submit the documents first, and then leave the experience difference to the same monster area in the later stage.", s={{"There is no requirement to practice alone on this site"}, {"If the difference is 56, go to the next station to submit the documents first, and then leave the experience difference to the same monster area in the later stage"}}}}, danger={[1]="The Forgotten Coast The giant needs to be reduced with a compressor before playing. Wait for Sea Elemental to go away and deal with them one by one."}, grind={[1]={mob="Northspring Windcaller", note="If you have already submitted the documents at Beiquan, clear the ordinary harpies outside the camp and collect the quest drops from Beiquan. The strange level is on the low side. If it is still a long way off, go to Winterspring."}, [2]={mob="Ice Thistle Yeti", note="If there is a level difference of 56, give priority to making up for it here before leaving Everlook at the previous station. Ordinary snowmen are concentrated, and the outer slope is easier to pull than the entrance of the cave."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Shyn"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Greul"}, [3]={npc="Cawind Trueaim"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Greul"}, [5]={npc="Cawind Trueaim"}, [6]={npc="Tarhus"}}, steps={[1]={text="Fly from Everlook to Camp Mojache. Turn in the Camp Mojache and Rage Scar Hold leads from Felwood. Head north for Videre Elixir if you picked up the quest."}, [2]={npc="Talo Thornhoof", tgt="Talo Thornhoof", tag="If Felwood Bloodvenom Post and Timbermaw Hold have been completed"}, [3]={text="If you have The Videre Elixir, follow the road west to the fork, then go toward the Twin Colossals and Ravenwind Ruins."}, [4]={hint="Seek out Gregan Brewspewer in northern Feralas. From him, learn how you may acquire the Videre Elixir, then return to Donova Snowden in Winterspring.", tag="If Winterspring Everlook is connected", desc="Get Gregan's elixir for The Videre Elixir. Don't drink it. Take it to Donova in Winterspring."}, [5]={text="Only visit the Forgotten Coast for the optional quests. If you have the Feralas beacon, pick up the Feral Scar Vale cave escort on the way.", tag="Optional"}, [6]={npc="OOX-22/FE Distress Beacon", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="The locator is dropped by normal mobs. Pick it up after you picked it up."}, [7]={hint="Take the distress beacon to Oglethorpe's homing robot in a cave near Feral Scar Vale.", tag="Optional", desc="The locator is dropped by normal mobs. Pick it up after you picked it up."}, [8]={npc="Homing Robot OOX-22/FE", tgt="Homing Robot OOX-22/FE", tag="Optional", desc="The locator is dropped by normal mobs. Pick it up after you picked it up."}, [9]={npc="Homing Robot OOX-22/FE", tgt="Homing Robot OOX-22/FE", tag="Optional", desc="Watch for ambushes. Turn in at Booty Bay if you take the Ratchet boat route."}, [10]={hint="Escort OOX-22/FE to the dock along the Forgotten Coast, then report to Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay.", tag="Optional", desc="Watch for ambushes. Turn in at Booty Bay if you take the Ratchet boat route."}, [11]={npc="Zorbin Fandazzle", tgt="Zorbin Fandazzle", tag="Optional"}, [12]={npc="Zorbin Fandazzle", tgt="Zorbin Fandazzle", tag="Optional"}, [13]={hint="Use Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker to zap any kind of giant found in Feralas into a more manageable form. Bring 15 Miniaturization Residues found on the zapped versions of these giants to Zorbin Fandazzle at the docks of the Forgotten Coast, Feralas.", tag="Optional", desc="Shrink first and then kill; unshrunk giants will not drop the required items."}, [14]={npc="Zorbin Fandazzle", tgt="Zorbin Fandazzle", tag="Optional"}, [15]={hint="Collect 10 Water Elemental Cores from the Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays along the Forgotten Coast of Feralas, and bring them back to Zorbin Fandazzle who is near the dock there.", tag="Optional"}, [16]={npc="Zorbin Fandazzle", tgt="Zorbin Fandazzle", tag="Optional"}, [17]={text="Return to Camp Mojache and fly to Ratchet. If Rescue OOX-22/FE! is ready, take the boat to Booty Bay for the turn-in and come back. Otherwise turn in at Ratchet."}}},
    ["04-49"] = {name="The Barrens: Ratchet (short visit)", short="Barrens: Ratchet", tips={{k="交通", text="After Ratchet flies to Orgrimmar, change to the zeppelin in the direction of Undercity outside the city. Arrive at Tirisfal Glades and take the east road to The Bulwark."}, {k="取捨", text="Do | Completed Un'Goro Ash and the workshop branch will be handed over to Liv, and then Islon will be picked up on the coast to return Felwood's letter."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional|If you don't have Ratchet to hand in the quest, fly directly from Feralas to Orgrimmar and transfer to the zeppelin."}, {k="提醒", text="The monster level of Ratchet is low. If you have not reached level 56, fly back to Everlook and fight the ordinary snowmen on the east side (about 64, 40) before transferring to the zeppelin, or go to Western Plaguelands The Bulwark and fight the ordinary undead at Felstone Field (about 38, 56).", s={{"The monster level of Ratchet is low"}, {"If you have not reached level 56, fly back to Everlook and fight the ordinary snowmen on the east side (about 64, 40) before transferring to the zeppelin, or go to Western Plaguelands The Bulwark and fight the ordinary undead at Felstone Field (about 38, 56)"}}}}, grind={[1]={mob="Skeletal Sorcerer", note="Ratchet only handles handover. If you are short of level 56, take the zeppelin along the original path and go to the next stop Felstone Field and try again. There are many ordinary skeletons, so pull them from the field ridge to avoid the Scarlet patrol."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Bragok"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Wiley"}, [3]={npc="Grazlix"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Wiley"}, [5]={npc="Jazzik"}, [6]={npc="Horthus"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Oglethorpe Obnoticus", tgt="Oglethorpe Obnoticus", tag="If taking the boat via Booty Bay, Optional"}, [2]={text="Turn in the engineering quest in Ratchet, then follow the coast south to Islen Waterseer."}, [3]={npc="Liv Rizzlefix", tgt="Liv Rizzlefix", tag="If Un'Goro Crater Marshal's Refuge is full of ashes"}, [4]={hint="Travel to Marvon Rivetseeker's workshop in Ratchet.", tag="If Un'Goro Crater Marshal's Refuge is connected"}, [5]={npc="Liv Rizzlefix", tgt="Liv Rizzlefix", tag="If Un'Goro Crater Marshal's Refuge is connected"}, [6]={hint="Take the Corrupt Moon Well Water to Islen Waterseer in the Barrens.", tag="If Felwood Bloodvenom Post and Timbermaw Hold are connected"}, [7]={npc="Islen Waterseer", tgt="Islen Waterseer", tag="If Felwood Bloodvenom Post and Timbermaw Hold are connected"}, [8]={npc="Islen Waterseer", tgt="Islen Waterseer", tag="Requires quest Seeking Spiritual Aid", desc="Keep the purified water for Greta at Emerald Sanctuary later."}, [9]={text="Fly from Ratchet to Orgrimmar and take the Tirisfal Glades zeppelin. On arrival, follow the east road to the Bulwark."}}},
    ["04-50"] = {name="Western Plaguelands", tips={{k="交通", text="Step 1: Go from the zeppelin tower to The Bulwark. After beating Gahrron's Withering, go east along the main road to Eastern Plague."}, {k="取捨", text="Do | Scourge Cauldron Do it in the following order, The Writhing Haunt complete two sections of wild animals en route."}, {k="取捨", text="Don't turn it in yet | Return to the Bulwark will be left in Western Plaguelands The Bulwark, A Plague Upon Thee will be completed in Eastern Plaguelands Light's Hope Chapel and returned to Western Plaguelands The Bulwark."}, {k="提醒", text="Also for the 56-57 level band, go to Eastern Plaguelands Light's Hope Chapel. The barrier was next to Skeletal Fragments before it started accumulating Skeletal Fragments. For characters who plan to bring their own Scholomance key, pick up Mold Rhymes With... after handing it over, and bring two pieces of Thorium Bar to Tanaris Gadgetzan, and then enter Un'Goro Crater.", s={{"Also for the 56-57 level band, go to Eastern Plaguelands Light's Hope Chapel"}, {"The barrier was next to Skeletal Fragments before it started accumulating Skeletal Fragments"}, {"For characters who plan to bring their own Scholomance key, pick up Mold Rhymes With... after handing it over, and bring two pieces of Thorium Bar to Tanaris Gadgetzan, and then enter Un'Goro Crater"}}}}, danger={[1]="Dalson's Tears There is a Scarlet patrol on the north side. When collecting plague pot materials, pull the skeletons from the field ridge. Do not go north through the camp."}, grind={[1]={mob="Skeletal Terror", note="Grind normal skeletons at Dalson's Tears for Skeletal Fragments on the cauldron loop. Avoid the Scarlet patrol north of the farm."}, [2]={mob="Freezing Ghoul", note="The Writhing Haunt The common ghoul nearby, with a suitable level, goes the same way as the next pot. The doorways of houses are densely packed, starting from the edge of the fields."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Argent Quartermaster Hasana"}}, steps={[1]={text="Fly from Ratchet to Orgrimmar and take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades. Follow the main road east from outside Undercity to the Bulwark."}, [2]={hint="Deliver the Everlook Report to Argent Officer Garush at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."}, [3]={npc="Argent Officer Garush", tgt="Argent Officer Garush"}, [4]={npc="Mickey Levine", tgt="Mickey Levine"}, [5]={npc="High Executor Derrington", tgt="High Executor Derrington"}, [6]={hint="Speak with Apothecary Dithers at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."}, [7]={npc="Apothecary Dithers", tgt="Apothecary Dithers"}, [8]={npc="Apothecary Dithers", tgt="Apothecary Dithers"}, [9]={npc="Shadow Priestess Vandis", tgt="Shadow Priestess Vandis"}, [10]={hint="Go to Dalson's Tears in Western Plaguelands to locate and defeat the Cauldron Lord present there, and use its key to gain access to the cauldron. You must have the Empty Dalson's Tears Bottle with you to secure a sample of the poisons used inside the cauldron.", desc="Clear normal undead around the cauldron. Approach to spawn the guardian."}, [11]={npc="Scourge Cauldron", npcObj=true}, [12]={npc="Scourge Cauldron", npcObj=true}, [13]={hint="Bring the Filled Dalson's Tears Bottle to Shadow Priestess Vandis at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."}, [14]={npc="Shadow Priestess Vandis", tgt="Shadow Priestess Vandis"}, [15]={npc="Shadow Priestess Vandis", tgt="Shadow Priestess Vandis"}, [16]={hint="Go to the Writhing Haunt in Western Plaguelands to locate and defeat the Cauldron Lord present there, and use its key to gain access to the cauldron. You must have the Empty Writhing Haunt Bottle with you to secure a sample of the poisons used inside the cauldron.", desc="Clear normal undead around the cauldron. Approach to spawn the guardian."}, [17]={npc="Scourge Cauldron", npcObj=true}, [18]={npc="Scourge Cauldron", npcObj=true}, [19]={npc="Mulgris Deepriver", tgt="Mulgris Deepriver"}, [20]={hint="Destroy 8 Diseased Wolves, and then return to Mulgris Deepriver at the Writhing Haunt, Western Plaguelands."}, [21]={npc="Mulgris Deepriver", tgt="Mulgris Deepriver"}, [22]={npc="Mulgris Deepriver", tgt="Mulgris Deepriver"}, [23]={hint="Destroy 8 Diseased Grizzlies, and then return to Mulgris Deepriver at the Writhing Haunt, Western Plaguelands."}, [24]={npc="Mulgris Deepriver", tgt="Mulgris Deepriver"}, [25]={hint="Bring 15 Skeletal Fragments to Apothecary Dithers at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.", desc="Collect on the two-cauldron loop. Turn in with the samples at the Bulwark."}, [26]={hint="Bring the Filled Writhing Haunt Bottle to Shadow Priestess Vandis at The Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."}, [27]={npc="Shadow Priestess Vandis", tgt="Shadow Priestess Vandis"}, [28]={npc="Apothecary Dithers", tgt="Apothecary Dithers"}, [29]={npc="Shadow Priestess Vandis", tgt="Shadow Priestess Vandis"}, [30]={hint="Go to Gahrron's Withering in Western Plaguelands to locate and defeat the Cauldron Lord present there, and use its key to gain access to the cauldron. You must have the Empty Gahrron's Withering Bottle with you to secure a sample of the poisons used inside the cauldron.", desc="Clear normal undead around the cauldron. Approach to spawn the guardian."}, [31]={npc="Scourge Cauldron", npcObj=true}, [32]={npc="Scourge Cauldron", npcObj=true}, [33]={hint="Bring the voodoo feathers to Bath'rah the Windwatcher.", tag="Optional, Target: Gasher / Zul'Lor / Gasher / Hukku / Mijan / Hukku / Zolo / Loro / Loro", desc="Fly from Undercity to Stonard to form a team."}, [34]={npc="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tgt="Bath'rah the Windwatcher", tag="Optional", desc="In Ott Ranko Basra, choose equipment such as the Enamored Water Spirit.", star={"Enamored Water Spirit", {"SHAMAN"}}}, [35]={hint="Bring a total of 6 Voodoo Feathers from the trolls in sunken temple.", tag="Optional, Target: Gasher / Zul'Lor / Gasher / Hukku / Mijan / Hukku / Zolo / Loro / Loro", desc="Fly to Stonard from Undercity. Save Impsy's turn-in for Irontree Woods."}}},
    ["04-51"] = {name="Eastern Plaguelands", tips={{k="交通", text="After handover Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff and pick-up Defenders of Darrowshire, open the chapel flight path; the last step is to fly Undercity and then transfer to the zeppelin."}, {k="取捨", text="Don't hand over yet | A Plague Upon Thee and Auntie Marlene return Western Plaguelands The Bulwark."}, {k="取捨", text="Skipable|Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee..., Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...) is the target of elite patrols in the Eastern Plague; skip it according to the video selection."}, {k="取捨", text="Skipable | Hameya's Plea To go back and forth between the tomb and Zulmasha, after Of Forgotten Memories points of the tomb soil will attract a group of mercenaries, skip it if you are in a hurry."}, {k="提醒", text="If you are behind on progress, fight ordinary bats, dogs and ghouls outside the Plague Wood (about 29, 28). To reach level 57, wait for Feralas Frayfeather Highlands.", s={{"If you are behind on progress, fight ordinary bats, dogs and ghouls outside the Plague Wood (about 29, 28)"}, {"To reach level 57, wait for Feralas Frayfeather Highlands"}}}}, danger={[1]="The side of Plaguewood near Stratholme has Greater Stitched Abominations and patrols. Go outside when hunting for termites or looking for ghouls."}, grind={[1]={mob="Cannibal Ghoul", note="Ordinary undead on the outskirts of the Plague Wood. complete quests related to the souls of residents en route and avoid higher-level suture abominations and patrols."}, [2]={mob="Frenzied Plaguehound", note="The ordinary Plaguehound outside the road in the same area has a grade close to this section and is easier to pull in the open space. When someone clears the dead, they can look for dogs along the outer circle instead."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Georgia"}, [2]={npc="Jessica Chambers"}, [3]={npc="Craftsman Wilhelm"}, [4]={npc="Jessica Chambers"}, [5]={npc="Caretaker Alen"}}, steps={[1]={text="Cross the western border and find Tirion along the Thondroril River. Pick up his quests, then head south to the main road."}, [2]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring"}, [3]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring"}, [4]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring"}, [5]={npc="Nathanos Blightcaller", tgt="Nathanos Blightcaller"}, [6]={npc="Nathanos Blightcaller", tgt="Nathanos Blightcaller"}, [7]={hint="Find Pamela Redpath in Darrowshire."}, [8]={npc="Pamela Redpath", tgt="Pamela Redpath"}, [9]={npc="Pamela Redpath", tgt="Pamela Redpath"}, [10]={hint="Find Pamela's doll.", desc="Ghosts may appear when picking up parts, so clear the door first."}, [11]={npc="Pamela Redpath", tgt="Pamela Redpath"}, [12]={npc="Pamela Redpath", tgt="Pamela Redpath"}, [13]={npc="Pamela Redpath", tgt="Pamela Redpath"}, [14]={hint="Travel to Corin's Crossing to the east and slaughter the Scourge that inhabit the town. Collect 7 pieces of Living Rot in under 10 minutes. Use the Mortar and Pestle to grind the Living Rot into Coagulated Rot.", desc="The rot lasts about 10 minutes. Grind it on the spot once you have enough."}, [15]={hint="Find Carlin Redpath."}, [16]={npc="Carlin Redpath", tgt="Carlin Redpath"}, [17]={hint="Deliver the book, \"Studies in Spirit Speaking\", to Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff at Light's Hope Chapel, Eastern Plaguelands."}, [18]={npc="Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff", tgt="Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff"}, [19]={npc="Carlin Redpath", tgt="Carlin Redpath"}, [20]={text="Unlock Light's Hope Chapel with Georgia (70.53, 47.55) if needed. Then head north for a loop through Plaguewood."}, [21]={hint="Use the Empty Termite Jar on the Termite Mounds in Eastern Plaguelands. After you've gathered 100 Plagueland Termites, return to Mickey Levine at the Bulwark in Tirisfal Glades.", desc="Check termite mounds along Plaguewood's edge. Avoid elites by Stratholme."}, [22]={hint="Slay 20 Plaguehound Runts, 5 Plaguehounds and 5 Frenzied Plaguehounds. Return to Tirion Fordring when the task is complete."}, [23]={hint="Slay 30 Plaguebats and return to Tirion Fordring."}, [24]={hint="Seek out the Carrion Grubs and Devourers of the region. Slay them and harvest their meat. Return to Tirion Fordring when you have gathered 15 Slabs of Carrion Worm Meat."}, [25]={hint="Slay 20 Noxious Plaguebats and 10 Monstrous Plaguebats. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller when you are finished."}, [26]={hint="Free 15 Darrowshire Spirits and return to Carlin Redpath.", desc="Click each spawned soul after the kill. Kills alone don't count."}, [27]={npc="Carlin Redpath", tgt="Carlin Redpath"}, [28]={npc="Nathanos Blightcaller", tgt="Nathanos Blightcaller"}, [29]={npc="Nathanos Blightcaller", tgt="Nathanos Blightcaller"}, [30]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring"}, [31]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring"}, [32]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring"}, [33]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring", desc="It will only appear after completing Tirion's three hunting quests."}, [34]={hint="Listen to what Tirion Fordring has to say.", desc="It will only appear after completing Tirion's three hunting quests."}, [35]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring", desc="It will only appear after completing Tirion's three hunting quests."}, [36]={text="After the loop, fly from Light's Hope Chapel to Undercity and take the Orgrimmar zeppelin."}}},
    ["05-d27"] = {name="Stratholme: Undead", entrance="Eastern Plaguelands The Lost Supplies about 43.50, 19.40 (side entrance of the undead area)", pickup="First go to Eastern Plaguelands Light's Hope Chapel to find Bettina, Lenid and Caretaker Alen, then go west to Terrordale to find Egan and then enter the side door. The team that ran through the main entrance can save the follow-up The Active Agent for this trip.", pickupS={{"First go to Eastern Plaguelands Light's Hope Chapel to find Bettina, Lenid and Caretaker Alen, then go west to Terrordale to find Egan and then enter the side door"}, {"The team that ran through the main entrance can save the follow-up The Active Agent for this trip"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Service gate → Aurius in the chapel → Baroness Anastari, Nerub'enkan and Maleki in the three ziggurats. Check for the data → Ramstein in the Slaughterhouse → Baron Rivendare, then speak to Aurius. Loot flesh and Holy Water and free Spectral Citizens on the way."}, {k="取捨", text="Pieces of meat, holy water, and the soul of Egan can be taken together. By brushing only one wing, skip the Aurius line, which requires you to get Medallion of Faith first."}, {k="說明", text="Team of five. Use the city gate key for the side entrance; for the first time, go through the city route from the main entrance and get the side entrance key from Barsselas.", s={{"Team of five"}, {"Use the city gate key for the side entrance; for the first time, go through the city route from the main entrance and get the side entrance key from Barsselas"}}}, {k="提醒", text="Team of five. Use the city gate key for the side entrance; for the first time, go through the city route from the main entrance and get the side entrance key from Barsselas.", s={{"Team of five"}, {"Use the city gate key for the side entrance; for the first time, go through the city route from the main entrance and get the side entrance key from Barsselas"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Betina Bigglezink", tgt="Betina Bigglezink", desc="If it has been submitted, pick up The Active Agent on this trip."}, [2]={npc="Betina Bigglezink", tgt="Betina Bigglezink", desc="The Flesh Does Not Lie must be paid first; if it has not been opened for the first time, please leave one.", preText="The Flesh Does Not Lie"}, [3]={npc="Leonid Barthalomew the Revered", tgt="Leonid Barthalomew the Revered"}, [4]={npc="Caretaker Alen", tgt="Caretaker Alen"}, [5]={hint="Find Egan. You only know that he was last seen around Stratholme."}, [6]={npc="Egan", tgt="Egan"}, [7]={npc="Egan", tgt="Egan", desc="Obtain the blaster Egan.", preText="The Restless Souls"}, [8]={text="Stratholme: Undead entrance"}, [9]={hint="Recover 10 Plagued Flesh Samples from Stratholme and return them to Betina Bigglezink. You suspect that any creature in Stratholme would have said flesh sample.", desc="Location: Enter the service gate and loot flesh from the undead along the streets."}, [10]={hint="Travel to Stratholme and search the ziggurats. Find and return new Scourge Data to Betina Bigglezink.", desc="Location: Search all three ziggurats. The data is in a small box in one of them. Order: Every time you defeat a tower gate leader, enter the tower to check."}, [11]={hint="Travel to Stratholme, in the north. Search the supply crates that litter the city and recover 5 Stratholme Holy Water. Return to Leonid Barthalomew the Revered when you have collected enough of the blessed fluid.", desc="Location: Check wooden supply crates along the streets. Clear nearby mobs first."}, [12]={hint="Use Egan's Blaster on the ghostly and spectral citizens of Stratholme. When the restless souls break free from their ghostly shells, use the blaster again - freedom will be theirs!", desc="Location: Find Spectral Citizens and use the Blaster twice on each target."}, [13]={npc="Aurius", tgt="Aurius", tag="Unverified", desc="Loot the medallion from Malor's Strongbox, then go to the service gate chapel."}, [14]={hint="Use/collect: Malor's Strongbox", desc="Location: Enter the service gate. Look for the burning chapel by the entrance."}, [15]={npc="Aurius", tgt="Aurius", tag="Unverified"}, [16]={npc="Aurius", tgt="Aurius", tag="Unverified", desc="Give the medal and accept the quest first, then go to Baron Rivendare.", preText="The Medallion of Faith"}, [17]={hint="Complete the quest objectives.", desc="Map: Baron Rivendare (38.90, 20.40). Talk to Aurius in the room afterward. Location: Clear the ziggurats and Slaughterhouse. Find Aurius in Rivendare's room. Order: After killing, find Aurius in the same room."}, [18]={npc="Aurius", tgt="Aurius", tag="Unverified", desc="Turn in to Aurius in Rivendare's room (38.90, 20.40). Pickup: service gate chapel."}, [19]={npc="Betina Bigglezink", tgt="Betina Bigglezink"}, [20]={npc="Betina Bigglezink", tgt="Betina Bigglezink"}, [21]={npc="Leonid Barthalomew the Revered", tgt="Leonid Barthalomew the Revered"}, [22]={npc="Egan", tgt="Egan"}}},
    ["05-d26"] = {name="Stratholme: Live", entrance="Eastern Plaguelands The Lost Supplies About 27.10, 10.70 (main entrance portal)", pickup="First find Duke and Smoker at Eastern Plaguelands Light's Hope Chapel. Go northwest along the Plaguelands Avenue and take the main entrance; to do Tirion's painting, first go to Eastern Plaguelands Light's Hope Chapel The Hunt Completed, then go to the southern tomb, Northdale, then go to the Western Plague Caer Darrow to find the painter, and then return to the Eastern Plague.", pickupS={{"First find Duke and Smoker at Eastern Plaguelands Light's Hope Chapel"}, {"Go northwest along the Plaguelands Avenue and take the main entrance; to do Tirion's painting, first go to Eastern Plaguelands Light's Hope Chapel The Hunt Completed, then go to the southern tomb, Northdale, then go to the Western Plague Caer Darrow to find the painter, and then return to the Eastern Plague"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Main gate → tobacco shop in Market Row → Scarlet Bastion. Skip Cannon Master Willey if desired. In Archivist Galford's room, retrieve the painting and burn the records. Kill Balnazzar for a full clear."}, {k="取捨", text="Tobacco and archive quests are both easy to pick up; after completing the first half of Tirion, add Of Love and Family. If you want to run only one trip, connect all the front parts first."}, {k="說明", text="Team of five. Please bring the The Scarlet Crusade key to the Scarlet Fortress Gate. If you are under level 58, pick it up first and then group it together when you reach a higher level; enter the Undead Zone from the underground side door.", s={{"Team of five"}, {"Please bring the The Scarlet Crusade key to the Scarlet Fortress Gate"}, {"If you are under level 58, pick it up first and then group it together when you reach a higher level; enter the Undead Zone from the underground side door"}}}, {k="提醒", text="Team of five. Please bring the The Scarlet Crusade key to the Scarlet Fortress Gate. If you are under level 58, pick it up first and then group it together when you reach a higher level; enter the Undead Zone from the underground side door.", s={{"Team of five"}, {"Please bring the The Scarlet Crusade key to the Scarlet Fortress Gate"}, {"If you are under level 58, pick it up first and then group it together when you reach a higher level; enter the Undead Zone from the underground side door"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Smokey LaRue", tgt="Smokey LaRue"}, [2]={npc="Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff", tgt="Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff", desc="On the same trip to clear the file manager, remember to burn the files."}, [3]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring", desc="Optional Tirion chain. Skip if done on the Light's Hope Chapel leg."}, [4]={hint="Slay 20 Plaguehound Runts, 5 Plaguehounds and 5 Frenzied Plaguehounds. Return to Tirion Fordring when the task is complete."}, [5]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring"}, [6]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring", desc="Optional Tirion chain. Skip if done on the Light's Hope Chapel leg."}, [7]={hint="Slay 30 Plaguebats and return to Tirion Fordring."}, [8]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring"}, [9]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring", desc="Optional Tirion chain. Skip if done on the Light's Hope Chapel leg."}, [10]={hint="Seek out the Carrion Grubs and Devourers of the region. Slay them and harvest their meat. Return to Tirion Fordring when you have gathered 15 Slabs of Carrion Worm Meat."}, [11]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring"}, [12]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring", desc="Optional Tirion chain. Skip if done on the Light's Hope Chapel leg.", preText="Demon Dogs, Blood Tinged Skies, Carrion Grubbage"}, [13]={hint="Listen to what Tirion Fordring has to say."}, [14]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring"}, [15]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring", desc="Optional Tirion chain. Skip if done on the Light's Hope Chapel leg.", preText="Redemption"}, [16]={hint="Travel to the Undercroft - at the southernmost section of the Eastern Plaguelands - and recover Taelan's Hammer. Return to Tirion Fordring upon completion of your objective."}, [17]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring"}, [18]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring", desc="Optional Tirion chain. Skip if done on the Light's Hope Chapel leg.", preText="Of Forgotten Memories"}, [19]={hint="Travel to Northdale, in the northeastern region of the Eastern Plaguelands, and recover the Symbol of Lost Honor. Return to Tirion Fordring upon completion of your objective."}, [20]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring"}, [21]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring", desc="Optional Tirion chain. Skip if done on the Light's Hope Chapel leg.", preText="Of Lost Honor"}, [22]={hint="Travel to island of Caer Darrow, in the south-central region of the Plaguelands, and look for any clues as to the whereabouts of the painting."}, [23]={npc="Artist Renfray", tgt="Artist Renfray"}, [24]={npc="Artist Renfray", tgt="Artist Renfray", preText="Of Love and Family"}, [25]={text="Stratholme: Live entrance"}, [26]={hint="Find Ezra Grimm's smoke shop in Stratholme and recover a box of Grimm's Premium Tobacco. Return to Smokey LaRue when the job is done.", desc="Location: Enter the main gate and open the tobacco shop's crate in Market Row."}, [27]={hint="Travel to Stratholme and find Archivist Galford of the Scarlet Crusade. Destroy him and burn down the Scarlet Archive.", desc="DungeonsForever map: Archivist (27.10, 75.10). The records are in his room. Location: Kill Galford in the Scarlet Bastion archives, then burn the records."}, [28]={hint="Travel to Stratholme, in the northern part of the Plaguelands. It is in the Scarlet Bastion that you will find the painting 'Of Love and Family,' hidden behind another painting depicting the twin moons of our world.", desc="Map: Archivist (27.10, 75.10). The painting is in the same room. Location: Check the painting of two moons on the wall of the Scarlet archives."}, [29]={npc="Smokey LaRue", tgt="Smokey LaRue"}, [30]={npc="Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff", tgt="Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff"}, [31]={npc="Tirion Fordring", tgt="Tirion Fordring"}}},
    ["04-52"] = {name="Moonglade", tips={{k="交通", text="In step 2, fly to Thunder Bluff. In step 7, fly to Felwood and go to Timbermaw Hold. unlock the flight path southwest of Moonglade, and then go to Winterspring."}, {k="取捨", text="Do | Connect Wasteland and A Reliquary of Purity first, Silithus Southwind Village can continue to do the quests in the same area."}, {k="取捨", text="Don't turn it in yet | Mystery Goo is handed in to Winterspring Everlook; A Reliquary of Purity is picked up in Cenarion Fortress at Silithus, and Moonglade Nighthaven is left to hand in."}, {k="提醒", text="If the Timbermaw is still actively attacking, first kill the Timberbolg outside the fortress or complete the reputation quests Felwood Emerald Sanctuary and Bloodvenom Post to Winterspring Everlook; immediately pick up Winterspring Everlook after passing the fortress.", s={{"If the Timbermaw is still actively attacking, first kill the Timberbolg outside the fortress or complete the reputation quests Felwood Emerald Sanctuary and Bloodvenom Post to Winterspring Everlook; immediately pick up Winterspring Everlook after passing the fortress"}}}}, danger={[1]="If you go from Moonglade to Timbermaw Hold to Winterspring, first confirm the reputation of Timbermaw. When hostile, go around or return to Felwood to replenish your reputation."}, grind={[1]={mob="Deadwood Avenger", note="After Nighthaven is delivered, Timbermaw Hold can be returned to Felwood side entrance for refill. Ordinary dead wood furbolgs are densely packed, which can also replenish Timbermaw's reputation; avoid Timbermaw guards and the chain pulls in the tent."}, [2]={mob="Winterfall Den Watcher", note="If you have passed through the fortress, Winterspring first fight the ordinary furbolgs along the road. A small amount can be replenished near Donova, and the main monster group is still east of Everlook."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Faustron"}, [2]={npc="Meliri"}, [3]={npc="Dargon"}, [4]={npc="Daeolyn Summerleaf"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Cenarion Emissary Blackhoof", tgt="Cenarion Emissary Blackhoof"}, [2]={text="Fly from Orgrimmar to Thunder Bluff. Pick up the courier's lead-in at the base, then find the Arch Druid on Elder Rise."}, [3]={npc="Bluff Runner Windstrider", tgt="Bluff Runner Windstrider", desc="Horde breadcrumb to Nighthaven. Go straight to Hamuul if you've done The New Frontier or The New Frontier."}, [4]={hint="Speak with Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem on the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff about the Cenarion Circle's call to explore the frontiers of Kalimdor.", desc="Horde breadcrumb to Nighthaven. Go straight to Hamuul if you've done The New Frontier or The New Frontier."}, [5]={npc="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem", tgt="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem", desc="Horde breadcrumb to Nighthaven. Go straight to Hamuul if you've done The New Frontier or The New Frontier."}, [6]={npc="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem", tgt="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem"}, [7]={text="Fly to Bloodvenom Post. Go north through Deadwood Village to the cauldron (60.20, 5.84), then take the Timbermaw Hold fork to Moonglade."}, [8]={hint="Search the Deadwood furbolg camp in northern Felwood for a clue."}, [9]={npc="Deadwood Cauldron", npcObj=true}, [10]={npc="Deadwood Cauldron", npcObj=true}, [11]={hint="Speak with Rabine Saturna in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade. Moonglade lies between Felwood and Winterspring, accessible through a path out of Timbermaw Hold."}, [12]={npc="Rabine Saturna", tgt="Rabine Saturna"}, [13]={npc="Rabine Saturna", tgt="Rabine Saturna"}, [14]={npc="Rabine Saturna", tgt="Rabine Saturna"}, [15]={node="Moonglade", desc="Go to the southwest of Moonglade and open the tribal flight path towards Faustron."}, [16]={hint="Travel to Blackmaw Hold in Kalimdor, and recover the Reliquary of Tyr.", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="Lv 55-60. Enter through the north Azshara cave. Save the relic for Tirisfal."}, [17]={text="Cross Timbermaw Hold again to reach Winterspring."}}},
    ["04-53"] = {name="Winterspring", tips={{k="交通", text="The first step is to stop at the hot spring after coming out of Timbermaw Hold. The last step is to choose a route depending on whether you want to go around Feralas or Frayfeather Highlands."}, {k="取捨", text="Don't pay it yet | Meet at the Grave is solved in Tanaris Gadgetzan. Toxic Horrors Go to Felwood Irontree Woods to brush items and return to Winterspring Frostfire Hot Springs to hand in."}, {k="取捨", text="Do | Are We There, Yeti? will run three pictures along the same route. After receiving it, use it once in Everlook."}, {k="提醒", text="If you are still short of level 57, first fight the ordinary snowman at Ice Thistle Hills (about 66, 43), or fight the hippogryph at Feralas Frayfeather Highlands.", s={{"If you are still short of level 57, first fight the ordinary snowman at Ice Thistle Hills (about 66, 43), or fight the hippogryph at Feralas Frayfeather Highlands"}}}}, danger={[1]="The cave in Ice Thistle Hill is narrow, and level 57-58 snowmen will pull around corners. If you lack experience, drill the outside of the hole first."}, grind={[1]={mob="Ice Thistle Matriarch", note="Ice Thistle Hills The ordinary snowman at the entrance of the cave will also lose the corners required for the quest. If there are many people, hit the outer slope, but pay attention to the continuous pull inside the cave."}, [2]={mob="Ice Thistle Patriarch", note="For high-level ordinary snowmen in the same area, it is more appropriate to grind XP to 57. Teammates clear the narrow path first to avoid two enemies entering into battle at the same time."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Yugrek"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Vizzie"}, [3]={npc="Nixxrak"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Vizzie"}, [5]={npc="Wixxrak"}}, steps={[1]={text="Head east from Timbermaw Hold. Visit Donova at Frostfire Hot Springs before entering Everlook."}, [2]={hint="Report back to Donova Snowden with your findings."}, [3]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden"}, [4]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden"}, [5]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden"}, [6]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden"}, [7]={npc="Umi Rumplesnicker", tgt="Umi Rumplesnicker"}, [8]={hint="Collect 2 Pristine Yeti Horns for Umi Rumplesnicker in Everlook.", desc="Only the cave's adult matriarchs and patriarchs drop it. Skip the lower-level yetis."}, [9]={npc="Umi Rumplesnicker", tgt="Umi Rumplesnicker"}, [10]={npc="Umi Rumplesnicker", tgt="Umi Rumplesnicker", desc="Use the Mechanical Yeti on Legacki in Everlook (61.54, 38.61), then on two in Un'Goro."}, [11]={text="Fly to Camp Mojache only for the optional egg or a ready Dire Maul group. Otherwise fly straight from Everlook to Gadgetzan."}}},
    ["04-54"] = {name="Feralas", tips={{k="交通", text="The first step is the stopping point for heading south to get the eggs, and the second step is flying Gadgetzan."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional|The Super Egg-O-Matic is a one-time delivery. If you have already done it or reached level 57 and want to save running maps, fly directly to Gadgetzan."}, {k="提醒", text="If you have not reached level 57, fight ordinary hippogryphs at Frayfeather Highlands (approximately 57, 76), or fight Ice Thistle Yeti at Winterspring Everlook and then take the plane directly.", s={{"If you have not reached level 57, fight ordinary hippogryphs at Frayfeather Highlands (approximately 57, 76), or fight Ice Thistle Yeti at Winterspring Everlook and then take the plane directly"}}}}, grind={[1]={mob="Ice Thistle Matriarch", note="Feralas The short interview only has the hippogryph egg branch. If you are missing level 57, make up for it before leaving Everlook at the previous station. Ice Thistle Hills is a snowman with a higher level; there may be people grabbing it at the entrance of the cave."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Shyn"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Greul"}, [3]={npc="Cawind Trueaim"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Greul"}, [5]={npc="Cawind Trueaim"}, [6]={npc="Tarhus"}}, steps={[1]={text="Take the south road from Camp Mojache to the Frayfeather Highlands. Loot one Hippogryph Egg (55.91, 76.03 or 58.62, 75.53), then return to the flight master.", tag="Optional"}, [2]={text="If you collected an egg, return to Camp Mojache and fly to Gadgetzan. If you skipped Feralas, start the Marshal's Refuge leg from Gadgetzan."}}},
    ["05-d30"] = {name="Dire Maul: North", entrance="Feralas 62.50, 24.90 (North District Portal)", pickup="At Feralas Camp Mojache, form a team and head west; Feralas Camp Mojache can prepare materials first. Most of the common quests in the North District are in this book. Get Crescent Key in the East District first, or go with teammates who have the key. To submit a professional certificate, first prepare the certificate from the auction house.", pickupS={{"At Feralas Camp Mojache, form a team and head west"}, {"Feralas Camp Mojache can prepare materials first"}, {"Most of the common quests in the North District are in this book"}, {"Get Crescent Key in the East District first, or go with teammates who have the key"}, {"To submit a professional certificate, first prepare the certificate from the auction house"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Full clear: Guard Mol'dar → Stomper Kreeg → Guard Fengus → trap by Knot → Captain Kromcrush → King Gordok. Tribute: leave guards alive, find Knot and fix the trap, then see Kreeg after killing the king. The courtyard side door leads to the Library for class books."}, {k="取捨", text="When leveling up, give priority to the team that can complete it in one trip; if you are deliberately waiting for materials just for tribute, do the main story first."}, {k="說明", text="Try to keep the guards and Craig as a tribute, and talk to them after defeating King Gordok. If you only want to play normal and clear, please make it clear to your team first.", s={{"Try to keep the guards and Craig as a tribute, and talk to them after defeating King Gordok"}, {"If you only want to play normal and clear, please make it clear to your team first"}}}, {k="提醒", text="Try to keep the guards and Craig as a tribute, and talk to them after defeating King Gordok. If you only want to play normal and clear, please make it clear to your team first.", s={{"Try to keep the guards and Craig as a tribute, and talk to them after defeating King Gordok"}, {"If you only want to play normal and clear, please make it clear to your team first"}}}}, steps={[1]={text="Dire Maul: North entrance"}, [2]={npc="Knot Thimblejack", tgt="Knot Thimblejack", tag="Unverified", desc="Bring 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 8 Rugged Leather and 2 Rune Thread. Loot 1 Ogre Tannin."}, [3]={hint="Bring 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 8 Rugged Leather, 2 Rune Threads, and Ogre Tannin to Knot Thimblejack. He is currently chained inside the Gordok wing of Dire Maul.", desc="Location: Loot tannin upstairs past Fengus. Find Knot by the trap."}, [4]={npc="Knot Thimblejack", tgt="Knot Thimblejack", tag="Unverified"}, [5]={npc="Knot Thimblejack", tgt="Knot Thimblejack", tag="Unverified", desc="Only do with a Gordok Shackle Key. Tribute runs skip guards that can drop it."}, [6]={hint="Loot from: Gordok Brute, Gordok Mage-Lord, Gordok Captain", desc="Location: Past Fengus's courtyard, use the key on Knot next to the broken trap."}, [7]={npc="Knot Thimblejack", tgt="Knot Thimblejack", tag="Unverified"}, [8]={npc="Stomper Kreeg", tgt="Stomper Kreeg", tag="Unverified", desc="Find Craig after completing the Tribute Route and obtaining King status. Map: Stomper Kreeg (60.90, 67.80). Talk to him after becoming king."}, [9]={hint="Complete the quest objectives.", desc="Map: Stomper Kreeg (60.90, 67.80). Talk to him after becoming king. Location: Become king, then backtrack to Stomper Kreeg near the entrance. Order: Talk back after the tribute runs away."}, [10]={npc="Stomper Kreeg", tgt="Stomper Kreeg", tag="Unverified", desc="After the tribute run, stay inside to turn in to Kreeg. Map: Stomper Kreeg (60.90, 67.80). Talk to him after becoming king."}, [11]={npc="Garona: A Study on Stealth and Treachery", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Loot the class book from bosses or book piles, or buy one. Use it before the Library."}, [12]={hint="Return the book to its rightful owners.", desc="Location: Enter the north courtyard. Take the locked side door and tunnel to the Library."}, [13]={npc="Lorekeeper Kildrath", tgt="Lorekeeper Kildrath", tag="Unverified"}, [14]={npc="Codex of Defense", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Loot the class book from bosses or book piles, or buy one. Use it before the Library."}, [15]={hint="Return the book to its rightful owners.", desc="Location: Enter the north courtyard. Take the locked side door and tunnel to the Library."}, [16]={npc="Lorekeeper Kildrath", tgt="Lorekeeper Kildrath", tag="Unverified"}, [17]={npc="The Arcanist's Cookbook", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Loot the class book from bosses or book piles, or buy one. Use it before the Library."}, [18]={hint="Return the book to its rightful owners.", desc="Location: Enter the north courtyard. Take the locked side door and tunnel to the Library."}, [19]={npc="Lorekeeper Kildrath", tgt="Lorekeeper Kildrath", tag="Unverified"}, [20]={npc="The Light and How to Swing It", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Loot the class book from bosses or book piles, or buy one. Use it before the Library."}, [21]={hint="Return the book to its rightful owners.", desc="Location: Enter the north courtyard. Take the locked side door and tunnel to the Library."}, [22]={npc="Lorekeeper Mykos", tgt="Lorekeeper Mykos", tag="Unverified"}, [23]={npc="Harnessing Shadows", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Loot the class book from bosses or book piles, or buy one. Use it before the Library."}, [24]={hint="Return the book to its rightful owners.", desc="Location: Enter the north courtyard. Take the locked side door and tunnel to the Library."}, [25]={npc="Lorekeeper Mykos", tgt="Lorekeeper Mykos", tag="Unverified"}, [26]={npc="The Greatest Race of Hunters", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Loot the class book from bosses or book piles, or buy one. Use it before the Library."}, [27]={hint="Return the book to its rightful owners.", desc="Location: Enter the north courtyard. Take the locked side door and tunnel to the Library."}, [28]={npc="Lorekeeper Mykos", tgt="Lorekeeper Mykos", tag="Unverified"}, [29]={npc="Holy Bologna: What the Light Won't Tell You", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Loot the class book from bosses or book piles, or buy one. Use it before the Library."}, [30]={hint="Return the book to its rightful owners.", desc="Location: Enter the north courtyard. Take the locked side door and tunnel to the Library."}, [31]={npc="Lorekeeper Javon", tgt="Lorekeeper Javon", tag="Unverified"}, [32]={npc="Frost Shock and You", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Loot the class book from bosses or book piles, or buy one. Use it before the Library."}, [33]={hint="Return the book to its rightful owners.", desc="Location: Enter the north courtyard. Take the locked side door and tunnel to the Library."}, [34]={npc="Lorekeeper Javon", tgt="Lorekeeper Javon", tag="Unverified"}, [35]={npc="The Emerald Dream", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified", desc="Loot the class book from bosses or book piles, or buy one. Use it before the Library."}, [36]={hint="Return the book to its rightful owners.", desc="Location: Enter the north courtyard. Take the locked side door and tunnel to the Library."}, [37]={npc="Lorekeeper Javon", tgt="Lorekeeper Javon", tag="Unverified"}}},
    ["05-d29"] = {name="Dire Maul: West", entrance="Feralas 60.30, 30.20 (courtyard west area portal)", pickup="Find Sage Korolusk at Feralas Camp Mojache; if you are level 54 or above, first pick up Elven Legends at Feralas Camp Mojache. After flying to Moshache, go west along the avenue. The team will confirm Crescent Key first; if no one has it, go to the east area first.", pickupS={{"Find Sage Korolusk at Feralas Camp Mojache; if you are level 54 or above, first pick up Elven Legends at Feralas Camp Mojache"}, {"After flying to Moshache, go west along the avenue"}, {"The team will confirm Crescent Key first; if no one has it, go to the east area first"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="West gate → clear the garden pylons → Tendris Warpwood → see the Ancient upstairs and clear the remaining pylons, with Kalendris and Illyanna optional → Immol'thar in the prison → Prince Tortheldrin in the Library. Turn in to the Ancient, then return to the Library for the chest and remains."}, {k="取捨", text="Completed Elven Legends, The Madness Within and The Treasure of the Shen'dralar in the same trip; exchanged materials for enchantments and multiple long-chain equipment trips."}, {k="說明", text="Five players. Pusillin in Dire Maul East drops the Crescent Key. Clear all five pylons before Immol'thar. See North for class books.", s={{"Five players"}, {"Pusillin in Dire Maul East drops the Crescent Key"}, {"Clear all five pylons before Immol'thar"}, {"See North for class books"}}}, {k="提醒", text="Five players. Pusillin in Dire Maul East drops the Crescent Key. Clear all five pylons before Immol'thar. See North for class books.", s={{"Five players"}, {"Pusillin in Dire Maul East drops the Crescent Key"}, {"Clear all five pylons before Immol'thar"}, {"See North for class books"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Sage Korolusk", tgt="Sage Korolusk", desc="Pick up in Camp Mojache. Reach the Library through West or the North shortcut."}, [2]={text="Dire Maul: West entrance"}, [3]={npc="Shen'dralar Ancient", tgt="Shen'dralar Ancient", tag="Unverified", desc="Talk to the Shen'dralar Ancient on the upper level of Dire Maul West first."}, [4]={hint="You must destroy the guardians surrounding the 5 Pylons that power the Prison of Immol'thar. Once the Pylons have powered down, the force field surrounding Immol'thar will have dissipated.", desc="Clear all five pylons first. Map: Immol'thar (35.00,57.60), Prince (62.20,22.70). Location: Clear five pylons, then go through the locked door to Immol'thar and the Prince. Order: Five Towers → Immol'thar → Library Prince."}, [5]={npc="Shen'dralar Ancient", tgt="Shen'dralar Ancient", tag="Unverified"}, [6]={npc="Shen'dralar Ancient", tgt="Shen'dralar Ancient", tag="Unverified", desc="After turning in to Guling, we picked up the bus, the same trip as The Madness Within.", preText="The Madness Within"}, [7]={hint="Return to the Athenaeum and find the Treasure of the Shen'dralar. Claim your reward!", desc="Location: Go from Immol'thar's cage to the Library. Check under the stairs for the chest."}, [8]={npc="Treasure of the Shen'dralar", npcObj=true, tag="Unverified"}, [9]={hint="Search Dire Maul for Telmius Dreamseeker. Report back to Sage Korolusk at Camp Mojache with whatever information that you may find.", desc="Location: Follow the hall from the cage to the Library. Look for remains by the shelves."}, [10]={npc="Sage Korolusk", tgt="Sage Korolusk"}}},
    ["05-d28"] = {name="Dire Maul: East", entrance="Feralas 64.80, 30.20 (portal in the recess of the east wall of the arena)", pickup="Azshara Valormok can receive Camp Mojache from Warcaller Gorlach after passing Orgrimmar and reaching level 54; after turning over Feralas Camp Mojache to receive tarot and receive Lethtendris's Web first, fly to Feralas Camp Mojache and then find Lariss Pavilion of Azj'Tordin. A Reliquary of Purity can be picked up from Moonglade, Silithus Cenarion Fortress Southwind Village pick up the box, Moonglade Nighthaven will have Shards of the Felvine after handing it over, leave it until later.", pickupS={{"Azshara Valormok can receive Camp Mojache from Warcaller Gorlach after passing Orgrimmar and reaching level 54; after turning over Feralas Camp Mojache to receive tarot and receive Lethtendris's Web first, fly to Feralas Camp Mojache and then find Lariss Pavilion of Azj'Tordin"}, {"A Reliquary of Purity can be picked up from Moonglade, Silithus Cenarion Fortress Southwind Village pick up the box, Moonglade Nighthaven will have Shards of the Felvine after handing it over, leave it until later"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Chase Pusillin from the entrance and fight him at the end → Lethtendris and Hydrospawn on the side paths → Zevrim Thornhoof at the satyr altar → Alzzin the Wildshaper. Enter the Library from West or North."}, {k="取捨", text="The East District takes Crescent Key first, and Tarot and Pusillin are the most successful. Shards of the Felvine There is no need to cross two pictures To get the box before it is solved."}, {k="說明", text="For teams of five, enter directly through the east gate. Don't just jump to the king and miss Pusillin. Keep the key to the west and north areas.", s={{"For teams of five, enter directly through the east gate"}, {"Don't just jump to the king and miss Pusillin"}, {"Keep the key to the west and north areas"}}}, {k="提醒", text="For teams of five, enter directly through the east gate. Don't just jump to the king and miss Pusillin. Keep the key to the west and north areas.", s={{"For teams of five, enter directly through the east gate"}, {"Don't just jump to the king and miss Pusillin"}, {"Keep the key to the west and north areas"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Warcaller Gorlach", tgt="Warcaller Gorlach", desc="For urban guidance, pick up Lethtendris's Web directly to Tarot."}, [2]={hint="Speak with Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache in Feralas."}, [3]={npc="Talo Thornhoof", tgt="Talo Thornhoof"}, [4]={npc="Talo Thornhoof", tgt="Talo Thornhoof", desc="Horde quest. The Camp Mojache lead-in is optional."}, [5]={npc="Azj'Tordin", tgt="Azj'Tordin", desc="Camp Mojache North Lariss Pavilion."}, [6]={npc="Rabine Saturna", tgt="Rabine Saturna", desc="This line already exists at stations 52, 56, and 59 of the main line and has been skipped."}, [7]={hint="Travel to Silithus and search for a Reliquary of Purity within the ruins of Southwind Village. If you are able to find it, return with it to Rabine Saturna in Nighthaven, Moonglade."}, [8]={npc="Rabine Saturna", tgt="Rabine Saturna"}, [9]={npc="Rabine Saturna", tgt="Rabine Saturna", desc="Bring the Reliquary of Purity. If A Reliquary of Purity isn't done, save this for the next run.", preText="A Reliquary of Purity"}, [10]={text="Dire Maul: East entrance"}, [11]={hint="Travel to Dire Maul and locate the Imp, Pusillin. Convince Pusillin to give you Azj'Tordin's Book of Incantations through any means necessary.", desc="Map: meet Pusillin at 74.40, 44.00. Talk to him at each stop to chase him. Location: Talk to Pusillin at the east entrance and chase him to the end. Order: The fight started after many conversations en route."}, [12]={hint="Bring Lethtendris's Web to Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache in Feralas.", desc="DungeonsForever Dungeon Map Reference Points 44.00, 47.40. Lethtendris. Location: Take the upper passage from the garden to Lethtendris's platform."}, [13]={hint="Find the Felvine in Dire Maul and acquire a shard from it. Chances are you'll only be able to procure one with the demise of Alzzin the Wildshaper. Use the Reliquary of Purity to securely seal the shard inside, and return it to Rabine Saturna in Nighthaven, Moonglade.", desc="Map: Alzzin (56.40, 28.10). The Felvine Shard is nearby. Location: Follow the last tunnel to Alzzin. Kill him, then loot and seal the shard."}, [14]={npc="Lorekeeper Lydros", tgt="Lorekeeper Lydros", tag="Unverified", desc="At 60, pick up from Lydros in the Library on the West or North run, then do East."}, [15]={hint="Travel to the Warpwood Quarter of Dire Maul and slay the water elemental, Hydrospawn. Return to Lorekeeper Lydros in the Athenaeum with the Hydrospawn Essence.", desc="DungeonsForever dungeon map reference points 5​​​6.50, 68.50. Hydrospawn. Location: Take the lower waterway in Dire Maul East. Kill Hydrospawn by the pool."}, [16]={npc="Azj'Tordin", tgt="Azj'Tordin"}, [17]={npc="Talo Thornhoof", tgt="Talo Thornhoof"}, [18]={npc="Rabine Saturna", tgt="Rabine Saturna"}, [19]={npc="Lorekeeper Lydros", tgt="Lorekeeper Lydros", tag="Unverified", desc="Return to the Library and turn in to learn the highest rank of Conjure Water."}}},
    ["04-55"] = {name="Un'Goro Crater", tips={{k="交通", text="Steps 1 and 11 pass through Gadgetzan, use mechanical snowmen en route, and take the northwest slope to Silithus for the final step."}, {k="取捨", text="Don't pay it yet | The New Springs should be paid to Winterspring Frostfire Hot Springs, Are We There, Yeti? should be paid to Everlook; Linken's Memory should be reserved for Felwood Irontree Woods."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional|The Super Egg-O-Matic Only set out when you have picked up the eggs and can still hand them in; if you haven't picked up the eggs, you don't have to turn back."}, {k="提醒", text="Both are in the 57-59 band. To make up for the progress, fight Fire Plume Ridge normal element or the northern orangutan, and pay attention to the Devilsaur patrolling the plains.", s={{"Both are in the 57-59 band"}, {"To make up for the progress, fight Fire Plume Ridge normal element or the northern orangutan, and pay attention to the Devilsaur patrolling the plains"}}}}, danger={[1]="Fire Plume Ridge There is a level 54-56 Elite Devilsaur in the southern plain. Observe the route before escorting Ringe, and avoid the plains by walking on the mountainside."}, grind={[1]={mob="Living Blaze", note="The common element of Fire Plume Ridge has a higher level and can be used for volcano quests. Pull along the mountainside and don't enter the plains where Devilsaur patrols."}, [2]={mob="Tar Lord", note="Marshal's Refuge fight a few rounds of nearby tar monsters from the camp when they are almost upgraded. Single pull along the edge of the pool."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Gryfe"}, [2]={npc="Gibbert"}, [3]={npc="Nergal"}, [4]={npc="Nergal"}, [5]={npc="Innkeeper Fizzgrimble"}}, steps={[1]={text="Finish the graveyard steps in Gadgetzan first. Stay in town until you've used the Mechanical Yeti if you're on that quest."}, [2]={npc="Egg-O-Matic", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Use Feralas Frayfeather Highlands to pick up 1 egg; skip it if you have already done it."}, [3]={hint="Use/collect: Hippogryph Egg", tag="Optional"}, [4]={npc="Egg-O-Matic", npcObj=true, tag="Optional"}, [5]={hint="Go to the graveyard outside Gadgetzan, and use the Videre Elixir. Follow the rest of Donova's instructions to find Gaeriyan.", desc="Drinking it kills you. Talk while dead, then resurrect at the graveyard."}, [6]={npc="Gaeriyan", tgt="Gaeriyan"}, [7]={npc="Gaeriyan", tgt="Gaeriyan"}, [8]={hint="Resurrect, then look for the gravestone that Gaeriyan told you to find."}, [9]={npc="A Conspicuous Gravestone", npcObj=true}, [10]={npc="A Conspicuous Gravestone", npcObj=true}, [11]={text="Use the Mechanical Yeti on Sprinkle in Gadgetzan (51.06, 26.87), then take the south road into Un'Goro."}, [12]={npc="Torwa Pathfinder", tgt="Torwa Pathfinder"}, [13]={hint="Discover the location of the Eastern Crystal Pylon in Un'Goro Crater."}, [14]={hint="Using the contents of Torwa's Pouch, summon Lar'korwi and defeat him. Then bring Lar'korwi's Head to Torwa Pathfinder near the entrance to Un'Goro Crater.", desc="Open Torva's sack, put the meat pieces first, and then use pheromones to elicit Lar'korwi."}, [15]={hint="Bring 2 Un'Goro Gorilla Pelts, 2 Un'Goro Stomper Pelts, and 2 Un'Goro Thunderer Pelts to Torwa Pathfinder at the entrance of Un'Goro Crater.", tag="Target: Un'Goro Gorilla / Un'Goro Gorilla / Un'Goro Stomper / Un'Goro Thunderer"}, [16]={hint="Discover the location of the Northern Crystal Pylon in Un'Goro Crater."}, [17]={hint="Deliver Linken's Superior Sword to Linken in Un'Goro Crater."}, [18]={npc="Linken", tgt="Linken"}, [19]={npc="Linken", tgt="Linken"}, [20]={hint="Find J.D. Collie in the cave at Marshal's Refuge."}, [21]={npc="J.D. Collie", tgt="J.D. Collie"}, [22]={npc="J.D. Collie", tgt="J.D. Collie"}, [23]={npc="Spraggle Frock", tgt="Spraggle Frock"}, [24]={hint="Take Umi's Mechanical Yeti and scare her friends with it:", desc="Use the yeti on Quixxil here after the first two targets. Turn in at Frostwhisper Gorge."}, [25]={hint="Discover the location of the Western Crystal Pylon."}, [26]={npc="Krakle", tgt="Krakle"}, [27]={hint="Krakle in Un'Goro Crater wants you to find the hottest area of Fire Plume Ridge.", desc="It's completed when you have a reaction, no need to jump into the lava."}, [28]={hint="Find Ringo at Fire Plume Ridge."}, [29]={npc="Ringo", tgt="Ringo"}, [30]={npc="Ringo", tgt="Ringo", desc="Clear the cave entrance before escorting. Wake Ringo with Spraggle's Canteen."}, [31]={hint="Lead Ringo to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge."}, [32]={npc="Spraggle Frock", tgt="Spraggle Frock"}, [33]={npc="J.D. Collie", tgt="J.D. Collie"}, [34]={npc="J.D. Collie", tgt="J.D. Collie"}, [35]={npc="J.D. Collie", tgt="J.D. Collie"}, [36]={npc="J.D. Collie", tgt="J.D. Collie"}, [37]={hint="Speak with J.D. Collie in a moment."}, [38]={npc="J.D. Collie", tgt="J.D. Collie"}, [39]={npc="Krakle", tgt="Krakle"}, [40]={npc="Krakle", tgt="Krakle"}, [41]={npc="Torwa Pathfinder", tgt="Torwa Pathfinder"}, [42]={npc="Torwa Pathfinder", tgt="Torwa Pathfinder"}, [43]={npc="Torwa Pathfinder", tgt="Torwa Pathfinder"}, [44]={hint="Bring U'cha's Pelt to Torwa Pathfinder at the entrance of Un'Goro Crater.", desc="Clear the gorillas at the cave entrance. U'cha is a normal mob."}, [45]={npc="Torwa Pathfinder", tgt="Torwa Pathfinder"}, [46]={npc="Torwa Pathfinder", tgt="Torwa Pathfinder", tag="Optional", desc="Turn in Torva when you take the southeast entrance; choose leather armor or a staff.", star={"Grizzled Pelt", {"DRUID"}}}, [47]={text="Use Un'Goro's northwest ramp into Silithus. Follow the road to Cenarion Hold."}}},
    ["05-d31"] = {name="The Shaper's Terrace", entrance="Un'Goro Crater 48.10, 6.10 (Titan building outdoor sign; the exact point of the copy portal?)", pickup="En route to Moonglade, when passing through Thunder Bluff, first go to the northwest of Mulgore to find Mayena Earthseeker. After returning to Un'Goro Crater Marshal's Refuge, go up the stone steps on the north side to find the Titan Building; the recipients of the two pieces other than Crystalline Elements are still to be confirmed.", pickupS={{"En route to Moonglade, when passing through Thunder Bluff, first go to the northwest of Mulgore to find Mayena Earthseeker"}, {"After returning to Un'Goro Crater Marshal's Refuge, go up the stone steps on the north side to find the Titan Building; the recipients of the two pieces other than Crystalline Elements are still to be confirmed"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Entrance → collect four crystal colors through the titan ruins → handle the pool objectives by the Colorless Crystal. The full order for the titan dragon, Bolt, Vitrix and Nanaya remains unconfirmed."}, {k="取捨", text="First pick up Crystalline Elements who has verified the NPC. If there are no other quests to take in the camp, just join the team directly."}, {k="說明", text="A new five-player dungeon has been added to the WoW Forever. Go uphill from the north side of Marshal's Refuge, and use Crystals of Power collected by Un'Goro in front of the Titan Gate. Un'Goro is about 48.10 and 6.10. It is the outer entrance sign of the Titan building. The exact point of the dungeon portal is?.", s={{"A new five-player dungeon has been added to the WoW Forever"}, {"Go uphill from the north side of Marshal's Refuge, and use Crystals of Power collected by Un'Goro in front of the Titan Gate"}, {"Un'Goro is about 48.10 and 6.10"}, {"It is the outer entrance sign of the Titan building"}, {"The exact point of the dungeon portal is?"}}}, {k="提醒", text="A new five-player dungeon has been added to the WoW Forever. Go uphill from the north side of Marshal's Refuge, and use Crystals of Power collected by Un'Goro in front of the Titan Gate. Un'Goro is about 48.10 and 6.10. It is the outer entrance sign of the Titan building. The exact point of the dungeon portal is?.", s={{"A new five-player dungeon has been added to the WoW Forever"}, {"Go uphill from the north side of Marshal's Refuge, and use Crystals of Power collected by Un'Goro in front of the Titan Gate"}, {"Un'Goro is about 48.10 and 6.10"}, {"It is the outer entrance sign of the Titan building"}, {"The exact point of the dungeon portal is?"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Mayena Earthseeker", tgt="Mayena Earthseeker", desc="Pick up on the western bluff in Thunder Bluff. NPCs are from player records."}, [2]={npc="Chemist Fuely", tgt="Chemist Fuely", tag="Unverified", desc="Pickup NPC and coordinates are unconfirmed. Check the quest prompts outside."}, [3]={npc="Master Apothecary Faranell", tgt="Master Apothecary Faranell", tag="Unverified", desc="Receive NPC and coordinates?."}, [4]={text="The Shaper's Terrace entrance"}, [5]={hint="Bring Mayena Earthseeker a Moist Crystal, a Charged Crystal, a Noxious Crystal and a Fiery Crystal from Shaper's Terrace.", tag="Unverified", desc="Location: Follow the titan ruins and loot all four crystal colors from elementals."}, [6]={hint="Gather 8 Seeping Slime Essence in the Shaper's Terrace.", tag="Unverified", desc="Location: Find Seeping Slimes inside. Their exact pool location is unconfirmed."}, [7]={hint="Gather a colorless Drained Crystal Fragment near the Achromatic Crystal in the Shaper's Terrace.", desc="Location: Look on the ground around the Colorless Crystal for a depleted fragment."}, [8]={npc="Mayena Earthseeker"}, [9]={npc="Chemist Fuely", tgt="Chemist Fuely", tag="Unverified"}, [10]={tag="Unverified"}}},
    ["04-56"] = {name="Silithus", tips={{k="交通", text="The first step is to drive to the Cenarion Fortress flight path, and the last step is to transfer the zeppelin back to Eastern Kingdoms."}, {k="取捨", text="Don't turn it in yet | A Reliquary of Purity and Umber, Archivist, save them for Moonglade."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional|Noggle's Lost Satchel run from the fortress to the southernmost point of the map again; Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the Sands kill elites, so skip the training route."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional|The Darkwing Bat Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee... mentioned in the video is in the Eastern Plague; Silithus This site also skips the team elite."}, {k="提醒", text="If you are under level 59, still go to Western Plaguelands The Bulwark first; if you want to supplement, stay in the northeast of the fortress (about 55, 29) and fight ordinary scorpions, spiders or southwest Twilight Cultists (about 38, 44).", s={{"If you are under level 59, still go to Western Plaguelands The Bulwark first; if you want to supplement, stay in the northeast of the fortress (about 55, 29) and fight ordinary scorpions, spiders or southwest Twilight Cultists (about 38, 44)"}}}}, danger={[1]="Southwind Village The top of the tower will trigger a swarm of silithid scorpions. Clear the tower and stairs first, leaving the escape route until after the trigger."}, grind={[1]={mob="Twilight Avenger", note="Twilight Base Camp is an ordinary cultist on the outside, with the right level and the twilight equipment, so he can complete the cultist quest. You will encounter players who want to collect them, so clear them from the edge of the camp."}, [2]={mob="Dredge Striker", note="The normal mobs in the open space in the northeast of the fortress have a slightly lower level but good density, and they go the same way as collecting quest materials. If there are many people, Twilight Base Camp can be replaced."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Runk Windtamer"}, [2]={npc="Calandrath"}, [3]={npc="Vargus"}, [4]={npc="Calandrath"}, [5]={npc="Calandrath"}, [6]={npc="Khur Hornstriker"}}, steps={[1]={node="Cenarion Hold", desc="After arriving at Cenarion Hold, open the Horde flight path towards Runk Windtamer."}, [2]={text="Set your hearth at the inn (51.89, 39.16) if you want to use it after Valor's Rest."}, [3]={hint="Talk to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus."}, [4]={npc="Windcaller Proudhorn", tgt="Windcaller Proudhorn"}, [5]={npc="Beetix Ficklespragg", tgt="Beetix Ficklespragg"}, [6]={npc="Windcaller Proudhorn", tgt="Windcaller Proudhorn"}, [7]={npc="Geologist Larksbane", tgt="Geologist Larksbane"}, [8]={npc="Bor Wildmane", tgt="Bor Wildmane"}, [9]={hint="Beetix Ficklespragg at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to gather 8 Stonelash Scorpid Stingers and 8 Sand Skitterer Fangs. Return to her when you have completed the task."}, [10]={hint="Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to kill 15 Dredge Strikers."}, [11]={hint="Speak with Layo Starstrike near the Valor's Rest graveyard of Silithus, showing him Rabine's Letter."}, [12]={npc="Layo Starstrike", tgt="Layo Starstrike"}, [13]={npc="Layo Starstrike", tgt="Layo Starstrike"}, [14]={hint="Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to collect 8 Twilight Tablet Fragments."}, [15]={hint="Bring 10 Encrypted Twilight Texts to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold."}, [16]={npc="Beetix Ficklespragg", tgt="Beetix Ficklespragg"}, [17]={npc="Windcaller Proudhorn", tgt="Windcaller Proudhorn"}, [18]={npc="Geologist Larksbane", tgt="Geologist Larksbane"}, [19]={npc="Bor Wildmane", tgt="Bor Wildmane"}, [20]={npc="Beetix Ficklespragg", tgt="Beetix Ficklespragg"}, [21]={npc="Windcaller Proudhorn", tgt="Windcaller Proudhorn"}, [22]={npc="Geologist Larksbane", tgt="Geologist Larksbane"}, [23]={hint="Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to slay 20 Dredge Crushers."}, [24]={hint="Beetix Ficklespragg at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to gather 3 Stonelash Pincer Stingers, 3 Stonelash Flayer Stingers and 3 Rock Stalker Fangs."}, [25]={hint="Take the restored tablet to Hermit Ortell in Silithus."}, [26]={npc="Hermit Ortell", tgt="Hermit Ortell"}, [27]={hint="Travel to Silithus and search for a Reliquary of Purity within the ruins of Southwind Village. If you are able to find it, return with it to Rabine Saturna in Nighthaven, Moonglade."}, [28]={hint="Free the spirits of 8 Tortured Druids and 8 Tortured Sentinels in Southwind Village, and then return to Layo Starstrike at the Valor's Rest graveyard of Silithus.", desc="Undead can spawn a silithid when killed. Kill it before the next pull."}, [29]={npc="Layo Starstrike", tgt="Layo Starstrike"}, [30]={npc="Layo Starstrike", tgt="Layo Starstrike"}, [31]={hint="Scale the tower of Southwind Village and locate a means to stir the silithid hive into activity. Bring back anything unusual you may uncover when doing so to Layo Starstrike at the Valor's Rest graveyard of Silithus.", desc="Clear the tower stairs before opening the object. Watch your line of sight."}, [32]={npc="Layo Starstrike", tgt="Layo Starstrike"}, [33]={npc="Layo Starstrike", tgt="Layo Starstrike"}, [34]={text="Return to Cenarion Hold. Hearth if bound here."}, [35]={npc="Beetix Ficklespragg", tgt="Beetix Ficklespragg"}, [36]={npc="Windcaller Proudhorn", tgt="Windcaller Proudhorn"}, [37]={text="Fly from Cenarion Hold to Orgrimmar, then take the Tirisfal zeppelin from Durotar."}}},
    ["04-57"] = {name="Western Plaguelands", tips={{k="交通", text="The first step is to The Bulwark, and the last step is to take the zeppelin from Undercity."}, {k="取捨", text="Do |Firestone and Andorhal are done together, and the final part of the termite return journey happens to be done together."}, {k="取捨", text="Drop by later | Chromie The rest of the chain will have to go to the Eastern Plague; I will make a special trip back to pick it up."}, {k="提醒", text="If you have not reached level 59, fight ordinary undead in the eastern outskirts of Andorhal (about 46, 64) or plague Farm, and then transfer to Felwood.", s={{"If you have not reached level 59, fight ordinary undead in the eastern outskirts of Andorhal (about 46, 64) or plague Farm, and then transfer to Felwood"}}}}, danger={[1]="Andorhal City Hall is located near the level 61 elite \"Summoner\" Araki. When looking for The Annals of Darrowshire, go around the outer wall."}, grind={[1]={mob="Searing Ghoul", note="The ordinary undead on the eastern edge of Andorhal can be beaten continuously before returning to Farm. Please avoid the elites and monster houses in the city."}, [2]={mob="Haunting Vision", note="Gahrron's Withering ordinary wraiths, if they are still in the east, replenish them nearby, the level is higher. Surround it from the outside of Farm to avoid pulling inside the house."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Argent Quartermaster Hasana"}, [2]={npc="Michael Garrett"}, [3]={npc="Innkeeper Norman"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Norman"}, [5]={npc="Eleanor Rusk"}, [6]={npc="Thomas Mordan"}, [7]={npc="Ezekiel Graves"}}, steps={[1]={text="Go from the Tirisfal zeppelin tower to the Bulwark, then through Felstone Field, Andorhal and Northridge Lumber Camp."}, [2]={hint="Bring the Filled Gahrron's Withering Bottle to Shadow Priestess Vandis at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."}, [3]={npc="Shadow Priestess Vandis", tgt="Shadow Priestess Vandis"}, [4]={npc="Mickey Levine", tgt="Mickey Levine"}, [5]={npc="High Executor Derrington", tgt="High Executor Derrington", star={"Valiant Shortsword", {"PALADIN", "MAGE", "WARLOCK"}}}, [6]={hint="Complete the quest objectives."}, [7]={npc="High Executor Derrington", tgt="High Executor Derrington", star={"Valiant Shortsword", {"PALADIN", "MAGE", "WARLOCK"}}}, [8]={npc="Mickey Levine", tgt="Mickey Levine"}, [9]={hint="Return to Janice Felstone in Western Plaguelands her Good Luck Half-Charm."}, [10]={npc="Janice Felstone", tgt="Janice Felstone"}, [11]={npc="Janice Felstone", tgt="Janice Felstone"}, [12]={hint="Locate the other half of the Good Luck Charm somewhere on the Felstone Farm in Western Plaguelands and reassemble it.", desc="The ghoul moves at Farm, first look for the south side of Farm."}, [13]={npc="Janice Felstone", tgt="Janice Felstone"}, [14]={hint="Speak with Marlene, south of the Ruins of Andorhal."}, [15]={npc="Marlene Redpath", tgt="Marlene Redpath"}, [16]={npc="Marlene Redpath", tgt="Marlene Redpath"}, [17]={hint="Bring Joseph's Wedding Ring to Chromie.", desc="There are elite lichs in the center of Andorhal. Go outside to the inn."}, [18]={npc="Chromie", tgt="Chromie"}, [19]={npc="Chromie", tgt="Chromie"}, [20]={npc="Chromie", tgt="Chromie"}, [21]={hint="Bring the Annals of Darrowshire to Chromie in Andorhal.", desc="Fake books may attract enemies; look at the cover and avoid inner-city elites."}, [22]={hint="Use the Temporal Displacer near one of Andorhal's silos and uncover Temporal Parasites."}, [23]={npc="Chromie", tgt="Chromie"}, [24]={npc="Chromie", tgt="Chromie"}, [25]={npc="Chromie", tgt="Chromie"}, [26]={hint="Locate 5 Andorhal Watches, found in lockboxes amongst the rubble of the city. Return with them to Chromie in the Andorhal Inn, Western Plaguelands."}, [27]={npc="Chromie", tgt="Chromie"}, [28]={hint="Find someplace suitable in the center of the Northridge Lumber Mill in Western Plaguelands to place the Barrel of Plagueland Termites."}, [29]={npc="Termite Barrel", npcObj=true}, [30]={npc="Termite Barrel", npcObj=true}, [31]={hint="Release the Plagueland Termites in the Northridge Lumber Mill, then return with the Barrel of Plagueland Termites to Mickey Levine at the Bulwark in Tirisfal Glades.", desc="The barrel will attract enemies, so evacuate after opening it."}, [32]={npc="Mickey Levine", tgt="Mickey Levine"}, [33]={npc="Knight of Mourning", tag="Optional, Unverified", desc="See the Knight of Mourning in southwest Tirisfal. Sword of Mourning is a reward choice.", star={"Sword of Mourning", {"PALADIN"}}}, [34]={text="Return to the Undercity zeppelin tower. Take the Orgrimmar zeppelin and continue to Felwood."}}},
    ["05-d32"] = {name="Scholomance", entrance="Western Plaguelands Threat From the Sea about 68.90, 72.80 (Caer Darrow underground entrance)", pickup="In Western Plaguelands The Bulwark, first connect Alex Barov Family Fortune and the front part of the key; Light's Hope Chapel connect Plagued Hatchlings. From The Bulwark, follow the south road to Caer Darrow Island, look for Ava first and then enter the door. If you want to make the key yourself, go to The Bulwark to Skeletal Fragments and then connect the mold, go to Tanaris Gadgetzan and Un'Goro Crater Fire Plume Ridge, and finally return to The Bulwark to complete.", pickupS={{"In Western Plaguelands The Bulwark, first connect Alex Barov Family Fortune and the front part of the key"}, {"Light's Hope Chapel connect Plagued Hatchlings"}, {"From The Bulwark, follow the south road to Caer Darrow Island, look for Ava first and then enter the door"}, {"If you want to make the key yourself, go to The Bulwark to Skeletal Fragments and then connect the mold, go to Tanaris Gadgetzan and Un'Goro Crater Fire Plume Ridge, and finally return to The Bulwark to complete"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Entrance bridge → deed in the first hall → another past the summoning chamber → ossuary for Rattlegore and hatchlings → deed in Ras Frostwhisper's room → final deed and Krastinov downstairs → Darkmaster Gandling."}, {k="取捨", text="Four land deeds, Plagued Hatchling and the professor's trip together will bring high returns. As long as someone in the team can open the key, others can save the entire chain of materials."}, {k="說明", text="Five players. Have the keyholder open the outer gate. Quests Krastinov's Bag of Horrors and Kirtonos the Herald after Krastinov require return runs; save them for a group that can stay.", s={{"Five players"}, {"Have the keyholder open the outer gate"}, {"Quests Krastinov's Bag of Horrors and Kirtonos the Herald after Krastinov require return runs; save them for a group that can stay"}}}, {k="提醒", text="Five players. Have the keyholder open the outer gate. Quests Krastinov's Bag of Horrors and Kirtonos the Herald after Krastinov require return runs; save them for a group that can stay.", s={{"Five players"}, {"Have the keyholder open the outer gate"}, {"Quests Krastinov's Bag of Horrors and Kirtonos the Herald after Krastinov require return runs; save them for a group that can stay"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Alexi Barov", tgt="Alexi Barov", desc="The Bulwark, pick it up in advance if you reach level 52."}, [2]={npc="Betina Bigglezink", tgt="Betina Bigglezink", desc="Find Bettina at Light's Hope Chapel."}, [3]={npc="Eva Sarkhoff", tgt="Eva Sarkhoff", desc="Caer Darrow Ava in front of the door."}, [4]={npc="High Executor Derrington", tgt="High Executor Derrington", desc="Only do if you need your own Scholomance key. Skip if done at the Bulwark."}, [5]={hint="Proceed to the Scarlet Crusade's base camp between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears and destroy their command tent."}, [6]={npc="High Executor Derrington", tgt="High Executor Derrington"}, [7]={npc="High Executor Derrington", tgt="High Executor Derrington", desc="Main line Western Plaguelands The Bulwark has been scheduled.", preText="Scarlet Diversions"}, [8]={hint="Using the Beacon Torch, mark each tower in Andorhal; you will need to stand in the doorway of the tower to successfully mark it."}, [9]={npc="High Executor Derrington", tgt="High Executor Derrington"}, [10]={npc="High Executor Derrington", tgt="High Executor Derrington", desc="Western Plaguelands The Bulwark can be handed in first.", preText="All Along the Watchtowers"}, [11]={hint="Speak with Apothecary Dithers at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."}, [12]={npc="Apothecary Dithers", tgt="Apothecary Dithers"}, [13]={npc="Apothecary Dithers", tgt="Apothecary Dithers", desc="Skip these three if done at the Bulwark. Take the mould if making your own key.", preText="Scholomance"}, [14]={hint="Bring 15 Skeletal Fragments to Apothecary Dithers at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."}, [15]={npc="Apothecary Dithers", tgt="Apothecary Dithers"}, [16]={npc="Apothecary Dithers", tgt="Apothecary Dithers", desc="Bring two Thorium Bars before leaving Gadgetzan for Marshal's Refuge.", preText="Skeletal Fragments"}, [17]={hint="Bring the Imbued Skeletal Fragments and 15 gold coins to Krinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan."}, [18]={npc="Krinkle Goodsteel", tgt="Krinkle Goodsteel"}, [19]={npc="Krinkle Goodsteel", tgt="Krinkle Goodsteel", desc="Un'Goro Crater Marshal's Refuge can be completed in one trip with Fire Plume Ridge quests.", preText="Mold Rhymes With..."}, [20]={hint="Take the Skeleton Key Mold and 2 Thorium Bars to the top of Fire Plume Ridge in Un'Goro Crater. Use the Skeleton Key Mold by the lava lake to forge the Unfinished Skeleton Key."}, [21]={npc="Apothecary Dithers", tgt="Apothecary Dithers"}, [22]={npc="Apothecary Dithers", tgt="Apothecary Dithers", desc="Western Plaguelands The Bulwark Only play when you have a team when doing Andorhal.", preText="Fire Plume Forged"}, [23]={hint="Destroy Araj the Summoner and bring Araj's Scarab to Apothecary Dithers at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."}, [24]={npc="Apothecary Dithers", tgt="Apothecary Dithers"}, [25]={npc="High Executor Derrington", tgt="High Executor Derrington", preText="Araj's Scarab"}, [26]={hint="Complete the quest objectives."}, [27]={npc="High Executor Derrington", tgt="High Executor Derrington"}, [28]={text="Scholomance entrance"}, [29]={hint="Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Alexi Barov when you have completed this task.", desc="Location: Search the first hall, past the summoning room, then Ras's and Barov's rooms. Order: Southshore → Tarren Mill → Brill → Caer Darrow."}, [30]={hint="Kill 20 Plagued Hatchlings, then return to Betina Bigglezink at the Light's Hope Chapel.", desc="Location: Pass the summoning room and kill hatchlings in Rattlegore's ossuary."}, [31]={hint="Find Doctor Theolen Krastinov inside the Scholomance. Destroy him, then burn the Remains of Eva Sarkhoff and the Remains of Lucien Sarkhoff. Return to Eva Sarkhoff when the task is complete.", desc="Map: Krastinov (88.80, 45.50). Eva's and Lucien's remains are in the room. Location: Find Krastinov in the last six rooms. Burn both sets of remains in his room. Order: Remains in the same room."}, [32]={npc="Eva Sarkhoff", tgt="Eva Sarkhoff", desc="Take The Bag of Horrors from Eva for next time. On a first run, just turn in."}, [33]={npc="Alexi Barov", tgt="Alexi Barov"}, [34]={npc="Betina Bigglezink", tgt="Betina Bigglezink"}}},
    ["04-58"] = {name="Felwood", tips={{k="交通", text="The first step is from Ashenvale to the north, and the last step is from Timbermaw Hold to Moonglade."}, {k="取捨", text="Skipable | A Final Blow go through Shadow Hold again for the three deep targets. If you don't go well alone, just skip it."}, {k="取捨", text="Don't pay it yet|Toxic Horrors and bring it to Winterspring Frostfire Hot Springs."}, {k="提醒", text="If you are under level 60, fight poisonous elements and ironwood trees at Irontree Woods (about 49, 25), or leave the difference to Winterspring.", s={{"If you are under level 60, fight poisonous elements and ironwood trees at Irontree Woods (about 49, 25), or leave the difference to Winterspring"}}}}, danger={[1]="Shadow Hold The braziers are scattered in the narrow cave. Clear a section first and then extinguish the fire. When retreating, follow the original path."}, grind={[1]={mob="Toxic Horror", note="Irontree Woods is a common element beside the pool and can be collected with Toxic Horror Droplet. If the level is low, only a small difference will be made up. Players often go to Winterspring for poolside quests."}, [2]={mob="Warpwood Shredder", note="There are ordinary trees beside the north road. If the pool is occupied, continue to fight. Use the convenient road to continue to Timbermaw Hold. Watch out for spellcasting monsters in the camp."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Innkeeper Kaylisk"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Kaylisk"}, [3]={npc="Brakkar"}, [4]={npc="Altsoba Ragetotem"}, [5]={npc="Bale"}, [6]={npc="Bale"}}, steps={[1]={text="Fly from Orgrimmar to Splintertree Post. Follow the north road into Felwood and stop near Emerald Sanctuary."}, [2]={npc="Maybess Riverbreeze", tgt="Maybess Riverbreeze"}, [3]={hint="Take the Purified Moon Well Water to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood."}, [4]={npc="Greta Mosshoof", tgt="Greta Mosshoof"}, [5]={hint="Find Eridan Bluewind in southern Felwood."}, [6]={npc="Eridan Bluewind", tgt="Eridan Bluewind"}, [7]={npc="Greta Mosshoof", tgt="Greta Mosshoof"}, [8]={npc="Eridan Bluewind", tgt="Eridan Bluewind"}, [9]={hint="Using the Purified Moon Well Water, douse the flames of the four braziers of protection within Shadow Hold in Felwood, then return to Greta Mosshoof in the Emerald Sanctuary.", desc="Clear the passage first and then go deeper; the coordinates in the cave may overlap."}, [10]={hint="Collect 11 Silvery Claws and 1 Irontree Heart for Eridan Bluewind in Felwood.", desc="Loot Silver Claws from wolves and bears. Kill Irontree treants for the heart."}, [11]={npc="Greta Mosshoof", tgt="Greta Mosshoof"}, [12]={npc="Eridan Bluewind", tgt="Eridan Bluewind"}, [13]={npc="Greta Mosshoof", tgt="Greta Mosshoof", tag="Optional", desc="Return deep into Shadow Hold with a partner or if you can pull mobs one at a time."}, [14]={hint="Kill Moora and Salia, and bring Shadow Lord Fel'dan's Head to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.", tag="Optional", desc="The two guards are close to the lord, so patrol nearby first."}, [15]={npc="Greta Mosshoof", tgt="Greta Mosshoof", tag="Optional"}, [16]={npc="Trull Failbane", tgt="Trull Failbane"}, [17]={hint="Collect 3 Toxic Horror Droplets for Donova Snowden in Winterspring."}, [18]={npc="Impsy", tgt="Impsy", tag="Optional", desc="Optional Soul Harvester and other equipment.", star={"Soul Harvester", {"WARLOCK"}}}, [19]={hint="Impsy in Felwood has asked that you bring him three Flawless Fel Essences originating from three distinct locations.", tag="Optional", desc="If you have obtained all the transfers at stations 45, 52, and 57, go back to Impsy."}, [20]={npc="Impsy", tgt="Impsy", tag="Optional"}, [21]={npc="Impsy", tgt="Impsy", tag="Optional", desc="Form a team for elite battle. return to Nibi and turn in the quest to unlock Inferno."}, [22]={hint="Search Shatter Scar Vale in Felwood for the remains of Kroshius. When you locate the remains, use the Fel Fire near them and await Kroshius' return. When the infernal has awoken, slay him and take from his corpse Kroshius' Infernal Core.", tag="Optional", desc="Form a team for elite battle. return to Nibi and turn in the quest to unlock Inferno."}, [23]={npc="Niby the Almighty", tgt="Niby the Almighty", tag="Optional", desc="Form a team for elite battle. return to Nibi and turn in the quest to unlock Inferno."}, [24]={text="Go north into Timbermaw Hold and take the Moonglade exit."}}},
    ["04-59"] = {name="Moonglade", tips={{k="交通", text="The first step is to walk to Nighthaven. In the last step, choose hot spring or Everlook according to the quest at hand."}, {k="取捨", text="Do | Nighthaven The handover between two NPCs takes place in the same village."}, {k="取捨", text="Later, I will stop by | Shards of the Felvine to enter Dire Maul East District, so leave a copy of the itinerary."}, {k="提醒", text="Still in the 59-60 level zone, go directly to Winterspring Frostwhisper Gorge after finishing it.", s={{"Still in the 59-60 level zone, go directly to Winterspring Frostwhisper Gorge after finishing it"}}}}, danger={[1]="When converting from Moonglade to Winterspring, characters whose reputation is still hostile to Timbermaw should not pierce the hole directly, but deal with the reputation from the Felwood side first."}, grind={[1]={mob="Rabid Shardtooth", note="After turning in Moonglade, turn along the fortress to Winterspring and go to the north entrance of Frostwhisper Gorge to fight ordinary bears. Monsters wait close to 60 and avoid the bottom elite."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Meliri"}, [2]={npc="Dargon"}, [3]={npc="Daeolyn Summerleaf"}, [4]={npc="Faustron"}}, steps={[1]={text="Leave Timbermaw Hold and follow the main road to Nighthaven. Turn in both items from Silithus."}, [2]={npc="Rabine Saturna", tgt="Rabine Saturna"}, [3]={hint="Take the Encrusted Silithid Object to Umber - the Cenarion Circle's archivist - in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade."}, [4]={npc="Umber", tgt="Umber"}, [5]={npc="Umber", tgt="Umber"}, [6]={hint="Speak with Rabine Saturna in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade."}, [7]={npc="Rabine Saturna", tgt="Rabine Saturna"}, [8]={npc="Umber", tgt="Umber"}, [9]={hint="Complete the quest objectives."}, [10]={npc="Umber", tgt="Umber"}, [11]={text="With The New Springs or Toxic Horrors, go back through Timbermaw Hold to the Winterspring hot springs. If you have neither and are skipping Donova, fly to Everlook from Faustron (32.09, 66.61)."}}},
    ["04-60"] = {name="Winterspring", tips={{k="交通", text="The first step is to go to the hot spring, hand in the snowman Everlook, then go south, and the last step is to collect monsters outside the north entrance of the canyon."}, {k="取捨", text="Do | Winterfall Runners gives priority to finding the lone messenger; Strange Sources is exploration, which is the same as the point of replenishing monsters in the film."}, {k="取捨", text="Optional | High Chief Winterfall is an elite; single player can directly use ordinary furbolgs to make up for the level."}, {k="提醒", text="If you are under level 60, follow the video of hunting a bear on the north side of Frostwhisper Gorge. QuestieDB's regular crazy Cracktooth Bear points (~57.63, 70.83/66.68, 70.57), avoiding the Valley Elite.", s={{"If you are under level 60, follow the video of hunting a bear on the north side of Frostwhisper Gorge"}, {"QuestieDB's regular crazy Cracktooth Bear points (~57.63, 70.83/66.68, 70.57), avoiding the Valley Elite"}}}}, danger={[1]="Frostwhisper Gorge contains level 59-60 elite Frostmaul Giants. When replenishing bears at the north entrance, pull them along the slope. Don't bring the monsters into the valley bottom.", [2]="Darkwhisper Gorge has level 57-60 elite Hedaline Slayers. Strange Sources triggers at the north exit, return to the road when completed."}, grind={[1]={mob="Rabid Shardtooth", note="Frostwhisper Gorge An ordinary bear on the west side of the north entrance, capable of melee combat, single pulling and skinning. After clearing, head to the eastern front to rotate, and don't enter the elite area at the bottom."}, [2]={mob="Rabid Shardtooth", note="There are ordinary bears on the east side of the north entrance of the canyon. There are people on the west side or they come along the slope before they are refreshed. Pull back up the slope and avoid the valley bottom elite."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Yugrek"}, [2]={npc="Innkeeper Vizzie"}, [3]={npc="Nixxrak"}, [4]={npc="Innkeeper Vizzie"}, [5]={npc="Wixxrak"}}, steps={[1]={text="From Timbermaw Hold, see Donova at the hot springs. Turn in the Marshal's Refuge and Irontree Woods quests, then head to Everlook and the southern valley. If you flew straight to Everlook, start with Umi."}, [2]={hint="Travel to Winterspring and speak with Donova Snowden."}, [3]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden"}, [4]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden"}, [5]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden"}, [6]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden"}, [7]={hint="Find the Winterfall Runners and stop them from delivering their shipment to Winterfall Village.", desc="Find a lone courier near Timbermaw's entrance or the Deadwood cauldron."}, [8]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden"}, [9]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden", tag="Optional", desc="Level 59 elite, there are other furbolgs next to you, and do it with teammates."}, [10]={hint="Donova Snowden in Winterspring wants you to defeat High Chief Winterfall.", tag="Optional", desc="Clear the outer mobs first. Follow up if the letter drops and you need the chain."}, [11]={npc="Crudely-written Log", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Type High Chief Winterfall to find the log and then right-click to pick it up."}, [12]={hint="Bring the Crudely-written Log to Donova Snowden in Winterspring.", tag="Optional"}, [13]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden", tag="Optional"}, [14]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden", tag="Optional"}, [15]={npc="Umi Rumplesnicker", tgt="Umi Rumplesnicker"}, [16]={hint="Follow Donova Snowden's instructions, then report back.", desc="Just go to the entrance of the canyon and avoid the elites in the depths."}, [17]={npc="Donova Snowden", tgt="Donova Snowden"}, [18]={text="Below level 60? Grind normal Crazed Shardtooth bears outside the gorge's north entrance."}}},
    ["05-d34"] = {name="Upper Blackrock Spire", entrance="Searing Gorge 34.80, 85.30 (Blackrock Mountain external road mark)", pickup="After reaching level 55, fly from Winterspring Everlook to Orgrimmar, then take the zeppelin to Eastern Kingdoms. First do the lower level 4903, then return to Kargath and pick up Eitrigg's Wisdom in Gaotusi. return to Orgrimmar Wisdom Valley after The Barrens Ratchet to hand over to Eitrigg and Thrall and keep For The Horde!. After level 57, return to Undercity Alchemy Zone to pick up Vivian Lagrave and the Darkstone Tablet, then fly Kargath to Vivian and pick up The Darkstone Tablet. At least one person on the lower floor must complete Seal of Ascension→Seal of Ascension and open the door with a seal; if there are already teammates with seals, they can go directly to the upper floor.", pickupS={{"After reaching level 55, fly from Winterspring Everlook to Orgrimmar, then take the zeppelin to Eastern Kingdoms"}, {"First do the lower level 4903, then return to Kargath and pick up Eitrigg's Wisdom in Gaotusi. return to Orgrimmar Wisdom Valley after The Barrens Ratchet to hand over to Eitrigg and Thrall and keep For The Horde!"}, {"After level 57, return to Undercity Alchemy Zone to pick up Vivian Lagrave and the Darkstone Tablet, then fly Kargath to Vivian and pick up The Darkstone Tablet"}, {"At least one person on the lower floor must complete Seal of Ascension→Seal of Ascension and open the door with a seal; if there are already teammates with seals, they can go directly to the upper floor"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Clear the seven runes → Pyroguard Emberseer → tablet in the rookery → Blackhand Hall → Rend and Gyth in the arena → forge, with The Beast optional → General Drakkisath at the throne and his brand behind him."}, {k="取捨", text="Kargath and Orgrimmar should be filled up first; Blackhand's Command is the prerequisite for team copy transmission, and will be done if needed."}, {k="說明", text="It shares the outer door with the lower floor. After entering, go up to the left to find the locked door on the upper floor. When forming a team, first look for teammates who can use Seal of Ascension. After the server is launched, the guide has the actual door sequence of the upper level; if you encounter terrain blocking the way, walk up the outer trail of the upper level.", s={{"It shares the outer door with the lower floor"}, {"After entering, go up to the left to find the locked door on the upper floor"}, {"When forming a team, first look for teammates who can use Seal of Ascension"}, {"After the server is launched, the guide has the actual door sequence of the upper level; if you encounter terrain blocking the way, walk up the outer trail of the upper level"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Warlord Goretooth", tgt="Warlord Goretooth", desc="If no quest window opens, talk to the NPC and use the orders from your bags."}, [2]={hint="Slay Highlord Omokk, War Master Voone, and Overlord Wyrmthalak. Recover Important Blackrock Documents. Return to Warlord Goretooth in Kargath when the mission has been accomplished.", desc="The file location will change. Find the first three rooms when you encounter them. Map: Omokk 35.10,55.30; Voone 52.50,54.90; Wyrmthalak 57.80,60.50. Check each room."}, [3]={npc="Warlord Goretooth", tgt="Warlord Goretooth"}, [4]={npc="Warlord Goretooth", tgt="Warlord Goretooth", preText="Warlord's Command"}, [5]={hint="Speak with Eitrigg in Orgrimmar. When you have discussed matters with Eitrigg, seek council from Thrall."}, [6]={npc="Thrall", tgt="Thrall"}, [7]={npc="Thrall", tgt="Thrall", preText="Eitrigg's Wisdom"}, [8]={npc="Apothecary Zinge", tgt="Apothecary Zinge", tag="Optional", desc="Pick up at 57 in Undercity's Apothecarium. Skip this lead if you have The Darkstone Tablet."}, [9]={hint="Speak with Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave.", tag="Optional"}, [10]={npc="Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave", tgt="Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave", tag="Optional"}, [11]={npc="Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave", tgt="Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave", desc="Pick up from Vivian if offered. Otherwise start with Vivian Lagrave and the Darkstone Tablet in Undercity."}, [12]={npc="Blackhand's Command", npcObj=true, tag="Optional", desc="Loot and use the quartermaster's letter outside Blackrock Spire for BWL access."}, [13]={text="Upper Blackrock Spire entrance"}, [14]={hint="Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay Warchief Rend Blackhand. Take his head and return to Orgrimmar.", desc="Blackrock Spire Upper Special Map Layer 3: Red Blackhand 48.60, 25.60. Location: Pass the rookery to Blackhand Hall. Enter the arena north gate to trigger Rend. Order: Take the incubator stone first and then play the arena."}, [15]={hint="Bring the Darkstone Tablet to Shadow Mage Vivian Lagrave in Kargath.", desc="Stay on the path and avoid the eggs. Broken eggs spawn whelps. Location: After Pyroguard Emberseer, enter the rookery. Check the floor by the wall. Order: Completed before the arena in step 13."}, [16]={hint="That is one stupid orc. It would appear as if you need to find this brand and gain the Mark of Drakkisath in order to access the Orb of Command.", tag="Optional", desc="Blackrock Spire Upper Special Map Layer 3: Dakisas 34.80, 50.10, imprinted behind it. Location: Leave the arena's south gate and pass the forge. The brand is behind the boss. Order: After killing Drakisas, click on the mark behind you."}, [17]={npc="Drakkisath's Brand", npcObj=true, tag="Optional, Unverified"}, [18]={npc="Thrall", tgt="Thrall"}, [19]={npc="Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave", tgt="Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave"}}},
    ["05-d33"] = {name="Blackmaw Hold", entrance="Winterspring 66.60, 84.40", pickup="At Valormok, go to Jediga and pick up Beneath Nordrassil; at the same station, go to Ogtinc to pick up Claws That Rend, Tusks that Gore. After reaching level 55, return to Azshara to find Ekkal. When returning to Kalimdor via The Barrens Ratchet, fly Thunder Bluff to Elder Rise, hand in the letter from Jediga, answer Get to the Roots of It, and go to Mulgore to find Mullen Earthfury. Finally, fly Valormok and go to the dungeon through the Azshara tunnel; leave Get to the Roots of It and Blackmaw Magic for the next return trip of Thunder Bluff and Mulgore.", pickupS={{"At Valormok, go to Jediga and pick up Beneath Nordrassil; at the same station, go to Ogtinc to pick up Claws That Rend, Tusks that Gore"}, {"After reaching level 55, return to Azshara to find Ekkal"}, {"When returning to Kalimdor via The Barrens Ratchet, fly Thunder Bluff to Elder Rise, hand in the letter from Jediga, answer Get to the Roots of It, and go to Mulgore to find Mullen Earthfury"}, {"Finally, fly Valormok and go to the dungeon through the Azshara tunnel; leave Get to the Roots of It and Blackmaw Magic for the next return trip of Thunder Bluff and Mulgore"}}, tips={{k="動線", text="Loot Blackmaw Pouches in the entrance tunnels → gather Nordrassil Rootcaps underground → branches for Withermaw and Bonesnout the Unbroken → Elder Shaman Bloodmane for the ritual totem. Exact forks and boss order are unconfirmed."}, {k="取捨", text="En route, prepare Ogtinc and Ruins of Eldarath quests first; the Horde root hat chain can be completed in one go at Thunder Bluff."}, {k="說明", text="The coordinates of the portal are located on the Winterspring map. From Azshara 38.70, 33.40, enter the furbolg tunnel and walk all the way to the door. Do not search on the surface of Winterspring.", s={{"The coordinates of the portal are located on the Winterspring map"}, {"From Azshara 38.70, 33.40, enter the furbolg tunnel and walk all the way to the door"}, {"Do not search on the surface of Winterspring"}}}}, steps={[1]={npc="Jediga", tgt="Jediga", tag="Unverified"}, [2]={hint="Speak to Nara Wildmane at Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Unverified"}, [3]={npc="Nara Wildmane", tgt="Nara Wildmane", tag="Unverified"}, [4]={npc="Nara Wildmane", tgt="Nara Wildmane", tag="Unverified", preText="Beneath Nordrassil"}, [5]={npc="Ogtinc", tgt="Ogtinc"}, [6]={npc="Alaana Stormwalker", tgt="Muln Earthfury", desc="Use the Mulgore map pin on the path to Thunder Bluff."}, [7]={npc="Ekkal", tgt="Ekkal", desc="Azshara Ruins of Eldarath. The minimum access level is made up by native DungeonsForever."}, [8]={text="Blackmaw Hold entrance"}, [9]={hint="Gather 10 Nordrassil Root Caps inside Blackmaw Hold for Nara Wildmane in Thunder Bluff.", tag="Unverified", desc="Location: Follow the passages to the underground roots and gather rootcaps there."}, [10]={hint="Bring the Claws of the Great Bear and the Tusks of the Unbroken to Ogtinc, in Azshara.", tag="Target: Giant Bear Withermaw / Bonesnout the Unbroken, Unverified", desc="Location: Find Withermaw and Bonesnout the Unbroken in the tunnels. Fork unconfirmed."}, [11]={hint="Recover a Blackmaw Ritual Totem from Blackmaw Hold.", tag="Unverified", desc="Location: Follow the boss route to Elder Shaman Bloodmane and loot his ritual totem."}, [12]={hint="Enter Blackmaw Hold and recover 5 Blackmaw Pouches for Ekkal at the Ruins of Eldarath in Azshara.", desc="Location: Clear corrupted Blackmaw furbolgs in the living quarters and loot pouches."}, [13]={npc="Ogtinc", tgt="Ogtinc"}, [14]={npc="Ekkal", tgt="Ekkal"}, [15]={npc="Nara Wildmane"}, [16]={desc="QuestieDB lists Mulen Earthfury as the pickup. The turn-in is unconfirmed."}}},
  },
  quests = {
    [2] = {n="Sharptalon's Claw", d="Bring Sharptalon's Claw to Senani Thunderheart at Splintertree Post, Ashenvale."},
    [10] = {n="The Scrimshank Redemption", d="Discover the fate of Junior Surveyor Scrimshank, and bring either him or his surveying equipment to Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser in Gadgetzan.", objs={"Scrimshank's Surveying Gear"}},
    [23] = {n="Ursangous's Paw", d="Bring Ursangous's Paw to Senani Thunderheart at Splintertree Post, Ashenvale."},
    [24] = {n="Shadumbra's Head", d="Bring Shadumbra's Head to Senani Thunderheart at Splintertree Post, Ashenvale."},
    [25] = {n="Stonetalon Standstill", d="Dispatch 12 Befouled Water Elementals at Mystral Lake, due east of the Talondeep Path and southwest of Splintertree Post.\nScout the gazebo on Mystral Lake that overlooks the nearby Alliance outpost.\nReturn to Mastok Wrilehiss at Splintertree Post, Ashenvale.", tgo={{"Befouled Water Elemental"}}},
    [27] = {n="A Lesson to Learn", d="Speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade."},
